window.FWN_LADY_GU_TOO_WEAK_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_LADY_GU_TOO_WEAK_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":901,"title":"Chapter 901 - Apologize To Qingfeng","paragraphs":["Assistant Gao glanced coldly at Jiang Qin and snorted. “Think carefully about whether you’ve offended that person. If anything goes wrong with this company merger, all of you will have to pay the price!”","Jiang Qin panicked. How could she have offended someone? It must be an employee who was blind and offended an important guest!","“Do you know what President Gu’s relationship with the president of Qingfeng Entertainment is? You even dared to offend the president of Qingfeng Entertainment. I really admire your courage!”","Jiang Qin was so scared that her face turned pale. She said in horror, “I... I really don’t know how I offended the president. My subordinates must be blind. How can they blame it on me?”","Assistant Gao replied indifferently, “Director Jiang, whether it’s you or your employees who offended the president of Qingfeng, you should be the one to solve this matter. I advise you to apologize to Qingfeng as soon as possible. If you’re sincere enough, they might forgive you and you can still keep your job.”","With that, Assistant Gao smiled meaningfully. “I heard that Miss Xia and the president of Qingfeng Entertainment are good friends! You can get Miss Xia to help you! With her helping you plead for your case, anything can be resolved.”","Jiang Qin’s eyes lit up. How could she have forgotten about Xia Mengyan?! She rushed to the president’s office without turning back. Xia Mengyan’s expression froze when she heard the words.","All these years, she had been claiming connections with the president of Qingfeng Entertainment to gain many benefits, but she had never met him before. She did not even know if he was a man or a woman, nor did she know his age. Hence, she could not help Jiang Qin at all. If she rashly appeared, she would be exposed. At that time, it would be troublesome.","Xia Mengyan hesitated for a moment. “Hold on. I’ll make a call first.”","With that, Xia Mengyan picked up the phone, stood up, and walked to the window. She pretended to make a call and said helplessly, “I can’t contact him. Maybe he’s in a fit of anger! If you really offended him, why don’t you visit Qingfeng and apologize? I don’t think the other party will make things difficult for you.”","Jiang Qin was mentally and physically exhausted. Why was Miss Xia so helpless? Wasn’t she very close to the president? If she couldn’t solve it, no one could help her.","After thinking about it, Jiang Qin could only brace herself and go to Qingfeng Entertainment. When she reached the entrance of the company, she was stopped by the security guards. When they found out that she was the director of Heavenly Voice Entertainment who specially came to apologize to the president, the security guards looked at each other with strange expressions. In the end, they let her in.","At this moment, Jiang Qin was standing at the door, extremely nervous. She thought for a long time but did not know how she had offended the president of Qingfeng Entertainment. Even if she were to apologize, she did not know where to start!","......","All these years, she had worked hard and used all possible methods to finally climb to the position of director. She absolutely could not lose this job. Fortunately, Miss Xia was the president’s friend. No matter how angry the president was, he would probably show Miss Xia some respect. The matter would be resolved then.","After hesitating for a moment, Jiang Qin took a deep breath and knocked on the office door. Unexpectedly, the door suddenly opened. Jiang Qin mustered her courage and walked in. She originally thought that the chairman was a middle-aged man. After all, Miss Xia had called him her senior. However, the person she saw was a young woman.","At this moment, there was only a young lady in the room. She was sitting on the president’s office chair and playing with her phone. When she heard footsteps, she slowly looked up. Jiang Qin was instantly stunned. She immediately swallowed the words of flattery and widened her eyes. “Why are you here?”","She never expected that Qiao Xi would actually be sitting in the president’s office. Jiang Qin, who was originally prepared to apologize humbly, instantly became imposing. “Mrs. Gu, you’re quite capable. You can even enter the office of Qingfeng’s president as you please. I’m looking for the president. Where is he?”","Qiao Xi glanced at her coldly, then continued playing the game on her phone. Waves of battle noises came from her phone. She did not take Jiang Qin seriously at all.","“Say something!” Jiang Qin shouted in exasperation.","She still did not know how she had offended the president of Qingfeng. Now that she saw Qiao Xi, Jiang Qin finally reacted. Qiao Xi must have come to Qingfeng and exaggerated things to badmouth her to the president, so the president did not send anyone for the handover.","Jiang Qin shouted, “I was wondering why there was a problem with the handover ceremony. You must be behind it. I want to see the president!”"]},{"number":902,"title":"Chapter 902 - Two-Timing","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi didn’t even raise her head as her long fingers lightly tapped on the screen. Her voice was indifferent as she casually said, “You’re not worthy.”","Jiang Qin glared fiercely at Qiao Xi and said unwillingly, “You even have the cheek to sit here, so how am I not worthy to see the president? I’m the director of Heavenly Voice Entertainment!","“That’s the president’s seat, yet you’re sitting there? You’re too uneducated! Don’t think that just because you’re Mrs. Gu, you can do whatever you want. Miss Xia is the president’s friend as well, but she’s not as impudent as you. Don’t you have any shame?!”","Jiang Qin stared at Qiao Xi’s face and suddenly had a flash of inspiration. Qiao Xi’s appearance made her one of the top beauties in the entertainment industry. If such a beauty appeared in the president’s office, perhaps...","“What’s your relationship with the president of Qingfeng? No matter what, you and President Gu haven’t divorced yet. You’re still Mrs. Gu in name. How could you do such a thing? You really don’t care about President Gu’s reputation at all!”","Jiang Qin had worked in the entertainment company for so many years and had seen these things happen often. Those small-time celebrities who had poor resources would rely on their faces to seduce men in power if they wanted to take a shortcut. However, Qiao Xi was Gu Zheng’s wife. Instead of fulfilling her duties as Mrs. Gu, she actually seduced an old man?","“The president of Qingfeng and President Gu are friends, yet you still dare to be so impudent? If President Gu finds out, he’ll definitely not let you off!”","At this point, Jiang Qin suddenly curled her lips into a proud smile. “However, if you can help me plead with the president of Qingfeng and get him to forgive me so that the handover ceremony can be completed smoothly, I’ll definitely keep this a secret.”","After the game ended, Qiao Xi put down her phone and said in a teasing tone, “So you’re here to apologize, Director Jiang? But why do I feel that you’re not sincere at all?”","“I’m not apologizing to you. Why do I need to show my sincerity to you?! When I see the president, I’ll naturally apologize respectfully. You don’t have to worry about that!","Jiang Qin looked at her with a mocking expression. “Aren’t you just relying on your face to seduce men? Back then, you seduced President Gu and got married to him. Now that you’ve taken a liking to the future of Qingfeng Entertainment, you’re here to seduce the president. However, he’s an experienced man. He won’t be bewitched by a woman like you. He’s just playing with you.","“If you continue to two-time and the matter is exposed, President Gu will abandon you and the president of Qingfeng will ignore you as well. You’ll even ruin their relationship as friends. Your reputation will be ruined from then on. Can you still stay in Li City then?”","Qiao Xi slowly raised her eyes, and her eyes were calm. “Oh.”","......","Seeing her indifferent expression, Jiang Qin was instantly infuriated. She threatened, “Qiao Xi, if you don’t help me tide over this crisis today, then don’t blame me for falling out with you. If President Gu knows that you’ve cheated on him, will he still let you fool around using the title of Mrs. Gu?”","As soon as she finished speaking, footsteps came from the door. The person knocked and slowly walked in with a folder in his hand.","Jiang Qin turned around. Wasn’t this Mr. Li from Qingfeng Entertainment? Previously, everyone thought that Li Jiang was the boss of Qingfeng Entertainment, but in reality, Li Jiang was just an employee. To be able to make such an outstanding person like Li Jiang willingly work under him meant that the president of Breeze Entertainment was very capable. He must have something outstanding that could convince talented employees like Mr. Li. How could such a man like him like a woman like Qiao Xi?","“The documents are all sorted out?” Qiao Xi pointed at the documents on the table.","Li Jiang replied respectfully, “There’s still one more set. There’s a problem with the data submitted by Heavenly Voice Entertainment’s public relations department. It needs to be checked again.”","Qiao Xi had a serious expression. “My time is limited. If there’s a mistake in the verification, I’ll just toss the work to Heavenly Voice’s public relations department and let them solve it themselves.”","Jiang Qin’s body instantly trembled. Wasn’t the public relations department under her jurisdiction? Why did Qiao Xi look like she was very familiar with Li Jiang? She was even speaking to Mr. Li in a commanding tone. Was she so arrogant because she was used to being Mrs. Gu?","At this moment, Jiang Qin’s mind was filled with the thought of meeting the president. She did not have time to think about it because if she did not get the president’s forgiveness, her career would be over. If she was fired by Heavenly Voice Entertainment, who in the entire entertainment industry would dare to hire her? Hence, Jiang Qin rushed over to stop Li Jiang as though she was grabbing onto her savior.","Li Jiang did not expect Jiang Qin to suddenly rush over. He took a few steps back in fear. “What’s the matter?”"]},{"number":903,"title":"Chapter 903 - Humiliating Director Jiang","paragraphs":["Hearing Li Jiang’s distant tone, Jiang Qin looked troubled. Her heart thumped, but she still had a trace of hope. “Hello, Mr. Li. I’m the director of the public relations department of Heavenly Voice Entertainment. We did make a mistake in our work, which has made the president unhappy. I’m here to apologize to the president. Mr. Li, can you bring me to see the president?”","“You’re here to apologize to the president?” Li Jiang’s expression was a little strange. He was silent for a few seconds before he suddenly laughed. “If you’re here to apologize, why do you still need me to introduce you to the president? The president is already sitting here. Where else do you need me to bring you?”","The president was already here?","Jiang Qin’s face was pale. She was stunned for a few seconds before understanding Li Jiang’s words. She instantly felt as if she had been struck by lightning, and the blood in her entire body seemed to have frozen. At this moment, she finally reacted. Why was Li Jiang so respectful to Qiao Xi and he even reported to her? It was because Qiao Xi was actually the president of Qingfeng Entertainment!","At this instant, Jiang Qin wished for nothing more than to faint. Her heart was filled with regret, and she wished for nothing more than to be able to transmigrate. If she was given a chance, she would absolutely not dare to offend Qiao Xi.","Li Jiang smiled. “I was wondering why our president was mocked when she went to Heavenly Voice Entertainment. It turns out that you misunderstood things, Director Jiang.”","Jiang Qin’s face alternated between green and white. Then, her body began to tremble slightly.","“It doesn’t matter if you’re unwilling to apologize, Director Jiang. Our president won’t force you. However, if President Gu finds out that you offended the president and ruined the handover ceremony, I don’t know what he’ll do to you,” Li Jiang said word by word, but it sounded like a death warrant to Jiang Qin.","Qiao Xi sat on the chair, and the corners of her mouth curled up slightly when she saw Jiang Qin’s sorry state.","At this moment, Li Jiang’s eyes suddenly turned cold. “If you’re unwilling to apologize, then leave as soon as possible. You’re really an eyesore standing here.”","Jiang Qin’s face turned red as she muttered in a low voice, “You’re the president of Qingfeng Entertainment. Why didn’t you say anything when you went to the company?”","If Qiao Xi had told her her identity earlier, everything would not have happened. She would not have needed to come to Qingfeng Entertainment to apologize. In the end, it was all Qiao Xi’s fault!","Li Jiang stood in front of Jiang Qin, his eyes filled with coldness. “Director Jiang, when our president went to the company, she told you that she was going to take over the company, but you already decided that the new president was Miss Xia. This is your negligence, yet you’re blaming it on the president now?”","......","Jiang Qin was instantly speechless. As she looked at Qiao Xi’s smiling appearance, anger surged in her heart. She shouted loudly, “No wonder you said to me, ‘I hope you won’t regret your decision today.’ You were deliberately embarrassing me. You knew about the photos online, and you wanted to harm me!”","President Gu’s affair had caused an uproar. Qiao Xi would definitely investigate who was behind it. Perhaps she had already found out something.","Li Jiang said coldly, “Director Jiang, you’re thinking too much. Our president is usually busy with work and doesn’t have time to bicker with you. Are you worthy of wasting the president’s time?”","The truth was already in front of her, but Jiang Qin was still unwilling to believe it. After a long silence, she slowly lowered her head, and her voice trembled slightly. “Mrs. Gu, I’m sorry.”","Qiao Xi was only 20 years old. If she was really the president of Qingfeng Entertainment, wouldn’t she have founded this entertainment company when she was in her teens? How was this possible? Perhaps President Gu was the real boss behind the scenes and gave Qingfeng to Qiao Xi after they got married.","Suddenly, footsteps sounded from outside the door. A man wearing a navy blue suit jacket walked in with a trace of coldness. The moment he looked at Qiao Xi, the ice and snow in his eyes instantly melted, turning into a layer of warmth and affection.","Gu Zheng walked past Jiang Qin and walked in front of Qiao Xi. He handed a dessert bag to her and smiled gently. “Here, your favorite cake. I waited a long time to buy it.”","Qiao Xi took the bag and took out an exquisite box. She asked with a smile, “Ah Zheng, how did you know I wanted to eat this?”","Gu Zheng smiled gently. “I know what you’re thinking, Mrs. Gu. You’ll be in a good mood if you have some desserts. This way, you won’t have to be angry with certain idiots.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Jiang Qin felt a cold gaze land on her. It scared her so much that her entire body trembled. She looked up in fear and saw the brand on the dessert bag. She knew that this dessert shop was very particular about its workmanship. The ingredients were fresh and the desserts they made were limited every day. It was very difficult to buy them. A career man like President Gu would actually line up to buy cakes for a woman?"]},{"number":904,"title":"Chapter 904 - She Lied","paragraphs":["At this moment, Jiang Qin’s mind was a mess. It turned out that the rumors of Mrs. Gu being abandoned were fake. President Gu clearly doted on her very much, but he was actually willing to waste precious time helping her queue up for desserts. What kind of favoritism was this? How could a man like Gu Zheng, who thought highly of himself, be so meticulous?","Jiang Qin’s eyes were filled with horror as she retreated in fear. She even had the urge to run away. Just as she was about to leave, Gu Zheng suddenly turned around and said coldly, “Director Jiang.”","Hearing Gu Zheng call her, Jiang Qin’s body instantly trembled. The next second, she heard Gu Zheng ask casually, “In Qingfeng Entertainment, you should be addressing Mrs. Gu as ‘President’. Do you think Mrs. Gu is unqualified to be the president of the two companies?”","Jiang Qin’s face was pale as she lowered her head. If Qingfeng Entertainment was given to Qiao Xi by Gu Zheng, then the two of them had already known each other eight years ago. At that time, Qiao Xi was only a child.","Li Jiang walked forward with a cold expression. “Director Jiang, our president doesn’t accept your apology. Please leave immediately!”","If Qiao Xi did not accept her apology, she would be chased out of the company before the two companies could merge. Jiang Qin did not know how she walked out of the door of Qingfeng Entertainment. She only felt weak all over like a walking corpse. When she dragged her tired body back to Heavenly Voice, many higher-ups were waiting for her in the company.","“Director Jiang, what did you do? How did you suddenly offend the president of Qingfeng Entertainment? What did he say?”","“Has the president of Qingfeng Entertainment forgiven you? Will he send someone over for the handover ceremony?”","Jiang Qin lowered her head, her body cold. She said while trembling, “The president of Qingfeng Entertainment didn’t forgive me.”","“What?” A higher-up’s face instantly darkened. He roared at Jiang Qin, “President Gu cares a lot about this company merger. I told you a long time ago that you had to take this handover ceremony seriously, but what have you done? Qingfeng Entertainment won’t send anyone over now. If President Gu blames us, who can bear the responsibility?”","Jiang Qin sobbed as tears welled up in her eyes. The higher-up took a deep breath. “Aren’t you very close to Miss Xia? For now, you can only beg Miss Xia to plead for mercy. No matter what, she’s a friend of the president of Qingfeng. If she pleads for mercy on your behalf, the president will at least show her some respect.”","Hearing these words, Jiang Qin’s eyes instantly turned vicious. She finally understood what she had done wrong. If Xia Mengyan had not come over early in the morning and pretended to be the president, even saying that she was very close to President Gu and President Gu did not like Qiao Xi anymore, how could she have offended Mrs. Gu?","It was all Xia Mengyan’s fault! She lied! She was a b*tch!","......","“Miss Xia! You’re finally here. Now...” Coincidentally, Xia Mengyan was walking over. The higher-up who spoke earlier immediately went forward to explain the current situation. Unexpectedly, before he could finish, Jiang Qin laughed crazily.","The higher-up frowned unhappily. “Are you crazy?! Why are you suddenly laughing?!”","“Mr. Pan, I’m laughing at this lady for not knowing the president of Qingfeng at all yet pretending to. It’s useless to look for her now. She can’t solve this matter at all.” Jiang Qin looked at Xia Mengyan sharply.","Xia Mengyan’s body trembled, but she quickly returned to normal. Her voice was still gentle, but there was a trace of guilt. “Director Jiang, how can you say that about me? You can’t blame me even if the president refused to forgive you, right?”","“You said that you’re friends with the president of Qingfeng, right?” Jiang Qin suddenly questioned, her voice suddenly sharp. “Then why didn’t you know when the president came just now? The president was standing there, but you stole the position of the president and even used her reputation to deceive us! You’re too scheming, Xia Mengyan!”","As soon as she finished speaking, the entire place was silent. Everyone looked at Xia Mengyan. Even the higher-up from earlier was looking at Xia Mengyan suspiciously. “Miss Xia, did you chase the president of Qingfeng away?”","If all of this was orchestrated by Xia Mengyan, it would have nothing to do with Heavenly Voice. At the very least, they could give President Gu an explanation.","Xia Mengyan’s face darkened, and her voice trembled slightly. “Director Jiang, what nonsense are you talking about? I’m the new president. I haven’t seen the president of Qingfeng since I arrived at the company. How could I have chased him away?”","“Are you sure? Why don’t you think about it carefully?” Jiang Qin revealed a mocking smile. Her voice was as terrifying as a demon’s."]},{"number":905,"title":"Chapter 905 - Sue Xia Mengyan","paragraphs":["Xia Mengyan was about to answer when her body suddenly trembled. A figure flashed past her mind, and she instantly swallowed the words in her mouth. Her eyes were filled with disbelief.","Jiang Qin looked at her shocked gaze and smiled proudly. “You clearly chased Qiao Xi away!”","Everyone had puzzled expressions. What did this have to do with Qiao Xi?","Xia Mengyan’s lips trembled slightly. “No... Impossible!”","“Xia Mengyan! Stop pretending. You’re not the friend of Qingfeng’s president at all! Today, the president of Qingfeng personally came to the company for the handover, but you chased her away. That person is Qiao Xi!”","The anger and grievances in Jiang Qin’s heart gathered into a ball as she vented everything out on Xia Mengyan. After her angry roar, the place was silent, and even the sound of breathing stopped.","After a few seconds of silence, Xia Mengyan stammered, “What nonsense are you talking about?! The president of Qingfeng and I are friends! How could that person be Xi Xi?”","“Then who’s the president you’re talking about? Why don’t you call him out to confront us?” A man’s voice came from the door. Everyone looked in the direction of the voice and saw Li Jiang walking in with Qingfeng’s higher-ups.","“Miss Qiao Xi has been the president for six years. Miss Xia, don’t you know this? If you didn’t, why did you go around saying that you’re the friend of Qingfeng’s president?”","Li Jiang’s words were light, but it was like a slap to Xia Mengyan’s face, making her blush in shame.","When the higher-up of Heavenly Voice saw Li Jiang arrive, he hurriedly went forward to greet him. “Mr. Li, welcome. We’re so sorry for not going out to meet you. It was Heavenly Voice’s negligence. Please don’t take offense.”","Li Jiang glanced at that person and said indifferently, “Fortunately, the president and President Gu are husband and wife. Their collaboration won’t be affected by certain people. If it were anyone else, it would’ve been absolutely impossible for them to agree to the merger. President Gu already knows that you’ve angered the president and is very angry. However, the president is soft-hearted and pleaded on your behalf. After all, we have to work together in the future. But...”","When the higher-up heard Li Jiang’s words, his heart jumped. The next second, Li Jiang’s gaze landed on Xia Mengyan. He snorted. “After our two companies merge, we’ll be a family. But how did an outsider like Miss Xia become the president?”","......","Everyone gasped. Everyone knew that Xia Mengyan became the president because she said that she was a friend of the president of Qingfeng, but now that Li Jiang had already clarified this matter in public, she was clearly the one who cheated her way to this position.","“Miss Xia, you’re not from Qingfeng or Heavenly Voice. What right do you have to be the president? Could it be that you want to steal business secrets? The company’s legal department will be suing you. I hope you’ll be mentally prepared. Remember not to impersonate someone else in the future to avoid trouble.”","The higher-up of Heavenly Voice hurriedly said, “Actually, it’s our fault for not investigating clearly. That’s why we easily believed Xia Mengyan’s words. Fortunately, the president is magnanimous and won’t bicker with us. Xia Mengyan and Director Jiang’s actions have seriously harmed the company’s interests. We should indeed sue them!”","Jiang Qin had long expected her to pay the price for this, but she did not expect the company to sue her. She cried and begged for mercy, but Li Jiang’s face was cold.","Xia Mengyan lowered her head and clenched her fists tightly. Her ears were buzzing. The surroundings were noisy, but she could not hear a word. Li Jiang’s words kept repeating in her mind. What right did they have to sue her?","“Miss Xia, our president doesn’t want to bicker with you, but when President Gu found out about this, he was very angry. The handover ceremony that he carefully prepared was ruined by an outsider, so what kind of punishment do you think will await you?”","Xia Mengyan took a few steps back, her eyes filled with horror. “What are you doing? I’m the eldest daughter of the Xia family!”","Li Jiang snorted and said disdainfully, “The Xia family? In President Gu’s eyes, the Xia family is nothing. Miss Xia, wait for the lawyer’s letter!”","Xia Mengyan’s gaze was vicious as she gritted her teeth. She could only ignore everyone’s disdainful gazes. She picked up her bag and fled from Heavenly Voice Entertainment in a panic. She had just reached the underground parking lot when she heard a woman’s angry roar behind her. “Xia Mengyan!”","She turned around and saw Jiang Qin with bloodshot eyes. She rushed over crazily and grabbed her hair. She shouted at the top of her lungs, “You b*tch! How dare you lie to me? You’re killing me. I’ve worked hard for so many years, but in the end, not only am I out of a job but I’m also being sued!”"]},{"number":906,"title":"Chapter 906 - The Truth Behind The Rumors","paragraphs":["Xia Mengyan had been pampered since she was young and was the eldest daughter of the Xia family. She was the center of attention wherever she went. Naturally, no one would quarrel with her or hit her. It was her first time seeing someone act as crazily as Jiang Qin.","Jiang Qin pulled her hair forcefully. Xia Mengyan gritted her teeth in pain and ignored her image as a socialite. She reached out and grabbed Jiang Qin’s hair as well. “You’re too stupid. That’s why you were deceived by me. You deserve it!”","“If you hadn’t said that you were the president, how could I have offended Mrs. Gu?” Jiang Qin shouted while panting. She was so angry that her entire body was trembling. She wished she could tear Xia Mengyan into pieces.","Xia Mengyan’s face was ferocious as she fought with Jiang Qin. Coincidentally, a few people were walking over not far away. Xia Mengyan was afraid that others would see her in a sorry state, so she shook Jiang Qin off and quickly got into the car. “Let’s go!”","After the chauffeur replied, he stepped on the accelerator and the car quickly drove away. The window was still open, so Xia Mengyan could clearly hear their conversation. “She’s really shameless! She pretended to be the president and even chased Mrs. Gu away. She’s still a noble daughter nonetheless, so how could she throw away her reputation for the position of president?”","“She even said that the president of Qingfeng Entertainment is a senior. Actually, Mrs. Gu is only in her 20s. She’s even a few years younger than her! She doesn’t even blush when lying!”","Xia Mengyan hurriedly closed the car window, her face as dark as ink. She clenched her fists tightly, her nails digging into her palms.","‘Qiao Xi! Just you wait!’","After calming down, Xia Mengyan suddenly sensed that something was wrong. Qiao Xi was chased out of the house 10 years ago. Six years ago, she was still a child. It was already unexpected that she was able to eat her fill and wear warm clothes. How did she have the ability to found Qingfeng Entertainment? This was impossible! Was Qingfeng Entertainment the property left to her by Xia Yunqiu? Since it was left to her by Xia Yunqiu, it should belong to the Xia family!","What right did Qiao Xi have to rely on her identity as the president of Qingfeng to suppress her, the eldest daughter of the Xia family?","After returning to the Xia family, Xia Mengyan sat on the sofa with messy hair. Her eyes were red as she sobbed softly. Xia Cheng’s expression was gloomy as he slammed the table. “Qiao Xi! She’s too impudent!”","Xia Mengyan’s tears trickled down as she choked. “She clearly went to the company for the handover, but she didn’t tell me and made me lose my reputation in public. Moreover, Qingfeng Entertainment was established six years ago. At that time, she was only 13 or 14 years old. How could she have had the ability? I’m guessing Qingfeng must be Aunt Yunqiu’s inheritance.”","Xia Cheng’s expression changed. “What? Qingfeng is an asset Yunqiu left behind?”","......","Xia Mengyan wiped her tears. “I’m just guessing, but this is the most reasonable possibility. Although Aunt Yunqiu has passed away, she’s still your daughter. The assets she gave to the Qiao family were enough for the Qiao family to squander for so many years. She must have left Xi Xi a lot of assets too, so I think Qingfeng Entertainment was also one of Aunt Yunqiu’s assets.”","Xia Cheng’s gaze was cold. Their Xia family did not even have such a huge entertainment company, yet Xia Yunqiu actually handed the company to a teenage girl?","“Yunqiu is my daughter, and Xi Xi is my granddaughter. If you have time, get her to come home for a meal. Coincidentally, we should look into Yunqiu’s assets. If she’s really unwilling to interact with the Xia family, then the assets that belong to the Xia family should be returned.”","Xia Mengyan revealed a victorious smile. Since she could not deal with Qiao Xi, she would let her grandfather deal with her!","Heavenly Voice and Qingfeng were being merged. Qiao Xi and Li Jiang were so busy that they did not even have time to eat. Many things had to be dealt with immediately before the company could continue operating. Everyone was only done at nine at night.","The news of the two companies merging instantly spread throughout the internet. The artists in the company also reposted the news on Weibo. Netizens commented: [When President Gu attended the annual meeting of Heavenly Voice Entertainment, he said that Heavenly Voice was for a friend and it would be returned to that person one day.]","[I heard that the new president has already taken over. Who is it?]","[The president is Mrs. Gu! Heavenly Voice is a gift from President Gu to Mrs. Gu. The two of them have known each other for many years. They’re really too loving!]","[Love? But someone exposed President Gu’s affair yesterday!]","[I finally understand why President Gu didn’t come forward to explain yesterday. It’s because after the merger of Heavenly Voice and Qingfeng, all the rumors will be proven to be unfounded. If President Gu really wanted to abandon Mrs. Gu, why would he give Heavenly Voice to her? If it weren’t for the fact that he really liked her, President Gu wouldn’t have founded Heavenly Voice Entertainment at all!]"]},{"number":907,"title":"Chapter 907 - The Person In Her Dream","paragraphs":["After everyone finished their work, it was already 10 o’clock when they walked out of the company. Although it was early spring, the night was still very cold. The cold wind blew. Qiao Xi wrapped her coat tightly around her body when she suddenly heard footsteps behind her.","Gu Zheng was wearing a black jacket and held a white windbreaker in his hand. His deep eyes swept over the thin suit Qiao Xi was wearing, then he draped the windbreaker in his hand over her and asked softly, “Are you cold?”","“Yes, it’s fortunate that you’re here.” Qiao Xi buttoned up the windbreaker and waved goodbye to Li Jiang. At this moment, there were only the two of them at the door. Qiao Xi looked at the neon lights in the distance and took a deep breath. “When I founded Qingfeng, I always thought that Heavenly Voice was my greatest rival. I didn’t expect that one day, the two companies would merge and I would even become the president.”","Gu Zheng pulled her into his arms, his warm chest transmitting warmth to her. Then, he held her hand and got into the car. “Heavenly Voice was originally a company under Gu Corporation, so you have to go to Gu Corporation’s headquarters tomorrow to sign some documents.”","Qiao Xi nodded and leaned against his shoulder tiredly before closing her eyes.","20 minutes later, Song Shiyu parked the car at the entrance of Longwan Residential. He had just turned around to ask the president and Young Madam to get out of the car when he saw Gu Zheng hugging Young Madam. The president signaled at him to not make a sound. It turned out that Young Madam was already asleep.","Song Shiyu quickly got out of the car and opened the door of the back seat. Gu Zheng carefully carried Qiao Xi out, and the two of them went upstairs.","...","Qiao Xi’s mind was heavy. There seemed to be someone standing in front of her. That person’s voice was very familiar, and it sounded like the Gu Zheng she remembered from her childhood. His tone was equally calm, but it carried a trace of immaturity. She wanted to see the person before her clearly, but her vision was blurry. No matter how hard she tried, she was unable to approach him.","She tried to use all her strength. Just as she was about to approach that person, she heard a mature man’s voice. “Xi Xi?”","Qiao Xi abruptly opened her eyes and gasped for breath.","Gu Zheng’s deep eyes were filled with gentleness. He reached out to grab a tissue and gently wiped the sweat off her forehead. His voice was low and magnetic. “What did you dream of?”","Qiao Xi shook her head. “It’s nothing. I just feel a little hot.”","......","Gu Zheng knew that she had something on her mind, but he did not continue asking. He naturally changed the topic. “I heard that you’ve been playing games with Gu Yao recently? What game is it?”","Qiao Xi was stunned for a moment and gritted her teeth. That b*tch Song Shiyu must have told Gu Zheng. She smiled and shook her head. “No! I’m very busy with work. How could I have time to play games? You must have heard wrongly.”","Seeing her guilty look, Gu Zheng could not help but smile. “I didn’t say I wouldn’t let you play. You don’t have to rush to deny it.”","As a top hacker, he had naturally come into contact with competitive games. He had also watched professional competitions. There were many professional players in Stars. He knew that Qiao Xi liked to play games, but she usually played with others and never teamed up with him.","Gu Zheng stroked Qiao Xi’s cheek. “I want to play with you.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes in surprise. “Forget it. Those games don’t have much technical content. They’re meaningless to you.”","Gu Zheng smiled. Ordinary competitive games did not interest top hackers like him, but if it was with Mrs. Gu, he would be very interested in playing. He asked, “You’re also a top hacker. Why do you like to play that game, then? And you even play with Gu Yao.”","Qiao Xi was stunned for a few seconds. Why did she feel that these words were laced with a little jealousy?","She hurriedly explained, “Gu Yao and I play the same game, but the difference in our levels is too big. We can’t play together, so we play by ourselves.”","Gu Zheng instantly understood. It turned out that Gu Yao’s rank was too low and he could not form a team with Qiao Xi, so he could only watch Qiao Xi fight in the game while expressing his admiration for her.","Qiao Xi yawned, and her eyes were slightly sore. She lay lazily on the bed and said coquettishly, “Ah Zheng, I’m so tired! I’ll sleep first. Wake me up in the morning. I still have documents to handle.”","Gu Zheng covered her up with the blanket and said gently, “Sleep well. I’ll help you handle the documents.”","After Qiao Xi fell asleep, Gu Zheng picked up her phone. He had just unlocked the password when a game interface appeared on the screen. Mrs. Gu kept saying that she was too busy to play games, but she was clearly still playing before she fell asleep."]},{"number":908,"title":"Chapter 908 - The Allure Of The Game","paragraphs":["Gu Zheng had always thought that Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng were playing a competitive game, but the animation on the game interface was too childish. He frowned and tapped on the screen. A line of words appeared clearly: [Welcome back! Dear Princess Xi Xi, please help Lisa choose a dress to attend the dance.]","The corners of Gu Zheng’s mouth suddenly twitched. The phone in his hand was like a hot potato. He suddenly felt a little awkward.","This was actually a game for little girls where one did makeovers? This was the game Qiao Xi and Gu Yao were playing together?","Gu Zheng sat on the chair and could not calm down for a long time. He looked at the game interface in a daze. He was very curious about the allure of this game. It actually made a man like Gu Yao so obsessed. Hence, the domineering president, Gu Zheng, downloaded the makeup game that countless little girls liked.","...","The next morning, Gu Yao went downstairs early as it was the day of the official merger of Heavenly Sound and Qingfeng. However, he realized that the butler and Song Shiyu were not around. Gu Zheng was the only one sitting on the sofa with his phone.","The living room was filled with game music. Gu Yao suddenly stopped in his tracks and looked at Gu Zheng in shock. His brother was also playing a game? Was he still Gu Zheng?","Gu Yao approached with a strange expression. Gu Zheng looked up and glanced at him before focusing on the game again. Gu Yao suddenly became nervous. Could it be that Gu Zheng knew that he was playing this game? What was wrong with him playing this game? At first, he only watched Li Xing’er play the game. Then, he became curious about the allure of this game, so he downloaded it.","Looking at Gu Zheng’s expression, Gu Yao could not help but gulp. He was afraid that Gu Zheng would laugh at him, so he decided to take the initiative. He placed his hands behind his back and pretended to be calm. “Hey! Gu Zheng, how old are you? You’re actually playing this game that little girls like? You’re a man! You’re playing makeover games like this? How inappropriate! If news of this gets out, it’ll damage your dignity!”","Gu Zheng sneered without turning his head.","“You’re unconvinced? Do you believe that I’ll tell Qiao Xi?” Gu Yao had an arrogant expression.","“So?” Gu Zheng replied disdainfully.","Gu Yao looked at Gu Zheng’s indifferent expression and was suddenly a little angry. It was not easy for him to have something on Gu Zheng, so how could he let him off so easily? He put on a shameless posture. “You’re the president of Gu Corporation and the head of the Gu family. How dare you hide in the living room early in the morning to play a game meant for little girls?","......","“Time is money. Every minute you have is so precious, yet you’re actually using it to play games? I was really wrong about you. You’ve really disappointed me.”","Gu Zheng sneered and continued playing the game, not taking him seriously at all. Gu Yao sat beside Gu Zheng, and his gaze subconsciously landed on his phone screen. He asked in surprise, “How did you pass?”","“You want to know?” Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow.","Gu Yao nodded without hesitation. “Yes!”","“I also want to know why you can’t pass such a simple round.” Gu Zheng’s tone was indifferent, but there was a trace of disdain.","Gu Yao was embarrassed and snorted angrily. “I don’t play this game. Don’t malign me!”","“How do you know it’s difficult to pass if you haven’t played it before? Are you still gonna lie to me?” A trace of ridicule flashed past Gu Zheng’s eyes as he quietly watched Gu Yao pretend.","Gu Yao was still unconvinced. “I just saw Li Xing’er playing. I downloaded it, but I didn’t play it at all!”","“You don’t play it?” Gu Zheng pointed at the friend list on the screen. Gu Yao’s name was displayed there. “If you don’t play this game, why is your name here? Moreover, it shows that you’ve already passed 130 rounds.”","Gu Yao wanted to cry but had no tears. How could he have forgotten about this? It was too awkward for his brother to realize that he played such a game.","On the other hand, Gu Zheng clicked into Gu Yao’s homepage curiously. Suddenly, the corners of his mouth twitched slightly. Then, he looked at his silly brother in disdain. “Gu Yao, your game name is Yao Yao?”","...","After breakfast, Gu Yao complained to Qiao Xi with an aggrieved expression. “Sister-in-law! Control Gu Zheng. Is this how he treats his younger brother? He looks down on me for playing the makeover game and even mocked my username!”","Only then did Qiao Xi realize that she had forgotten to exit the game interface yesterday. Gu Zheng should have seen it.","Gu Yao was indignant. “What’s wrong with playing a makeover game? What right does he have to look down on me? I’ve decided that from today onward, I want to be an internet-addicted youth! I want to play a difficult game!”","Qiao Xi shook her head helplessly. ‘With your IQ, you can probably only play such games.’"]},{"number":909,"title":"Chapter 909 - Uninvited Guests","paragraphs":["At Gu Corporation’s headquarters.","A black Rolls-Royce stopped in front of the door. The chauffeur hurriedly got out of the car and opened the door. “President, we’re here.”","Gu Zheng nodded and held Qiao Xi’s hand as they got out of the car. Under the burning gazes of everyone, Qiao Xi was slightly uncomfortable. “Gu Zheng, I’m just signing a contract. There’s no need to make such a big fuss, right?”","As soon as she entered, Qiao Xi saw the special decorations around her. Everyone bowed to the two of them. Gu Zheng held her hand and walked straight to the elevator. Everyone was curious and afraid, so they could only take a few glances.","“So that’s Mrs. Gu!”","“Mrs. Gu is really good-looking. No wonder the president dotes on her so much!”","“Have you all heard? Yesterday, Mrs. Gu went to Heavenly Voice Entertainment but was stopped by two women. They said that Mrs. Gu wasn’t worthy of President Gu at all and she didn’t have the ability to manage the company.”","After the two of them went upstairs, someone immediately sent over the contract and documents. After Qiao Xi signed the paperwork, she took a deep breath and said, “Actually, the person who founded Qingfeng was my mother. She was also the one who named Qingfeng Entertainment. I only saw it in her notebook. I found that notebook when I was packing up my mother’s belongings. Later on, it was almost burned by Xu Mei. Fortunately, I managed to salvage half of it, so it’s still fresh in my mind.”","Hearing Qiao Xi’s words, Gu Zheng frowned. Xu Mei was really evil. Letting her spend the rest of her life in prison was letting her off easy.","“When Mom died, this entertainment company had yet to be officially established, but it was already in its infancy and was left to Mr. Li to manage. Mr. Li and his son have been working hard for this company all these years. If it weren’t for them, Qingfeng Entertainment wouldn’t exist today. I’d even be willing to give all the company’s funds and power to Mr. Li. Unfortunately, Mom didn’t have the chance to see Qingfeng Entertainment at its peak now.","“Mr. Li used the start-up funds left behind by my mother and his savings over the years to manage Qingfeng Entertainment with difficulty. At that time, the company only had one artist and no resources. With Eldest Brother’s help six years ago, Qingfeng Entertainment finally made a splash in the entertainment industry.”","Gu Zheng pulled her into his arms and chuckled. “Then I have to thank Shen Yu. Without him, the two companies wouldn’t have been able to merge today.”","Qiao Xi lowered her eyes and was about to speak when her secretary suddenly called. “President, there’s an old man in the hall. He claims to be Young Madam’s grandfather and wants to come up.”","......","Grandpa?","Gu Zheng’s gaze turned cold. “No.”","...","The secretary informed the receptionist, who replied in embarrassment, “Old Master, the young madam is very busy and doesn’t have time to see you for the time being.”","In reality, the receptionist was already used to dealing with people who tried to get close to the president. There had been more than 10 people who said they were the president’s family members. These people must know that the president had a bad temper, so they started pretending to be Young Madam’s relatives.","The receptionist looked at the old man and the young lady in front of her helplessly. “I’m sorry, but please come back another day.”","Xia Cheng’s expression instantly darkened. This unfilial daughter, Qiao Xi, was actually refusing to see him? Qingfeng Entertainment, which was in her hands, occupied half of the variety shows in the entertainment industry. Its annual income was very considerable. That was Xia Yunqiu’s asset, which meant it was also the Xia family’s asset. What qualifications did Qiao Xi have to keep it all for herself? She should give Yunlou and Mengyan some shares.","He had given Qiao Xi face by personally coming to Gu Corporation. He did not expect that Qiao Xi would actually refuse to meet them.","Xia Cheng pointed at Xia Mengyan who was beside him and glared at her. “This is the young madam’s sister, and I’m the young madam’s grandfather. Are you sure you’ve reported it to Qiao Xi?”","The receptionist revealed a formal smile. “We’ve already reported it according to the standard procedures. The president has said that he won’t be seeing you today. No matter whose relative you are, as long as the president doesn’t agree, we don’t have the right to let you in. Why don’t you call Young Madam? As long as she agrees, I believe the president won’t refuse.”","Xia Cheng’s expression darkened. Seeing this, Xia Mengyan hurriedly said gently, “Xi Xi is arguing with us. We can’t contact her, so let us in.”","As soon as she finished speaking, the receptionist’s patience ran out. She said with disdain, “So many people come and claim to be the president or young madam’s relatives. Our president and young madam are busy, so how could they have the time to meet you? Please leave!”","Xia Cheng was so angry that his beard trembled. He snorted. “Bastard! They’re refusing to meet us? Mengyan! Let’s go!”"]},{"number":910,"title":"Chapter 910 - She’s Young And Insensible","paragraphs":["Xia Mengyan looked helpless. “Grandpa, don’t be angry. Cousin is now the wife of the president of Gu Corporation. She’s arrogant, so she looks down on us. Your health isn’t good, so don’t be angry. Let’s go home first.”","When the people at the side heard this, they instantly frowned. There were many people in the company, and the news quickly spread throughout the entire company. Mrs. Gu had just taken over the position, yet she did not acknowledge her grandfather anymore? No matter what, he was her grandfather. The old master personally came to the company to look for her, but she refused to see him?","“Is Mrs. Gu so heartless?”","“She’s young, so it’s normal for her to fool around considering how much President Gu dotes on her. However, Mrs. Gu is insensible. Could it be that President Gu doesn’t know what’s going on? He’s actually letting her fool around?”","“I heard that President Gu went to a meeting. It must be because Mrs. Gu doesn’t want to see her relatives, so she instructed the front desk to chase her away.”","Hearing the crowd’s discussion, Xia Mengyan lowered her head and smiled sinisterly. When she looked up again, she frowned and looked troubled. “Grandpa, let’s go. Cousin must be too busy to see us. She’s not looking down on us.”","Xia Cheng snorted. “As an elder, I’ve already come personally, but she’s unwilling to see me. What is she so busy with that she doesn’t even have time to meet me for a few minutes?”","With that, Xia Cheng coughed violently, looking heartbroken.","Xia Mengyan helped him vent his anger and said with a bitter smile, “Grandpa, she’s married to President Gu now and doesn’t care about us anymore. Why are you angry with her?”","“This is too much!” Suddenly, someone could not help but say, “Just because she’s married to the president, she can be arrogant and refuse to see her elders? What’s there for her to be arrogant about?!” At this moment, a young man in a suit walked over. He was not an employee of the company but was here to discuss a collaboration with Gu Corporation. He comforted Xia Mengyan softly, saying, “Miss, don’t be anxious. I’ll help you ask around.”","With that, the man walked toward the front desk, his eyes filled with anger. “Even if she’s the wife of the president, she can’t refuse to meet her elders! The old man came all the way to the company just to see his granddaughter, but she refuses to pay attention to him. Isn’t that too unreasonable?”","After being questioned like this, the receptionist suddenly lost her confidence. “The president said...”","“How could President Gu not want to see his elders? It must clearly be Mrs. Gu’s idea! She’s young and insensible. Don’t you understand? The old man couldn’t contact his granddaughter, so he rushed all the way here. However, you insist on not letting them in. If President Gu blames you, can you bear the responsibility?”","......","The man turned to look at Xia Mengyan. Seeing her red eyes, his heart softened. “Don’t be sad. The matter will be resolved.”","Xia Mengyan lowered her eyes and smiled bitterly. “Thank you. Actually, I’m already used to it. Xi Xi is wilful, but she’s still very kind. If she finds out that Grandpa dragged his sick body to see her, her heart will definitely soften.”","“You’re welcome. I just can’t stand to see a beauty suffer. I’m an employee of Jiye Corporation. No matter what, I’ll help you to the end today!”","Seeing Xia Mengyan’s aggrieved look and tears, his heart immediately ached. “If Mrs. Gu still doesn’t want to see you, I’ll go upstairs and look for her to reason things out. She actually made her grandfather wait here—”","“Miss Xia, Old Master Xia.” At this moment, a sweet voice interrupted the man’s arrogant words.","Everyone looked in the direction of the voice and saw Qiao Xi slowly walking toward them. Her indifferent gaze swept across the crowd before she finally looked at Xia Mengyan. Before Xia Mengyan could speak, the young man stood up and reprimanded, “Mrs. Gu, your grandfather has been waiting for you downstairs for a long time. You didn’t answer his calls and refused to see him. You even asked the receptionist to chase them away. You’re too much!”","Qiao Xi glanced at the nameplate on the man’s clothes with an indifferent expression. Xia Mengyan was really charming. It had only been a short while, yet someone was already standing up for her.","Xia Mengyan smiled proudly. No matter what her grandfather had done in the past, he was still Qiao Xi’s grandfather. If Qiao Xi did not acknowledge him as her grandfather, she would be unfilial! Even if she held a high position, she would still be despised by the world.","“Xi Xi, you’re married to President Gu now. I can understand that you want to cut ties with us and are unwilling to interact with us, but...” Xia Mengyan looked sad and could not help but sob."]},{"number":911,"title":"Chapter 911 - Mrs. Gu Is Here","paragraphs":["Seeing Xia Mengyan cry sadly, the surrounding people were furious. Mrs. Gu treated her elders and relatives like this just because she was married to President Gu. It was simply unreasonable.","When Xia Mengyan saw everyone’s indignant expressions, the corners of her mouth curled up slightly. Then, she pretended to be nervous and said, “Everyone, don’t misunderstand. Xi Xi has just become the president and is very busy every day. It’s not her intention to avoid Grandpa.”","However, the more she explained while trembling with fear, the more people felt that Qiao Xi looked down on them. Perhaps she even used her power to bully them. Under all this pressure, Qiao Xi might have to obediently hand over the shares of Qingfeng Entertainment.","Xia Mengyan stared fixedly at Qiao Xi. If she was unwilling to apologize, then she would be labeled as unfilial. The handover would probably not go smoothly either. Moreover, the internet would definitely be filled with curses. At that time, both entertainment companies would be boycotted. She wanted to see if Qiao Xi could hold on to her position as the president!","Unexpectedly, as soon as she finished speaking, Xia Mengyan heard a soft and choked voice. “Miss Xia, are you and Old Master Xia here to see me?”","Qiao Xi’s eyes were slightly red, and her voice trembled slightly. “Is this true? I thought you would never come to see me.”","Xia Mengyan was instantly stunned. Why was Qiao Xi crying? What was she trying to do?","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart, and her eyes were filled with disdain and disgust. When she heard that the two of them had come to Gu Corporation, she knew that there was definitely nothing good going on. Now that Qingfeng Entertainment and Heavenly Voice Entertainment had merged, the impact was huge. The Xia family would definitely get jealous. They wanted to stand on the moral high ground and force her to hand over Qingfeng Entertainment’s shares. However, with Xia Mengyan’s acting skills, was she worthy of pretending to be an innocent lady? Her skills were still lacking!","Qiao Xi lowered her head and squeezed out a few drops of tears. She choked and said, “Miss Xia, I thought that all of you had forgotten about me a long time ago. I sent you a lot of messages before, but they all went unanswered. I thought that you didn’t want to see me, so when I heard that my grandfather and cousin were here, I thought that scammers were pretending to be my family members. I never expected to really see you here!”","The receptionist quickly echoed, “That’s right. President Gu also thought that they were scammers, so he said that he wouldn’t see them. That’s because it’s impossible for Young Madam’s grandfather to come looking for her. Young Madam has never met or contacted her grandfather. She wouldn’t have expected her family to suddenly come over today.”","At this moment, everyone started to panic. “In that case, Young Madam and her grandfather have never met. Moreover, she has sent messages to her family but they didn’t respond. That’s why she didn’t believe that her grandfather was here to see her.”","“If Young Madam’s grandfather isn’t close to her, why did he suddenly show up today? If I were Young Madam, I wouldn’t believe it either!”","The corners of Xia Mengyan’s mouth twitched slightly. How did Qiao Xi instantly turn the situation around with just a few words? Her face was gloomy, and the man beside her hurriedly stood up to defend the injustice. “Mrs. Gu, are you truly happy that your grandfather and cousin are here to see you? In that case, why are you calling your grandfather ‘Old Master Xia’ and your cousin ‘Miss Xia’? If you really treat them as family, you wouldn’t be so distant.”","......","Everyone could not help but nod. They felt that Mrs. Gu’s way of addressing her family members was very strange. Xia Mengyan instantly heaved a sigh of relief. She admitted that Qiao Xi was a little smart, but she had made a mistake.","Qiao Xi lowered her head and was silent for a moment. Suddenly, she raised her eyes and looked at Xia Cheng and Xia Mengyan with tears in her eyes. “I’ve been wandering outside since I was young. I wanted to contact the Xia family, but I never got a response. Speaking of which, this is the first time I’ve met Old Master Xia. It’s normal for us to be unfamiliar with each other. Moreover... a long time ago, Old Master Xia asked Miss Xia to remind me that I’m just a wild girl. I’m not worthy to be a member of the Xia family, nor am I worthy to call him ‘Grandpa’. So before Old Master Xia agrees, I don’t dare to change how I address him so casually. I... Boo-hoo...”","After she finished speaking, Qiao Xi looked at the man from Jiye Corporation. Her eyes were red, and her voice was delicate. “Sir, I’m just respecting their wishes. That’s why I didn’t change the way I address them. You won’t blame me for this, right?”","Everyone’s hearts ached when they saw Mrs. Gu cry silently. They also heard that she had been wandering outside since she was young and the Xia family had never looked for her. They sympathized with her even more.","Xia Mengyan’s face was pale as she hurriedly stopped her. “Xi Xi, how can you say that? Grandpa clearly—”","“Miss Xia, Old Master Xia, I haven’t seen you in so many years. Could it be that you suddenly came here today for Qingfeng Entertainment?” Qiao Xi interrupted her with a trace of grievance in her tone as she looked at them in confusion."]},{"number":912,"title":"Chapter 912 - The President Protects His Wife","paragraphs":["“Qingfeng Entertainment was indeed left to me by my mother, but Old Master Xia and my grandmother divorced decades ago. At that time, the assets were also divided. Ever since then, my mother has never returned to the Xia family and has been living with my grandmother. My mother used the money my grandmother gave her to establish Qingfeng Entertainment, and it was left to me. Logically speaking, the company has nothing to do with the Xia family. I also want to give Qingfeng Entertainment to you, but I think my mother in heaven will definitely not agree.","“After you divorced Grandma, you stopped contacting Mom. You never even attended her funeral after she passed away. She had a grudge against you, but you’re now asking me to transfer the shares of Qingfeng Entertainment to you. This will go against Mom’s wishes. Moreover, the two companies have already merged. Gu Zheng has a portion of the shares. I really can’t make the decision myself.”","Qiao Xi’s tone was filled with sorrow as she sighed helplessly. “I’ve never seen you before. I didn’t expect our first meeting to be in such a manner.”","Her voice became more and more choked up. “You despise me for being abandoned by the Qiao family and wandering outside alone, so you don’t acknowledge that I’m from the Xia family and refuse to let me call you ‘Grandpa’. I can understand that, but...”","At this moment, the employees of Gu Corporation finally could not stand it anymore. They said indignantly, “When Mrs. Gu was wandering outside alone, the Xia family despised her and didn’t let her come home. The old master also doesn’t allow her to call him ‘Grandpa’. Now that they know that she’s married to the president and is the chairwoman of Qingfeng Entertainment, they’re here to blackmail her. Do they still have any shame?”","The beautiful woman at the front desk also snorted. “You just want to get benefits from Mrs. Gu because she’s rich and powerful. Where were you when Mrs. Gu suffered when she was young? Now that she’s rich, you came to the company to put on a show. How do you have the cheek to say those things?”","“That person from Jia Ye Corporation is also crazy. He actually spoke up for that woman without distinguishing between right and wrong. He just saw that she’s a little good-looking and became momentarily lustful.”","The face of the man from Jia Ye Corporation instantly flushed red as he lowered his head in shame. Xia Mengyan, who was at the side, wished for nothing more than to find a hole to hide in. She bit her lip and calmed down for a long time before saying in a trembling voice, “Xi Xi, Grandpa has never said such things. You’ll always be a member of our Xia family and Grandpa’s granddaughter. All these years when you were wandering outside, we all missed you very much. Aunt Yunlou was also worried about you. How could you think of us like that? Grandpa must be so sad to hear you say that!”","Xia Mengyan burned with rage. She came here today to force Qiao Xi to hand over the shares, but before she could obtain the shares, Qiao Xi had labeled her as a high and mighty big shot. She forcefully suppressed the anger in her heart and gritted her teeth. “You’ve really misunderstood us. We’ve never thought of getting the shares of Qingfeng Entertainment. We’re only here to see you. You can’t maliciously speculate about us!”","“Malicious speculation?”","At this moment, an extremely cold voice came from afar. The man was tall and exuded the aura of a king. As soon as he appeared, everything around him lost its glow.","A group of men and women in business attire stood behind Gu Zheng. They were all higher-ups of Gu Corporation. Gu Zheng slowly walked over, and everyone made way for him. He was the owner of Gu Corporation. He had shocking wealth and power, and he was also handsome. After he appeared, the entire lobby fell silent. Many female employees could not help but blush.","Gu Zheng walked straight toward Qiao Xi and protected her in his arms. Then, his deep eyes swept toward Xia Mengyan as he said in a cold tone, “Miss Xia, can you explain what you mean by malicious speculation?”","......","Xia Mengyan’s eyes were filled with horror, and she did not dare to meet Gu Zheng’s eyes. The corners of his mouth curled up slightly, then he said casually, “Miss Xia, Mrs. Gu is pure and kind. She doesn’t have any ill intentions. She’s just telling the truth.”","Xia Mengyan gritted her teeth. Qiao Xi was pure and kind? She was clearly the most scheming and vicious woman!","However, in front of Gu Zheng, she had to maintain her image, so her voice was gentle. “President Gu, you’ve really misunderstood.”","The man said casually, “Miss Xia, you pretended to be the friend of Qingfeng’s president yesterday and stole Mrs. Gu’s position as the executive president. Today, you came to visit with Old Master Xia. Are you still going to insist that you don’t want Qingfeng Entertainment?”","Song Shiyu said, “Of course, Young Madam would think that you’re doing this for Qingfeng Entertainment when you brought Old Master Xia here today and pretended to be close to her!”","Gu Zheng nodded in satisfaction. He did not hire this assistant for nothing. He was still useful at critical moments."]},{"number":913,"title":"Chapter 913 - The Strong Don’t Care About Rumors","paragraphs":["Gu Zheng lowered his eyes to look at Qiao Xi. His deep eyes were filled with gentleness and affection. He took out a handkerchief from his pocket and gently wiped her face. “Be good and stop crying!”","Qiao Xi took the handkerchief and covered her face while crying. She pretended to wipe the tears on her face.","At this moment, everyone’s eyes were filled with disdain when they looked at Xia Mengyan. It turned out that the woman who caused trouble at Heavenly Voice Entertainment yesterday was Xia Mengyan! The news of her pretending to be the president had already spread. It was just that no one knew who that woman was. Now that President Gu had said so, everyone understood.","Xia Mengyan was clearly the one who shamelessly stole Mrs. Gu’s position. She even brought the old master here today and stood on the moral high ground to criticize Mrs. Gu for being unfilial. If they were not here for Qingfeng Entertainment, what else could it be?","Xia Mengyan’s face was pale as she took a few steps back in horror. Now, everyone knew about her ugly incident yesterday. Qiao Xi was just pretending to be pitiful, but why did everyone believe her? She wanted to pretend to cry, but her tears did not fall.","Qiao Xi whimpered and pounced into Gu Zheng’s arms, crying pitifully.","Everyone hurriedly comforted her softly. “Mrs. Gu, don’t cry. It’s not worth crying for people like them!”","Song Shiyu: “...” Young Madam was really good at pretending, but these people all believed her. There was no trace of her pretending in her eyes at all. Her skills were too good!","Qiao Xi hid in Gu Zheng’s embrace and raised her eyebrows at Xia Mengyan. This was all she could do? She had only used 20% of her strength, yet Xia Mengyan could not take it anymore. She had not even used her trump card!","Everyone looked at Xia Mengyan and Old Master Xia angrily. Xia Mengyan lowered her head and eyes without saying anything. Her nails dug into her palms. Xia Cheng, who was at the side, said with a gloomy face, “President Gu.”","His expression was cold, and he did not care about everyone’s gazes or words at all. He still pretended to be an elder and continued to be so arrogant. “President Gu, we’re here to have a good talk with Xi Xi. Aren’t you going to invite us in to talk?”","Gu Zheng said casually, “Yes, I’m not going to invite you in.”","Xia Cheng’s expression froze for a moment, then he continued, “President Gu, you’re the head of Gu Corporation. You’re all-powerful in the business world. What happened yesterday is already in the past. Why take it to heart?”","......","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow, his voice low and filled with disdain. “Mrs. Gu is kind-hearted. She doesn’t mind Xia Mengyan’s actions, but I do. What right do you have to question me?”","“President Gu, I’m Qiao Xi’s grandfather!”","When Qiao Xi heard Xia Cheng’s angry roar, she was terrified to the point her entire body trembled. She kept hiding in Gu Zheng’s embrace. Gu Zheng gently patted her back, then looked at Xia Cheng with an icy-cold gaze. “So what?”","“President Gu, let’s talk about Mengyan and Xi Xi’s misunderstanding later. No matter what, I’m Xi Xi’s grandfather. We rushed all the way here and have been waiting at the door for so long. How can you refuse to let us in? If news of this gets out, what will everyone say? They’ll say that President Gu is heartless! They’ll even scold Qiao Xi for being unfilial!”","Xia Cheng smiled proudly, thinking that he had Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi under his control. “President Gu, Gu Corporation is in the midst of public opinion now. I don’t know how many enemies want to play tricks on you behind your back. In the past, there was Gu Weiming. If you chase me away now, everyone will definitely think that it’s your fault.”","Qiao Xi’s eyes narrowed slightly. Was this old master tired of living?","Gu Zheng grabbed Qiao Xi’s hand as if he had seen through her thoughts. He did not care about Xia Cheng’s threat at all and said casually, “Old Master Xia, why are you still so naive even though you’ve lived for so long? Let me tell you a principle today. A truly powerful person won’t care about the rumors outside at all. It’s too laughable if you think those unimportant people will affect me.”","Xia Cheng’s expression changed, but he was still unconvinced as he shouted, “You don’t care, but what about Qiao Xi? She’s just a weak lady, yet she has to be cursed by everyone online. Do you think she can endure it?”","“Old Master Xia, don’t tell me you think today’s matter can be spread online? I’ve already told you that I can control everything, including the direction of the rumors. I’ll kill whoever makes Mrs. Gu sad!”","Gu Zheng walked to Xia Cheng’s side and said softly. His deep eyes were filled with strong killing intent. He did not care about Xia Cheng’s threat at all. To him, Xia Cheng was just a flea. He was not afraid at all.","Xia Cheng finally panicked. He could clearly feel Gu Zheng’s killing intent. It was so cold that it seemed to be able to pierce through his heart."]},{"number":914,"title":"Chapter 914 - Dusty Memory","paragraphs":["“Old Master Xia, do you think that because you’ve already arranged for people outside that as long as you give the order, they’ll add fuel to the fire and post this matter online? Moreover, you think that since the people from Jia Ye Corporation will also know about this matter and make it known to everyone, Qiao Xi will bear the reputation of being unfilial regardless of whether this matter is true or not.”","Gu Zheng’s words hit the nail on the head. His indifferent tone and voice made the usually calm Xia Cheng’s face turn livid.","“Mr. Xia, this is my territory. What right do you have to fight me here? Are all the members of the Xia family so naive?”","Xia Cheng’s expression was gloomy, and his eyes were bloodshot. Gu Zheng was just a junior, yet he was so disrespectful to him. However, he could not do anything to Gu Zheng.","A trace of impatience flashed past Gu Zheng’s eyes as if he found it disgusting to say another word to Xia Cheng. He turned to look at Qiao Xi, and his tone became gentle. “Xi Xi, let’s go upstairs.”2","Xia Cheng was unconvinced and wanted to pull Qiao Xi forward immediately, but he was stopped by Song Shijing. He smiled formally. “Mr. Xia, this is Gu Corporation. Our president has the right to decide who to meet. If you think you’re shameless enough, you can stand here and wait. I just don’t know if you have the cheek to continue standing here.”","Xia Cheng stared fiercely at Gu Zheng’s and Qiao Xi’s backs, wishing for nothing more than to rush over and tear them apart. Not only had he not obtained any shares on this trip today, but he was even mocked in public. Since he had already offended Gu Zheng, he could not wait to be trampled on. He had to resist.","On the other hand, Gu Zheng went upstairs and asked Qiao Xi to rest in the inner room while he sat in the office chair. His gentle expression earlier was gradually shrouded by a layer of darkness, and his entire body emitted dense killing intent.","Song Shiyu was so scared that his body trembled. He asked in a trembling voice, “President, do you need me to do anything about those two people from the Xia family? I’ll deal with them.”","Gu Zheng looked up and glanced at him coldly. Song Shiyu gasped. Song Shijing glanced at him. Why was this younger brother of his still so stupid? The president went downstairs because he cared about Young Madam. No matter who the person was, as long as they bullied Young Madam, the president would not sit idly by. He had to tell everyone that Qiao Xi was his wife. If they wanted to bully Qiao Xi, they had to go through him.","Afraid that his brother would anger the president, Song Shijing said quickly, “President, have you dealt with Old Master Xia’s subordinates?”","Gu Zheng responded indifferently. Song Shijing was a little surprised. “He must have made full preparations this time and brought a lot of people with him. How did you resolve the issue so quickly?”","“Are those pieces of trash under him worthy of wasting my time?” Gu Zheng tapped his long fingers on the table, his tone very disdainful.","......","Xia Cheng’s subordinates were nothing in the president’s eyes. Who else present would dare to take the risk of offending the president and spread the news?","What Gu Zheng did was to nip the rumors in the bud and not let anyone have the chance to hurt Mrs. Gu. He would not allow such things to happen.","“What about that person from Jia Ye Corporation?” Song Shijing asked.","Gu Zheng thought for a moment and said coldly, “Jia Ye Corporation spent a lot of effort to get this collaboration, so I was willing to give them a chance. However, they didn’t cherish it, so we’ll cancel the collaboration. Jiaye Corporation isn’t the best choice for us.”","Song Shijing nodded and immediately issued the president’s order. The president of Jia Ye Corporation never expected that he would lose the collaboration with Gu Corporation just because he spoke up for a woman. They had spent a lot of money and time to get this opportunity. Now, because of his carelessness, all their previous efforts were ruined.","...","At this moment, Qiao Xi was resting in the office. She casually picked up a book from the shelf and was just about to sit down when she noticed that there was a yellow notebook hidden behind the shelf. It looked very old and seemed to be filled with stories. Qiao Xi’s entire body trembled as her forehead suddenly hurt violently as if something was about to rush out of her mind.","Gu Zheng pushed open the door to the inner room and quickly walked toward her. He bent down and asked softly, “Are you feeling unwell?”","Qiao Xi held her forehead as her mind was a mess. A few unfamiliar scenes flashed past her mind, and her heart ached. Her body seemed to be covered in a cold sweat as a suffocating feeling swept over her, causing her to break out in a cold sweat."]},{"number":915,"title":"Chapter 915 - Injured And Unconscious","paragraphs":["When she was young, Qiao Xi was pushed into the water by Qiao Rou and almost drowned. After that, she was very afraid of water for the next few years. It was only after she challenged herself countless times that she slowly learned how to swim. However, before that, it was absolutely impossible for her to approach the water’s edge, nor was it possible for her to dive into the sea. Even so, those memories were firmly engraved in her mind and could not be erased.","“Xi Xi,” Gu Zheng called out softly, then took the yellow notebook from her hand. He bent down and picked up Qiao Xi who was in pain while gently placing her on the bed and caressing her forehead. “Close your eyes and calm down for a while.”","Qiao Xi could not open her eyes, nor could she hear anything. She was deeply immersed in her own world. There was a dark beach in front of her, and the surrounding was cold and dark blue seawater. Her nose was filled with the strong smell of blood and salt from the seawater. Her hands and feet seemed to be tied up, and she was unable to struggle free. She could only watch helplessly as she sank into the sea. Gradually, she grew unable to breathe.","“Xi Xi?”","Gu Zheng’s slightly cold lips landed on her eyes. They were extremely gentle and trembling. Gu Zheng reached out and gently stroked her cheek, afraid that he would hurt her. His low and hoarse voice murmured in her ear, but it still could not wake her up from her nightmare.","“I’ll be by your side forever. Don’t be afraid.”","This time, Qiao Xi slept for a long time. When she woke up, the sky was very dark outside, and her temples were slightly painful. She carefully recalled what had happened before she fell asleep. She vaguely remembered that she had casually picked up a book and seen something. For some reason, she fell asleep and had another nightmare.","Qiao Xi had a splitting headache as if someone had punched a hole in her forehead. She was missing something. She raised her eyes to look around and confirmed that she was still in the office. Did that mean she had slept from morning till night? When did she sleep so well? She remembered that when she was busy completing design drafts in the past, she would still be full of energy. She could go two days and two nights without sleep. However, she seemed to not have ha enough sleep recently.","“You’re awake?”","Gu Zheng’s voice sounded from behind. Qiao Xi abruptly turned around and noticed that Gu Zheng had been sitting on the sofa the entire time. The lights were dim, and his eyes were so empty like a statue.","Gu Zheng was already used to the dark. Even if he could not see, he could quickly find the switch. Instantly, the entire interior lit up, and Gu Zheng’s eyes gradually recovered to a light brown color.","Qiao Xi was stunned for a few seconds. Hadn’t she already detoxified Gu Zheng’s poison? Logically speaking, Gu Zheng should be able to see now, but in the darkness, his eyes were still empty. Qiao Xi suddenly became nervous. “Gu Zheng, can’t you see?”","Gu Zheng was stunned for a moment before he replied softly, “Of course, I can see. Otherwise, how could I have found the switch? I was able to see long ago. It’s just that I can’t see as clearly.","......","“How are you? Are you still feeling unwell?” Gu Zheng did not give her the chance to continue asking and quickly changed the topic. He approached Qiao Xi and reached out to rub her forehead before smiling. “Mrs. Gu, you’re really stupid.”","Qiao Xi cried out in pain as a dull pain came from her forehead. Coincidentally, there was a mirror opposite her. She hurriedly looked over and saw that her forehead was red and swollen.","What was going on? Could it be that she suddenly fainted because her head hit the bookshelf?","“How is it? Does your head still hurt?”","The two of them looked in the direction of the voice. Ye Qingyuan walked in with the first aid kit. When he saw that Qiao Xi was awake, he smiled and said, “I thought you would sleep for a longer period of time. Miss Qiao, you’re really awesome!”","Qiao Xi could not help but blush. Had she really fainted from hitting her head on the bookshelf? Wasn’t this too awkward?","Ye Qingyuan handed the first aid kit to Gu Zheng. “Apply the medicine on her.”","Qiao Xi looked at him and asked in surprise, “Why aren’t you applying it for me? You’re the doctor!”","“Me? You have to get your jealous lover to agree first! I’ve already delivered the medicine, so I’ll leave first. Take note of your wound these few days. You’ll be fine in a few days. It’s just a small injury. Is it worth calling me over at night? Moreover, Mrs. Gu, you know medicine. Did you need me to come over?”","Gu Zheng glanced at him coldly. “The medicine is here. You can leave now.”","Ye Qingyuan smiled helplessly. Just as he was about to leave, he was stopped by Qiao Xi. “Wait, Doctor Ye, do you know Huang Yu?”","“I do.” Ye Qingyuan nodded. Qiao Xi gestured for Ye Qingyuan to walk over and whispered in his ear, “Help me pass a message to him. Gu Zheng’s eyes...”"]},{"number":916,"title":"Chapter 916 - Complaining About The President In Her Heart","paragraphs":["Ye Qingyuan frowned and suddenly realized something. “Are you worried about his eyes? He’ll be fine. You just detoxified the poison in his body not long ago. The poison in his body needs to be eliminated bit by bit. At least the poison won’t flare up anymore. He’ll just lose his sight occasionally. He was poisoned for so many years that the poison has already spread to various parts of his body. He can’t be cured in a day or two. You know medicine too, so you should understand this logic.”","Qiao Xi nodded. Of course, she knew that there was a need for a transitional period, but she could not help but worry. If her blood could not help Gu Zheng detoxify the poison in his body, then there would be nothing in the world that could.","Ye Qingyuan comforted her softly, saying, “Even if Ah Zheng still can’t see at night, he’s already a normal person now. At least, he won’t suddenly have a relapse. It’s already a big step forward for him. You can’t be so nervous just because Gu Zheng was poisoned. Calm down and he’ll naturally recover in the future.","“Gu Zheng loves you so much. How could he bear to die?” Ye Qingyuan glanced at the man standing in front of the French windows. “The two of you are now connected by blood. If he dies, you won’t be able to live either. So even if it’s for you, he’ll cherish his life and try his best to survive!”","Hearing Ye Qingyuan’s comforting words, Qiao Xi’s anxious heart finally relaxed. Was she too nervous? But why did she keep feeling that Gu Zheng was hiding something from her? Should she hypnotize Gu Zheng to see what he was hiding?","After comforting Qiao Xi, Ye Qingyuan stood up and left. Gu Zheng followed him out. Ye Qingyuan raised his eyes to look at him and said helplessly, “Ah Zheng, let me remind you that she knows hypnosis. Maybe one day, she’ll hypnotize you. At that time, she’ll know everything. I helped you lie to her this time, but I might not be able to do it again. Gu Zheng, she’ll have to face all of this sooner or later. It’s better to let her adapt sooner.”","Gu Zheng was silent for a moment, then he said in a low voice, “I know I’ll have to face her sooner or later. But no matter what, you have to help me hide it from her for now. I’ll owe you one.”","Ye Qingyuan shook his head, sighed, and turned to leave.","Gu Zheng returned to the office and helped Qiao Xi apply the medicine. Then, the two of them returned to Longwan Residential. While Song Shiyu was not around, Qiao Xi suddenly looked up. “Gu Zheng, look into my eyes.”","At this moment, her eyes were slightly red, and her expression became serious. The images in her mind appeared again and interrupted her hypnosis. She gathered her thoughts again and asked softly, “Gu Zheng, can’t you see?”","The man’s eyes were empty, and his light brown eyes were pitch-black. His expression had also become dull. He was like a puppet as he calmly answered Qiao Xi’s question, “I occasionally lose my sight at night.”","Qiao Xi was just about to continue asking when Gu Zheng’s eyes suddenly recovered their clarity. Qiao Xi knew that the defense mechanism in Gu Zheng’s heart was very strong, so she probably wouldn’t be able to get anything out of him. However, this wasn’t normal. Could it be that her hypnosis had failed?","Coincidentally, Song Shiyu walked over at this moment. She thought that she might as well look for Song Shiyu to try and see if her hypnosis was effective. She was thinking about when to hypnotize Song Shiyu when he walked in front of them. Gu Zheng instructed coldly, “The company has developed a new project in a remote mountain area. Go and inspect the situation tomorrow.”","......","Song Shiyu was stunned. He had only gone to the bathroom. Why was he sent to the mountains as soon as he came back? How did he offend this big shot?","He wanted to cry. “President... How did I...”","Before he could finish, Gu Zheng glanced at him coldly. “You’re unhappy about it?”","Song Shiyu felt as if he had been struck by lightning. How could the president say such cold words? It hurt him too much. However, he could only complain in his heart and scold the president for being a bastard. He revealed a flattering smile. “I submit to your orders! Of course, I have to listen to the president’s orders! Every decision you make is wise! I promise to complete the mission!”","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow and looked at him, revealing his white teeth. “You wouldn’t be scolding me in your heart right now, right?”","On the other hand, Qiao Xi knew that Song Shiyu was going to the mountains soon. If she did not ask today, she would not have had the chance. Her eyes immediately darkened. Song Shiyu was stunned, then his eyes became empty. A voice echoed in his mind. ‘You wouldn’t be scolding me in your heart right now, right?’"]},{"number":917,"title":"Chapter 917 - The Miserable Song Shiyu","paragraphs":["Song Shiyu wanted to deny it. As an assistant, how could he dare to scold Gu Zheng? Even if he thought so, he could not say it. However, he suddenly lost the ability to think, and his body was out of control. He could not help but tell the truth. “Yes! I’m scolding you in my heart, you bastard! You’re a pervert who always tortures his assistants!”","Song Shiyu: “...” ‘Damn! Why can’t I control my mouth?’","His strong desire to live made his face ferocious. Qiao Xi’s gaze was sharp as she continued to control his thoughts.","Gu Zheng smirked and leaned lazily on the sofa. “You’re indeed scolding me in your heart.”","Song Shiyu said crazily, “Of course, I’m scolding you. If it weren’t for you being the person who gives me my salary, do you think I would constantly let myself be the target of your anger? I’m telling you, give me a raise immediately or I’ll kneel down and beg you!”","Qiao Xi: “...” Even when he was hypnotized, he was still so cowardly?","Gu Zheng was silent for a moment before he sneered. “I didn’t expect Assistant Song to think that way! I understand.”","Qiao Xi retracted her gaze and ended the hypnosis. It seemed that there was nothing wrong with her hypnosis. Otherwise, why would Song Shiyu dare to say such things?","At this moment, Song Shiyu did not remember what he had just said. He just looked at the president and Young Madam in confusion. Why were their expressions so strange?","Just then, Song Shijing walked over and looked at him with sorrow. “I admire your courage!”","Song Shiyu said, “Huh?”","...","When Qiao Xi returned home from work the next day, she heard Song Shiyu’s screams echoing in the villa. “President! I definitely didn’t say those words. I was controlled by someone! My loyalty to you can be seen by the heavens. How could I scold you in my heart? If you tell me to go left, I wouldn’t dare to go right. If you wanted more food, I wouldn’t dare to turn the table. My admiration for you is endless!","......","“Last night’s incident must be a misunderstanding. I’ve been with you for so many years and am loyal to you. How could I call you a bastard? You’re the best man in the world!”","Then, Gu Zheng glanced at him indifferently. Qiao Xi, who was outside the door, could not stand it anymore. After all, Song Shiyu was suffering now because of her. She pushed the door open and explained, “Um... I believe Assistant Song wouldn’t say such things. Maybe he was just drunk.”","Seeing Young Madam plead for him, Song Shiyu was so touched that tears welled up in his eyes. He almost knelt down and kowtowed to Qiao Xi. “Young Madam is right! How could I scold the president?”","Qiao Xi looked at Song Shiyu’s grateful gaze and could not help but feel a little guilty. Gu Zheng glanced at the two of them and waved his hand impatiently to chase Song Shiyu out.","Gu Zheng lazily leaned against the sofa and said casually, “Mu Ming and Mu Ling have already changed their names back. They’ve decided to go overseas to develop their careers.”","Qiao Xi was slightly surprised. “Why? Isn’t it good to be in the country?”","“It’s inevitable that it’s a little troublesome to do business in the country with the Tang family’s name. Although everyone knows that those things have nothing to do with them and they even helped the police investigate the whereabouts of the kidnapped people, their surname is still Tang. Hence, it’s better for them to just go overseas and start their own company.”","“They left you a letter.” Gu Zheng pointed at the envelope on the table.","Qiao Xi opened it and read it carefully. There was a sour feeling in her heart. She and Mu Ling had been enemies since the day they met. They always quarreled and were unwilling to yield to each other. Unexpectedly, one day, they joined forces to deal with the same enemy. Now that she had left just like that after leaving behind a letter, Qiao Xi could not help but be slightly sad.","The Tang family had all received their deserved punishment. It was the end of a chapter for the Tang siblings as well as a new beginning.","After returning to her room, Qiao Xi was still worried about Gu Zheng’s illness, so she went to the forum of the Medical Association. The people gathered here were all famous doctors in the world. Everyone often discussed difficult problems here, so they might discover something unexpected.","[Do you still remember the incident of Lu Qingyun being poisoned? I heard that someone was poisoned with the same poison as her and actually recovered! Who exactly is so powerful?]","Soon, someone replied: [Who else but the divine physician?]","The original poster continued to ask: [But back then, the divine physician treated Lu Qingyun for so long. In the end, Lu Qingyun still died from the poison! That poison is very domineering. Once the poison enters the body, unless the divine physician uses his blood, there’s no other way to detoxify the poison. However, once the blood is used, it means that their lives are connected. Who would risk their lives to save someone?]"]},{"number":918,"title":"Chapter 918 - The Engagement That Was Snatched Away","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi heaved a sigh of relief. In that case, using blood to detoxify the poison was the right thing to do. However, she kept feeling slightly uneasy. She felt that Gu Zheng’s eyes had not fully recovered and only looked normal on the surface.","She frowned and was about to put down her phone when a thread popped up on the screen: [Willing to offer a doctor a lot of money! Looking for the descendant of the divine physician!]","Everyone commented: [The Xia family posted it. They’re offering 30 million! They’re really rich!]","Someone immediately replied: [30 million is nothing to the descendant of the divine physician. I remember that the descendant is a 20-year-old girl with a very unique personality. If she’s unwilling to save someone, it’s useless no matter how much money you offer her. Hence, she definitely doesn’t lack money. The Xia family has been looking for the divine physician for so long, but the girl has never appeared on their doorstep. I reckon they’ll be in trouble this time.]","Qiao Xi’s eyes were deep. Was it that Xia family? So Xia Cheng had been looking for the descendant of the divine physician? What a coincidence!","Her eyes were filled with a cold smile as she ignored the Xia family’s news. Suddenly, her phone rang. She opened it and saw that her private message inbox was about to explode. She was greeted with curses and accusations.","[Don’t you have any shame?! How dare you snatch someone else’s engagement, you b*tch?!]","[Your cousin is kind-hearted and doesn’t want to bicker with you, but you don’t feel guilty at all. You even kept finding trouble with your cousin? Do you have a conscience?]","Qiao Xi frowned in confusion and clicked on the relevant article. She instantly understood. This morning, Sally released a statement. As an internationally renowned perfumer, Sally’s account had always been the center of attention. Coupled with the fact that she came from a large family and had won many international awards, she had gained a large number of fans.","Sally uploaded a video of her playing the zither. Many sharp-eyed netizens immediately recognized that Sally was in Li City. Immediately, the number of comments increased.","[Is Miss Sally in Li City? I think I saw Li City’s ancient castle.]","[That’s right! It’s an ancient castle. I didn’t expect Miss Sally to live near the ancient castle! Every inch of land there is expensive! But I remember that Sally is from Luo City! Why did she go to Li City?]","After the fans asked the question, Xia Mengyan unexpectedly replied: [I signed a contract with Lu Corporation, so I came to Li City to work. My cousin is also in Li City, and my grandparents are also here for a while.]","......","Hearing Xia Mengyan’s reply, everyone could not help but be puzzled. [Miss Sally has a cousin? Why haven’t I heard of her?]","Everyone continued to ask the same question. Everyone was very curious about who Sally’s cousin was. Then, Xia Mengyan agreed to start a live broadcast in the afternoon to answer everyone’s doubts. Hence, reporters from various platforms rushed to the Xia family’s villa, wanting to get first-hand news.","However, the live broadcast that was supposed to start at two o’clock did not start for a long time. As the protagonist, Xia Mengyan, did not appear, the reporters could not help but enter to look for her. Unexpectedly, as soon as they entered, they heard the family’s conversation. “Grandpa, now that Cousin has already married President Gu, it’s meaningless to discuss whose marriage it’s supposed to be. I can’t ruin their marriage.”","The sounds of Xia Mengyan and Old Master Xia arguing came from upstairs. The old master shouted with a trembling voice, “Mengyan! You’re still so weak even after all these years. I told you a long time ago that you’d be bullied like this. Now, look, your fiance has been snatched away! The two of you are my granddaughters. I should be impartial, but she’s too much! If I don’t help you, you’ll be bullied to death by her!”","Then, Old Madam Xia tried to persuade him. “Old Master, don’t blame Mengyan. She doesn’t want to give up this engagement either. It’s just that that person has already married President Gu. What else can Mengyan do? She’s very sad too!”","Xia Cheng sighed helplessly. “I’ve never blamed Mengyan. I just feel sorry for her! As the granddaughter of the Xia family, it’s not difficult for that girl to get a good marriage partner. She could have married anyone, but she just had to snatch her cousin’s fiance! Back then, this marriage was indeed not publicized. Only the Gu and Xia families knew about it. The Gu family didn’t even take it to heart. If President Gu was willing to abide by the agreement, the person who married him should have been you!”","Xia Mengyan lowered her head, and her eyes were red. She choked and said, “Grandpa, I didn’t want this to happen either! But she’s my cousin! Moreover, President Gu doesn’t even know that the person he was supposed to be engaged to is me. Now that what’s done is done, I can only accept it!”"]},{"number":919,"title":"Chapter 919 - Unable To Explain","paragraphs":["“Xi Xi is my cousin, and they’re already married. If I ruin their marriage, won’t I be a mistress? I don’t want to do this!”","Xia Cheng looked helpless. “But she hasn’t apologized at all. She doesn’t feel guilty at all. Don’t you feel aggrieved?”","At this moment, the reporters knew that they had found shocking news. No one turned off the filming equipment. Instantly, all the conversations were heard by the audience in front of the screen. The live broadcast had already exploded on social media.","In that case, it was not difficult for them to guess that the person who stole Sally’s engagement was Mrs. Gu.","[According to the conversation between Sally and Grandpa, I’ll summarize the following points. The Gu family and the Xia family formed an engagement between the two youngsters many years ago. The Gu family didn’t take it to heart, but President Gu has always remembered this matter, which is why he married Mrs. Gu according to the marriage contract. However, President Gu only knew that he was engaged to a daughter of the Xia family, but he didn’t know which daughter of the Xia family it was. Hence, he married Sally’s cousin. In reality, he should have married Sally.]","[In that case, Sally’s cousin knew about the engagement between the Xia and Gu families. She pretended to be the person who was engaged to President Gu and got married to President Gu. Now that the Xia family knows about this, it’s too late.]","[Rumor has it that President Gu dotes on Mrs. Gu very much, but who would have thought that she’s a scheming woman who stole someone else’s marriage contract?]","Someone stepped up and asked: [I remember President Gu saying a few years ago that Heavenly Voice Entertainment was for an important person. This means that President Gu and Mrs. Gu have known each other for a long time. Maybe the two of them are really in love and didn’t get married because of the engagement.]","[Qingfeng Entertainment was officially established six years ago. At that time, Mrs. Gu was only 13 or 14 years old. How could she have the ability to manage a company? I’m guessing that this company originally belonged to the Xia family, so the important person President Gu was talking about might not necessarily be Mrs. Gu. It could even be Sally!]","[That’s why President Gu knows that the person he’s engaged to is the daughter of the Xia family. He also knows that Qingfeng Entertainment is the Xia family’s business, so he decided to give it to his fiancee. Who knew that Mrs. Gu would snatch her cousin’s engagement?]","[The two of them are already married. If Sally tells anyone about this, it’ll ruin their marriage. However, this marriage agreement originally belonged to Sally. She’s President Gu’s fiancee. Now, she can only watch helplessly as the man she loves gets together with her cousin.]","Xia Mengyan’s fans were extremely crazy. They hurriedly ran to Qiao Xi’s account and cursed. Hence, as soon as Qiao Xi went online, she saw an overwhelming amount of insults and curses. As long as someone stood up for her, they would be surrounded by Xia Mengyan’s fans and harshly scolded.","Qiao Xi curled her lips. Xia Mengyan actually said that the engagement was hers?","......","At this moment, Gu Zheng had also seen the rumors online. After all, this matter involved the president of Gu Corporation. Everyone was very concerned about it, and the entire internet was discussing the authenticity of this matter.","Song Shiyu asked in fear, “President, do you want me to handle it now?”","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent, and his voice was low with a trace of disdain. “The Xia family is really becoming more and more shameless.”","Song Shiyu could not help but nod. “Your engagement was set by Madam and Madam Xia Yunqiu. There’s no marriage contract. If the Xia family insists that the person you were engaged to back then was Xia Mengyan, what should we do?”","Gu Zheng revealed a sinister smile. “There’s no marriage contract. It’s my freedom to marry whoever I want. Do I have to listen to their orders?”","“But if the Xia family insists on this matter, we’ll really be unable to explain ourselves. We’ll bring trouble to Young Madam.”","Gu Zheng’s long fingers tapped on the keyboard twice. His eyes were filled with unruliness with a trace of mockery and ridicule. “Doesn’t the Xia family like to cause trouble? Then I’ll give them a gift and watch them deal with the chaos.”","...","The live broadcast in the afternoon was suddenly terminated due to some accidents. Xia Mengyan begged everyone not to spread the news with a troubled expression, but the conversation between the grandfather and granddaughter had already been aired through the live broadcasts. The more she said this, the angrier the fans became. They felt that she was too kind.","Sally was clearly so good to her cousin because she was afraid that this matter would affect her cousin’s reputation, but her cousin disregarded family ties and stole her engagement. She even showed off her love in front of Sally. How sad would Sally feel when she saw the man who originally belonged to her dote on her cousin?!"]},{"number":920,"title":"Chapter 920 - Good Luck","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi’s inbox and the comment section were filled with curses from many netizens. She was occupying the trending list when she suddenly received a call from the Xia family.","“Xi Xi, you know everything, right? Grandpa and I really didn’t do it on purpose. We didn’t expect to be recorded by those reporters. I’m sorry...” Xia Mengyan’s voice was filled with guilt.","Qiao Xi was silent for a few seconds before she suddenly sneered. “You didn’t do it on purpose?”","“Xi Xi, actually, the engagement—”","Qiao Xi interrupted Xia Mengyan coldly. “That engagement was set by my mother and Madam Lu Qingyun, the matriarch of the Gu family. Because my mother is from the Xia family and you’re the daughter of the Xia family, you think this engagement should be yours, right?”","When Xia Mengyan heard Qiao Xi’s words, her heart suddenly tightened. However, there was no marriage contract. It was impossible to find out who the marriage was supposed to be for. As long as the Xia family insisted that the marriage contract was hers, no matter how Qiao Xi explained it, no one would believe her. The seeds of doubt would germinate in everyone’s hearts. At that time, Qiao Xi would be pointed at no matter where she went.","The engagement was a verbal agreement between Xia Yunqiu and Lu Qingyun. There was no substantial evidence. Moreover, the two of them were already dead. Xia Mengyan did not hope for everyone to criticize Qiao Xi. It was enough as long as someone doubted her.","Xia Mengyan smiled proudly but pretended to be sad. “Xi Xi, I’m really sorry. I didn’t want to ruin your reputation, and I’ve been restraining myself, but you clearly did something wrong. Why don’t you have any regrets?”","Qiao Xi replied indifferently, “Oh!”","“Xi Xi, do you know that Gu Corporation is holding a banquet? Most of the people in high society have received invitations. The Xia family has also received an invitation. President Gu is willing to give the Xia family an invitation, which means that he doesn’t hate the Xia family very much. I hope you can put aside your past misunderstandings and get along well with us.”","Qiao Xi looked at the news on the screen. Gu Zheng invited the Xia family to the banquet not because he had already forgiven them but because he had other plans.","“Xi Xi, my grandparents and I will be attending this banquet. Will you be angry? I really don’t want to ruin the relationship between you couple!”","Hearing Xia Mengyan’s words, Qiao Xi instantly understood. Xia Mengyan was not calling to apologize to her. She was clearly here to show off. She thought that she had already caught Gu Zheng’s eye, so she ran in front of her, Mrs. Gu, to show off.","......","“Your legs belong to you. Where you go has nothing to do with us. I wish you good luck!” Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully, then hung up.","Wish her good luck? Xia Mengyan was stunned for a few seconds. Why did she feel slightly uneasy? Could it be that Qiao Xi had a plan? Or was she deliberately scaring them?","Xia Mengyan looked at the invitation in her hand and thought that Qiao Xi must be unwilling, so she deliberately said that. She turned to look at Xia Cheng, her eyes filled with dejection. “Grandpa, Cousin still blames me.”","Old Madam Xia shouted fiercely, “What right does she have to blame you? This marriage agreement is yours! Xia Yunqiu’s surname is Xia, so the marriage agreement she set must be for the eldest daughter of the Xia family! How could it be for that wild girl, Qiao Xi? Moreover, Xia Yunqiu is already dead. The marriage agreement should be decided by us. That wretched girl, Qiao Xi, actually made the decision to snatch your marriage agreement!”","Old Madam Xia smiled proudly. Throughout the years, she had climbed from a down-and-out daughter to the position of the mistress of the Xia family. Could it be that she could not deal with Qiao Xi? Even if the Yin family made the decision for Qiao Xi, they would not be able to prove who this marriage contract belonged to. They could even accuse the Yin family of bullying others.","So what if Yin Lianxin married Xia Cheng back then? In the end, she still ended up getting a divorce. Even her own daughter, Xia Yunlou, had abandoned her.","“Mengyan, look at the situation online. Everyone is speaking up for you. No one believes Qiao Xi at all. She hasn’t appeared to explain herself until now, so it’ll be hard to explain things in the future.”","The corners of Xia Mengyan’s mouth curled into a smile. It was not that Qiao Xi did not want to explain, but she could not explain at all. Who would believe her without any evidence?","Suddenly, Old Madam Xia frowned and asked, “There’s another important matter. Do you know the whereabouts of the divine physician?”","Xia Mengyan shook her head and said helplessly, “There’s still no news. I heard that the descendant of the divine physician doesn’t care about money. He decides who to treat based on his mood, but no one else can treat your and Grandpa’s illness. We can only continue to wait.”"]},{"number":921,"title":"Chapter 921 - Banquet Interview","paragraphs":["Xia Cheng’s expression darkened as a trace of horror flashed past his eyes. His health was getting worse. If he could not find the divine physician or his descendant, it was hard to guarantee that he would not suddenly fall ill one day.","“Mengyan, I heard that President Gu is also looking for the descendant of the divine physician. If you become his woman, you’ll be able to find the divine physician very quickly. Moreover, on the account of President Gu, the divine physician won’t refuse to treat us.”","Xia Mengyan nodded and replied shyly, “Grandpa, I’ll remember. I’ll perform well tomorrow.”","“Gu Corporation will definitely invite reporters to the banquet tomorrow. At that time, you’ll announce in front of everyone that you’re the one engaged to President Gu. The position of Mrs. Gu should belong to you. Even if you can’t get Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng to divorce, you can at least give them some pressure and have them be under your control,” Xia Cheng instructed.","...","The next day.","Every year, Gu Corporation’s large-scale banquets would be broadcasted live. Reporters from all platforms would rush over and wait at the venue of Gu Corporation’s banquets.","“President Gu only accepts interviews at this time every year. Have you thought of what to ask? This time, President Gu will definitely bring Mrs. Gu along!”","“Definitely! There are two seats for the interview! President Gu will definitely accept the interview with Mrs. Gu. We’ve already prepared the questions. We must seize the opportunity this time!”","“I think someone’s here!” someone exclaimed. Everyone rushed over with their equipment, but it was not Mrs. Gu or President Gu. Instead, it was a young and beautiful woman and two old people.","Just as the reporters were about to ask who this person was, the woman said gently, “Hello, reporters. I’m Xia Mengyan. Behind me is my grandparents.”","Xia Mengyan?","Everyone suddenly reacted. Wasn’t the hottest news on the internet recently about the marriage contract? The main characters of this matter were Xia Mengyan and Qiao Xi. Now that Xia Mengyan was here to attend the banquet, it was unknown what sparks would fly when the love rivals met.","......","Just then, Gu Zheng got out of the car. Song Shijing came to welcome him with his bodyguards. “President.”","Qiao Xi stuck her head out of the car. “So many reporters!”","Song Shijing replied, “Yes, the president only accepts interviews at this time every year, so all reporters will rush over to get first-hand news.”","Just as Qiao Xi was about to get out of the car, Song Shiyu rushed over. “President, I need you to handle a document. I’m sorry for having to take a few minutes of your time.”","Gu Zheng turned around and said softly to Qiao Xi, “Wait for me. I’ll be right back.”","When facing Qiao Xi, the usually cold and murderous Gu Zheng was always so gentle. The higher-ups of Gu Corporation were dumbfounded when they saw this. After a long time, they realized that the man in front of them was indeed their president.","Qiao Xi smiled and nodded. “Work is important. You can go first.”","Gu Zheng left with Song Shiyu to handle his work. The gentleness in his eyes dissipated instantly, replaced by coldness and dignity. He had once again returned to being the all-powerful leader of Gu Corporation.","On the other hand, the reporters were still interviewing Xia Mengyan. “Miss Xia, everyone knows that President Gu will be bringing Mrs. Gu to the banquet, but why are you here too? Aren’t the two of you...”","When Qiao Xi heard this, she abruptly turned around and saw a group of reporters surrounding a few people. They were like a group of bugs hovering over a lightbulb. She focused her gaze and saw that the woman standing at the door and being interviewed was actually Xia Mengyan! However, Xia Mengyan was sitting at the interview spot that was originally prepared for her and Gu Zheng. It seemed that Xia Mengyan was not here for the interview but to declare her sovereignty.","At this moment, the reporters were asking Xia Mengyan many questions. She was not impatient and answered everything gently. She avoided answering the questions about Qiao Xi.","“Miss Xia, can you respond to the rumors online? I heard that Mrs. Gu stole your engagement. Is this the truth or a rumor?”","As soon as the reporter asked the question, the entire venue was silent. Everyone was very curious about this matter, but no one dared to offend her. They could only ask indirectly in hopes of getting useful information, but Xia Mengyan always avoided those questions. Now that someone had asked the question directly, everyone looked at Xia Mengyan curiously.","Xia Mengyan was stunned for a few seconds, then she smiled helplessly. “Since everyone knows, there’s nothing to hide. It’s indeed true.”","The reporters instantly went crazy and leaned forward to ask, “So you’re the one who’s engaged to President Gu, Miss Xia. If she hadn’t acted first, you’d be Mrs. Gu now!”"]},{"number":922,"title":"Chapter 922 - Beautiful Misunderstanding","paragraphs":["Xia Mengyan smiled bitterly. “This engagement is indeed mine, but it doesn’t matter whether I’m Mrs. Gu or not. Don’t blame my cousin anymore. No matter what, she has the Xia family’s bloodline. It’s only right for her to marry President Gu.”","The reporters instantly understood. They originally thought that Mrs. Gu and President Gu had fallen in love. Now, they knew that Mrs. Gu had snatched someone else’s engagement to claim the title of Mrs. Gu. Everyone had already thought of how to write the news articles.","“It’s been so long since the matter of snatching the marriage contract, but Mrs. Gu hasn’t responded. Miss Xia, are you here today to ask for an explanation?”","Hearing the reporter’s question, Xia Mengyan shook her head and looked at her grandparents beside her. She took a deep breath and said, “There’s nothing to fight over between us cousins. I’ll just treat this as a beautiful misunderstanding. Xi Xi and I...”","At this point, she suddenly choked, making everyone feel regretful and angry for her. This marriage contract originally belonged to Xia Mengyan. She could have married Gu Zheng and become the most powerful woman in Li City. Moreover, everyone knew that Gu Zheng doted on Mrs. Gu very much. This love should have belonged to Xia Mengyan. Which woman would not be angry if they were in her shoes?","If she had lost something, she could ask the other party to compensate her. However, Xia Mengyan had lost an engagement. How was she going to ask for compensation?","At this moment, Xia Cheng walked forward with a serious expression. “If you have any questions, ask me. I’ll answer them for everyone. Firstly, we only came to the banquet after receiving President Gu’s invitation.”","The moment that was said, everyone was dumbfounded. President Gu had actually invited the Xia family to the banquet? The Xia family and Mrs. Gu were already at odds. Xia Mengyan’s fans went to Mrs. Gu’s account every day to curse and send countless private messages to her. However, President Gu actually invited the Xia family over at this time. Why?","Even if President Gu hated the Xia family and wanted to take revenge on them, he would never do it in front of everyone. If he really did that, their reputation would be completely ruined.","“That’s right. The engagement was originally Mengyan’s. Although Xi Xi did something wrong, she’s my granddaughter, after all. I can’t let her get a divorce. If she can be happy, as her grandfather, I’ll be relieved.","“But Mengyan is also my granddaughter. I can’t bear to see her suffer. Xi Xi stole her fiance, and President Gu didn’t know about it. No one can understand what this sort of pain is like.”","With that, Xia Cheng sighed helplessly. The reporters also looked regretful.","President Gu did not know about this and was already married to Qiao Xi. Xia Cheng could not let Qiao Xi divorce Gu Zheng, but who would bear the grievances Xia Mengyan had suffered?","......","Xia Cheng’s old eyes were slightly red. “When I first received the invitation, I didn’t want to bring Mengyan along. I was afraid that she would be sad. Most importantly, Xi Xi has been refusing to meet us recently. I’m not making things difficult for Xi Xi today. I just want her to apologize to Mengyan.”","The reporters continued to ask, “Old Master Xia, when President Gu founded Heavenly Voice, he said that he wanted to give it to an important person. Now that he has handed Heavenly Voice Entertainment to Mrs. Gu to manage, it means that they’ve known each other for a few years, so...”","President Gu was able to establish Heavenly Voice for Mrs. Gu. Now that he had given it to Mrs. Gu, it was enough to prove that President Gu had already liked Mrs. Gu many years ago. The couple’s union had nothing to do with the marriage contract.","Hearing the question, Xia Cheng slowly lowered his head, and his eyes were filled with sorrow. “I didn’t want to talk about this. Actually, Qingfeng Entertainment is the Xia family’s business.”","The reporters gasped.","“Qingfeng Entertainment used to be a small studio in the Xia family. I always handed it to my daughter, Xia Yunqiu, to manage. After my daughter passed away, I handed the studio to Xi Xi. However, she was too young to manage the company, so I often had Mengyan handle company matters.”","The reporters hurriedly asked, “You mean that the person President Gu has been thinking about is Miss Xia, but he got the wrong person?”","Xia Cheng remained silent, but in everyone’s opinion, he was tacitly agreeing to this matter. They originally thought that it was just a conflict between Xia Mengyan and Qiao Xi because of their engagement, but they never expected that there was such a thing behind it.","Everyone could not help but have a guess. Perhaps President Gu had long known that he was engaged to the Xia family. Coincidentally, he met a young lady in the studio and fell in love with her at first sight. Hence, he decided to establish Heavenly Voice Entertainment for her."]},{"number":923,"title":"Chapter 923 - Public Opinion Is A Killing Weapon","paragraphs":["This was originally a beautiful love story, but after Qiao Xi snatched Qingfeng away and secretly contacted President Gu behind the backs of the Xia family, President Gu thought that she was the daughter of the Xia family he was engaged to. After all, so many years had passed, so her appearance had definitely changed. Moreover, the two of them had only met in a hurry, so President Gu could not be sure if she was really the girl from back then.","However, when he found out that Qiao Xi was the president of Qingfeng Entertainment, he confirmed that Qiao Xi was the person he had been looking for. Just like that, Qiao Xi married Gu Zheng and became Mrs. Gu. Gu Zheng doted on her and tolerated her, but he did not know that the person he was supposed to marry was Xia Mengyan.","The reporters all opened their mouths wide. This kind of plot that only appeared in TV shows actually happened in real life. Moreover, Xia Mengyan was an internationally renowned perfumer with many fans. Now, because of her marriage contract being snatched, she had gained another million fans overnight.","Xia Cheng sighed, and his voice trembled slightly. “Now that things have come to this, there’s no way to change it. However, Xi Xi did something wrong, so she should apologize to Mengyan. There’s no doubt about that!","“Mengyan is the daughter of the Xia family. She’s so outstanding. She doesn’t care about marrying into a rich family or not being able to marry President Gu. She’ll meet the right person in the future.","As Xia Cheng spoke, he looked at Xia Mengyan with heartache. “Previously, some people said that Mengyan liked President Gu and wanted to break up President Gu and Xi Xi’s marriage. This is all nonsense! She’s clearly the one who was wronged, but she refused to say it. How could she have done such a thing?!”","At this moment, those watching the live-streams were in an uproar. The netizens said indignantly: [Miss Xia is so pitiful. She clearly had a beautiful marriage and could’ve been with the person she liked, but now, she can only watch helplessly as her loved one is in love with another.]","[Moreover, Miss Xia is so kind. Even though she knows that her cousin impersonated her to marry President Gu, she can’t bear to criticize her. She’s even protecting her cousin’s reputation.]","[Old Master Xia is right. Miss Xia is from a noble family. There’s no need for her to fall out with Mrs. Gu over a man. She’ll meet better men in the future, but Mrs. Gu’s conscience is tainted! She has to apologize to Miss Xia!]","Xia Mengyan looked at the comments online and revealed a proud smile. Public opinion was a sharp weapon to kill. Now, Qiao Xi had already become a fish on the chopping board that she could slaughter at will. She only needed to generously forgive Qiao Xi and make Qiao Xi apologize to her in public. From then on, Qiao Xi would never be able to raise her head again.","After that, she would seize the opportunity to constantly get close to President Gu so that he would distance himself from Qiao Xi. She would take the opportunity to rise to power. At that time, everyone would probably understand her because she would only be taking back everything that belonged to her.","At this moment, Qiao Xi was standing not far away and looking at them indifferently. Only then did everyone notice that Mrs. Gu was standing behind them.","“Mrs. Gu is here!” Someone shouted, and everyone immediately raised their heads to look for her. They immediately pinpointed Qiao Xi’s location and saw that she was wearing a long beige dress and a coat of the same color. It made her look extremely elegant. When faced with everyone’s different gazes, she was not nervous in the slightest and just raised her eyes indifferently.","When Xia Cheng saw her, he immediately walked forward. Before the reporters could follow him, he lowered his voice and threatened, “Qiao Xi, you’d better keep quiet today! Otherwise, you’ll suffer!”","“Old Master Xia, are you threatening me?” Qiao Xi grunted coldly, her eyes filled with disdain. “Do you think I’m Xia Mengyan who’s at your mercy?”","“If you ruin Mengyan’s plan, I definitely won’t let you off!” Xia Cheng’s voice was low, and his eyes were filled with ferocity and warning.","Qiao Xi lowered her eyes and replied coldly, “Old Master Xia, are you using public opinion to force me to get a divorce so that Xia Mengyan can take over my spot? You’re really scheming!”","Xia Cheng’s eyes were cold as he looked at the reporters rushing over from behind. He could only remain silent.","“Old Master Xia, you’re too funny. You and Xia Mengyan are slandering me, so why can’t I retort? What kind of logic is this? Should I be treated as a pushover by you?”","Xia Cheng’s face was livid. “This marriage contract belongs to the Xia and Gu families. The entire Xia family is on Mengyan’s side. What right do you have to marry President Gu? What right do you have?!","“If Yunlou were here, she’d definitely accuse you of snatching Mengyan’s engagement in public. At that time, you’ll lose all your dignity. We’ve already left you a way out. Don’t be ungrateful!”"]},{"number":924,"title":"Chapter 924 - Listen To My Advice","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi said casually, “So you’re sure that I’ll be at your mercy? Do you think I can’t do anything to you?”","Xia Cheng smiled proudly and lowered his voice. “Xi Xi, on the account that we’re related by blood, let me give you a piece of advice. You don’t have any substantial evidence, so it’s useless to explain. Now that everyone has already suspected you of snatching the marriage, the internet is filled with criticisms. I advise you to cooperate with us obediently. Otherwise, your outcome will definitely be very miserable.”","Qiao Xi had an indifferent expression. “Oh.”","Xia Cheng’s tone was very arrogant. “Everyone now knows that you stole Mengyan’s marriage contract. You’ll never be able to raise your head again. Even if President Gu has power and influence, he won’t be able to stop the public from talking. How can you endure all these curses? Listen to my advice. Give up your position as Mrs. Gu as soon as possible. Mengyan and President Gu have known each other since they were young. If you hadn’t interfered, the two of them would’ve gotten together a long time ago. As long as you agree to the divorce, I’ll definitely introduce you to a more suitable man. The Xia family won’t treat you badly.”","Qiao Xi sneered. “Old Master Xia, you really have a good plan.”","Looking at Qiao Xi’s indifferent appearance, Xia Cheng felt a trace of uneasiness in his heart. Things were already like this, so why was Qiao Xi not nervous at all? Today, all the reporters from Li City were gathered here, and there were even fake commenters hired by the Xia family in the live-streams. Even with Gu Zheng’s help, Qiao Xi would not be able to make a comeback. Moreover, Gu Zheng himself would be criticized. At that time, he would definitely hate Qiao Xi.","Xia Cheng heaved a sigh of relief. Not far away, Xia Mengyan greeted Qiao Xi with a gentle smile. “Cousin.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes and glanced coldly. The bodyguards at the side immediately went forward and said, “Miss Xia, the spot you’re in are the president and young madam’s seats. Please leave.”","As soon as these words were spoken, the surroundings fell silent.","Xia Mengyan’s face darkened, and her eyes instantly turned red. Her voice was trembling as she said, “Cousin, I know that there have been too many comments attacking you on the internet recently, but I don’t want that to happen either. Grandpa and I are here today to persuade everyone to forgive you. Can you not have such bad intentions toward me?”","Qiao Xi crossed her arms and looked at her with interest. It had only been a short while since they last met, but Xia Mengyan’s status had improved! It seemed that she had the guidance of an expert behind her. Could it be that the old two-faced b*tch from the Xia family had given her guidance?","Seeing that the two of them were at daggers drawn, the reporters hurriedly rushed in front of Qiao Xi and raised the microphones to ask, “Mrs. Gu, do you have anything to say about Old Master Xia and Miss Xia’s words?”","“You haven’t stepped forward to retort because you’ve already tacitly agreed to this matter, right? Did you really snatch your engagement with President Gu?”","The moment that was said, everyone revealed disdainful gazes. The words that were originally filled with suspicion gradually turned into accusations. “Look at her fearless appearance. She doesn’t have the slightest intention of repenting!”","“No wonder Old Master Xia doesn’t like his granddaughter. How can anyone like her after what she’s done?”","Xia Mengyan lowered her eyes as sparkling tears fell. She pretended to speak up for Qiao Xi. “Everyone, don’t criticize Xi Xi. Xi Xi is very good to me. She just did something wrong. Now that she’s already married to President Gu, let’s let everything go.”","When the reporters heard this, they immediately praised, “Miss Xia, you’re really beautiful and kind-hearted. You’ve clearly been wronged, yet you’re still speaking up for Mrs. Gu. On the other hand, Mrs. Gu did something wrong, but she did not apologize and is also so arrogant. Speaking of which, not only did she snatch away the engagement, but she also stole Qingfeng Entertainment, which originally belonged to Miss Xia!”","At the mention of Qingfeng Entertainment, Xia Cheng’s eyes instantly lit up. He seized the opportunity and hurriedly said, “Ever since Qingfeng Entertainment was established, there has been no clear rule regarding who the heir is. Originally, it was only handed to my daughter to manage. Later on, I once thought of handing the company to Mengyan, but my daughter loved Xi Xi, so she gave the company to Xi Xi behind my back.”","As soon as he finished speaking, the reporters all aimed their cameras at Qiao Xi. She smiled calmly. “Old Master Xia, are you saying that Qingfeng Entertainment is the Xia family’s business? You decided to give the company to Xia Mengyan, but I’m occupying it now?”","The banquet hall was silent for a moment. Xia Cheng’s heart could not help but tremble. Why was Qiao Xi still so calm at a time like this? It made him feel that something was wrong!","Before Xia Cheng could figure it out, Old Madam Xia rushed over with an angry expression. “Mengyan, you’re indulging her too much. If you hadn’t tolerated her so much, how would she have dared to snatch your engagement?”"]},{"number":925,"title":"Chapter 925 - Old Madam Yin’s Support","paragraphs":["Old Madam Xia looked at Qiao Xi with a vicious gaze. She did not look like the kind and caring Xia family matriarch in the slightest. Her tone was sharp and unkind. “Qiao Xi! You stole Mengyan’s engagement and Qingfeng Entertainment, yet you’re still unwilling to apologize! You’re a mistress. President Gu will despise you sooner or later!”","Hearing the old madam’s curses, everyone was slightly puzzled. Why did Qiao Xi’s grandmother hate her so much? Could it be that it was because she was scheming, so Old Madam Xia hated her?","For some reason, Xia Cheng felt uneasy in his heart. Every time he looked at Qiao Xi’s face, he would feel inexplicably nervous. He advised, “Xi Xi, although your grandmother is a little strict, it’s also for your own good. You stole Mengyan’s engagement. Actually, you’re the third party here. You should officially apologize to Mengyan. Mengyan is your cousin, so she’ll naturally forgive you.”","“Xia Cheng! How dare you bully my granddaughter?!”","At this moment, a dignified female voice came from outside the door, scaring everyone. Everyone hurriedly looked in the direction of the voice and saw Old Madam Yin wearing a wine-red suit. Her makeup was exquisite, and she exuded a noble aura.","The fifth young master of the Yin family, Yin Jinglin, helped Old Madam Yin in. Qiao Xi hurriedly went forward with a smile. “Grandma, Cousin, you’re here!”","Grandma? Cousin? Qiao Xi’s grandfather was Xia Cheng, so wasn’t her grandmother Old Madam Xia? Why did she call Old Madam Yin her grandmother?","A reporter who was bribed by the Xia family hurriedly criticized, “Mrs. Gu, Old Madam Xia only reprimanded you a few times, yet you’re already dissatisfied. Why do you have to call her ‘Grandma’ in front of so many people?!”","Some reporters who knew the truth glanced at him meaningfully. The reporter was still puzzled. Who was this Old Madam Yin? Why was everyone silent the moment she arrived?","Yin Lianxin was calm and arrogant. The moment she appeared, the entire venue seemed to grow quiet. Someone like Xia Cheng was not even worthy of carrying her shoes!","Yin Jinglin looked coldly at the reporter who had just spoken. “Are the requirements for being a reporter so low now? Can any Tom, Dick, or Harry be a reporter?”","The reporter’s face was livid as he gritted his teeth. “Mrs. Gu, please answer my question.”","“Is there a problem with my cousin calling her ‘Grandma’? Let me formally introduce you. The person beside me is the noble madam of the Yin family, Yin Lianxin. Everyone has heard of her, right?!”","Of course, everyone had heard of Old Madam Yin. Her name had already resounded throughout the entire Shengdu decades ago. She was the noblest daughter of the Yin family and the only female head of the Yin family in the past hundred years. She did things swiftly and decisively. Under her management, the Yin family was even more prosperous than before. Those who looked down on her in the past could not help but be convinced.","If Old Madam Yin was Qiao Xi’s grandmother, then was Qiao Xi’s mother Old Madam Yin’s daughter?","Yin Jinglin smiled as he looked at Qiao Xi. “Cousin, they’re so silly! They don’t even understand such a simple thing!”","Qiao Xi’s eyes were indifferent as she replied with a light smile, “Their IQ is too low. It’s really difficult to talk to people like that!”","“Haha!” Yin Jinglin could not help but laugh out loud. Then, he looked at Xia Cheng with a smile. “Oh! Grandpa! You’re here too! It’s been decades since we last met, right?”","Xia Cheng’s face was livid as he lowered his head and did not say anything. He finally knew why Qiao Xi was so calm. How could Gu Corporation not have invited the Yin family to such a grand banquet? With the Yin family backing Qiao Xi up, she would naturally be fearless.","Yin Jinglin had a gentle temperament. He was fair and clean-looking. He was not much different from a popular celebrity. The reporters all aimed their cameras at him. Then, they heard him say unhurriedly, “Grandpa, you don’t seem to want to see me! Actually, I understand. After all, I’ve never seen you since I was born. Cousin Mengyan grew up by your side, so you’re naturally close to her.”","Yin Jinglin actually called Xia Mengyan ‘Cousin’? What was their relationship?","The moment Old Madam Xia saw Yin Lianxin, she felt as if she had been struck by lightning. Her angry face was filled with horror. She was afraid of Yin Lianxin, and it was a fear that came from her bones.","Xia Mengyan’s heart trembled. She had a bad feeling.","At this moment, Yin Lianxin slowly looked up and asked coldly, “It looks like the Xia family doesn’t want to see me!”","Xia Cheng’s face was ferocious, and the corners of his mouth twitched slightly. His expression was extremely ugly. “Yin Lianxin...”"]},{"number":926,"title":"Chapter 926 - Identity Of The Third Party Exposed","paragraphs":["“Xia Cheng, you just said that Xi Xi is the third party? Do you dare to repeat it in front of me?”","Old Madam Yin was the head of the Yin family. She had a domineering and arrogant aura. Even a simple question like that could make everyone break out in a cold sweat. Xia Cheng could not withstand her sharp aura and could only lower his head without saying anything.","“What did Xi Xi do wrong? The engagement between Yunqiu and Eldest Miss Lu was naturally for her daughter. How could it be for the granddaughter of a mistress?”","The moment that was said, it was like a thunderclap exploded in everyone’s ears. The granddaughter of a mistress? The mistress Yin Lianxin was talking about was Old Madam Xia?","Xia Cheng’s face was livid. After a few seconds of silence, he gritted his teeth and said, “Yin Lianxin, watch your words!”","As soon as he finished speaking, Qiao Xi suddenly sneered and crossed her arms. Her gaze was cold and filled with disdain. “Old Master Xia, are you angry from embarrassment? Isn’t that the truth?”","Yin Jinglin mocked, “In Grandpa’s heart, there’s only Old Madam Xia and our cousin, Xia Mengyan. The children and grandchildren of the first wife are not important to him at all.”","Everyone was dumbfounded. They did not expect to hear such shocking news. After all, the marriage between the Yin and Xia families happened decades ago. Moreover, ever since Yin Lianxin and Xia Cheng divorced, the two of them had never contacted each other again. Hence, only a small number of people knew that the two of them had once been husband and wife.","Yin Jinglin did not want to save Xia Cheng any dignity either. He said helplessly, “Old Madam Xia, back then, you ruined Grandpa and Grandma’s marriage and became a mistress. Our Yin family didn’t bicker with you over this, but how could you have the cheek to ask Xi Xi to call you ‘Grandma’? Cousin Xi Xi is very close to Grandma Xia, so she naturally can’t call you ‘Grandma’.","“Don’t be in a rush to retort. Back then, my grandmother married the entire Xia family. Everyone in Shengdu knows that she’s the legitimate mistress of the Xia family, but your son is even older than Aunt Yunqiu. Doesn’t that explain everything?”","The son of Old Madam Xia and Xia Cheng was older than Xia Yunqiu, which meant that Xia Cheng had an affair and secretly had an illegitimate child with Old Madam Xia. It was enough to confirm Old Madam Xia’s identity as a mistress.","Old Madam Xia did not expect the most unbearable thing in the past to be exposed. She was instantly embarrassed and wanted to dig a hole to crawl into. She wished she could escape from the banquet hall immediately. Her body could not help but tremble as she fell onto the chair beside her.","Everyone looked at all of this in disbelief. It turned out that Old Madam Xia was a mistress! In other words, Xia Mengyan’s father was an illegitimate child? Xia Mengyan’s image as a perfect daughter was instantly shattered.","Decades ago, the Xia family was still a run-down family. As the daughter of the Yin family, Yin Lianxin could be said to be extremely glorious. When the two of them got married, Xia Cheng married into the Yin family. As a result, he obtained many benefits from the Yin family. However, after he took advantage of the situation, he cheated. If it were not for the Yin family’s funds and connections, how could the Xia family be at its peak now?","Xia Cheng was ungrateful. Not only did he cheat on Yin Lianxin, but he even forced his granddaughter to call the mistress ‘Grandma’. Wasn’t this making things difficult for her?","Yin Lianxin walked forward and grabbed Qiao Xi’s hand. Her cold gaze landed on Old Madam Xia as a trace of disdain seeped out of her nose. “Are you worthy of scolding my granddaughter? You’re just a mistress. Who gave you the guts? Xia Cheng?”","Old Madam Xia lowered her head and broke out in a cold sweat. Faced with Yin Lianxin’s question, she did not dare to say a word.","Yin Jinglin quickly echoed, “Some people are just so shameless. Back then, she seduced a man to climb up the social ladder. Now, she’s coveting Aunt Yunqiu’s assets and even wants to bully my cousin. Her skin is thicker than city walls!”","Xia Mengyan looked at Old Madam Xia, who was trembling all over. Tears trickled down her face as she choked. “Cousin, how can you say that about Grandma? That’s all in the past. Now...”","“She has the cheek to do it, but I can’t call her out on it? Besides, she’s not my grandmother. Do I have the obligation to respect her?” Yin Jinglin chuckled, his eyes filled with coldness.","“Moreover, it seems that Old Madam Xia scolded Xi Xi first, so I merely counterattacked. She’s just an immoral mistress. How dare she scold the daughter of the Yin family? How laughable!”","Old Madam Xia’s legs went weak, and her expression was ferocious. If the reporters were not around, she would definitely not have swallowed her anger!","Xia Mengyan hurriedly calmed Old Madam Xia down, then said with a sad expression, “Cousin, what exactly do you want?! Do you want to force my grandmother to her death?”"]},{"number":927,"title":"Chapter 927 - Scumbag","paragraphs":["“I couldn’t tell that she wanted to die! Aren’t you guys quite shameless? Why are you already unable to take it when I’ve only said a few words to you?” Yin Jinglin mocked sarcastically. “Actually, it’s Grandma’s fault for being muddle-headed back then. Why did she marry a scumbag?! She should have let that couple be together earlier. Unfortunately, Old Madam Xia has been carrying the reputation of a mistress her entire life. It won’t be pleasant if news of this gets out!","“I also heard that it was Old Master Xia who took the initiative to marry Grandma back then. He even agreed to marry into the Xia family. Grandma knew that the Xia family was greedy for the Yin family’s wealth and power, but she still married him. It’s because she thought that such a man would definitely be loyal to her. However, she didn’t expect that this man would still cheat on her. If she had known earlier, why would she have married into the dilapidated Xia family? With her looks and family background, she could have found a man a hundred times better than Old Master Xia!","“All these years, Old Madam Xia, you must still hate Grandma. You must hate her for occupying the position of the rightful madam and making you bear the infamy of being a mistress. That’s why you’re venting your anger on Xi Xi. But Xi Xi is so innocent! She doesn’t know about the grudges between your previous generation at all!”","Yin Jinglin said casually, and everyone in the Xia family looked extremely embarrassed, especially Old Madam Xia. The scene of her being pointed at appeared in her mind.","At this moment, the reporters looked at the Xia family with doubt and disdain. They discussed animatedly. “No wonder Old Madam Xia and Xia Mengyan hate Qiao Xi. It turns out that the seeds of resentment had been planted since the previous generation.”","“Old Madam Xia is clearly a mistress herself, yet she still has the cheek to accuse Mrs. Gu of being a mistress? Even if Mrs. Gu is really a mistress, she has no right to criticize her!”","“Old Master Xia looks like a decent person, but he actually had an affair when he was young and even left behind an illegitimate child. After using the Yin family, he happily divorced. He’s really a scumbag among scumbags!”","“Old Madam Yin is from a rich family and is beautiful. She’s a hundred times better than that mistress. Is Xia Cheng blind? He actually abandoned his first wife and chose such a woman?”","The discussion of the crowd reached the ears of the Xia family. Old Madam Xia’s vision darkened, and she almost fainted. Xia Mengyan hurriedly supported her with tearful eyes.","Xia Cheng’s expression darkened, but his tone softened. “Lianxin, stop fooling around, alright? Let’s go back and talk about this.”","Yin Lianxin did not fall for this at all. From the moment Xia Cheng cheated on her, their relationship as husband and wife had been completely severed. At this moment, she felt disgusted just looking at Xia Cheng.","After a long silence, Yin Jinglin said, “Old Master Xia, who’s causing trouble? Anyway, we don’t expect you to speak up for Xi Xi. After all, you only have eyes for your mistress and her children and grandchildren.”","Xia Cheng’s expression froze as he glared at the people in front of him.","Yin Jinglin did not seem to notice his angry gaze and said with a faint smile, “But our Yin family can’t bear to see Xi Xi suffer! Xi Xi and President Gu are in love and got married because of that, but you refuse to let go of the so-called arranged engagement. You just had to call Xi Xi a mistress when it’s actually Xia Mengyan who wants to be a mistress! Your Xia family is really strange. The grandmother of the family is a mistress, and the granddaughter also wants to be a mistress. What kind of family education do you have? How embarrassing!”","Yin Jinglin was handsome, but his mouth was really vicious. He continued to say, “President Gu said that he and Xi Xi have known each other for 10 years. He specially founded Heavenly Voice Entertainment for Xi Xi, but you didn’t mention this at all. You just had to say that Xi Xi is a mistress on the day of Gu Corporation’s banquet. Do you want to completely ruin Xi Xi’s reputation and pave the way for Xia Mengyan to rise to power?”","The employees of Gu Corporation all confirmed, “Mr. Yin is right! The president did say that he and Young Madam have known each other for 10 years and have a deep relationship. Would our president lie?”","“Old Madam Xia has been a mistress for so many years. She must have taught her granddaughter how to be a mistress. These two are really shameless!”","“Shut up! All of you, shut up!” Old Madam Xia shouted crazily, her voice extremely ear-piercing.","It had been so many years, so why were there still people clinging to this matter? So what if she was a mistress? Now that she was the madam of the Xia family, what right did they have to offend her?","“Yin Jinglin! You bastard! What right do you, a junior, have to say that about me? Ah Cheng and I are in love with each other. At that time, his engagement with Old Madam Yin was only in name. What did we do wrong?”"]},{"number":928,"title":"Chapter 928 - Abdication","paragraphs":["Yin Jinglin snorted. “Love? Since Old Master Xia didn’t like my grandmother to begin with, why did he ask to marry her back then? Was it for the Yin family’s power or—”","“Shut up! Shut up immediately! How did your Yin family educate your juniors? How dare you make things difficult for your elders on such an occasion? You’re really too much!” Old Madam Xia roared heart-wrenchingly, wishing she could stuff Yin Jinglin’s mouth.","In the past, perhaps some people knew that she was a mistress, but because of the Xia family, no one could spread the news. However, now that the reporters were doing live broadcasts, everyone would know that she was not the noble madam of the Xia family at all but an unpresentable mistress. She had worked hard for so many years to change her background and image. Now, it was all ruined by Qiao Xi and Yin Jinglin.","At this moment, Yin Lianxin slowly took a few steps forward. Her body was filled with pressure, and her aura was fully released. Wherever her gaze landed, everyone’s breathing stopped. Finally, her gaze landed on Xia Cheng and Old Madam Xia. She frowned in disgust as if looking at them would dirty her eyes. She said in a low voice, “The Yin family isn’t considered outstanding when it comes to educating the younger generation, but at least I can guarantee that every child in the Yin family has a good character. Meanwhile, the children raised by your Xia family are all scheming. Are you worthy of talking to me about education?”","Xia Mengyan clenched her fists tightly. She knew that Yin Lianxin was hinting at her. Before she could retort, the surroundings were already filled with everyone’s restless voices. “A mistress still has the cheek to talk to the first wife about educating the younger generation? Moreover, the Yin family is a century-old family. Old Madam Yin was carefully nurtured since she was young and later became the head of the Yin family. The two of them are simply worlds apart. She actually has the cheek to compare herself to Old Madam Yin?”","The anger in Old Madam Xia’s heart burned fiercely. Her eyes almost popped out. She was about to curse when she was pulled back by Xia Mengyan. Xia Mengyan was also forcefully suppressing her anger. Her nails dug into her palms, and the sharp pain reminded her to be rational.","Xia Mengyan calmed down for a long time before slowly looking up. Her eyes were filled with tears as she said pitifully, “Old Madam Yin, although the matter back then is over, we still owe you an apology. I apologize on behalf of Grandma, but today is Gu Corporation’s banquet. We can’t cause trouble here. It’ll affect President Gu as well. Let’s not quarrel anymore. We’ll talk after the banquet, alright?”","After that, she looked at Qiao Xi and advised earnestly, “Xi Xi, you’ve grown up. You can’t rely on the love of your elders to fool around anymore.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows as if she did not expect Xia Mengyan to suddenly mention her, and a trace of surprise flashed through her eyes.","“Xi Xi, today is Gu Corporation’s big day. President Gu still has to do an interview later. You’ve already caused a scene for so long and affected the progress of the banquet. If you affect the interview again, President Gu will be unhappy.","“You’re already married now. As President Gu’s wife, you have to think about him. You can’t always do whatever you want for yourself. Aren’t you being a little selfish by doing this?”","Hearing Xia Mengyan’s persuasion, Qiao Xi dug her ears impatiently. How annoying! She was nagging like an old lady at the entrance of the village!","At this moment, the reporters bribed by the Xia family received Xia Mengyan’s gaze. They immediately stood up and berated loudly, “Mrs. Gu! You clearly know that today is an important day for Gu Corporation, yet you still brought so many people to cause trouble. Do you know how much impact this will have on Gu Corporation? Do you know how much loss there’ll be?”","“It’s been decades, yet you’re still talking about the past and making everyone feel awkward. The reporters don’t even have time to interview President Gu. As Mrs. Gu, you should put President Gu first. However, you only care about your own happiness and don’t care about President Gu’s reputation at all. You’re not worthy to be Mrs. Gu at all. Only a virtuous woman like Miss Xia is most suitable to be Mrs. Gu.”","Xia Mengyan lowered her eyes shyly. These reporters were very understanding. It seemed that their money was not spent in vain.","Yin Lianxin glanced at Xia Mengyan, her eyes filled with disgust. “Shameless!”","Xia Mengyan’s body trembled as if she had been greatly insulted. A tear fell from the corner of her eye. She was really pitiful!","The reporters hurriedly retorted, “Old Madam Yin, as an elder, how can you say that Miss Xia is shameless? A certain someone doesn’t have the ability, but she just insists on sitting in the position of Mrs. Gu. In my opinion, Miss Xia is the most suitable person for President Gu. If Mrs. Gu knows what’s good for her, she’d better abdicate her position and give up her position!”"]},{"number":929,"title":"Chapter 929 - Make Them Disappear Forever","paragraphs":["When Xia Mengyan heard the reporters’ words, she pretended to go forward and persuade them. “Stop arguing, Xi Xi...”","“I want to hear who dares to say bad things about Mrs. Gu!” A cold voice interrupted Xia Mengyan. Gu Zheng’s voice was magnetic, but it was filled with killing intent at this moment, making one shudder.","Gu Zheng was dressed in a black high-end suit, looking elegant and noble. His gaze swept coldly across the Xia family. Even someone as experienced as Xia Cheng could not withstand his oppressive gaze.","His gaze landed on Xia Mengyan, and the corners of his mouth curled into a cold smile. “You’re indeed shameless.”","Boom!!!","Xia Mengyan’s body trembled, and she instantly swallowed the words in her throat. Her heart seemed to be clenched tightly, and she almost could not breathe. Her face was livid, and she was extremely embarrassed.","Gu Zheng retracted his gaze and questioned coldly, “This is Gu Corporation’s banquet. What right does the Xia family have to criticize Mrs. Gu?”","The reporters were so scared that they did not dare to make a sound. The microphones in their hands trembled.","“Since things have already come to this, I don’t mind spending more time chatting with the Xia family.” As soon as Gu Zheng finished speaking, his gaze landed on the reporters who previously mocked Qiao Xi. His gaze was sharp. “You’re reporters from Tianyun Network, right? You’re very bold! You actually dare to interfere in my family matters? Do I need your permission to marry someone I like?”","The reporters met Gu Zheng’s sharp gaze and were so scared that they broke out in a cold sweat. They could not even control their mouths anymore. “President Gu, we...”","Song Shijing walked forward and smiled coldly. “President, I’ll contact Tianyun Network immediately. I’ll make them disappear from your sight forever.”","Gu Zheng nodded in satisfaction and gently held Qiao Xi’s hand. His voice was icy-cold to the extreme. “What everyone just said has been recorded. I’ll pursue the matter according to the law.”","As soon as he finished speaking, someone said, “President Gu, Chengyue Law Firm is willing to serve you!”","Everyone instantly gasped. Chengyue Law Firm had never lost a case. If they decided to sue someone, that meant they were confident in not losing their reputation.","Gu Zheng held Qiao Xi’s hand and walked to the interview seats. Facing the many reporters, his voice suddenly became dignified. “Everyone, if you have any questions, you can ask me. You don’t have to listen to the rumors spread by outsiders. I’ll answer them directly.”","He looked at Xia Cheng, who instantly panicked. Could it be that Gu Zheng had evidence? Impossible! Back then, Xia Yunqiu and Lu Qingyun’s marriage was only a verbal engagement. Now that the two of them were dead, who knew which daughter of the Xia family he was supposed to be engaged to? It would be difficult to explain if they continued insisting the engagement belonged to Xia Mengyan.","The entire venue was silent. Song Shijing gestured for the reporters to come forward. “Our president will only give you 10 minutes. You can ask now.”","The reporters’ eyes lit up. They squeezed to the front with microphones and asked the questions in their minds.","Qiao Xi turned her head and looked at the man who was standing beside her and replying indifferently. His entire body emitted charm as if a god had descended. No wonder so many women had fallen for him, but Gu Zheng had given all his gentleness and love to her. Qiao Xi did not know what good deeds she had done in her previous life to actually be able to obtain Gu Zheng’s love in this life.","...","10 minutes later, the reporters had already obtained the answer. However, even though Gu Zheng had publicly explained that Qiao Xi did not snatch someone else’s engagement, the audience in the live broadcast still did not believe him.","[Everyone in Li City knows that President Gu dotes on Mrs. Gu. He’s naturally on her side. Mrs. Gu is very beautiful, but I just hate her for snatching someone else’s engagement. B*tch!]","[Old Madam Xia is a mistress, but Sally isn’t! This is all in the past. What does it have to do with Sally? She’s the victim!]","Xia Mengyan looked at the audience in the live-stream and could not help but heave a sigh of relief. As long as there was no evidence, no matter how Gu Zheng and the Yin family explained, no one would believe them. In everyone’s eyes, Qiao Xi was still the mistress who stole someone else’s engagement.","There were also some people in the live-stream who spoke up for Qiao Xi, but those people were quickly drowned out by the curses of Xia Mengyan’s fans.","At this moment, everyone had already entered the banquet hall, and only the Xia family was standing at the door. Old Madam Xia gritted her teeth, and her eyes were vicious. She let out a vicious roar. “Ah! They actually said that in public!”"]},{"number":930,"title":"Chapter 930 - Using Others To Make A Move","paragraphs":["Xia Mengyan hurriedly went forward to comfort her. “Grandma, you have to take care of your health! We were invited to the banquet today. President Gu won’t let the Yin family make things difficult for us. Moreover, that’s all in the past. Why is Old Madam Yin still clinging to it? Isn’t she too petty?”","Xia Cheng’s expression changed slightly. Lianxin must still be unable to let go of her past grudges. They had already been divorced for decades, but she was still alone and had not remarried. Perhaps it was because of their past relationship. Now, for the sake of his granddaughter’s happiness and the Xia family’s future, he could only stand opposite Lianxin.","Speaking of which, Qiao Xi, that child, could not be considered a member of the Yin family at all. She did not grow up in the Yin family either. He did not understand why Lianxin doted on Qiao Xi so much. What was so good about her? Even the Qiao family was unwilling to acknowledge her identity. She was just a wild girl that no one wanted. How was she worthy of the noble Gu Zheng?","Gu Zheng was the president of Gu Corporation. His wife should be as sensible and generous as Mengyan, not like Qiao Xi, who would only embarrass him. It would not be long before Gu Zheng got tired of her.","Xia Mengyan reminded them gently, “Grandpa, Grandma, the banquet is about to start. Let’s all go in. I also want to hear what President Gu has to say. No matter what, Qingfeng Entertainment belongs to the Xia family, and the marriage contract is also mine. Xi Xi can’t deny it at all.”","The few of them nodded and entered the banquet hall together.","“Mengyan?”","At this moment, a familiar voice came from behind. Xia Mengyan turned around and saw a tall man walking toward her. The man said warmly, “I’m Sun Chuan! We were classmates!”","Sun Chuan? Xia Mengyan pondered for a few seconds before realizing that Sun Chuan had liked her since she was in university. She did not expect to meet an old friend on such an occasion.","Xia Mengyan suddenly thought of a good idea. Her eyes turned red as she lowered her head aggrievedly. “I’m sorry. I’ve been in a daze and didn’t manage to recognize you. Please don’t mind me.”","Seeing her pitiful look, Sun Chuan hurriedly asked, “What happened?”","Xia Mengyan bit her lip and said awkwardly, “Actually, it’s not a big deal. I just had a conflict with my cousin. She’s already ignoring me now. Our matter has spread online. I really don’t know how to explain it to her.”","Sun Chuan knew that she was unwilling to say it, so he hurriedly took out his phone to look at the recent news. He finally understood why Xia Mengyan was so sad and in a daze.","He shouted indignantly, “When I pursued you in university, you said that you were already engaged, but I didn’t expect your fiance to be President Gu! How could Mrs. Gu snatch your engagement? She’s too much!”","Xia Mengyan wiped her tears and smiled bitterly. “It’s all in the past. It can only mean that President Gu and I are not fated. You can’t blame my cousin for this. Don’t be angry.”","Sun Chuan could not accept that the woman he liked was being bullied. He immediately patted his chest and promised, “Mengyan, don’t be sad. I’ll help you teach Mrs. Gu a lesson and make her pay the price!","“You’ve been engaged to President Gu for so many years. What right does she have to interfere?”","Xia Mengyan pretended to be worried. She quickly advised Sun Chuan not to be rash, but Sun Chuan did not listen at all. He swore to seek justice for her.","She pretended to pull Sun Chuan, but she stood where she was as she watched him leave angrily. Then, the corners of her mouth curled into a proud smile.","Hah! Stupid man.","...","In the banquet hall.","Gu Zheng held Qiao Xi’s hand and entered the venue. Suddenly, a waiter who was walking in a hurry arrived with a few glasses of wine in his hand. He walked to Qiao Xi’s side and slipped. The wine in the glass instantly spilled out. Fortunately, Gu Zheng reacted quickly and protected her in his arms, but Gu Zheng’s suit was drenched in wine.","Seeing that he had splashed Gu Zheng, the waiter immediately apologized in fear. “President Gu, I’m sorry. I... I didn’t do it on purpose.”","Gu Zheng ignored her and looked at Qiao Xi who was in his arms. “Were you scared?”","Qiao Xi shook her head, and her gloomy gaze landed on the waiter. She was wearing a long white dress today. If the glass of wine from earlier had splashed on her, she would definitely be in an extremely sorry state and would definitely be mocked.","Song Shijing quickly brought over a clean suit jacket. Gu Zheng took it but was not in a rush to change. Instead, he pulled Qiao Xi into his arms and comforted her carefully. She leaned into Gu Zheng’s arms, her body enveloped by his warm breath."]},{"number":931,"title":"Chapter 931 - Her Skills Have Upgraded","paragraphs":["Gu Zheng lowered his eyes as a trace of cold killing intent flashed past his eyes. The waiter felt the coldness spread throughout his body and trembled in fear. “President Gu, I... I was really careless! Mrs. Gu! Please forgive me!","“Mrs. Gu, I beg you. I can’t be fired. I rely on this job to support my family. You’re the wife of a rich man. You’re a magnanimous person. Don’t bicker with a poor person like me.”","When everyone heard the noise, they all looked over and saw Gu Zheng hugging Qiao Xi. His back was already drenched.","Someone looked at the terrified waiter and came forward to persuade Mrs. Gu. “Mrs. Gu, he didn’t do it on purpose. Why are you making things difficult for him?”","“Mrs. Gu, it’s true that you’re the wife of a rich family, but you can’t look down on waiters! Waiters are also people. They rely on their own hard work to earn money. Why must you humiliate this waiter like this?”","Just then, Xia Mengyan entered with a surprised expression. “Why are they arguing?”","When the waiter saw Xia Mengyan, it was as if he had grabbed onto a life-saving straw. He rushed toward Xia Mengyan anxiously and shouted in sorrow, “Miss, you must know Mrs. Gu, right? Please help me. I really can’t lose this job. As long as Mrs. Gu doesn’t bicker with me, I’m willing to do anything. I can kneel down and kowtow to apologize!”","The waiter’s cries attracted many guests. Gradually, everyone surrounded them. The huge banquet hall suddenly fell silent.","Xia Mengyan seemed to be frightened by the waiter and took a few steps back in fear. Then, she looked at Qiao Xi, her eyes filled with worry. “Xi Xi, are you okay?”","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart. She had already guessed what Xia Mengyan was going to do, but her expression remained indifferent.","Xia Mengyan ran to her nervously and sized her up. Seeing that she was fine, she heaved a sigh of relief. “It’s good that you’re not injured. What exactly happened?”","The waiter covered his face and cried. “I walked to Mrs. Gu with a few glasses of wine just now. I don’t know why, but I slipped and accidentally spilled the wine. It almost drenched Mrs. Gu’s clothes, but I really didn’t do it on purpose. Mrs. Gu, please let me off!”","Gu Zheng’s gaze turned cold. Qiao Xi patted his hand and said with a smile, “Don’t be anxious. Let him speak.”","“Miss Xia is really tenacious! She put on an act at the door and now, she’s acting in the banquet hall,” Gu Zheng whispered into her ear.","He stroked the hair by Qiao Xi’s ear and said in a gentle and charming voice, “Xi Xi, how are you going to deal with her?”","Qiao Xi leaned into his embrace and did not say anything. She only revealed a crafty smile.","When Xia Mengyan saw that Qiao Xi was silent, she was even prouder in her heart. The banquet had just begun, yet Qiao Xi had already left such an arrogant image in everyone’s hearts. It seemed that Sun Chuan was not too stupid.","“Don’t cry. I’ll plead for you. Xi Xi is kind-hearted and won’t make things difficult for you,” Xia Mengyan said gently.","When the waiter heard this, he immediately said excitedly, “Thank you, Miss! You’re such a good person!”","Xia Mengyan hurriedly looked at Qiao Xi and bit her lip. She seemed to have made a huge decision before saying uneasily, “Xi Xi, he has also apologized. You’re not injured either. It’s just a small matter. Why are you pushing him into a dead end? If you cause him to lose his job, it won’t do you any good. At that time, everyone will say that you’re petty.”","“Don’t think I’m being long-winded. I’m doing this for your own good. I just don’t want others to misunderstand you. Moreover, today is Gu Corporation’s banquet. There are so many guests present. Even if you don’t think for yourself, you have to think for President Gu!”","Qiao Xi’s eyes narrowed slightly. She had to admit that Xia Mengyan’s methods were getting more and more advanced. First, she hired a waiter to act, then she stood up and accused her of being petty. Qiao Xi did not fall for this trick at all. She leaned into Gu Zheng’s embrace and crossed her arms. Her voice was indifferent but filled with a trace of coldness. “I’m pushing him into a dead end?”","Xia Mengyan stood in front of Qiao Xi, and her aura instantly weakened. She explained in a panic, “That’s not what I meant, but now that you’re married to President Gu, you have to think about how your actions will affect him. It’s fine if you fooled around in the past, but your reputation represents President Gu’s reputation now. It’s just a small matter. Can’t you forgive him?","“Xi Xi, you stole my engagement, but I can let the matter slide. I just hope you’ll cherish it. I hope you can do your duties well and be praised by everyone.”"]},{"number":932,"title":"Chapter 932 - You Can Definitely Be An Actress","paragraphs":["As Xia Mengyan spoke, tears suddenly fell from her eyes. She was extremely sad. On the surface, she was a gentle and kind cousin. Even though her cousin had done something wrong, she would not complain in the slightest. However, in her heart, she was constantly looking forward to Qiao Xi making a fool of herself and being hated by others. At that time, everyone would say that Qiao Xi was vulgar and not worthy of Gu Zheng at all. Only she, Xia Mengyan, was the most suitable person to be Mrs. Gu!","There were many women who liked Gu Zheng, and Qiao Xi had also seen many two-faced b*tches. She had to admit that Xia Mengyan’s acting was not bad. At the very least, she had deceived many guests, but she was still far inferior to her.","Qiao Xi abruptly raised her eyes and looked at Xia Mengyan with a sharp gaze. After a few seconds of silence, she suddenly asked, “Miss Xia, what major are you studying at university?”","Xia Mengyan did not understand why Qiao Xi suddenly asked this and replied with slight confusion, “Me? Finance and incense-making. What’s wrong?”","Qiao Xi had a mocking expression as she said with a smile, “I think you’re more suitable for acting. You’ll definitely be able to be an actress!”","At first, Xia Mengyan did not understand what Qiao Xi meant. She hesitated for a moment and was instantly stunned. Her gaze that was initially gentle suddenly burst with viciousness.","Qiao Xi! What right did she have to be so arrogant? How could she mock her like this in front of everyone?","“Xi Xi, I know you hate me, but I’m doing this all for you...” Xia Mengyan’s voice trembled as she suddenly choked. Tears welled up in her eyes as she looked aggrieved.","Qiao Xi looked at her with a faint smile and sneered. “Miss Xia, you keep saying that you’re doing this for me, but I’ll tell you very clearly that I never reprimanded the waiter from the beginning till the end, nor did I say I would punish him.","Everyone thought for a moment. It was true that they did not seem to have heard Qiao Xi say anything to the waiter.","“I’ve never criticized anyone, but the waiter and Miss Xia seem to have agreed to put on a show. You’re both accusing me of being unreasonable and committing crimes. But in fact, I’m a victim here.”","Only then did everyone realize that it was the waiter who rushed over and almost bumped into Mrs. Gu, causing President Gu’s clothes to be wet. The two of them did not criticize or punish him, but the waiter suddenly cried and started begging for mercy in horror. Speaking of which, his wine had spilled on President Gu. Even if he was begging for mercy, he should be begging President Gu! Why did he keep mentioning Mrs. Gu?","Moreover, after Xia Mengyan entered, she did not ask for the reason and just felt that Mrs. Gu was pushing that waiter to a dead end. She kept saying that it was for Mrs. Gu’s own good and accused her cousin without distinguishing between right and wrong. What was she up to?","Xia Mengyan lowered her head and shed tears aggrievedly. “Xi Xi, I’m sorry. When I entered, I saw him begging you for mercy. I thought that you wanted to punish him, so I pleaded on his behalf.”","Qiao Xi chuckled and looked up. “Song Shijing.”","Song Shijing understood what she meant immediately and said respectfully to Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi, “President, Young Madam, please wait a moment. I’ll go and find out who this waiter has been in contact with before this. I want to know who instructed him to frame Young Madam.”","Hearing this, Xia Mengyan shuddered. “Xi Xi, I was just a little anxious, so I said something wrong. But this waiter didn’t do it on purpose. What are you asking Song Shijing to investigate? Why are you making things worse? Don’t affect the banquet.”","“Didn’t do it on purpose?” Qiao Xi suddenly laughed out loud, causing her appearance to seem even more stunning.","She threw Gu Zheng’s suit to the floor, her voice filled with cold killing intent. “Then open your eyes wide and see if it’s intentional.”","Everyone took a closer look and instantly gasped. They were so scared that they took a few steps back. This suit had already been corroded by the wine. If the glass of wine had spilled on Mrs. Gu’s face just now, the consequences would have been unimaginable!","Ye Qingyuan quickly arrived with the first aid kit. He first helped Gu Zheng check his body, then checked his clothes that were covered in alcohol. “The alcohol is poisonous. This poison is highly corrosive. If it’s inhaled through the nose or mouth, it’ll immediately corrode the mucous membrane and the person will eventually suffocate.”","Everyone’s faces were filled with horror as they hurriedly covered their mouths and noses. They did not expect that someone would poison them at the banquet. Was this waiter’s target Mrs. Gu? If President Gu had not protected her, wouldn’t Mrs. Gu be either dead or injured?","At the thought of this, everyone looked at Xia Mengyan at the same time. “When she first entered, she accused Mrs. Gu of making things difficult for the waiter. Now that Mrs. Gu wants to investigate this matter thoroughly, she thinks that Mrs. Gu is blowing things up and it’ll affect the banquet. Who is she to say such things?”"]},{"number":933,"title":"Chapter 933 - Don’t Make A Fool Of Yourself","paragraphs":["“Look at how nervous she is. Could it be that she instructed the waiter to poison Mrs. Gu? After all, she has been speaking up for the waiter since she entered. The waiter even ran to her and begged her when he saw her. They must’ve come up with this plan together.”","“I heard that Xia Mengyan was President Gu’s fiancee. She must hate Mrs. Gu for snatching her engagement, so she’s using this method to punish Mrs. Gu.”","“Xia Mengyan didn’t seem to care about the engagement anymore, but she secretly poisoned Mrs. Gu. Even if Mrs. Gu stole her engagement, she shouldn’t try to poison her!”","Hearing everyone’s discussion, Xia Mengyan’s face was as pale as paper. She bit her lip and did not say anything. She knew very well that this waiter was Sun Chuan’s subordinate, but she did not know if anyone had seen them meet. It would be bad if they were discovered.","Not long after, Song Shijing rushed back and said something in Qiao Xi’s ear. She asked coldly, “Who’s Sun Chuan?”","Coincidentally, Sun Chuan was standing not far away from his father. When he heard someone calling him, he immediately frowned and said angrily, “I didn’t do anything! You’re framing me!”","Song Shiyu sneered. “My young madam is just asking who Sun Chuan is. She hasn’t said why she’s looking for you, yet you’re saying that she’s framing you? Are you confessing without even being questioned?”","Sun Chuan’s face was livid as he gritted his teeth. “You just said that you wanted to investigate this waiter, then you said my name. Who wouldn’t know what you mean? Let me tell you, I didn’t do anything. Don’t slander me!”","The waiter quickly explained, “Mrs. Gu, I poisoned you of my own accord. I hate you! I want you to die! It has nothing to do with anyone else!”","Qiao Xi grunted coldly. “What a good dog! You’re quite loyal.”","At the side, Sun Chuan instantly gained confidence and retorted loudly, “What does this have to do with me? I don’t know Mrs. Gu at all. I think it’s because you didn’t find out anything, so you casually found someone to be your scapegoat!”","Xia Mengyan pretended to be dizzy and looked weak and pitiful. She said weakly, “Xi Xi, I know that you were almost poisoned. Of course, my heart aches, but you can’t implicate innocent people just because you were hurt!","“No matter the reason the waiter poisoned you, it won’t be good if news of this gets out. They’ll say that you’re too unruly and treat others badly, so that’s why people hate you so much that they’ll go as far as to poison you! Today is Gu Corporation’s big day. You can’t bear to ruin this banquet, right? Your reputation has already plummeted. What will everyone think of you in the future if this goes on?”","Qiao Xi had an indifferent expression. She thought that Xia Mengyan was quite smart, but she was anxious to speak up for Sun Chuan at this moment. Was she not afraid of being implicated?","Qiao Xi slowly raised her eyes, and her sharp gaze seemed to be able to pierce through Xia Mengyan’s heart. She said in a mocking tone, “Cousin, the person who was almost poisoned and murdered wasn’t you. But you’re telling me to not investigate things and let this incident go? You’ve been speaking up for that waiter since you entered, yet you still think that I, the victim, am guilty? There’s something wrong with your morals!","“I suspect that someone instructed this waiter to harm me. Can’t I investigate it? Why are you stopping me?”","Xia Mengyan’s face was livid as she hurriedly explained, “Cousin, you’ve misunderstood me. I just think that we should consider the overall situation. Why don’t we wait until the banquet is over? Isn’t everyone gathered here for the banquet? It’s not appropriate for the guests to fool around with you!”","“Even if this banquet is canceled, so what?” Gu Zheng, who was standing beside Qiao Xi, suddenly spoke. His voice was filled with dignity. “I don’t even care if the banquet is held or not, but you, an outsider, do.”","Xia Mengyan was at a loss and panicked.","Qiao Xi said with a blissful expression, “Ah Zheng dotes on me and knows that someone poisoned me. Of course, he has to find out the truth immediately. How can a banquet be more important than a person’s life? But Miss Xia, you’re insisting on stopping me. Are you guilty?”","“No!” Xia Mengyan blurted out.","Qiao Xi’s gaze suddenly turned sharp. “The person who poisoned me is this waiter, and the victim is me. Since it has nothing to do with you, Miss Xia, please shut up!”","Xia Mengyan’s entire body trembled. Qiao Xi actually dared to embarrass her in public? She gritted her teeth tightly and felt a trace of uneasiness in her heart. When Sun Chuan instigated the waiter to poison Qiao Xi, he should have avoided the surveillance cameras, right?","Gu Zheng waved his hand. “Song Shiyu, call the police.” With that, he held Qiao Xi’s hand and walked toward the lounge.","The waiter was subdued by the bodyguards. He fell to the floor, his face filled with horror."]},{"number":934,"title":"Chapter 934 - Investigating The Mastermind","paragraphs":["At this moment, the originally lively banquet hall was silent. The person who instructed the waiter to poison Qiao Xi had not been found yet. Everyone was worried that the murderer would attack again. Everyone sat in their seats in fear and looked around.","After Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng entered the lounge, Qiao Xi was suddenly pulled into Gu Zheng’s embrace. His eyes gradually turned from light brown to scarlet, and his entire body emitted a cold aura. This was the first time Qiao Xi had seen Gu Zheng lose his composure like this.","He pulled Qiao Xi tightly into his embrace, and an icy-cold and trembling voice sounded from his throat. “You were almost injured. If that glass of wine had really spilled on you...”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes to meet his and comforted him softly, saying, “With you protecting me, I’ll be fine.”","Gu Zheng grabbed her waist tightly and gritted his teeth. “What if I wasn’t around? Or what if there was an accident that you couldn’t avoid? You knew that the wine was poisoned, but you still didn’t tell me!”","Qiao Xi lowered her head guiltily. She could indeed recognize that the wine had been laced with poison, but when she noticed it, the waiter had already walked over. She did not have the time to tell Gu Zheng. In any case, the poison could not have hurt her. She just did not expect Gu Zheng to be so agitated.","He tightened his arms, afraid that the woman in his arms would leave him. After a long silence, he gradually calmed down and muttered softly, “Xi Xi, don’t take risks again.”","Qiao Xi nodded obediently. “Senior, even if that glass of wine had really splashed on me, I wouldn’t be poisoned. Don’t be angry.”","Gu Zheng hugged her waist and lifted her up. Qiao Xi subconsciously wrapped her legs around Gu Zheng’s waist. The two of them were in an intimate posture, and their hot breaths intertwined. His voice was hoarse as he chuckled. “Qiao Xi, you have to compensate me.”","Qiao Xi instantly blurted out, “How do you want to be compensated?”","How else could she compensate Gu Zheng other than by buying him a new suit?","The man lifted a strand of her hair and said in a charming voice, “Compensate me with a kiss.”","Qiao Xi’s mind buzzed, and she instantly blushed. When did Gu Zheng become so good at flirting? Had he secretly learned something from her behind her back?","Just then, Song Shijing knocked on the door of the lounge. Gu Zheng put Qiao Xi down and helped her tidy her clothes and hair. Then, he said indifferently, “Come in.”","At this moment, Gu Zheng’s expression was normal, and he didn’t have the slightest trace of that seductive appearance from before. On the other hand, Qiao Xi’s face was still red, and her shy expression was still there.","Song Shijing and the person in charge of the hotel walked in. The moment the person in charge saw Gu Zheng, his legs went weak and he almost knelt on the floor.","“President, we’ve already checked the surveillance footage. Sun Chuan and that waiter had indeed met. The two of them seem to be discussing something.”","The person in charge knew that President Gu doted on Mrs. Gu very much, and this matter concerned Mrs. Gu’s safety. He wanted to cry but had no tears. “President Gu, we’ll investigate this matter thoroughly. We’ll definitely give Mrs. Gu a satisfactory answer.”","Gu Zheng’s eyes suddenly turned cold as he looked at the person in charge with a sharp gaze. “If you can’t investigate what happened today, you should know the consequences.”","His tone was light, but it made one shudder. At this moment, police sirens came from outside.","Song Shijing said quickly, “The police are here, President. I’ve sent the surveillance footage to the police, but Sun Chuan has no grudge against Young Madam. Why would he take the risk to poison her? He has no motive!”","Qiao Xi was sure. “It’s Sun Chuan.”","Unfortunately, they did not have any evidence. This was because the surveillance cameras had only captured Sun Chuan meeting the waiter, but they did not know what the two of them had said. However, this poison was very rare. Only the Sun family had a small portion of it. Xia Mengyan probably did not have the means to buy this medicine.","...","Soon, the police quickly entered. Sun Chuan was a little flustered and could not help but look at Xia Mengyan. Xia Mengyan had an innocent expression. “Sun Chuan, did you poison Xi Xi? How could you do such a thing?”","Of course, it was impossible for Sun Chuan to admit it. He just lowered his head in fear and tried his best to reduce his presence.","Xia Mengyan said gently, “Don’t be nervous. Even if you’ve met that waiter, it can’t prove that you instructed him to poison you. As long as that waiter doesn’t say that it was you, who has the right to arrest you? Moreover, you’re not that kind of person. I believe you!”","Sun Chuan immediately reacted. When the police asked about it, he calmly said that he had met up with the waiter, but he only asked the waiter to deliver a glass of wine. He did not instruct the waiter to poison anyone."]},{"number":935,"title":"Chapter 935 - There Are Many Ways To Punish Him","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi’s eyes narrowed slightly. Before the police came, Sun Chuan had a nervous expression, but now that the police were here, he was no longer afraid. He insisted that she had nothing to do with this matter. Had Xia Mengyan said something to him?","Yuan Shan frowned. “You’re the most suspicious person now. I hope you can cooperate with us...”","“I’m a suspect just because I spoke to the waiter? Just because Mrs. Gu suspects me, you want to arrest me? You want to bully the commoners just because you have power? This is unfair!”","Sun Chuan looked proud. As long as he did not admit it, they had no evidence. Even Gu Zheng had no right to arrest him!","The scene fell into an awkward silence. Gu Zheng smiled casually, and a wave of killing intent instantly burst out, filling the entire lounge. Sun Chuan was so scared that his expression changed. “W-What are you doing?”","Gu Zheng was expressionless, and the color of his eyes was faint. However, for some reason, his expression made one shudder as their hearts thumped violently.","Song Shijing knew Gu Zheng well. The calmer he looked, the angrier he was. Sun Chuan had completely angered him.","Song Shiyu took a few steps forward and said impatiently, “Young Master Sun, you have to be clear about one thing. If our president wants to deal with someone, he doesn’t need evidence nor does he need to resort to formal sentencing. Maybe you can save your life if you go to jail!”","The smug look on Sun Chuan’s face vanished abruptly, and he broke out in a cold sweat. He quickly wanted to look for the police for help, but he was interrupted by Song Shiyu coldly. “Young Master Sun, since you didn’t do anything, what’s there to be afraid of? Our president is indeed worried about Young Madam, but she’s fine now. Why would we make things hard for you?","“Young Master Sun, you don’t admit that you instructed the waiter to poison Mrs. Gu, so we can’t force you to admit it. However, I remember that your family’s company hasn’t been doing well recently. You came to the banquet this time to take this opportunity to get a few collaborations.”","Sun Chuan’s face was pale. His body was stiff, and the blood in his body seemed to have frozen. If looks could kill, he would have died in Gu Zheng’s hands thousands of times. He said in a trembling voice, “This... This has nothing to do with our company. You... You’re forcing me to confess!”","“Young Master Sun, there’s no need for you to confess,” Gu Zheng said coldly. He did not even bother to look at Sun Chuan. To him, Sun Chuan was just an ant. There were many ways to punish him. Since there was no evidence to prove that he was the one who instructed the waiter to poison Qiao Xi, there was no need to torture him.","Gu Zheng retracted his gaze and said gently, “Xi Xi, the banquet has begun. Let’s go prepare.”","Qiao Xi smiled and nodded, and the two of them entered.","Song Shiyu said respectfully to Yuan Shan, “Officer Yuan, I’m really sorry. Our president has decided to withdraw the case. There are some things that we should solve ourselves. There’s no need to trouble you.”","Yuan Shan understood what Song Shiyu meant and left with his team. Sun Chuan’s legs went weak as he knelt on the floor, his eyes filled with horror.","...","Everyone knew Gu Zheng’s methods. He did not have to deal with a situation himself. As long as Song Shijing made a few calls, the Sun family’s company would soon fall into a desperate situation.","Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng were still changing in the inner room when Song Shijing knocked on the door. “President, Sun Chuan’s father, Sun Kai, is waiting to see you.”","The corners of Gu Zheng’s mouth curled up slightly. There were so many people who wanted to see him, so there was no need for him to see all of them. However, he changed his usual demeanor today. His voice was cold and dignified. “Let him in.”","As soon as the door of the lounge opened, Sun Kai scrambled in. The moment he saw Gu Zheng, it was as if he had seen his savior. He knelt in front of him and cried bitterly. “President Gu... President Gu, I beg you to let our Sun family off! The company is already in a difficult spot. Once you make a move, our Sun family will be completely doomed! I really don’t understand how I offended you. Why do you suddenly want to make things hard for me?!”","He originally wanted to attend Gu Corporation’s banquet and get to know a few more big shots in the business world, but he did not expect that before the banquet even started, his phone would explode. At this moment, the company was almost bankrupt.","After asking around, Sun Kai found out that it was President Gu who arranged this. However, he really did not know how he had offended President Gu that he would take revenge on him like this. He quickly found Song Shijing and asked to see President Gu. Even if he had to die, he had to die in peace.","The lounge was silent. After a long time, Mr. Sun heard a sneer above his head. Gu Zheng’s voice was indifferent. “Mr. Sun, do you really want to protect your company?”"]},{"number":936,"title":"Chapter 936 - Give Him A Chance To Change","paragraphs":["When Sun Kai heard his words, a trace of hope instantly lit up in his eyes. He could not wait to say, “I want to! Yes, I want to! The Sun family’s company is my life’s work. I worked hard to build the company from scratch. I hope you can let me off—”","Before he could finish, Gu Zheng’s indifferent voice came from above. He said word by word, “Then I’ll give you a chance. Choose yourself whether you’d like your son or your company.”","The lounge was dead silent. Sun Kai was stunned for a moment. Could it be that his son had offended President Gu?","Gu Zheng did not bother to talk to him anymore, so Song Shijing spoke up on his behalf, “President Sun, a waiter splashed poisoned wine on our young madam just now. Before that, that waiter had a conversation with Sun Chuan. Moreover, this poison is very special and only your Sun family has it. Although Sun Chuan didn’t admit that he instructed the waiter to poison her, the evidence is already pointing to him. Our president has always doted on Young Madam. How could he let the person who tried to kill her off?”","Sun Kai gasped, his eyes filled with horror.","“On the account of President Sun’s sincere attitude, the president is giving the Sun family a chance to turn over a new leaf. As long as you’re willing to use Young Master Sun’s arm as compensation, the president will let you off. Anyway, he’s not interested in your company. He just wants to avenge Young Madam.”","Sun Kai knew very well that the waiter was instructed by his son. President Gu must have already investigated it. Even if Sun Chuan did not admit it, so what? President Gu would do his best to attack the company so that their family would be left to their own devices.","He knelt on the floor, his body trembling uncontrollably. That was his biological son. How could he bear to do this? But if he did not agree, then the company...","Song Shijing guided him patiently. “Mr. Sun, I heard that your son is ignorant and incompetent. He causes trouble all day long. You’ve been having a headache over him. I think it’s quite worth it to use him in exchange for the company’s survival. Moreover, you’re in your prime and can have another son. Can you bear to ruin your years of hard work for such an unfilial son?”","Sun Kai instantly came back to his senses and knew what to do.","“President Sun, let me remind you again. Before Young Master Sun met that waiter, he met Miss Xia. You also know that Miss Xia has a grudge against our young madam. Perhaps Young Master Sun... You’re a smart person. You should understand what I mean.”","Song Shijing did not say it directly, but Sun Kai immediately understood. His son had been infatuated with Xia Mengyan since he was in university and was tricked by her a few times. Now, he was bewitched by this b*tch again and actually dared to poison Mrs. Gu in public. Was he crazy? It did not matter if he wanted to die, but if anything happened to Mrs. Gu, President Gu would definitely raze the entire Sun family to the ground.","Sun Kai walked back to the banquet hall like a zombie. Sun Chuan walked over nervously, but Sun Kai’s eyes were filled with viciousness when he looked at Sun Chuan. “You unfilial son! You almost killed me for a b*tch!","“Since you’ve already done it, you have to pay the price for it. If your arm is gone, you won’t go out and fool around anymore. Just stay at home obediently to avoid causing trouble for me. If the Sun family’s company is saved, it won’t be a problem for me to support you for the rest of your life.”","Sun Chuan’s pupils constricted abruptly, and his body trembled violently. At this moment, he finally understood what President Gu meant when he left. Just because he withdrew the lawsuit did not mean that he would not pursue the matter. Instead, he wanted him to pay an even more painful price.","If Gu Zheng made his father kill him, perhaps his father would not be able to bring himself to do it. However, if Gu Zheng only asked for one of his arms in exchange for the survival of the Sun family’s company, of course, his father would not refuse. However, if he lost an arm, how was he qualified to be the heir of the Sun family?","His life was ruined after attending a banquet. All of this started because of... Xia Mengyan!","Sun Chuan suddenly looked up, his eyes glowing green like a jackal’s. He pounced on Xia Mengyan crazily. “It’s all your fault! You caused me harm! Xia Mengyan!”","Everyone did not expect Sun Chuan to suddenly attack. In the blink of an eye, Xia Mengyan was already pushed to the floor by Sun Chuan. Sun Chuan grabbed Xia Mengyan’s neck tightly. Xia Mengyan’s face was ashen. She struggled weakly with her hands and could not say anything.","Seeing this, everyone hurriedly went forward to pull Sun Chuan away. Xia Mengyan took a few steps back in horror and coughed violently. Her eyes were red, and tears kept falling. She looked pitiful.","Sun Chuan roared crazily, “You destroyed me! If it weren’t for you, why would I have attacked Mrs. Gu? It’s all your fault, b*tch!”"]},{"number":937,"title":"Chapter 937 - Sudden Engagement","paragraphs":["Everyone could not help but look at Xia Mengyan. Could it be that Xia Mengyan had instructed Sun Chuan to poison Mrs. Gu? Everyone had seen with their own eyes that the glass of wine was extremely poisonous and had corroded the fabric of President Gu’s suit jacket. If that glass of wine had splashed onto Mrs. Gu’s face, even if she did not die, she would be completely disfigured and become ugly.","Actually, everyone knew that Sun Chuan did not know Mrs. Gu, let alone have a grudge against her. The only reason he could have poisoned her was Xia Mengyan. Now that Sun Chuan was cursing Xia Mengyan in public, she must have said something to Sun Chuan to make him poison Mrs. Gu on impulse.","Everyone looked at Xia Mengyan suspiciously. She lowered her head and clenched her fists.","Idiot! He actually exposed her! He said that he liked her and treated her as his goddess, so he was willing to sacrifice everything for her. Now, not only did he curse her in public, but he even attacked her! Not only did he not ruin Qiao Xi’s face but he even caused trouble for her. How could she ever like such a stupid man?","Sun Chuan was suppressed by everyone. He struggled crazily and roared at Xia Mengyan. Looking at his crazy appearance, Xia Mengyan curled her lips. Suddenly, tears trickled down her face as she sobbed softly. “Sun Chuan! Why are you maligning me? I know you’ve liked me for a long time, but I don’t like you. You can’t force feelings. You can’t hate me just because I rejected you. Now that your plan to poison Mrs. Gu has been exposed, you’re slandering me. How can I like you if you do this?","“Actually, I told you a long time ago that I was already engaged and couldn’t be with you. But no matter how much I refused, you continued to pester me. Now that you can’t woo me, you want to harm me?","“I also understand why you poisoned Xi Xi. You must have seen the news online and mistakenly thought that my relationship with Xi Xi wasn’t good, so you decided to poison her. You hoped to gain my favor, but your actions will only make me hate you even more!”","Looking at Xia Mengyan’s weak and tearful appearance, Sun Chuan suddenly stopped struggling. It was clearly Xia Mengyan who had cried in front of him and even asked him to look at the news online. That was why he decided to poison Qiao Xi. Now, Xia Mengyan was unwilling to admit what she had said and wanted him to bear all of this himself?","Xia Mengyan covered her face and cried. Everyone looked at each other, not knowing who was telling the truth.","Seeing the beauty cry, the gentlemen around finally could not sit still anymore. They worked together to chase Sun Chuan out and comforted her softly. “Miss Xia, it’s alright. Don’t cry anymore.”","Xia Mengyan wiped her tears and looked sad. “It’s my fault! I really didn’t know that he would poison Xi Xi. I should have known that he was vicious. I thought that everything would be over after I rejected him. Who knew that he actually...”","Seeing her cry, the men’s voices became even gentler. “Sun Chuan was rash and caused huge trouble. How can we blame you?”","‘That’s right! How can you blame me? It’s clearly Sun Chuan who’s stupid and willing to be used by others. Fortunately, Gu Zheng got rid of him. Otherwise, I’d have to personally take action against him.’","Xia Mengyan lowered her eyes and curled her lips into a sinister smile. She had finally managed to protect her reputation.","...","The person who attempted to poison Mrs. Gu had already been arrested. Only then did everyone continue with the banquet in peace. They drank and chatted. Suddenly, everyone’s phones rang. A notification appeared. It was the marriage contract between the president of Gu Corporation, Gu Zheng, and Xia Mengyan.","Qiao Xi naturally saw the marriage contract as well. Her expression was indifferent. She found a quiet corner and was eating a delicious cake without the slightest nervousness.","At this moment, the comments section was peaceful. They were all blessings from Sally’s fans to celebrate Gu Zheng finally abandoning that scheming woman at home and choosing Xia Mengyan, who had been engaged to him since they were young.","The marriage back then was decided by Lu Qingyun and Xia Yunqiu. Although the two of them had already passed away, the elders of the two families were still around. The Xia and Lu families had discussed it, and they were sure that this marriage contract belonged to Xia Mengyan. This was because Qiao Xi was not even born when they got engaged. How could Xia Yunqiu be sure that the child she gave birth to would definitely be a girl?","However, everyone had forgotten an important piece of news. Ever since Old Madam Yin and Xia Cheng divorced, Xia Yunqiu had also cut off all contact with the Xia family. Since they had no contact with each other, why would Xia Yunqiu set up an engagement with Xia Mengyan? However, as public opinion grew, everyone seemed to have already confirmed this matter. Moreover, the Lu family had also appeared to confirm it."]},{"number":938,"title":"Chapter 938 - Xia Yunlou’s Secret","paragraphs":["The Yin family stepped forward to refute the rumors, but there was no substantial evidence. It was hard to explain.","After Qiao Xi finished eating the cake, she wiped the cream off the corner of her mouth and revealed a satisfied smile. Even though she was sitting in the corner, she was still the center of attention.","At this moment, someone suddenly asked, “Old Master Xia, the official account of Xia Corporation has already released the news of Miss Xia and President Gu’s engagement. But President Gu and Mrs. Gu...”","Xia Cheng smiled kindly. “Everyone, you’re thinking too much. Of course, President Gu has agreed to this marriage. Otherwise, why would I dare to take matters into my own hands?”","At this moment, Xia Mengyan’s father, Xia Ji, and Xia Yunlou were also present. As Qiao Xi’s biological mother, Xia Yunlou was noticed by many reporters the moment she appeared.","When Xia Mengyan saw that her father and aunt were here, she hurriedly went forward with a blissful expression. When Xia Cheng saw his children, he immediately beamed. “Yunlou, Xia Ji.”","Qiao Xi sized up Xia Yunlou. She seemed to have become a little more mature and did not care about her adopted daughter, Xu Anran, anymore. She had a rare chance to return to the Xia family and start a new life. It was time for her to restrain herself.","Looking at the harmonious appearance of the Xia family, Qiao Xi could not help but narrow her eyes. She really did not understand. Xia Yunlou doted on Xu Anran so much and was very close to Xia Mengyan, but she was so cold to her biological daughter.","She sized up the Xia family and found it a little strange that everyone was here except for Xia Mengyan’s mother. Moreover, Xia Mengyan did not ask about her mother either. She seemed to be used to it. Qiao Xi heard that Madam Xia never attended any banquets and had always been reclusive. Qiao Xi even suspected that this person did not exist at all.","Xia Yun held Xia Mengyan’s hand and said with a loving expression, “Mengyan, don’t worry. You’re the legitimate Mrs. Gu! You’re the daughter of the Xia family who we’ve nurtured since you were young. Only you’re worthy of President Gu.”","Xia Mengyan blushed shyly, but she pretended to be troubled. “Aunt, you’re Xi Xi’s biological mother. If she finds out that you’re speaking up for me, she’ll definitely be sad. Moreover, she and Ah Zheng haven’t divorced yet. We—”","“I’m her biological mother, so I know her well. I know that she’s not worthy of being Mrs. Gu!” Xia Yunlou’s gaze turned fierce when she heard Qiao Xi’s name.","“Mengyan, just wait to be Mrs. Gu! She’ll have to give up her position sooner or later. The Lu family won’t even acknowledge her identity, so how can she continue to stay by President Gu’s side? Our Xia family is on good terms with the Lu family, and with the Lu family’s help, this position will be yours sooner or later!”","Actually, Xia Yunlou was also a little unwilling. At first, she planned to let Anran marry Gu Zheng. After all, she was the daughter she raised since she was young. However, ever since she was chased back to the Xia family and Xia Ji told her something, she decided to wholeheartedly help Mengyan rise to power.","Xia Yunlou comforted her in a low voice. “Xu Zhi and I haven’t divorced yet, so I’m still Madam Xu. The Jiang family and the Xu family are old friends. The two families are close. With the Lu family’s confirmation, this marriage will naturally succeed.”","Xia Ji also smiled and said, “Yunlou is right. Mengyan, just wait for your marriage!”","Qiao Xi looked at Xia Yunlou and could not help but sneer. Back then, this woman doted on Xu Anran like she was her own daughter. In the end, she heartlessly abandoned her. Now, Xu Anran was living like a street rat, but she did not care about her. Instead, she was concerned about Xia Mengyan.","In the Yin family’s memories, Xia Yunlou was kind and sensible when she was young. Although she was the youngest, she was very obedient. In order to not let her parents’ relationship fall apart, she took the initiative to leave home with her father when she was young. She was afraid that her siblings would be sad, so she decided to return home to accompany them. How did such a child become like this?","Xia Yunlou’s eyes were filled with viciousness and selfishness. She might have really loved Xu Zhi and doted on Xu Anran, but these two people were nothing compared to her. All her actions were for herself. For example, she was helping Xia Mengyan snatch her biological daughter’s engagement for the sake of wealth and benefits.","How could this woman be the obedient little girl described by the Yin family?","Qiao Xi felt that it was very strange. Before she could think clearly, someone suddenly blocked her line of sight. Xia Yunlou stood in front of her with a vicious gaze. When she thought about how she had been chased out of the house by Xu Zhi during this period of time and was mocked by the entire Luo City, she wished for nothing more than to tear Qiao Xi into pieces."]},{"number":939,"title":"Chapter 939 - Cousin Is Domineering When","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi slowly raised her eyes, and her stunning face was shrouded in shadows. She took a sip of the fruit wine, and her lips were stained with the sparkling wine, making her look even more charming.","However, Xia Yunlou did not find Qiao Xi stunning in the slightest. Instead, she said with a gloomy expression, “You’re still so rude. You don’t even greet me when you see me.”","Qiao Xi leaned comfortably against the sofa and said indifferently, “I’m wondering if I should call you Madam Xu or Madam Xia.”","These words were like a heavy blow to Xia Yunlou’s heart. In the past, she was the glorious Madam Xu, but now, Xu Zhi wanted to divorce her. Although the procedures had not been done, her marriage with Xu Zhi had already ended. The title of Madam Xu was a blatant mockery.","“Qiao Xi! Is this how you speak to your mother? I really hate it when you’re like this. You’re so arrogant. I’d rather dote on my adopted daughter and niece than waste a single second on you!”","Xia Yunlou glared angrily and pointed at Qiao Xi as she shouted in exasperation, “Other people’s daughters are all obedient and sensible, but you act like my enemy. As long as you curry favor and say a few good words, I’ll naturally dote on you. You’ve never had a mother to dote on you since you were young. Could it be that you don’t desire maternal love?”","Qiao Xi put down her wine glass and lazily leaned against the sofa. Her thin lips parted slightly. “What a coincidence. I don’t like you either. Moreover, there are many people who are good to me. You’re not the only one who can dote on me.”","These simple words almost made Xia Yunlou faint from anger. She glanced at the people around her before suppressing the anger in her heart. She gritted her teeth and warned, “Let me tell you, you need to shut up today. Don’t spout nonsense in front of others. Now that Mengyan and President Gu’s marriage has been decided, I won’t let you off if you ruin it!”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows indifferently with a disdainful expression. She, the legitimate wife, was still around, yet Xia Mengyan wanted to marry Gu Zheng. She was really daydreaming!","Xia Yunlou was infuriated by her appearance. She berated coldly, “Look at you. Are you worthy of President Gu? Moreover, this engagement doesn’t belong to you. You stole Mengyan’s engagement, so it’s time to return it to her.","“Once the news of the engagement is out, the Xia family’s business will improve a lot. If you dare to ruin it, you’ll be disloyal to the Xia family and unfilial!”","Qiao Xi snorted coldly. “Is there something wrong with you? What does the Xia family have to do with me?”","Xia Yunlou was angered to the point of having a ferocious expression. The flesh on her face trembled slightly as she pointed at Qiao Xi and shouted, “What are you talking about?! You’re also half a member of the Xia family! Mengyan is your cousin. She’s so good to you, yet you still snatched her engagement away. Why are you so selfish?!”","Qiao Xi had always been very curious. How could the Xia family be so shameless and lie through their teeth? Xia Mengyan was good to her? Hmph, she was so good that Qiao Xi wished for nothing more than to kill her!","Xia Yunlou suppressed her anger. “In any case, if you still want to acknowledge me as your mother, you’re not allowed to fool around today. You and President Gu are not compatible. You’d better divorce obediently. I’ll find a more suitable man for you.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes and glanced at her with slight doubt. She chuckled and asked, “Madam Xia, why do you think I want to acknowledge you as my mother?”","Xia Yunlou originally thought that she had deceived Qiao Xi, but she did not expect that Qiao Xi did not care at all. She was angered to the point her face flushed red, and her tone was vicious. “Qiao Xi! I’m warning you. If you ruin this marriage, I won’t let you off!”","“Madam Xia, you’re also a socialite from an aristocratic family. Why are you losing your composure?! Are you qualified to give me a warning?” As soon as Qiao Xi finished speaking, she stood up and left. Xia Yunlou looked at the surrounding guests and was angered to the point her entire body trembled. She quickly rushed to Qiao Xi’s side with the intention of grabbing her.","At this moment, Xia Mengyan hurriedly rushed over and comforted her softly. “Aunt! Don’t make things difficult for Cousin. It’s normal for her to be sad, but Cousin, I’ve already gone to see President Gu. He said that he’ll announce the marriage between the two families at the banquet. I advise you not to cause trouble lest you anger President Gu.”","As soon as she finished speaking, a tall figure suddenly appeared in front of Qiao Xi. Yin Jinglin raised his eyebrows with a disdainful expression. “Announce the marriage contract between the two families?”","Xia Mengyan smiled in embarrassment. “Cousin, I know you dote on Xi Xi, but President Gu has already agreed to this marriage. If Xi Xi continues to pester him, she’ll be laughed at. At that time, everyone will be in a difficult position.”","Yin Jinglin’s eyes turned cold. “Don’t call me your cousin. Are we close? Is the daughter of an illegitimate child worthy of being my relative? Are you worthy?”"]},{"number":940,"title":"Chapter 940 - Trash Should Stay In The Trash Can","paragraphs":["“Xia Mengyan, don’t think that your little tricks can hide from me. When you instigated Sun Chuan, I happened to see and record it. Even without the recording, do you think I can’t find evidence? If you don’t want others to know what you did, don’t do it!","“You keep saying that you’re on good terms with Xi Xi, but you plotted to poison her behind her back. Little girl, you’re so two-faced! You’re just trash, so you should stay in the trash can. Do you think everyone is like that idiot, Sun Chuan, who’s tempted by your appearance? Just because he’s a fool doesn’t mean that the others are the same!”","With a loud bang, some photos and documents fell in front of Xia Mengyan.","The entire venue was silent. The guests were so scared that their bodies trembled as they looked at Xia Mengyan. Everyone also suspected that Xia Mengyan was related to the poisoning. After all, when Sun Chuan was chased out, he shouted that Xia Mengyan had harmed him. In the end, Xia Mengyan cried and the matter was over. Now, Young Master Yin actually had evidence.","Xia Mengyan’s face was pale. She did not expect Yin Jinglin to have recorded her conversation with Sun Chuan. He even exposed it in public. At this moment, she looked at the photos and information on the floor. Her body was stiff, and her mind was a mess.","Hearing Yin Jinglin’s words, the men who liked Xia Mengyan felt offended and retorted indignantly, “Young Master Yin, who knows if your evidence is real or fake? Your Yin family is so rich. It might be fake.”","“Can’t you see for yourself whether it’s true or not? Right! I forgot that you’re blind to have taken a liking to a beast like Xia Mengyan!” Yin Jinglin retorted crazily, “Since you’re blind, I’ll tell you out of goodwill. Miss Xia secretly bought this poison a long time ago. This poison might still be hidden in the Xia family now! As expected of the granddaughter of a mistress. You only know how to play tricks behind others’ backs. Your grandmother is a shameless mistress, so you learned to be one too. You want to ruin Xi Xi’s marriage, and you even tried to poison her. Do you still have the cheek to live in this world?","“How does the Xia family educate their children? It’s really bad luck to have met you people! Fortunately, Grandma divorced the scumbag decades ago and left the Xia family with her father. Otherwise, the younger generation like us would have been raised in the Xia family. Wouldn’t we become as vicious as you, Miss Xia?”","Yin Jinglin’s words were not polite to the Xia family at all. His words were a harsh slap to their cheeks. They were all so angry that their faces turned red.","Xia Yunlou gritted her teeth. “Qiao Xi!”","“Jinglin.” A cold and dignified voice slowly sounded. A man in a gray suit walked over. His eyes were cold, and his face was handsome. However, he gave off an invisible sense of oppression.","Yin Jingting exuded a noble and elegant aura. This was the aura of the future head of the Yin family. He looked at the Xia family coldly, but his tone was very calm. “Jinglin, you’re the young master of the Yin family. How can you quarrel with a group of immoral people? Won’t you lose your status by doing this?”","Yin Jinglin smiled arrogantly. “Third Brother, you’re right. What’s there to quarrel about with a group of immoral people? Anyway, they don’t even care about their reputations anymore. What else could they care about?”","As soon as he finished speaking, he looked at Xia Mengyan with a mocking expression. “Don’t think that the matter of you poisoning my cousin is over. My grudge with you has just begun! You tried to harm my cousin, so I’ll make you pay a painful price!”","Xia Mengyan’s expression changed, and she broke out in a cold sweat. Her eyes were red as she choked. “Cousin, I really didn’t poison anyone. I was wronged. Moreover, today is Gu Corporation’s banquet. Why are we so tense? President Gu even said that he wanted to announce something important. We can’t affect the overall situation over such a small matter.”","Yin Jinglin really could not stand Xia Mengyan’s pretense and was about to retort when he was stopped by Yin Jingting. His eyes were indifferent and carried a trace of mockery. “Miss Xia, you just said that President Gu is going to announce an important matter. Is it the engagement between the two families? Does this engagement really belong to you?”","Xia Mengyan pretended to be calm, and her voice trembled slightly. “Cousin, why don’t you believe me? I admit that the poisoning incident is indeed related to me. Sun Chuan attacked you because he wanted to avenge me, but I’ve already apologized and Sun Chuan has been punished. Why won’t you forgive me?! I know you must be blaming me for being with Ah Zheng, but what’s wrong with me just taking back what belongs to me?”"]},{"number":941,"title":"Chapter 941 - He Has Decided","paragraphs":["“My heart also aches for Xi Xi, but she’s really not compatible with Ah Zheng. Moreover, on the account of our past relationship, Ah Zheng and I won’t treat her badly. The rumors online will dissipate soon, so you don’t have to care. Xi Xi and I will still be good friends in the future. Isn’t that good?”","Xia Mengyan said with a sincere expression, then looked at Qiao Xi and sighed helplessly. “I just asked Ah Zheng. He said that he’ll explain everything clearly. Xi Xi, when Ah Zheng announces the matter later, don’t fool around, alright?”","Qiao Xi stood silently on the spot and could not help but sneer when she heard Xia Mengyan’s words. “Why should I?”","“Ah Zheng has already made up his mind. Even if you...” Xia Mengyan was talking when her eyes suddenly lit up. “You mean you won’t stop him?”","“Of course, I won’t fool around if Gu Zheng wants to make an announcement! I’m not a lunatic.” Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully and didn’t even bother to look at Xia Mengyan. She walked straight to the sofa and sat down.","Seeing that Qiao Xi had agreed so easily, Xia Mengyan was slightly uncertain in her heart. However, Gu Zheng had already agreed to announce the engagement in public. He definitely hated Qiao Xi now. Could it be that there were other changes?","Half an hour ago, Xia Mengyan had gone to see Gu Zheng to express her feelings and explain the benefits of the marriage between the two families. Moreover, the elders of the two families had already agreed to this marriage. As long as he agreed, everyone would be happy.","Xia Mengyan was still slightly worried that Gu Zheng would refuse, but Gu Zheng actually agreed to announce the engagement. She did not expect the matter to be resolved so easily. From the looks of it, Gu Zheng did not like Qiao Xi much. He probably just liked her beauty and found her a little novel. However, in the face of absolute benefits, Qiao Xi was nothing.","At this moment, Xia Mengyan was still thinking about Gu Zheng’s words. Her expression became even prouder. “Xi Xi, don’t be sad anymore. Ah Zheng will explain everything to you later. Even though the fate between you and him has ended, you’ll find your own happiness in the future.”","Coincidentally, a few socialites around heard Xia Mengyan’s words. Someone asked curiously, “Mengyan, is your engagement with President Gu real?”","Xia Mengyan blushed shyly. “Actually, the two families have already discussed it, but President Gu said that he wants to announce it in public. He’ll also give the Xia family an explanation. No matter what his decision is, I’ll support him.”","In that case, President Gu had already admitted his engagement with Xia Mengyan and decided to get engaged to her. What should Qiao Xi do? No matter what, she was the legitimate Mrs. Gu!","“Now that Xi Xi and Ah Zheng are already married, I don’t want to ruin their marriage. I just want an explanation. As for whether Ah Zheng continues to be with Xi Xi or not, that’s up to him. I can’t interfere, but if he decides to fulfill the engagement, I’m willing to be with him. After all, feelings can’t be forced. Back then, Ah Zheng and Xi Xi got married to fulfill the engagement, not because of feelings.”","When the few socialites heard these words, they looked at Qiao Xi with disdain. “A certain someone stole her cousin’s engagement and successfully rose to power. Now that the matter has been exposed, she’s still unwilling to give up her position. How shameless! In any case, Mengyan is President Gu’s true fiancee!”","“Mengyan, even if you and President Gu are married, you won’t be considered to have ruined someone else’s marriage. After all, this marriage contract was yours from the beginning!”","Xia Mengyan hurriedly stopped them. “Everyone, stop talking. Xi Xi is my cousin, after all. At this point, my heart aches for her too. Now, it all depends on Ah Zheng’s decision.”","...","Half an hour later, the banquet was about to end. Everyone was anxiously waiting for the final outcome. They wanted to know who Gu Zheng would choose in the end. Would he admit that Qiao Xi had snatched Xia Mengyan’s engagement, or would he continue to help her cover it up? Would he divorce her and be with Xia Mengyan, or would the matter just stop there?","Just as everyone was guessing, another piece of news broke out online. The Lu family had already acknowledged the Xia family’s engagement. The Lu family was Miss Lu Qingyun’s family. If they admitted that this engagement belonged to Xia Mengyan, it meant that it was the truth.","“President Gu is here!”","Everyone shouted as Gu Zheng walked over slowly. Behind him were Song Shijing, Song Shiyu, and a group of bodyguards. His powerful aura made everyone shudder.","“So the engagement really belongs to Xia Mengyan!”","Song Shiyu was speechless. The president and Young Madam had known each other for 10 years. The two of them were truly in love, so did they still need a marriage contract? However, he could not say anything because the president had his own plans."]},{"number":942,"title":"Chapter 942 - Announcing The Engagement In Public","paragraphs":["Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent as his gaze landed on the woman in the corner. Under the illumination of the lights, Qiao Xi’s entire body seemed to be emitting light. Her skin was fair, and her soft hair fell on her shoulders like seaweed. His eyes could not help but become gentle.","The socialites gathered together and teased each other. Then, they pulled Xia Mengyan over and asked with a smile, “Mengyan, look, is President Gu here to look for you?”","Gu Zheng had said that he wanted to announce the engagement in public, and now, he was walking toward Xia Mengyan. Everyone in the Xia family was extremely excited. Those who were close to the Xia family also beamed. After all, if the Xia family could get close to Gu Zheng, it meant that they could also reap benefits.","Xia Mengyan’s breathing trembled slightly. She smiled shyly and said anxiously, “Ah Zheng...”","As soon as she finished speaking, Gu Zheng directly walked past her and walked in front of Qiao Xi. He held Qiao Xi’s hand gently, and his voice was extremely gentle. “Xi Xi, I’m back.”","The entire venue was silent as everyone looked at Xia Mengyan in confusion. Didn’t President Gu already agree to the marriage? Why did he not give Xia Mengyan a second look at all and directly walk to Qiao Xi’s side?","Xia Mengyan gasped, and the blood in her body seemed to have frozen. She could even hear the mocking laughter around her. Didn’t Ah Zheng say that he wanted to give the Xia family an explanation? Didn’t he say that he wanted to announce the engagement in public? But why was he still so cold to her?","Xia Mengyan’s eyes turned red as she choked and asked, “Ah Zheng, aren’t you going to announce the engagement?”","Xia Yunlou, who was at the side, also berated unhappily, “Qiao Xi! Why are you standing beside President Gu? Hurry up and come over! Mengyan and President Gu are already engaged, yet you’re still pestering President Gu. Don’t you have any shame?!”","Qiao Xi did not want to pay attention to Xia Yunlou at all, but Gu Zheng’s eyes sank. His sharp gaze seemed to pierce through everyone. “I do have something to announce in public.”","Hearing this, Xia Yunlou hurriedly went forward to ask for an explanation, but she was stopped by Xia Ji. Xia Ji gestured for Xia Yunlou to calm down and took a few steps forward. He said respectfully, “President Gu, not long after Mengyan was born, Eldest Miss Lu and my sister, Yunqiu, arranged an engagement between you and Mengyan. The Lu family has also confirmed this matter. Mengyan knew that she was engaged since she was young, so she has never been in a relationship. She has been waiting for you. If you don’t believe me, you can ask her friends and classmates.”","This was indeed the truth. Everyone around Xia Mengyan knew that she had a fiance, but they never knew who he was. They only knew that he was powerful.","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes and smiled. “Does that mean that the Xia family has already decided that I’m Miss Xia’s fiance? Miss Xia, don’t you have anything else to say?”","Everyone was stunned. What did Gu Zheng mean? Could it be that Xia Mengyan was hiding something?","At this moment, Xia Mengyan, whose head was lowered, suddenly sobbed. Tears trickled down her face. She suppressed her tears and said with a trembling voice, “Ah Zheng, actually, I know very well that you like Xi Xi. I don’t want to separate the two of you. I just want an explanation.","“This engagement was originally mine. I’ve dreamed of marrying you since I was young, but I didn’t expect Xi Xi to secretly marry you. I also have a trace of resentment in my heart about it, but I’ve already forgiven Xi Xi. Now, I just want an explanation. I just want an apology. Why can’t this small wish of mine be fulfilled?”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. “Miss Xia, your ability to lie through your teeth is really getting better and better!”","The expressions of everyone from the Xia family were extremely unsightly, and Xia Yunlou’s face was even gloomier. Qiao Xi, this little b*tch, did not take her warning seriously at all. If she had known earlier, she would’ve strangled Qiao Xi to death when she was born!","Qiao Xi sensed Xia Yunlou’s gaze and narrowed her eyes. She was slightly curious about why Xia Yunlou was so interested in Xia Mengyan.","Xia Mengyan did not expect Qiao Xi to mock her. Her eyes were filled with sorrow. “Xi Xi, I’m telling the truth. You can’t malign me just because I’m hurting your interests!”","At this moment, the socialite beside Xia Mengyan stood up and looked at Qiao Xi with disdain. She said indignantly, “You fake, stop spouting nonsense! You must have said something in front of President Gu that made him suspect something.”","Xia Mengyan wiped her tears and was heartbroken. “Xi Xi, I admit that I like Ah Zheng, but I’ve never thought of ruining your marriage. You can’t ignore the harm you’ve caused me just because of my kindness! For 20 years, I’ve treated him as my fiance, but you married him in my place. Do you know how sad I am because of this?”"]},{"number":943,"title":"Chapter 943 - Another Fiance","paragraphs":["Seeing Xia Mengyan cry bitterly, everyone pitied her. Qiao Xi was still unwilling to admit it because of her identity as Mrs. Gu. She wanted Miss Xia to swallow her anger.","What right did Qiao Xi have to be so arrogant? She was the one who did something wrong and even used her identity as Mrs. Gu to suppress the victims. She was really immoral and heartless!","“Miss Xia, stop crying. Your makeup is all ruined. You weren’t good-looking to begin with, so you’re even uglier now.”","Qiao Xi’s teasing voice sounded. Xia Mengyan hurriedly wiped her tears and picked up the mirror to look at her makeup. She was afraid that Gu Zheng would think that she was in a sorry state. Her eyes were red in the mirror, but her makeup was not messy. Instead, she just looked pitiful. Only then did Xia Mengyan realize that she had been teased.","However, before Xia Mengyan could speak, Qiao Xi said casually, “Miss Xia, you said that you don’t want to ruin our marriage, but your Xia family released the news of your engagement to Gu Zheng. Why? Do you still want to be a b*tch?”","Xia Mengyan’s face was fierce. The anger in her heart burned fiercely, and she could not help but retort, “Xi Xi, what right do you have to say that about me? I’m the one who’s supposed to be engaged to Ah Zheng. I’m the victim! I’ve never thought of being a mistress!”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled into a cold smile as she slowly walked in front of her and whispered in her ear, “Xia Mengyan, it’s a pity that you’re not an actress. I almost believed you.”","Xia Mengyan raised her eyes and met Qiao Xi’s indifferent eyes. Her heart suddenly skipped a beat. Why was Qiao Xi still so calm at a time like this?","Xia Ji also noticed that something was wrong and wanted to stop Qiao Xi from speaking, but Qiao Xi had already said, “Miss Xia, you say that you don’t want to be a mistress, but you’re forcing Gu Zheng to be the third party for the sake of achieving your goal. Isn’t this too inhumane?! You care about your reputation, but don’t you care about Gu Zheng’s life or death?”","The entire venue was silent. Everyone widened their eyes and looked at Qiao Xi in disbelief. What exactly did she say? Gu Zheng was a third party?","Someone said angrily, “What nonsense are you talking about?! You did something wrong, yet you’re still slandering others! What’s the use?!”","The other person was calm. “Stop arguing. Let’s hear what President Gu has to say first.”","Everyone looked at Gu Zheng and heard him say casually, “I did have a fiancee previously, but I’ve never said that my fiancee was Miss Xia.”","The moment that was said, everyone gasped. He actually did not admit that Xia Mengyan was his fiancee?","Xia Mengyan’s face was pale and filled with sorrow. “Ah Zheng, you can’t deny our marriage just because you like Xi Xi. Moreover, the Lu family has already admitted it.”","“Miss Xia, let me remind you that the Lu family doesn’t represent me. Also, don’t call me Ah Zheng. I’m not familiar with you. Moreover, you clearly have a fiance, but you’re still shameless enough to want to marry me. Do you actually think you’re beautiful enough to be acting like this? Have you ever considered how your fiance will feel when you do this?”","Boom!!!","Everyone was dumbfounded as if they had been struck by lightning. The atmosphere was silent for a few seconds before the scene exploded.","“Did I hear wrongly? President Gu said that Miss Xia has another fiance? How is that possible?”","“The Xia and Lu families have already admitted to this marriage. How could they be lying? Even if the Xia family might be lying, the Lu family is the family of President Gu’s grandfather. They have no reason to lie!”","“Moreover, this matter has caused an uproar. If Miss Xia really has a fiance, why hasn’t he appeared?”","Xia Mengyan’s body gradually stiffened. Her lips were pale, and her eyes were filled with horror. She was at a loss. “Ah Zheng... President Gu, what are you talking about? I don’t understand.”","In the past, the Xia family was also worried that this engagement would be found out by others. However, the Xia family was a big family in Luo City, after all. It was not difficult for them to hide this matter. Moreover, it had been many years since then. Who would know that secret?","However, at this moment, Xia Cheng’s body suddenly softened. His body trembled violently, but he still gritted his teeth and retorted, “President Gu, even if you don’t want to admit the engagement, you shouldn’t slander Mengyan’s reputation like this.”","Old Madam Xia looked at the Yin family with deep hatred in her heart. She was now the madam of the Xia family, but Yin Jinglin was still looking at her with a mocking gaze as if she was a mistress.","One day, she would let Mengyan marry Gu Zheng in Qiao Xi’s place and have the Xia family completely suppress the Yin family. Yin Lianxin would never be able to raise her head again."]},{"number":944,"title":"Chapter 944 - Forced To Confess","paragraphs":["Old Madam Xia glared fiercely at Qiao Xi. Suddenly, she clutched her chest and shouted, “Ouch! My heart hurts! President Gu, it’s fine if you’re unwilling to admit this marriage, but why are you slandering Mengyan for having another fiance? Aren’t you forcing Mengyan to her death?","“Mengyan has always treated you as her fiance since she was young, but for the sake of protecting Qiao Xi, you actually abandoned a woman who has such deep feelings for you. Can you bear to do this? If you don’t like her, you can just say so. Why do you have to insult her like this?","“Qiao Xi! You must have made President Gu say that. You stole Mengyan’s engagement and ruined her life. Now, you’re even going to bite back. You’re forcing her to her death. You’re really vicious!”","At this point, Old Madam Xia’s breathing suddenly stopped. Her face turned red as she fell weakly. Fortunately, Xia Cheng and Xia Ji hurriedly supported her.","Xia Ji immediately said nervously, “Mom! Don’t scare me! It’s all my fault for being unfilial. If I hadn’t insisted that Mengyan fulfill the engagement and insisted on seeking justice for my daughter, things wouldn’t have ended up like this. Now that Mengyan’s reputation is ruined and your health has collapsed... President Gu, we don’t want anything anymore. Let’s just forget about it!”","Hearing her father’s words, Xia Mengyan’s tears gushed out, and her eyes were filled with anxiety. “Grandma, I was wrong. I’ve let you down! We’ll go home now. Please be fine!”","Xia Mengyan looked up with tears in her eyes and announced to everyone, “Everyone, President Gu is telling the truth. I do have a fiance. It’s all my fault for what happened today. I shouldn’t have fought for what doesn’t belong to me.”","As she spoke, she looked at Qiao Xi and choked. “Xi Xi, I know you hate me. If you’re dissatisfied, target me. I don’t want to make things difficult for my grandmother. She’s old and can’t take any trouble. Just take it as though I... I’m begging you.”","Her voice trembled violently and was filled with sorrow. Tears fell from her cheeks, and her pitiful appearance made one’s heart ache.","Finally, someone could not stand it anymore and said indignantly, “Mrs. Gu is clearly using her power to suppress others! Looking at Miss Xia’s sad appearance, she’s really pitiful!”","“Previously, Mrs. Gu mocked Old Madam Xia for being a mistress, but that was decades ago. It has nothing to do with Miss Xia. Now, she made up the story that Miss Xia already has a fiance. Miss Xia is filial and can’t bear to see Old Madam Xia suffer. She can only admit to this. Mrs. Gu, you’re too much of a bully.”","Xia Mengyan lowered her head and revealed a proud smile, but she still pretended to be heartbroken when she looked up. “President Gu, Xi Xi, I’m sorry. I affected the banquet and your relationship as husband and wife. I admit that I coveted the position of Mrs. Gu and I intended to ruin your marriage. I do have a fiance. This is all my fault. I’ve let everyone down!”","She lowered her eyes as tears surged out. Her face was filled with grievances and coercion. It looked like Qiao Xi was using her power to force her to confess. As a result, Xia Mengyan could only endure the humiliation and admit it.","Xia Mengyan wiped her tears as a trace of sinisterness flashed past her eyes. She wanted to see how Qiao Xi would retort.","“Miss Xia, it’s really been hard on you. You spoke your mind in front of so many people!” Qiao Xi looked at Xia Mengyan with a smile. Her casual tone instantly caused everyone to be infuriated.","Things had already come to this. What right did she have to be so arrogant?","Xia Yunlou instantly cursed. “Qiao Xi! You bastard! How far have you pushed Mengyan? How can you say such things? Do you have a conscience?!”","Yin Lianxin glared at her coldly. Xia Yunlou’s heart trembled, but she still forcefully endured the fear in her heart and said, “Qiao Xi has been wandering outside since she was young. She’s naughty and mischievous. She’s clearly the one who stole Mengyan’s engagement and even slandered Mengyan for having a fiance. Now, she’s forcing Mengyan to confess to things she didn’t do. At this moment, she’s still making sarcastic remarks. Am I wrong to say that she has no conscience?","“Qiao Xi! Apologize to Mengyan immediately! You really haven’t changed! You stole someone else’s engagement, yet you’re still so arrogant. Mengyan’s fiance is President Gu. Stop talking nonsense!”","As soon as she finished speaking, Qiao Xi snapped her fingers, and the big screen suddenly flashed. She raised her eyebrows and asked, “Are you sure Xia Mengyan doesn’t have another fiance?”","Everyone was stunned for a moment before they abruptly looked up at the big screen. When they saw the contents, their faces suddenly turned pale. Xia Cheng’s expression darkened.","Impossible! How could Gu Zheng have found this evidence?"]},{"number":945,"title":"Chapter 945 - Stubborn","paragraphs":["Xia Ji shuddered and hurriedly rushed over to stop her. “Turn it off!”","“The Xia family has always said that Xia Mengyan’s fiance is Ah Zheng. I’m curious about who’s the groom on this marriage contract.”","The screen suddenly enlarged, and an old marriage contract appeared in front of everyone. The date was 20 years ago, and the two parties’ names were clearly written on the marriage contract.","Xia Cheng’s beard trembled slightly. At this moment, he had already lost his mind and rushed to the stage. “Turn it off! This is fake! Qiao Xi! You’re framing us!”","No matter what, Xia Cheng had lived for decades and had seen all kinds of things. He had long since stopped showing his emotions on his face. However, at this moment, he was shouting crazily without caring about his image. The more agitated he was, the more curious everyone was about the secret behind this marriage contract.","Old Madam Xia, who had collapsed on the chair, heard Xia Cheng’s roar and instantly stood up. At this moment, the Xia family was trying their best to cover the marriage contract, but the big screen was too high. Their efforts were useless. Everyone could still see it clearly.","Xia Cheng’s signature was clearly shown on the marriage contract, and on the other side, there was Xiao Lu’s signature.","Everyone was confused. Who was this person? Shouldn’t the signature for the groom be Miss Lu Qingyun’s signature? Previously, the Xia family said that this engagement was arranged by Xia Yunqiu and Lu Qingyun.","This marriage contract was extremely formal and made of gorgeous materials. It was enough to show that the Xia family valued this marriage contract very much. Xia Mengyan was engaged not long after she was born. It seemed that the two families were very close, but...","“Xiao Lu?”","“Have you heard of this name?”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows and said, “Does everyone think it’s very strange? Ah Zheng’s surname is Gu, and his mother’s surname is Lu. Why would someone with the surname Xiao appear on the marriage contract?”","Xia Ji’s face was livid. He was about to retort when Qiao Xi spoke first, “Mr. Xia, we spent money to hire the hacker named Mo Yuan to investigate this. If you doubt the authenticity of the marriage contract, we can meet in court. At that time, we’ll ask Mr. Mo Yuan to testify for us.”","Xia Ji was instantly speechless. Who would dare to question the hacker, Mo Yuan?","“The marriage contract was personally signed by you, Mr. Xia Ji. If you’re unconvinced, you can look for a professional to check the handwriting. Mr. Xia, do you have any questions?”","Looking at Qiao Xi’s smiling appearance, the members of the Xia family were fuming with anger. Xia Mengyan was still immersed in her joy just now. She originally thought that Qiao Xi would not be able to endure the curses of everyone and would have no choice but to give up her position as Mrs. Gu. However, the marriage contract from 20 years ago was actually exposed now.","At this moment, someone suddenly shouted, “Xiao Lu?","“I remember that there was indeed a Xiao family in Luo City in the past, but they went bankrupt a few years ago. After that, the head of the Xiao family left Luo City with his family. Could it be that the Xiao family in the marriage contract is them?”","“That’s indeed possible! This marriage contract was set 20 years ago, so Miss Xia has always said that she has a fiance. A few years ago, the Xiao family went bankrupt, so the Xia family didn’t acknowledge this marriage. However, the two families didn’t cancel the marriage contract, so the Xia family just pretended that Xia Mengyan and President Gu were engaged.”","Everyone looked at the Xia family with doubt. Their expressions were extremely ugly. Xia Cheng explained helplessly, “No! You’ve misunderstood. President Gu, this is just an old marriage contract. It might’ve been forged. Even if you really get someone to appraise it, with your current power and wealth, you can definitely skew things so that the results would work in your favor.”","Qiao Xi had a helpless expression. The Xia family was really stubborn. They were actually still quibbling at a time like this. However, the truth was right in front of them, so quibbling was useless.","She snorted. “Old Master Xia, you’re really eloquent. You’re right. The marriage contract might be fake, but...”","With that, she looked at Xia Mengyan coldly, then at Xia Cheng meaningfully. She snapped her fingers again. The big screen flashed, and a gorgeous living room appeared. A few people were sitting around the table.","Everyone took a closer look. Two of the people on the screen were Xia Cheng and Old Madam Xia.","Qiao Xi lazily leaned against the chair, and her tone suddenly became icy-cold. “You can say that the marriage contract is fake, but the video can’t be faked!”","Xia Cheng looked at the scene on the big screen in a daze. He felt as if he had fallen into an ice cave. He suddenly thought of the past that had been sealed for many years. This matter could not be leaked!","Old Madam Xia’s face was pale as she shouted in a panic, “Xia Cheng! Quick... Quick, stop them!”","However, Qiao Xi paid no attention to them at all. With a light wave of her hand, many bodyguards rushed over to stop the Xia family."]},{"number":946,"title":"Chapter 946 - 300 Million","paragraphs":["“Since you’re sure that the marriage contract is fake, why are you so afraid of letting us play the video? How do you know what I’m going to play?”","Qiao Xi curled her lips coldly and ordered, “Song Shijing.”","Song Shijing nodded, and the screen moved immediately. In the video, Xia Cheng and his wife said in a panic, “Friend, I’m really in trouble this time. Otherwise, I wouldn’t have come to look for you. You have to help me, or the Xia family will go bankrupt!”","Mr. Xiao nodded. “Calm down. We’ve been friends for so many years. Of course, I’ll help you. The Xia family’s crisis this time is because the capital chain has been broken. I can lend the Xia family 300 million yuan in assets first. You don’t have to rush to return it.”","300 million? That was 20 years ago. 300 million was enough to buy a company. It was enough to prove how rich the Xiao family was.","When Xia Cheng heard this, he instantly beamed. “Oh! Thank you, my friend. Other than that, I have something else to discuss with you. Previously, didn’t our two families agree on forming a marriage alliance? Now, look...”","Everyone watching the video knew very well that Xia Cheng took the initiative to propose a marriage alliance because he hoped that the Xiao family would be on the same page as them. If the Xia family encountered trouble again, the Xiao family would not be able to refuse to help them.","Xiao Lu hesitated for a moment, but in the end, he nodded. “It’s indeed a good thing for our two families to be united through marriage. Which child of mine have you taken a liking to?”","Xia Cheng said, “My granddaughter is already five years old. I heard that your eldest grandson is six years old. The two children are about the same age. Why don’t we set a marriage contract for the two of them?”","Xiao Lu chuckled and said, “Of course. Let’s set the engagement first and let the two children interact more. If they’re in love with each other when they reach adulthood, it’ll naturally be a happy ending. If they don’t like each other, we don’t have to force it. What’s your granddaughter’s name?”","Xia Cheng said, “My granddaughter is called Xia Mengyan.”","As soon as he finished speaking, the video ended. Everyone was shocked. They did not expect Xia Mengyan to really have another fiance. Moreover, when they were engaged, Mr. Xiao Lu lent the Xia family 300 million yuan. Not only was there a marriage contract as evidence, but there was also a video. The Xia family could not deny it at all.","The color on Xia Mengyan’s face gradually disappeared. She closed her eyes and did not dare to look at the scene on the screen. Her heart ached, and she was about to faint. However, she could only grit her teeth and endure it. She resisted losing her composure in front of everyone.","Everyone said indignantly, “When the Xia family went bankrupt, only the Xiao family was willing to fork out money. Half of the Xia family’s current wealth and power is thanks to the Xiao family. They should be grateful for the rest of their lives. Why is it that now that the Xiao family has gone bankrupt, this marriage doesn’t matter anymore?”","“This marriage contract was initiated by Xia Cheng. Back then, when he saw that the Xiao family was rich, he threw himself at them. Now that the Xiao family is bankrupt, he wants to marry his granddaughter to President Gu. He insists that she’s engaged to President Gu. The Xia family is really shameless!”","“Back then, Xia Cheng married into the Yin family and relied on the Yin family’s power to strengthen the Xia family. When he became successful, he cheated on Old Madam Xia. None of the people in this family are good. Unfortunately, Mr. Xiao generously helped a group of ingrates. When the Xiao family was in trouble, the Xia family refused to help.”","Xia Mengyan gritted her teeth. She did not expect Qiao Xi to be able to find out what had happened 20 years ago. She was a socialite in Luo City and an internationally renowned perfumer. She was the perfect goddess in everyone’s hearts. If news of this got out, her image would be completely ruined.","No, no!","Xia Cheng’s mind buzzed as everyone cursed and mocked him. The moment he looked up, he saw Yin Lianxin’s disdainful expression again. He clenched his fists tightly and suppressed the anger in his heart. He sighed helplessly. “It’s all my fault!”","Everyone looked at him in confusion, not knowing what other lies he would come up with.","Xia Mengyan seemed to know what her grandfather meant and hurriedly walked to his side. She held his hand, her eyes filled with sorrow. “Grandpa.”","Now that the matter was exposed, he could not deny it. Xia Cheng could only try his best to protect his granddaughter. After all, Mengyan had a lot of influence overseas and had millions of fans. She also had a studio under her name. Her future was limitless.","Xia Mengyan was the hope of the Xia family. As long as he could protect her reputation, the Xia family would still have a chance to make a comeback. He suddenly looked up and took a deep breath. “That’s right. Back then, I did form a marriage contract with the Xiao family, but Mengyan didn’t know about it!”"]},{"number":947,"title":"Chapter 947 - No Apology","paragraphs":["“Back then, after the two families set the engagement, Mengyan was still too young. I didn’t tell her and only wanted her to interact with Young Master Xiao. However, the two of them weren’t suitable for each other and were always arguing, so I let them be friends. Later on, Mengyan heard from someone that she had a marriage contract, but she never knew who the other party was. She just wanted to be loyal to her fiance.","“I knew that Yunqiu had made an engagement for her daughter to the Gu family. I was greedy and wanted to marry my granddaughter to President Gu, so I told Mengyan that her fiance was President Gu. This is all my fault. Mengyan was deceived by me from the beginning!”","Xia Cheng said with a look of sorrow, and the entire venue instantly fell silent. Could it be that this matter really had nothing to do with Xia Mengyan? Back then, when the two families were engaged, Xia Mengyan was just an ignorant child. She did not know about the engagement, and her grandparents did not tell her. In order to cling to President Gu, it was possible that they deliberately deceived Xia Mengyan.","At this moment, Xia Mengyan lowered her head, her heart filled with resentment. If it were not for Qiao Xi, she would not have been suspected by everyone. Fortunately, her grandfather had stopped everything for her, so she could not help but heave a sigh of relief.","Her eyes were red with shock as she shook her head in disbelief. Her lips were pale and trembling slightly. “Grandpa... This is impossible. Why did you lie to me?!”","Xia Cheng looked regretful. “Mengyan, it’s my fault. At that time, your Aunt Yunqiu was close to Eldest Miss Lu. I heard her mention this marriage. Now that President Gu is powerful, you’ll definitely have a good life if you marry him. That’s why I was muddle-headed and pretended that you were engaged to President Gu.”","Xia Mengyan widened her eyes and took a few steps back. She cried in sorrow. “I’m not President Gu’s fiancee? I wronged Xi Xi! I was wrong, I was really wrong!”","Her face was filled with tears, and everyone’s heart could not help but ache. “Miss Xia, you were also deceived by Old Master Xia. This has nothing to do with you!”","“Old Master Xia is really muddle-headed. In order to curry favor with the rich and powerful, he actually did such a thing. Miss Xia’s reputation has been ruined by him!”","Xia Mengyan looked up with a guilty expression, her tears blurring her vision. “Xi Xi, I’ve let you down. I didn’t expect everything to be a scam. I misunderstood you before. Can you forgive me?”","Everyone hurriedly tried to persuade her. “Mrs. Gu, you’ve indeed been wronged in this matter, but Miss Xia is innocent. Please forgive her!”","Qiao Xi had an indifferent expression as if she did not hear everyone.","The face of the socialite next to Xia Mengyan instantly darkened as she muttered unhappily, “Why is she still pretending?! With President Gu protecting her, she didn’t suffer at all. Now that she knows that Miss Xia has been deceived, she’s still unwilling to forgive her. How petty!”","As soon as she finished speaking, Yin Jinglin immediately retorted, “If apologizing is useful, why do we still need the police? If I kill someone and apologize, do I not have to go to jail, then? It’s Xia Mengyan’s business if she’s willing to apologize, but it’s Xi Xi’s right not to forgive her!”","Then, Yin Jinglin’s mocking gaze landed on Xia Mengyan again. “You’re innocent, huh?! First, you hired a group of fake commenters to spread the news of your engagement with Gu Zheng online. Then, you got your fans to stand up for you and scold Xi Xi. Now that the matter has been exposed, you’re washing your hands clean of it and even colluding with your friend to force Xi Xi to forgive you. Your actions have already seriously affected Xi Xi’s life. Do you think that by apologizing, you can let the matter rest?","“Logically speaking, Miss Xia, you’re someone who has received higher education. Why are you still so unreasonable? Don’t tell me you learned it from your shrewish and vicious grandmother?”","Yin Jinglin’s mockery made Xia Mengyan’s face turn pale. She glared at Yin Jinglin with resentment but could not do anything to him.","After being mocked, the socialite was instantly infuriated. “Mengyan is innocent! Mrs. Gu didn’t lose anything, so why can’t she forgive Mengyan?! It’s also embarrassing for Mrs. Gu to be so calculative! She needs to be aware of her identity!”","Yin Jinglin sneered. “Identity? Since you know Xi Xi’s identity, you should have basic respect for her! Where did you come from? Who are you to teach the daughter of our Yin family a lesson?”","The socialite was so angry that her face turned red. Due to the Yin family’s power, she did not dare to say anything and could only suppress her anger.","At this moment, Xia Mengyan hurriedly stood up. “Xi Xi, it’s fine if you don’t forgive me, but don’t make things difficult for my friend. If you’re dissatisfied, direct everything to me!”"]},{"number":948,"title":"Chapter 948 - Convinced By Her Shameless","paragraphs":["Seeing that Xia Mengyan was so loyal, the socialite was touched. She felt that she had not stood up for Xia Mengyan for nothing.","Yin Jinglin really could not stand Xia Mengyan’s pretense. He sneered and said, “Miss Xia, you’re so capable! You managed to win people’s hearts with just a few words and make them willingly work for you. But if it weren’t for you, would she have offended the Yin family?”","The socialite was stunned for a moment as if she had realized something. Xia Mengyan’s expression was extremely ugly. “I... I didn’t mean that. I just don’t want my friend to suffer with me. Xi Xi, you—”","“Miss Xia,” Qiao Xi said casually, “You should be clearly aware now that I was the only victim from the beginning until the end. After the Xia family released the news, the internet was filled with curses aimed at me, which caused a serious impact on my life. Hence, only I have the right to criticize you. You have no right to pick on my mistakes.”","“Xi Xi, I’m really sorry. I’ve always treated you as my cousin. I...” Xia Mengyan lowered her eyes and sobbed weakly. Tears fell one by one, splashing onto the floor.","She spoke in tears as if she was the most aggrieved person in the world. She wanted to make it seem that everything she did was because she was deceived. She could not be blamed for this. She was very pitiful, so she was also a victim. If Qiao Xi continued to be unreasonable and make things difficult for her, then Qiao Xi would have no right to be Mrs. Gu.","Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully. “Miss Xia, if you really didn’t know, I can naturally forgive you, but you clearly knew about it a long time ago.”","Her voice was very calm. “In order to protect his granddaughter, Old Master Xia is willing to take on everything himself. It’s really touching.”","As soon as these words were spoken, Xia Cheng’s expression changed and Xia Mengyan’s entire body trembled. When Xia Cheng decided to take all the blame for Xia Mengyan, he felt that even if Qiao Xi was dissatisfied, she could not do anything to him as she was a junior. However, if Mengyan was implicated, not only would her reputation be ruined, but Qiao Xi would also not let her off.","At this moment, everyone finally realized something. Qiao Xi was also Xia Cheng’s granddaughter, but he did not hesitate to ruin his granddaughter’s marriage for Xia Mengyan.","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up slightly. “Miss Xia, I forgot to tell you that I invited you to the banquet today for a reason. After all, you call me ‘Cousin’. I still have to save you some dignity. As long as you had admitted your crimes, I wouldn’t publicize the evidence I have on hand. However, I don’t think you have the slightest intention of repenting. You’re still shameless enough to say that you’re innocent and even bite me back. I’m really convinced by your shameless spirit!”","The big screen flashed again. Xia Mengyan suddenly looked up, and her body gradually stiffened. The blood in her body seemed to have stopped flowing. A strong sense of fear swept through her entire body. At this moment, all her rationality and disguise disappeared. She shouted at the top of her voice, “No!”","The scene changed. Xiao Lu was seen dragging his tired and old body to the door with Young Master Xiao. The two of them waited quietly at the entrance of the Xia family’s house. All these years, because of problems in the Xiao family’s company, their wealth had been deteriorating year by year. Now that they were on the verge of bankruptcy, their capital chain was broken, just like the Xia family 20 years ago.","Back then, when the Xia family was in danger, Xiao Lu did not hesitate to lend 300 million to the Xia family. At that time, 300 million was a huge sum of money and enough to support the Xia family through the crisis. Now that Xiao Lu had come to visit, he only hoped that the Xia family could lend them 300 million like before as a form of repayment for their kindness back then. Even if 300 million was not enough, he would not ask for a single cent more. It was just that he did not expect Xia Cheng to actually reject them.","Xia Cheng stood at the door and looked at the old Xiao Lu coldly. He waved at the butler impatiently. “Chase them away! Don’t let them dirty the Xia family’s door!”","Xiao Lu looked up in disbelief. He did not expect Xia Cheng to be so heartless. He said in a trembling voice, “Friend, about the 300 million I borrowed you the last time, can you...”","“What 300 million? Do you have evidence? What can you do even if I lent you 300 million? The Xiao family is hopeless! I advise you to leave Luo City quickly and not shamelessly come to the Xia family to ask for money! Otherwise, don’t blame me for being nasty!”","Old Madam Xia was not an easy person to deal with either. Her mouth was filled with ridicule and mockery. Xiao Lu lowered his head and clenched his fists. He said unwillingly, “Xia Cheng, when the Xia family was on the verge of bankruptcy, I was the one who lent the Xia family 300 million. All these years, I’ve never asked for the sum of money back. But now that the Xiao family is in trouble, are you going to ignore us?”"]},{"number":949,"title":"Chapter 949 - Repaying Kindness With Hatred","paragraphs":["Xia Cheng snorted. “That’s not borrowing! You’re the one who invested 300 million. Moreover, the Xiao family has also taken advantage of the Xia family’s power all these years. It’s already enough to cover that 300 million. Now, you’re here asking me for money? Why should I give it to you? What can your Xiao family do with that money?”","Xiao Lu abruptly looked up at Xia Cheng in disbelief. His fingers trembled violently. “You...”","Young Master Xiao’s expression darkened. “Grandpa, forget it. They don’t want to help us at all. It’s useless no matter how much we beg them. Just treat that 300 million as the money we spent on feeding the dogs! Our two families won’t see each other anymore!”","Xia Cheng did not care about Young Master Xiao’s mockery at all. “Alright! We’ll pretend not to know each other and never contact each other again! Your Xiao family is no longer worthy of our Xia family. Please leave!”","Xiao Lu looked at his grandson beside him and suddenly recalled something. He shouted indignantly, “Xia Cheng, don’t forget that our two families are still bound by a marriage contract!”","Actually, Xiao Lu knew that his grandson had always liked Miss Xia. Miss Xia also knew about the engagement between the two families. The two of them had always gotten along very well. Their families had only been waiting to hold a wedding for the two of them when they became adults. However, now that the Xia family and the Xiao family had cut ties, what should they do about the marriage contract?","Unexpectedly, as soon as these words were spoken, Xia Cheng laughed arrogantly. He laughed at Xiao Lu for being too naive. Since the two families had already gotten to this point, how could the engagement still stand?","At this moment, the 18-year-old Xia Mengyan slowly walked out of the villa. She was wearing a long white dress, looking pure, cute, obedient, and gentle. However, her eyes were filled with disgust. She said unhappily, “Young Master Xiao, now that the Xiao family has already gone bankrupt, do you think you’re worthy of me? Let’s part on good terms. Don’t make things too awkward!","“The engagement was set because of the Xiao family’s sponsorship of the Xia family. Now that the Xiao family is no longer of any value to the Xia family, the engagement is naturally canceled. Moreover, the engagement isn’t legally binding. If I don’t want to marry you, who can force me?”","As soon as Xia Mengyan finished speaking, the video ended. Everyone looked at Xia Mengyan. With the video as evidence, it was enough to prove that Xia Mengyan had long known about her engagement with Young Master Xiao.","Before everyone could denounce her, the image on the big screen flashed and showed a school. Young Master Xiao was angry and went to the school to argue with Xia Mengyan. At that time, Xia Mengyan was still in high school, but she had many followers. Without her saying anything, many people stood up for her.","“Xia Mengyan, we’re engaged! You once said that you would marry me when you grew up. Are you denying it now?”","Xia Mengyan shed tears aggrievedly. “That was a joke when I was young. My elders asked me to say it. I didn’t know what marriage meant at all. After I grew up, I’ve already expressed my feelings to you. Young Master Xiao, why are you forcing me?”","“Nonsense! Your Xia family accepted the Xiao family’s betrothal gifts long ago, which means that you’ve already agreed to this marriage. Moreover, I’ve given you a lot of jewelry and clothes. If you didn’t like me, why did you accept those things?”","Xia Mengyan looked at Young Master Xiao’s agitated appearance and took a step back in horror. Her eyes were filled with innocence. As long as she shed a tear, her followers would rush over crazily and curse at Young Master Xiao. “Why don’t you take a look at yourself in the mirror? Are you worthy of marrying Mengyan? If it weren’t for the fact that your Xiao family is rich, Mengyan wouldn’t even care about you! It’s your honor that Mengyan was willing to accept your gifts!”","“The Xiao family failed to live up to expectations and ended up going bankrupt, but you still have the cheek to look for trouble with Mengyan?”","While everyone was cursing Young Master Xiao, Xia Mengyan hid behind and cried. She pretended to wipe her tears. Her cries angered her followers. They beat Young Master Xiao up fiercely, but Xia Mengyan just watched Young Master Xiao get beaten up silently.","At that time, there were rumors in the school that Young Master Xiao was pestering Xia Mengyan and was beaten up. However, no one knew about the Xiao family’s kindness to the Xia family, nor did anyone know that Xia Cheng was the one who took the initiative to ask for the marriage contract back then. However, the entire Xia family was not grateful to their former benefactor at all. Instead, they repaid kindness with ingratitude, ruining Young Master Xiao’s reputation and making him suffer physical pain.","The banquet hall was silent, and everyone’s eyes were gradually filled with horror. Who would believe that the pure and kind-hearted Xia Mengyan had a demon living in her heart?"]},{"number":950,"title":"Chapter 950 - They Were Furious","paragraphs":["She was the legendary daughter of the Xia family, a socialite in Luo City, and a perfumer who was praised by everyone. However, it turned out that she was a vicious and scheming woman.","Back then, in order to get rid of her fiance in the Xiao family, she fabricated a lie and used public opinion to force the Xiao family into leaving their hometown. Her engagement with the Xiao family had not been canceled, but she wanted to seduce President Gu and ruin her cousin’s marriage. The Xia family still had the cheek to say that Xia Mengyan did not know?","After a moment of silence, Qiao Xi slowly said, “Miss Xia, I gave you a chance to admit your mistake, but you didn’t cherish it! I had no choice but to show some evidence to everyone.”","Xia Mengyan’s face was pale, and her body was stiff. Her mind was a mess, and her vision began to blur. Her ears buzzed, and she felt like she was about to die.","Even the Xia family did not know the existence of this video. Where did Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi get these things?","“Xia Cheng... Let’s go! Let’s go!”","Old Madam Xia was flustered, and her eyes were filled with horror. Ever since she got together with Xia Cheng, she had been suppressed by Yin Lianxin. Her family background, ability, and appearance were all inferior to Yin Lianxin’s. Her only hope was to rely on her granddaughter to make a name for herself and surpass the descendants of the Yin family. However, now that her granddaughter’s reputation was ruined, it was impossible for her to make a comeback.","Xia Cheng was so embarrassed in front of Yin Lianxin that his entire body was trembling. Faced with everyone’s questions and disdain, he had no ability to retort.","Yin Jinglin laughed wantonly. “Oh my! The Xia family doesn’t even blush when they lie! If Mo Yuan hadn’t released the evidence, Xi Xi would’ve suffered!”","“Miss Xia, you said that you’ve never thought of ruining Xi Xi and President Gu’s marriage. Then why did your Xia family do so much behind the scenes? Did you think you could hide your filthy intentions from everyone?”","Xia Mengyan’s heart seemed to be pinched tightly by someone. The sharp pain made her almost faint. With her last bit of rationality, she could only ignore the disdainful gazes around her and the humiliation of the crowd. She gritted her teeth and retorted, “Nonsense! This is all a misunderstanding. I never wanted to ruin their marriage!”","Qiao Xi glanced at her coldly, took a document from Song Shijing’s hand, and threw it in front of Xia Mengyan. “Miss Xia, you don’t have to quibble. This is evidence of the Xia family hiring people to spread rumors online. The money was all transferred from your account, and there’s also a recording. Miss Xia, do you want to hear it?”","“Ah! Take it away! Take it away!”","Hearing Qiao Xi’s words, Xia Mengyan shouted at the top of her voice. She no longer looked pitiful, and her face was filled with malevolence. She suddenly pounced over and tore the documents on the floor into pieces. “These are all fake! I didn’t do it!”","“Since you didn’t do it, why are you in a rush to destroy the evidence, Miss Xia?”","In everyone’s impression, Xia Mengyan had always been gentle and kind. Now, she had suddenly become a scheming b*tch in everyone’s hearts. She deliberately approached Gu Zheng and spread rumors to slander Qiao Xi. Everyone found it really difficult to accept.","Xia Cheng’s heart ached when he saw Xia Mengyan’s terrified and helpless appearance. He roared angrily at Qiao Xi. “Qiao Xi! Have you gone mad?!”","“Who exactly is the crazy one here?” Yin Lianxin’s dignified voice sounded. Her eyes were filled with coldness and disdain. She exuded the aura of a queen, and every word seemed to hit the hearts of the Xia family.","“Your Xia family deceived everyone and slandered Xi Xi. Now, you’re saying that Xi Xi has gone mad? I think you’re seriously ill! Are you angry from embarrassment now that the matter has been exposed?” Yin Lianxin mocked, making Xia Cheng so angry that his face turned red.","Yin Jinglin immediately echoed, “It’s not strange for the Xia family to do such things. Old Madam Xia was a mistress back then. Now, she even taught her granddaughter to be a mistress. Does your family have the genes to be a mistress? Do you think every man out there is a scumbag who will be seduced by a mistress?”","Xia Mengyan’s body went soft as she gritted her teeth. She was not a mistress. She and Gu Zheng were engaged. She was just taking back what belonged to her! How could she be a mistress?","She was indeed engaged to Young Master Xiao, but it had already been more than 10 years. That piece of trash from the Xiao family was not worthy of her at all. What was wrong with her pursuing a better man?! Why couldn’t Qiao Xi give Gu Zheng to her? Why did she have to embarrass her in front of everyone?"]},{"number":951,"title":"Chapter 951 - It’s All Your Fault For Being Too Handsome","paragraphs":["Xia Mengyan looked up in horror. She was surrounded by gazes filled with disgust. They were like a group of demons baring their fangs and brandishing their claws. They were about to tear her apart and eat her up. There was a dull pain in her temples, and her head felt like it was about to explode. Her eyes were blurred by tears, and the smell of blood surged from her throat.","She raised her eyes and met Qiao Xi’s eyes. Qiao Xi’s expression was indifferent, and her stunning face was expressionless. She was so beautiful that it made others jealous. At this moment, Xia Mengyan was in a sorry state. Sweat was ceaselessly dripping from her forehead, and the makeup on her face was already ruined.","Xia Mengyan’s body trembled violently, and she could not say a word. After a long time, she rushed out crazily, leaving everyone looking at each other.","Qiao Xi’s gloomy gaze landed on Xia Yunlou, who was also glaring fiercely at her. “Qiao Xi, what have you done?!”","“Madam Xia, are we close? This is Gu Corporation’s banquet. Please leave,” Qiao Xi said without raising her head. She did not want to pay attention to Xia Yunlou at all.","Xia Yunlou was angered to the point her face flushed red as if she had been slapped in the face. Her face burned with pain as she gritted her teeth. “Qiao Xi, even if I did something wrong in the past, I’m still your mother... Why do you treat me like an enemy?!”","“Song Shijing,” Gu Zheng ordered. “Young Madam has already given the order. Why is there still a commotion here? Hurry up and chase Madam Xia out.”","Xia Yunlou’s expression changed. Gu Zheng and his wife echoed each other and wanted to chase her out, but she was Qiao Xi’s biological mother!","“You... You! The Xia family is also your home. How can you do this to us? You’re unfilial!”","Qiao Xi looked at her coldly with no emotion in her eyes. Then, Song Shijing chased the Xia family out with a group of bodyguards. They knew very well that the people who came to attend Gu Corporation’s banquet were all famous in high society. After seeing the Xia family being chased out of the banquet, who would dare to interact with the Xia family in the future?","When Xia Yunlou was dragged out, she was still shouting. After a long time, her voice disappeared from the banquet hall.","As the saying went, everyone would kick a man when he was down. After the news of Xia Mengyan’s engagement was exposed, some of her former high school mates came forward to testify. Young Master Xiao also came forward to confirm the rumors.","Xia Mengyan’s fans were instantly stunned. The goddess they admired was actually a scheming b*tch? Moreover, Xia Mengyan’s fiance was not Gu Zheng at all but someone else. If it were not for Gu Zheng, wouldn’t they have continued to curse Mrs. Gu for a long time?","At this moment, in the Xia family’s villa, Xia Mengyan had just entered when her phone rang violently. Countless messages swarmed her phone. Her account was filled with private messages: [You liar! You’re not Gu Zheng’s fiancee at all!]","[You scheming b*tch. You only know how to use your fans to fight for you. You let everyone scold Mrs. Gu for you while you hid behind and pretended to be a good person. You’re really capable, huh?!]","[You can learn if you’re uneducated, and you can get plastic surgery if you’re ugly, but there’s really no cure for your evil heart.]","Xia Mengyan hurriedly put down her phone and almost stopped breathing. She panted heavily and collapsed on the sofa. She really could not figure out how Gu Zheng had so much evidence. Was the hacker Mo Yuan really so powerful?","Following that, Xia Mengyan’s contracts were all terminated. She suffered heavy losses, but she could only grit her teeth and swallow them. After thinking for a long time, she sent a message:","[I’m very sorry that my private matter has taken up public attention. I didn’t expect things to develop to this point. First of all, I have to apologize to Xi Xi because the matter of a marriage contract has affected her life and ruined our relationship. However, all of this is just a misunderstanding.","[In order to make up for my mistake, I’ve decided to donate five million yuan in Xi Xi’s name. From now on, I’ll close my account and focus on making new perfumes. I hope everyone can forgive me and give me a chance to change.]","After the news was released, Xia Mengyan closed her account. Most people naturally did not buy her apology, but there were a few brainless fans who still believed her words and begged her to come back in the comments section.","...","Longwan Residential.","Qiao Xi was eating fruits comfortably when she saw the news online. She threw her phone to the side and pretended to be fierce as she looked at Gu Zheng. “It’s all your fault!”","Gu Zheng looked up with an innocent expression and blinked his deep eyes.","Qiao Xi smiled and said, “It’s all your fault for being too handsome. Many women like you and want to look for trouble with me. There are already Yao Mengqing and Xia Mengyan. How many more women will be seduced by you?!”"]},{"number":952,"title":"Chapter 952 - Parting, Missing","paragraphs":["“Yes, it’s my fault.” Gu Zheng looked at her affectionately, then said hesitantly, “I’m going to F Nation tomorrow morning. I might be back in a week.”","Qiao Xi’s face sank. “Tomorrow morning? Is it an urgent matter?”","Under normal circumstances, if Gu Zheng wanted to go on a business trip, he would arrange it a few days in advance. However, he did not have the time to prepare this time. It was already evening, yet he suddenly said that he was going on a business trip early in the morning. It was really strange.","Gu Zheng did not answer her question directly and changed the topic. “Is there anything you want me to bring back?”","Qiao Xi thought about it seriously. There was a mountain of jewelry and makeup in her room, and her clothes filled the entire cloakroom. She shook her head. “No, I don’t lack anything.”","“Mrs. Gu, the project I’m going to discuss this time is a big order worth 800 million. I’m earning so much money for you to spend, but you don’t want anything?”","Seeing that Qiao Xi was frowning and thinking seriously, Gu Zheng smiled helplessly. “I won’t make things difficult for you anymore. Since I want to give you a gift, I’ll choose it myself. Coincidentally, F Nation is holding a large-scale auction. I’ve looked at the brochure and there’s a set of good jewelry that’ll be auctioned.”","Qiao Xi said in a low voice, “I can’t even wear all the jewelry in my room, yet you still want to give me jewelry. You buy me many gifts every time you go on a business trip. This makes me feel very pressured!”","Hearing Qiao Xi’s words, Gu Zheng could not help but laugh. His deep eyes were filled with affection as he stroked her cheek and said softly, “I want to give you many gifts. Even if you want the stars in the sky, I’ll think of a way to pluck them for you.”","Qiao Xi instantly blushed. She was too embarrassed and lowered her head. She wanted to rush upstairs to escape. “Um... It’s getting late. I’ll help you pack your luggage.”","As he watched Qiao Xi leave in a hurry, Gu Zheng’s laughter was clear and extremely pleasant.","...","The next morning.","Gu Zheng woke up early. Qiao Xi’s eyes were still closed when she heard him gently get up. His footsteps were slow as he was afraid of waking her up. She originally wanted to wait for Gu Zheng to pack his things and personally send him out, but she could not resist the strong sleepiness and fell asleep.","When Qiao Xi opened her eyes, it was already eight o’clock. She pouted angrily. She had promised to get up and send him off, but she still missed the timing. They would not see each other for many days.","She stuck her head out and saw a piece of paper on the bedside table. The handwriting on it was flamboyant: [Mrs. Gu, take care of yourself when I’m not around. Call me if you need anything.]","Qiao Xi smiled happily. This man looked cold, but he always doted on her in every way like she was a child.","Back then, when she married Gu Zheng, it was just an impulsive decision. However, she did not know when it started, but her heart was gradually occupied by him. She could not tolerate anyone else anymore. When she realized it, she had already fallen deeply in love with Gu Zheng and could not extricate herself.","Qiao Xi lowered her eyes and looked at the empty bed. She could not help but feel a little bitter. They had only been separated for a morning, yet she had already begun to miss Gu Zheng crazily. In the past, she did not feel much when Gu Zheng was by her side all day. Now, she finally knew how difficult it was to be apart from him.","She leaned against the bed and felt weak all over. Her heart was filled with sorrow when her phone suddenly rang. It was a call from Gu Zheng.","Qiao Xi instantly beamed with joy. Gu Zheng really understood her thoughts too well. He knew that she missed him, so he hurriedly called her as soon as he had time. She hurriedly picked up the phone and said in a delicate voice, “Ah Zheng, why are you calling me? Shouldn’t you be on the plane at this time? When I think about being separated from you for so long, I...”","“Mrs. Gu, use your little head to think carefully. Of course, I haven’t gotten on the plane yet because the plane is late.” Gu Zheng’s voice carried a trace of disdain.","The longing in Qiao Xi’s heart instantly vanished. This bastard didn’t even know how to say something nice when he called! If she had known earlier, she wouldn’t have picked up the call.","Seeing that she was silent, Gu Zheng’s tone softened. “Xi Xi, I have to go.”","His voice was low and magnetic, filled with endless love. “Baby, be good and wait for me to come back!”","The dissatisfaction in Qiao Xi’s heart instantly vanished. She smiled obsessively. Gu Zheng’s voice was really pleasant to listen to. It was too charming!","After hanging up, Qiao Xi’s eyes were filled with loneliness. She really could not control her longing! ‘Ah Zheng! Ah Zheng, how can I live without you?!’"]},{"number":953,"title":"Chapter 953 - Someone Is Waiting For Him In Li City","paragraphs":["In the evening, Gu Zheng’s plane finally landed. The first thing he did after getting off the plane was to video call Qiao Xi. Qiao Xi could not wait to pick up the call. His dissatisfied voice came from the other end. “Mrs. Gu, I heard that you haven’t had dinner tonight. Why aren’t you obedient? The butler said that you didn’t eat much at noon either. It’s already past seven, yet you still haven’t had dinner. You’re fooling around again!”","Qiao Xi frowned. This man was already far away in another country, yet he was still so nosy.","Looking at Qiao Xi’s aggrieved expression, Gu Zheng could not help but smile. His tone was gentle as he said, “Xi Xi, when I think about how I won’t be able to see you for so many days, I feel like a piece of my heart is missing.”","Qiao Xi was instantly stunned. She widened her eyes and looked at Gu Zheng. Her cheeks gradually turned red, and so did her ears. Gu Zheng was dressed simply, and his face was filled with gentleness. His deep eyes were like the stars in the sea, reflecting her image.","Just then, the voices of Song Shijing and another man’s voice sounded. The two of them seemed to be discussing a collaboration. Gu Zheng ignored them. His gaze was still on the screen as he looked at her affectionately. “Xi Xi, after I’m done here, I’ll rush back as soon as possible. You have to eat and sleep well before then. Don’t be willful.”","With that, Gu Zheng hung up the call. There was still a smile on the corners of his mouth, which added some vibrancy to his already handsome face. Zheng Jie, the business partner, smiled obsequiously. “President Gu, you’re new here, so you probably haven’t experienced the local customs here. Let’s not talk about the collaboration today. I’ll get Yanyan to bring you around to have fun. How about it?”","As soon as he finished speaking, an enchanting woman in a tight dress came forward. She had a voluptuous figure and bent down slightly to seduce Gu Zheng.","Gu Zheng’s eyes were cold, and his gentle expression suddenly turned cold. He refused without hesitation. “No.”","Zheng Jie smirked wretchedly. He thought that Gu Zheng was afraid of causing trouble and continued to persuade him. “President Gu, this is F Nation. Who will know what happens here? Don’t worry, I’ll keep it a secret for you. Moreover, Yanyan is a sensible person. She definitely won’t pester you afterward.”","Gu Zheng’s gaze became colder and colder. There was a trace of anger in his eyes, scaring Zheng Jie so much that his entire body trembled. He stammered, “President Gu... This...”","“Hand the contract to my assistant. We’ll have a meeting later,” Gu Zheng ordered coldly before turning to leave.","Zheng Jie looked at Gu Zheng’s departing figure in surprise. He did not expect that Gu Zheng really only cared about work as the rumors said. He did not have time to eat, drink, or play at all. Knowing that Gu Zheng had just gotten off the plane, he specially arranged for Yanyan to serve him. He wanted Gu Zheng to relax, but who knew that he was the one who was unaware?","Song Shiyu and Song Shijing knew very well that the president was in such a rush to work because there was someone waiting for him in Li City. Hence, the president could not wait to finish his work even if it meant sacrificing sleep. The sooner he finished his work, the sooner he could see Young Madam.","...","Four days later.","Qiao Xi lay on the bed in boredom, her mind filled with Gu Zheng. She wondered when Gu Zheng would come back. Longwan Residential was quiet. Just as she was about to sleep, her phone suddenly rang.","As soon as she saw Gu Zheng’s name on the caller ID, Qiao Xi quickly picked up. The man’s low and gentle voice came from the other end. “Xi Xi, do you know where I am?”","Ah! This voice was so gentle!","Qiao Xi smiled like a love-struck fool and replied sweetly, “You should be resting in the hotel since it’s so late at night.”","“No.”","Gu Zheng seemed to like guessing riddles with her and waited for her answer very patiently. After thinking for a moment, Qiao Xi asked, “Are you discussing a collaboration outside? You suddenly missed me, so you called.”","“Nope.”","Qiao Xi listened to the sounds on the other end of the phone. It seemed to be very quiet. Where else could he be?","After a moment of silence, Gu Zheng chuckled. “Actually, I’m buying a gift for you. You’ll definitely like this gift.”","Qiao Xi was stunned for a moment. Was Gu Zheng in a mall? What kind of mall would be open in the middle of the night? However, she was very curious about what gift Gu Zheng was buying. She said anxiously, “Then take a photo for me.”","Gu Zheng’s laughter was very hearty. Even though she could not see his face, she knew that his eyes were glowing at this moment. The corners of his mouth were also curled up gently.","“Don’t be anxious. The gift will be here soon.”","“Huh?” Qiao Xi’s face was filled with surprise. “Don’t tell me you mailed the gift back?”"]},{"number":954,"title":"Chapter 954 - I’m Mrs. Gu’s Gift","paragraphs":["Gu Zheng hesitated for a moment, then replied meaningfully.","Qiao Xi was instantly dumbstruck. In any case, Gu Zheng was about to come back soon, so he could just bring the gift back with him. Why spend money on international express delivery? No matter how precious the item was, he could wait another few days to deliver it himself.","“Xi Xi, do you miss me?” Gu Zheng suddenly asked, his voice a little coquettish.","Hearing Gu Zheng’s magnetic voice, Qiao Xi’s face turned red. Her longing for him surged out like a tide. She had not seen Gu Zheng for so many days, and she had lost her spirit in everyday life.","Seeing that Qiao Xi was silent, Gu Zheng asked again, “Do you miss me?”","Qiao Xi said, “Yes.” Of course, she missed him. It had already reached the point where she didn’t even want to eat or drink.","“I miss you too.” The man’s voice was mixed with smiles and affection. For a moment, Qiao Xi even felt that this man was beside her. It was as though he was hugging her from behind as usual and muttering in her ear.","“The gift is here. Go downstairs and take a look.”","Qiao Xi looked at the time in disbelief. It was past midnight. What kind of package would be delivered in the middle of the night? Could it be that Gu Zheng had sent someone to deliver it?","Suddenly, a guess appeared in Qiao Xi’s heart. She did not even have the time to change before hurriedly rushing downstairs in thin pajamas and slippers. The instant she pushed the door open, her breathing even stopped.","Gu Zheng was standing at the door in a navy blue windbreaker. His body was filled with a cold aura. He seemed to be a little tired. There was a slight stubble on his chin, and his eyes were bloodshot. However, it did not affect his gentle gaze at all.","He put his phone in his jacket pocket and touched her with his slightly cold fingertips before abruptly retracting them. “Xi Xi, I’m back.”","Qiao Xi stood at the door in a daze, her mind blank. She looked at the man in front of her with infatuated eyes. Their eyes met, and lingering feelings lingered around their bodies.","“I... am Mrs. Gu’s gift.”","Gu Zheng hurriedly entered, took off his jacket, and casually hung it at the side. He rubbed his slightly cold hands and opened his arms. “Mrs. Gu, I really missed you. Hug!”","It had only been five days since they last met, but every day felt like a year to them.","Qiao Xi stood on the spot and was stunned for a moment. “Why are you back today?”","“I rushed back after work today. Fortunately, I caught the last plane and could come back earlier to see you.”","Hearing Gu Zheng’s words, Qiao Xi’s heart suddenly ached. She was aware of how Gu Zheng’s business trip was planned out. He practically did not have any free time, yet he actually came back two days in advance. It was sufficient to show that he had been working practically without sleep these past few days.","At this moment, his eyes were dark and red, while his cheeks were slightly hollow. Qiao Xi knew that he had not been resting well these past few days.","Qiao Xi could not control her choked voice. “Gu Zheng! You’re crazy! Do you want to die?!”","The man smiled and reached out to pull her into his arms. He whispered in her ear, “I was afraid that you’d miss me and think of me not eating or sleeping, so I rushed back. Are you unhappy to see this gift?”","Qiao Xi hugged him tightly, her eyes filled with tears as she sniffled. “Of course, I’m happy! But I don’t want you to be so tired. What will I do if you fall sick?”","Gu Zheng laughed and shook his head. “I’m not tired at all. As long as I can see you, I’ll be filled with strength.”","At this moment, the noise in the living room woke the butler up. He walked out groggily and returned to his room with a speechless expression. It had only been a few days since they last met, but the two of them were already hugging and crying. If one did not know better, one would think that they had not seen each other for a few years.","...","The next morning, Qiao Xi slowly woke up. She glanced at the time and saw that it was already nine o’clock.","Gu Zheng was a very disciplined person. Even though he worked late the day before, he would still wake up at six in the morning to run, eat breakfast, and tidy up before going to work. However, he was sleeping soundly on the bed today. The dark circles under his eyes were still so obvious.","Qiao Xi’s heart ached slightly. In her mind, she imagined the scene of Gu Zheng attending endless meetings, reviewing documents, and finishing his work. He got on the plane home without stopping in the slightest. His body had already endured it to the extreme, so he could finally sleep in peace.","She leaned against the bed and quietly looked at his sleeping face. At this moment, Gu Zheng’s face was filled with traces of fatigue. His stubble had also appeared, but he was still beautiful and she could not get enough of him."]},{"number":955,"title":"Chapter 955 - Respect The Fate Of Others","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi quietly stared at his sleeping face. After a moment, she bent down and gently kissed his lips. She said in a low voice, “Ah Zheng, this is the best gift I’ve received. I’m really happy.”","During the days they were separated, she missed Gu Zheng while Gu Zheng also missed her. He was anxious to return. This was the manifestation of love.","Qiao Xi stood up slowly and went downstairs quietly. She saw Song Shiyu, who was also exhausted. His face was filled with resentment, and he had huge dark circles under his eyes.","The moment Song Shiyu saw Qiao Xi, he was so excited that he almost cried. “Young Madam! You don’t know what kind of life we’ve been living these days! We were already very busy with work this week. Apart from eating and sleeping, we were just working. However, the president was like a robot. He insisted on working overtime until midnight every day. He would get up to work after sleeping for three hours. We’re human too! We need to rest too. Look at the dark circles on my face. They’re affecting my handsome face!”","Qiao Xi looked at him with a sympathetic expression. “Gu Zheng said he’ll give you guys a break. Have a good rest.”","She thought that this matter would be over just like that, but Song Shiyu had not finished venting his anger that he had been suppressing for so many days. He had already forgotten that this was Longwan Residential and Gu Zheng might come downstairs to kick him at any time. He complained indignantly, “Just two days of leave! Can two days of leave make up for the harm we’ve suffered these past few days? He enslaved us for so many days. I’ve only been sleeping for two to three hours a day. I’m so tired! But he’s only giving me two days of leave? He’s a lunatic! He’s not human at all!”","Qiao Xi said, “You...”","Afraid that Qiao Xi would be angry, Song Shijing explained, “Young Madam, don’t mind him. He’s just too tired. He hasn’t been able to get a good night’s sleep recently, so he’s a little resentful.”","Qiao Xi laughed dryly. “I don’t mind. I understand.”","“Young Madam!” Song Shiyu shouted and became even more agitated. “Our schedule was already very tight, but the president insisted on cutting down on time. I asked him why he was in such a rush and he said that someone was waiting for him in Li City, so I want to ask which bastard asked him to come back quickly. Young Madam, who do you think that person is? Tell me!","“If I find out who that person is, I’ll definitely slap him and let him know how big of a mistake he made!”","Qiao Xi: “...” If she did not know that Song Shiyu was not smart, she would have thought that Song Shiyu was hinting at her!","Song Shiyu was furious. “I realize that the president is becoming more and more crooked. Why does he insist on acting like a scoundrel?”","Suddenly, Song Shijing saw the man behind Song Shiyu and looked terrified. He quickly blinked at his silly brother.","“Brother, you haven’t been resting well recently. Your eyes aren’t working well anymore. The president is too much. Look, my brother is so exhausted that he’s even having problems with his eyes now!” Song Shiyu did not understand Song Shijing’s reminder at all and continued to complain.","Seeing that his reminder was useless, Song Shijing rushed over and covered Song Shiyu’s mouth. He gritted his teeth and said, “Don’t spout nonsense! The president has been treating us well. Although we’ve been working hard these past few days, our salary is very high! Moreover, we have two days of leave. We should be satisfied. Where can we find such a good boss?!”","“You’re the one talking nonsense!” Song Shiyu broke free and continued to complain, “Brother! How dare you say that he’s good? Are you blind? He’s clearly the most vicious and savage boss!”","Song Shijing closed his eyes and mourned for Song Shiyu. Forget it. This silly brother of his was hopeless. He would respect the fate of others. He gave up on helping him.","Song Shiyu thought that his brother was agreeing with him, but the next second, a familiar voice came from behind. The other party’s voice was slightly hoarse with a hint of mockery. “I’m vicious?”","Where was the sound coming from? Was he hallucinating?","Song Shiyu’s body suddenly stiffened. He slowly turned around and met Gu Zheng’s smiling light brown eyes. He took a deep breath and almost fainted. He looked up at Song Shijing, who looked pained.","Gu Zheng smiled. “I’m crooked? I’m a scoundrel?”","Song Shiyu took a few steps back in horror and smiled obsequiously. “President, you heard wrongly. I mean, you’re the best boss in the world. You’re the most handsome man in the world. You’re my god!”","Qiao Xi could not help but sigh. Could it be that Gu Zheng kept Song Shiyu by his side because this kid was shameless?"]},{"number":956,"title":"Chapter 956 - Spreading The News","paragraphs":["A week later, Li City University reopened. Qiao Xi started to get busy, but when she got off work today, she saw someone she had not seen in a long time in the living room.","“Brother, why are you here?”","Shen Yu had been busy filming and traveling all over the country. However, he suddenly came today.","The man’s face was gentle as he pinched her soft cheek. However, his eyes were a little serious. “I received news that someone is secretly investigating you. They’ve already found out about me.”","Qiao Xi frowned. Why was someone investigating her?","Shen Yu comforted her softly. “Don’t worry. That person wants to look for the descendant of the divine physician, but they haven’t found out that it’s you. What surprised me is that they’re looking for the descendant of the divine physician because they know that the descendant’s blood can detoxify poison, so... they’re probably looking for you to take your blood. This isn’t good news.”","Qiao Xi’s gaze turned cold. “When did you find out?”","“That person had already taken action half a month ago, but I received the news 10 days ago. Now, everyone knows about this news.”","However, Shen Yu did not know that the other party had deliberately spread the news. What if they had other motives? In short, there was definitely more than one person investigating Qiao Xi.","“The Xia family is also looking for you,” Shen Yu said casually. “Xia Cheng and Old Madam Xia are looking for the descendant of the divine physician, but I’ve investigated and found out that they aren’t poisoned.”","Qiao Xi’s expression was serious. “No matter what their reason is, I want to know who spread the news first. Since they were able to find out about you, it means that the other party has already obtained some information. They’ll find me eventually. There’s another possibility. The person who spread the news knows that I’m the descendant of the divine physician and is deliberately leading everyone to look for me to cause me trouble.”","Actually, Shen Yu had thought of this a long time ago, which was why he hurriedly rushed over to remind Qiao Xi. Just the fact that her blood could cure all poisons was enough to make everyone rush to her.","They could imprison Qiao Xi and raise her like an animal. They would extract a little of her blood every day and use her blood to make an antidote to sell for a high price.","Shen Yu’s eyes suddenly turned cold. “Little Six, there might be many people who know that the blood of the descendant of the divine physician can cure poisons, but only these few people know that you’re the descendant. As your senior, we naturally wouldn’t have leaked this news. That leaves Gu Zheng. You have to be on guard.”","“I believe in him,” Qiao Xi said without the slightest hesitation.","“I also know that he won’t do such a thing, but that doesn’t mean that the people around him won’t. Think about it carefully. Who else could possibly know about this? There aren’t many people around him. You should be more careful. When I’m not around, you must protect yourself. If anything happens, remember to inform me.”","Qiao Xi’s heart was slightly heavy. She nodded and said in a low voice, “Alright.”","“Your second brother has temporarily suppressed the news. You don’t have to worry too much, but Gu Zheng...” Shen Yu suddenly paused. He recalled that he had bumped into Gu Zheng when he entered just now. He subconsciously looked at Gu Zheng and sensed that something was wrong.","Logically speaking, the poison in Gu Zheng’s body had already been cured. Although it was difficult to get rid of it completely, at least the poison would not flare up. However, when Shen Yu looked at Gu Zheng just now, he clearly saw that his eyes were gray and empty.","Although the sky was a little dark at this time, the sun had not completely set. Moreover, Xi Xi had already detoxified the poison in his body. This should not be happening.","Shen Yu stopped thinking and looked at Qiao Xi meaningfully. In the end, he did not mention Gu Zheng’s illness and said casually, “Remember to be careful of the people around you.","“Xi Xi, I’m going to participate in a show soon. I happen to need a fashion designer. Do you want to go with me? Just treat it as a trip,” Shen Yu said.","The program director and Shen Yu had known each other for many years. If he wanted to recommend a designer, the other party would naturally not refuse. Moreover, he was worried about Little Six staying in Li City. He might as well go out with him to avoid letting his imagination run wild.","Qiao Xi asked, “Where?”","“T City. It’s a two-hour drive from Li City. Are you afraid that Gu Zheng won’t agree?”","Qiao Xi frowned and felt inexplicably annoyed in her heart. Ever since Gu Zheng returned from his business trip, he had become a little strange. If it was because he was too tired from his business trip, it had already been so long since then. He should have recovered by now. However, he still gave off an unfathomable feeling."]},{"number":957,"title":"Chapter 957 - Keeping His Secret","paragraphs":["“What’s wrong?” Shen Yu asked.","Qiao Xi did not know what to say either, but she just felt that she could not leave Gu Zheng, so she shook her head. “Forget it, I’m not in the mood now.”","Shen Yu was a little surprised. Little Six liked crowds. As long as he took the initiative to invite her, she would participate in such programs. Could it be that she had already noticed something?","Shen Yu suddenly thought of Gu Zheng’s eyes. Could it be that Xi Xi already knew, so she insisted on staying by Gu Zheng’s side?","“Go.” A cold voice sounded. Gu Zheng took off his jacket and stood at the door with his tall body. His cold eyes landed on Shen Yu.","In the past, when Shen Yu came, although Gu Zheng was never enthusiastic, his eyes were not filled with warning like now. It seemed that he had guessed correctly.","“Hmm?” Qiao Xi was stunned.","Gu Zheng said indifferently, “What show are you going to participate in?”","Shen Yu explained, “A fashion design program. Every celebrity will choose a designer to participate in the competition and show their designs to the audience.”","Gu Zheng nodded and said, “Yes, not bad. Let’s go, then. I’m going to T City too. Let’s go together. We’ll come back together after you’re done filming for the show.”","“What a coincidence,” Shen Yu said meaningfully.","The atmosphere was silent for a few seconds. Suddenly, Gu Zheng looked up at Shen Yu coldly. “Mr. Shen, is there anything else?”","Shen Yu could not help but smile. Gu Zheng was anxious to chase him away!","“President Gu, do you have time? Let’s talk.”","Gu Zheng’s pupils constricted abruptly as he exuded a cold aura. “Alright, let’s go upstairs.”","Qiao Xi watched the two of them leave, her mind filled with question marks. Wasn’t her eldest brother here to inform her of the news? Why was he looking for Gu Zheng to chat with? Could it be that he was going to question him in person?","In the study.","Gu Zheng leaned lazily against the back of the chair, his eyes lowered. His tone was a little distant. “What do you want to say, Mr. Shen?”","“I heard that you had an important meeting. When I came, you were just about to leave. Why did you come back after a few minutes? Are you afraid that the secret will be exposed, so you rushed back?” Shen Yu raised an eyebrow, his eyes filled with ridicule.","Gu Zheng pursed his thin lips tightly.","“You know that I’ve discovered your secret. You’re afraid that I’ll tell Little Six, so you rushed back in a hurry to stop me. Has the poison acted up?”","Gu Zheng was still expressionless, but the emotions in his eyes could not be concealed. This was a sign of anger.","“Your poison has acted up, which means that you and Little Six are no longer connected by blood. The reason for this is that you haven’t taken her blood for a long time. Little Six once told me that every time you detoxified the poison, you did it when she was unconscious. She didn’t see you detoxify the poison with her own eyes.”","Shen Yu smiled. “President Gu, you’re a smart person. You can hide this for a while, but you can’t hide it for the rest of your life. Now, the poison has already acted up, and there are very serious aftereffects. In the past, you would only lose your eyesight in the dark, but now, there’s a possibility of you losing your eyesight even in the daytime.”","Gu Zheng suddenly looked up with a sharp gaze.","“President Gu, don’t be so resentful. I’m the disciple of the divine physician. Although I haven’t studied medicine, I can at least tell that there’s something wrong. You might not have expected me to suddenly visit, so you exposed yourself in front of me. However...”","Shen Yu paused for a moment, then his eyes suddenly lit up. “You’re Gu Zheng. How could you be discovered so easily? I’m guessing you did it on purpose, right?”","Gu Zheng stroked the cup with his long fingers and could not help but smile.","Looking at Gu Zheng’s smile, Shen Yu suddenly felt that he had been tricked by this man. Actually, Gu Zheng knew that he was afraid that Little Six would be sad, so he would not tell her the truth. Gu Zheng was in a hurry to rush back because he wanted to tell him this secret.","After a moment of silence, Gu Zheng said casually, “That’s right, I did it on purpose. Since others will find out sooner or later, why don’t I let you know first? That way, we’ll be on the same boat.”","“You want me to keep it a secret for you?” Shen Yu asked helplessly.","“Of course, I don’t think I need to say anything. Mr. Shen, I know you won’t tell Xi Xi,” Gu Zheng said with a smile. Suddenly, a trace of sorrow flashed past his eyes. “Mr. Shen, you should know that this poison is almost incurable. Otherwise, the divine physician wouldn’t have been helpless back then and watched my mother die. Now, only the descendant of the divine physician can cure this poison. However, this isn’t a good idea because it has already affected Xi Xi."]},{"number":958,"title":"Chapter 958 - Designer","paragraphs":["“The poison in my body can only be detoxified through Xi Xi’s blood, but I couldn’t completely detoxify the poison in my body. There was still no obvious effect even after so long. I could only guarantee that the poison wouldn’t flare up, but Xi Xi was becoming more and more haggard. Hence, I decided to give up on detoxifying the poison. But I can’t let Xi Xi know about this.”","Gu Zheng slowly raised his eyes and looked at Shen Yu with a smile. “The reason why I let you know about this is that I know very well that you’ll always think about Xi Xi, so you’ll definitely keep it a secret for me. Xi Xi is very lucky to have you brothers.”","Shen Yu understood what he meant and nodded. “Alright, I’ll keep it a secret for you, but are you sure you want to go to T City? Actually, I can protect Xi Xi too. You don’t have to go with me.”","Gu Zheng smiled. “I really have something to attend to there. Please take good care of Xi Xi, Mr. Shen.”","...","When everyone arrived at T City, Gu Zheng parted ways with the two of them. As a designer who flew in from elsewhere, Qiao Xi did not have to film anything yet, so she went straight to the dressing room to wait.","The few celebrities who were participating in the show were allocated separate dressing rooms according to their reputation. However, Qiao Xi was not a celebrity, so she could only share a dressing room with the others. Now that everyone had gone to record the show, she was the only one left in the dressing room. She leaned leisurely on the chair to rest.","She was really curious about what her brother and Gu Zheng had talked about that day, but no matter how she asked, the two of them refused to say anything. What secrets did they have?","Qiao Xi thought for a long time but still had no clue. Suddenly, she heard a shout from outside the door. “Miss Qiao, you can go to the design area and wait there for 20 minutes. Prepare yourself first. Also, you need to wear a mask before going on stage. You can only take off the mask after the judges are done giving their scores.”","Qiao Xi looked at the mask on the table and nodded before changing her clothes.","...","At this moment, in the luxurious dressing room next door.","A female celebrity in a pink dress asked arrogantly, “I heard that a designer was flown in for this episode?”","The assistant replied, “Yes, but she’s not a famous designer. Otherwise, why wouldn’t she have an independent dressing room?”","The female celebrity’s name was Xia Tong. She had been popular for a period of time, but her popularity had passed. Hence, her manager booked this show for her, hoping to use this opportunity to return to the public’s eyes. She looked up slightly. “Then why did I hear that the designer was recommended by Shen Yu?!”","Shen Yu was the young master of the Shen family in the capital and a famous Best Actor. If he was the one who recommended her, the production team would naturally give him some face. This might very well pose a threat to her.","The manager at the side chuckled. “So what if Shen Yu recommended her? Is that small-time designer qualified to compete with you? Don’t worry! I’ve already helped you arrange everything. You’ll definitely be the final winner.”","The manager was experienced. She knew very well that the designers who came to participate in such programs were either very famous or would be mentors in the programs. Even if they really participated in the competition, they would start recording from the first episode. The other kind of designer was the small fries. They came to participate in programs like this only to increase their popularity. Such designers would appear out of nowhere and be eliminated after participating in one episode. They would be satisfied by just showing their faces in front of the audience.","“This designer probably has nothing to do with Shen Yu. He just casually recommended a designer to show his influence. Your limelight won’t be snatched? This show was specially designed for you. We didn’t spend 50 million for nothing!”","Xia Tong smiled. “That’s good. I was just worried.”","The manager comforted her. “What’s there to worry about?! Even if this woman is close to Shen Yu, she can’t threaten you. Would Shen Yu offend you for a small designer?","“In this design competition, it doesn’t matter who’s stronger. As long as the judges acknowledge you, you’ll be the champion. No matter what, you’re a descendant of the Xia family. Although you’re from the branch family, with the Xia family’s current status in Luo City, who would dare to offend you?”","Xia Tong heaved a sigh of relief, but she was still a little uneasy. She whispered in her ear, “Sister Chen, I have an idea. Why don’t...”","The manager listened carefully and nodded. “That’s good too. We’ll let the production team edit the footage post-production and try to make you famous! Don’t worry, I’ll warn that little designer to be sensible and not ruin your show.”"]},{"number":959,"title":"Chapter 959 - Competitions Should Be Fair","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi had just walked out of the dressing room when she bumped into Xia Tong’s manager. She had her hands on her hips and stood in front of Qiao Xi, looking like a shrew looking for trouble.","Qiao Xi raised her eyes and glanced coldly at the other party. “Please move aside.”","The manager sized up Qiao Xi, who was in front of her. She was indeed very beautiful. Even among female celebrities, she was one of the best. Whether she was a designer or not, her face alone was enough to threaten Xia Tong.","For some reason, the manager felt that this small-time designer looked a little familiar as if she had seen her somewhere before.","“Hey! Young lady, let me remind you something. Just show your face in today’s competition. Don’t take it too seriously,” the manager warned arrogantly.","“Why?” Qiao Xi asked expressionlessly.","The manager seemed to have heard a joke and could not help but laugh out loud. “What right do you have to ask? This show is made for our Xia Tong. She’s the final champion, so you don’t have to put up a useless struggle. No matter what, you can’t be the champion.","“I know that as a designer, you’re arrogant, but you have to know that this is a show. Since it’s a show, it needs to have the elements of a show. Among these participants, Xia Tong is the most famous. No one else dares to compete with her, much less you!","“I’m warning you. Be careful in today’s competition. No matter how capable you are, you have to hold yourself back. If you steal Xia Tong’s limelight, you’ll suffer!”","Qiao Xi was angered to the point of laughing. “Competitions should be fair. If the outcome of the competition can be controlled by others, what’s the point?”","“Fair?” The manager was stunned for a few seconds, then laughed arrogantly. “What’s the point?! The audience wants to see Xia Tong. Who wants to see you?! Whether you’re convinced or not, the final winner can only be Xia Tong. If you dare to snatch Xia Tong’s limelight, you have to be prepared to lose your reputation on stage.","“Our Xia Tong has a backer, and there’s also the Xia family backing her up. What right do you have to compare yourself to her? I advise you to be sensible and not struggle fearlessly.”","Qiao Xi chuckled. She was not interested in this show at all. She was just playing around and did not want to be the champion. However, someone ignorant had to provoke her, so she wanted to challenge them.","Moreover, she heard that this female celebrity’s surname was Xia. She was from the Xia family? Since she was from the Xia family, there was no need to give in.","As soon as the manager finished speaking, she turned around and left. She seemed to be sure that Qiao Xi was afraid of Xia Tong’s identity, so Qiao Xi would not dare to challenge their authority.","...","Qiao Xi was waiting backstage to enter the design area when she suddenly received a call from an unknown number.","“Hello, Miss Qiao. I’m Old Xiang! Do you still remember me?” It was a middle-aged man on the other end, but his tone was very respectful.","Qiao Xi thought for a few seconds before realizing that Old Xiang was the president of T City’s television station. She smiled. “Old Xiang, it’s you!”","Old Xiang was extremely excited. “Miss Qiao, it’s been six years. I didn’t expect you to come to T City to participate in the show. It’s really my honor! If you and Shen Yu hadn’t saved my daughter back then, she would have died a long time ago. You’re the savior of our entire family.”","Qiao Xi fell into her memories. She liked to play when she was young and felt that it was too boring to stay on the mountain, so every time Shen Yu was filming, she would go with him. At that time, the production team was filming an explosive scene, but because of improper handling, it exploded for real and caused a fire.","Just as everyone was about to leave, Qiao Xi heard the cries of a little girl coming from inside. She rushed into the fire without hesitation. Shen Yu was worried about her safety and rushed in as well. Fortunately, they managed to save the little girl in the end. The two of them were not injured, and the little girl’s father was Old Xiang.","Qiao Xi smiled in embarrassment. “I just did what I could.”","Old Xiang said confidently, “Miss Qiao, I invited Mr. Shen to our house before, but he refused. I didn’t expect the two of you to come this time. When the show is over and if you have time, can we have a meal together? My daughter really wants to thank you in person.","“I heard that you’re a famous fashion designer now and go by the name of Gu Shan. You’re really too awesome. With your identity, you should be a mentor! Why are you a participant? You’re really young and promising! My daughter treats you as her role model! She said that she wants to be as outstanding as you in the future!”","Qiao Xi smiled indifferently. “The mentors have already been decided. Being a participant is very good too!”"]},{"number":960,"title":"Chapter 960 - The Design Was Stolen","paragraphs":["Old Xiang chuckled. “Miss Qiao, then perform well. Our television station’s program has to be fair and just. With your standard, you’ll definitely win the championship.”","Qiao Xi suddenly recalled the manager’s words and could not help but ask, “Fair and just? In that case, as long as I’m capable enough, I can win the championship? The results of the competition have nothing to do with one’s reputation?”","Old Xiang was stunned for a moment and asked in confusion, “Why do you ask, Miss Qiao? Did someone make things difficult for you?”","Qiao Xi did not want to complain. She did not need anyone’s help to deal with these small fries. She smiled. “No, I was just asking.”","After hanging up, the station head felt that something was wrong. He hurriedly instructed his subordinate, “Go to the recording venue of the show and see who’s making things difficult for Miss Qiao.”","At this moment, Qiao Xi had already entered the design area and drawn the design draft according to the production team’s requirements. Next, she would use the materials provided by the production team to design the final product within the stipulated time. In the end, the judges would grade everyone’s work and determine the final winner.","The design was already done. Qiao Xi took the design to the materials section to choose the materials. Unexpectedly, she bumped into Xia Tong’s manager.","Chen Li glanced arrogantly at Qiao Xi and looked at the lotus-colored silk and ink-colored gauze in her hand. Then, she glanced at Qiao Xi’s design and was instantly stunned.","This small-time designer was actually so capable? Even though she could not stand this woman, she had to admit that her design was too perfect. The finished product would definitely be even more stunning.","Chen Li was not worried that the standard of other designers would surpass Xia Tong. After all, there was always someone better. However, she would never allow the standard of a designer to surpass Xia Tong on the show. If that happened, it would cause unnecessary trouble if the show was broadcasted.","She frowned and pondered for a moment. If Xia Tong used this design to participate in the competition, all her difficulties would be resolved.","Qiao Xi had finished choosing the materials and was about to leave when someone suddenly bumped into her. By the time she reacted, the design on the table had been taken away.","She looked up and scanned her surroundings. Everyone had their heads lowered as they chose their materials. She did not know who bumped into her, but she knew that the other party’s goal was very clear. They wanted to snatch her design. She stood on the spot and thought for a moment before smiling.","Qiao Xi raised her eyes to size up the surroundings. There were surveillance cameras above the materials section, so she did not make a sound and went straight to the surveillance room.","...","An hour later.","The recording venue was already filled with people. Shen Xiu and Madam Shen, Yu Qinghe, were also here to watch the competition. After the two of them sat down, Yu Qinghe looked around. “Why don’t I see Xi Xi?”","“Xi Xi should still be backstage preparing,” Shen Xiu explained.","Yu Qinghe was all smiles. “Xi Xi has already shown me her design. I believe she’ll definitely win the championship!”","At this moment, the music at the venue suddenly became louder. The host entered the venue and announced the official start of the recording. “Please welcome the mentors and judges!”","The arrival of the four judges instantly ignited the atmosphere. These people were all famous designers and fashion editors in the fashion design world. After the host introduced them one by one, he raised his voice again. “We’ve also invited a special judge this time. Please give your welcome to Best Actor Shen Yu!”","The venue erupted in applause as a tall figure appeared on stage. The man was wearing a white suit and had a warm smile on his face. He looked like a noble prince. He picked up the microphone and smiled at the camera. “Hello, everyone. I’m Shen Yu.”","The audience screamed excitedly and shouted Shen Yu’s name. Shen Xiu and Yu Qinghe were shocked.","“Ah!!! My idol! Shen Yu!”","“Shen Yu! Shen Yu! The most handsome Best Actor!”","“Ah! The Best Actor is so handsome. He’s really gentle and handsome. There are very few actors in the industry with such good temperament.”","Shen Xiu and Yu Qinghe looked at each other helplessly. Their son was very gentle?","The judges stood up to welcome Shen Yu and shook hands with him. With Shen Yu’s appearance, it did not seem to matter who the next celebrity was.","Shen Yu shook hands with everyone gently and said politely, “Hello, everyone.”","The audience was once again intoxicated by Shen Yu’s gentleness. The fans said with infatuated expressions, “Shen Yu is really a gentleman. I heard that he has a good temper and doesn’t put on airs as a celebrity. He’s very gentle even to his juniors. Even if someone causes him trouble, he’ll just smile.”"]},{"number":961,"title":"Chapter 961 - Materials Were Replaced","paragraphs":["Hearing everyone praise his son, Shen Xiu lowered his head in shame. It was true that Shen Yu never argued with anyone, but those who had offended him were all secretly dealt with. It was not that he had a good temper but that he knew how to pretend.","At this moment, Shen Yu was sitting alone beside the judges. No matter who greeted him, he would smile back and wave his hand to make the fans like him even more.","The show was about to start recording. The celebrities would display their works and inspiration according to the order of drawing lots. After all, everyone here was of status. Even if their works were not good, the judges would not reprimand them too much.","Yu Qinghe asked anxiously, “Why hasn’t Xi Xi appeared yet?”","The moment that was said, the surrounding gazes landed on the two of them. The fans could not help but ask, “Aren’t you two Shen Yu’s fans?”","Only then did Shen Xiu realize that the seats Shen Yu had arranged for them were filled with his fans. They were all holding signs with his name on them that had blue lights.","However, among the many young people, two people in their 40s appeared. It was inevitable that they would be curious.","Yu Qinghe shook her head. “No, our daughter is a designer. We’re here to cheer her on.”","When the fans heard this, their eyes instantly lit up. “Wow! Your daughter is so awesome! She must have spent a lot of money to learn how to be a designer! Those who can participate in shows like this must be very outstanding designers!”","“But you’re not Shen Yu’s fans. Why are you sitting here? I remember that all the tickets here were taken by Shen Yu’s fan club.”","Everyone was discussing it noisily. At this moment, a few celebrities walked out one after another. Everyone was attracted to the stage.","Shen Yu looked at the celebrities indifferently. Suddenly, a familiar voice came from his earpiece. His expression was indifferent.","Qiao Xi’s voice slowly sounded. “Brother, the materials I need have been replaced with defective goods.”","Shen Yu’s eyes turned cold. He was about to raise his hand to signal the director to stop the recording when Qiao Xi hurriedly stopped him. “Don’t say anything. Just listen to me. The quality of these materials is indeed not good, but it’s enough for me to finish a set of clothes. It’s just that my design was stolen. Moreover, after I told the production team about this, they persuaded me to let the matter rest.”","Hearing this, Shen Yu could not help but clench his fists. Before he came, he had specially told Old Xiang that this show had to be fair and transparent. However, now that someone had stolen Little Six’s design, they were actually ignoring it?","“I already know who stole my design. It’s the female celebrity who was internally selected by the production team. They want to use this show to make her famous. They’re worried that I’ll be their stumbling block, so they made a move on me. Since they came to look for trouble with me first, don’t blame me for being merciless.”","Qiao Xi instructed softly, “Eldest Brother, you must calm down and not act rashly. I can handle such a small matter.”","Shen Yu replied imperceptibly. Qiao Xi cut off their contact and focused on completing the design.","In the entertainment industry, there were too many people who stepped on others to climb up the ranks. Those with low reputations would be treated as stepping stones. However, Qiao Xi had never been someone who would be at the mercy of others, nor would she be threatened by others. Moreover, the person who wanted to deal with her this time was surnamed Xia!","In the design area, Qiao Xi looked at the pile of defective goods on the table. She observed them for a moment before swiftly starting to make clothes.","“Miss Qiao, you’re so capable at such a young age. You’ll definitely achieve something in the future. Why do you have to be in the limelight on this show? As long as you’re willing to cooperate with us this time, you can design Xia Tong’s gowns in the future. She can even advertise them for you for free. What do you think?","“Xia Tong is a popular celebrity. If she helps you advertise, many people will definitely look for you to customize clothes for them. Before long, you’ll be a famous designer in the industry. It’s been hard on you this time, but your future is limitless! Actually, even if you design the perfect clothes, you might not be able to become popular. You’ll offend our Xia Tong instead. At that time, it’ll be difficult for you to stand out again.”","Chen Li tried her best to persuade Qiao Xi, but Qiao Xi turned a deaf ear and continued working hard.","At this moment, Qiao Xi’s fingers nimbly outlined the waist of the clothes. The clothes had already taken shape and were exactly the same as the design.","Chen Li’s expression changed. If she really submitted this work, there would be two sets of the same clothes at the scene. At that time, everyone would be suspicious."]},{"number":962,"title":"Chapter 962 - You Didn’t Cherish The Chance I Gave You","paragraphs":["As a professional manager, Chen Li would absolutely not allow such a thing to happen, so she decided to persuade Qiao Xi nicely. Unexpectedly, Qiao Xi completely ignored her.","Seeing that Qiao Xi was looking down on everyone, Chen Li was instantly infuriated. “Miss Qiao, you should have already looked for the production team, right? They know that your design was stolen, but does anyone care? They’ll only let you continue participating in the show as if nothing happened. You’re just a small-time designer. What right do you have to compete with our Xia Tong? Our Xia Tong has a backer. You can’t afford to offend her!","“I won’t make things difficult for you. As long as you change your design, we can give you a sum of money. Just take it as though we bought your design. Moreover, I can get Xia Tong to recommend your clothes. This is killing two birds with one stone. You have no reason to refuse!","“Even if your design is good, you can only make it with defective materials. As long as you agree to change the design, I’ll prepare new materials for you. I guarantee that they’ll all be high-quality fabrics. If you need anything, feel free to tell me. I’ll definitely—”","“You’re very noisy.” Qiao Xi interrupted Chen Li coldly, her eyes filled with impatience.","Chen Li instantly choked, and her expression gradually turned ugly. “You little girl, you actually dare to speak to me like this? I’ve said all the good things I could, but you didn’t listen to a single word. You’re so young, but you have such a bad temper!”","Qiao Xi pointed coldly at the door. “Miss Chen, please leave.”","“Say that again?” Chen Li glared at her.","“Scram!” Qiao Xi’s thin lips parted slightly as she coldly spat out.","Chen Li was so angry that her eyes almost popped out. Previously, when she saw Qiao Xi’s design, she thought that this designer was quite capable and wanted to rope her in to be Xia Tong’s substitute. She did not expect this young lady to be so stubborn and not give her any face at all.","Since she was unwilling, there was no need to force her. After all, there were so many designers, so there was no need to insist on recruiting her.","Chen Li’s face was filled with disdain as she snorted. “Don’t think that just because you say that the design is yours, people will believe you. You’re just a new designer, yet your work is exactly the same as Xia Tong’s. It’s obvious who was the one who plagiarized. The audience won’t believe you either. At that time, your reputation will be ruined. I gave you a chance today, but you didn’t cherish it. You’ll regret it one day!”","As soon as she finished speaking, Chen Li left angrily. The moment she turned around, a person suddenly appeared in her mind. This small-time designer looked a little similar to the chief of Liuli, but why would that big shot participate in such a show? Even if she really came, she would definitely be a judge.","Gu Shan was a pearl in the fashion design industry and the idol of many designers. However, she had always been low-profile and rarely showed her face. Chen Li had only seen her once from afar during a fashion show.","Qiao Xi was expressionless as her fingers gently stroked the dress she had designed. Even though it was made of rough fabric, it was unable to conceal its elegance.","Regret? It was still uncertain who would regret it! Was stealing someone else’s things justified these days?","...","On the other hand, Shen Yu believed that Qiao Xi could solve this small problem, so he was no longer worried. He stared at the stage. He wanted to see who stole Little Six’s design draft.","The show officially started recording. The first to appear was a singer who had debuted in a talent show. She had previously learned design. As soon as she appeared, the audience below the stage cheered excitedly. However, Shen Yu’s expression remained indifferent as if nothing could arouse his interest.","In Shen Yu’s eyes, the works of these celebrities could only be considered average. There was nothing outstanding about them. Those fans liked them because they had the aura of celebrities. When everyone saw Qiao Xi’s work, they would know how dull these celebrities’ works were.","The last person was Xia Tong. After her work was displayed on stage, the entire venue fell silent.","This... was too perfect!","The design of the gown matched the theme. The color was gorgeous but not tacky. It made everyone dumbfounded. Even the judges were stunned. They could not believe that this gown was designed by an amateur.","Shen Yu’s entire body exuded a chill, and a trace of disgust flashed past his eyes. Shen Yu, who was known for his gentleness, actually revealed such an expression. The judges at the side sensed that something was wrong.","It was just that the show was being recorded, so everyone could only pretend not to see it. The host invited all the contestants on stage. “The works of the five contestants have been displayed. They all have their own merits. It’s truly an eye-opener!”"]},{"number":963,"title":"Chapter 963 - Shen Yu’s Doubts","paragraphs":["Then, it was time for the evaluation segment. The judges commented on all the works one by one. As expected, the judges were full of praise for Xia Tong’s work. With Xia Tong’s current ability, even the judges present could not compare to her. What was even rarer was that she was not a professional designer. She had never studied design professionally and was usually very busy filming. She probably did not have time to learn. To be able to design such stunning works, she must be extremely talented.","At this moment, the judges had all expressed their opinions. The host could not help but look at Shen Yu. “Mr. Shen, whose work do you like?”","Everyone was very satisfied with Xia Tong’s work. Even amateurs could tell that she was much better than other designers. Hence, it was just a formality for the host to ask Shen Yu. After all, Shen Yu had a gentle temper. He thought that Shen Yu would definitely agree with the others.","Xia Tong looked at Shen Yu uneasily, expecting his praise. However, Shen Yu picked up the microphone unhurriedly and sneered.","Everyone looked at each other. Did Shen Yu like her work or not?","The judges at the side subconsciously looked at him, only to see that his eyes were filled with disdain. The host smiled awkwardly. “Teacher Shen, your way of expressing your feelings is very special. Well, let’s go to the next segment. The judges will give their scores.”","“No,” Shen Yu said coldly. Everyone was surprised. Shen Yu was famous for his good temper and had always been a gentleman. He had never been so rude, much less put on the airs of a celebrity just because of his identity. However, he was really acting too strangely today.","The host looked troubled. “Mr. Shen...”","“I haven’t expressed my opinion,” Shen Yu said bluntly. His cold gaze landed on Xia Tong. “Miss Xia’s work is indeed perfect.”","Xia Tong heaved a sigh of relief. Perhaps Shen Yu did not like this style, but he had to admit that her work was indeed perfect. There were a total of five contestants. Shen Yu had only praised her work, which was enough for her to stand out from everyone.","However, the next second...","Shen Yu’s eyes were sharp as he said sarcastically, “But did you design your work yourself, Miss Xia?”","Everyone was stunned. The host’s expression froze. He really did not expect Shen Yu to question Xia Tong in public. He was clearly saying that Xia Tong had plagiarized.","Xia Tong quickly retorted, “Yes! Of course!”","The judges looked at Shen Yu in surprise, then at Xia Tong in doubt. With Shen Yu’s current status, there was no need for him to malign Xia Tong. Since he said that, it meant that he knew the inside story.","Shen Yu snorted. “Is that so? Miss Xia, you’re very confident.”","The host laughed dryly. The judges at the side hurriedly stepped forward to mediate the situation. “Mr. Shen, you must be joking! After all, Xia Tong’s work is really too perfect. It doesn’t seem like something an amateur can do.”","Shen Yu ignored everyone and his voice became even colder. “Miss Xia, let me ask you again. Did you design this piece?”","The moment that was said, the judges could not help but suspect that since Xia Tong was just an amateur designer, how could she have designed such a stunning piece? Moreover, they knew Shen Yu’s character. He would not malign anyone.","Xia Tong lowered her head guiltily. Faced with everyone’s questioning gazes, cold sweat broke out on her forehead. She knew very well that if it was exposed that she didn’t design this, her career would be ruined. Hence, she could only brace herself and answer, “Mr. Shen, you must’ve misunderstood. This is my work. If you don’t believe me, I can show you the design!”","At this moment, a judge said unhappily, “Mr. Shen, what right do you have to say that this gown isn’t Xia Tong’s work? Do you have evidence? You have to know that rumors are scary. Your joke might ruin Xia Tong’s future.”","In order to stand out in the show, Xia Tong bribed two of the judges. They would naturally stand up for Xia Tong. Everyone knew this.","“Evidence?” Shen Yu raised an eyebrow and said with a smile, “I don’t have any evidence. Since you’re so sure that your work is yours, I’ll vote for you.”","Xia Tong finally heaved a sigh of relief. Fortunately, Shen Yu did not continue to make things difficult for her. Otherwise, she really would not know what to do.","Seeing this, the host immediately continued, “As Xia Tong’s work is too stunning, it has caused Mr. Shen to think that this work doesn’t belong to Xia Tong. Thank you for your straightforwardness, Mr. Shen. Our show needs to be realistic and transparent for the audience.”"]},{"number":964,"title":"Chapter 964 - Showing The Same Work","paragraphs":["With the host’s explanation, the awkward atmosphere at the scene eased up a little. Shen Yu was expressionless, but his eyes were filled with disdain.","The final score was the score determined by the judges and the audience’s support rate. The results were soon announced. Xia Tong was indeed ranked first.","“Congratulations to Xia Tong for temporarily getting first place, but the production team has also invited a masked designer to the venue today to showcase their work. Let’s wait and see who the final winner is!","“Faced with such a strong opponent like Xia Tong, what outstanding work will this masked designer bring us? Will Xia Tong crush her, or will the masked designer pose a strong counterattack?”","Xia Tong raised her head high and smiled confidently. The final winner could only be her. Her sugar daddy had invested 50 million yuan. It could be said that this show was made for her. The outcome was already decided.","At this moment, a staff member pushed a dress covered in a red cloth out from backstage. Under everyone’s expectant gazes, the red cloth was lifted, revealing the work inside. This gown was also perfect, but...","Everyone immediately reacted. “That’s not right! Isn’t this the same as Xia Tong’s work?”","“The staff member must have brought out the wrong gown!”","“No! Look carefully, the fabric and color of this gown are different from Xia Tong’s, but the style is exactly the same.”","Xia Tong was also stunned. She suddenly realized that the small-time designer had actually completed her work according to the original design. She really overestimated herself.","When two similar works appeared, one of them would naturally be deemed as having plagiarized the other. However, she was more famous than that designer. She went on stage to display her work first, so everyone would naturally have the first impression. Moreover, the production team was on her side. After taking her money, they would naturally speak up for her.","The fabric of this designer’s work was rough and lusterless. Who would believe that this design belonged to the designer?","The little b*tch actually dared to make a scene in front of the stage. In that case, she would let her have a taste of her reputation being ruined. She would probably never be able to be a designer again.","At this moment, the staff member could only brace themselves and push the work to the front. It was placed next to Xia Tong’s work. The two sets of clothes were just slightly different in color and materials. The host was stunned.","Xia Tong suddenly exclaimed, her eyes filled with disbelief.","The venue instantly fell silent. The audience stood up to watch this awkward scene. They had watched so many shows, but this was the first time they were seeing two sets of work that were exactly the same. Even the creases and embroidery on the waist were the same. These were all completed according to the same design.","Was this designer crazy?","Bang!","One of the judges slammed the table and shouted, “How arrogant! It’s exactly the same as Miss Xia Tong’s work. She didn’t even change it a little. She copied so brazenly!”","Xia Tong hurriedly placated him, saying, “Mr. Qiu, don’t be anxious. There might be a misunderstanding. You can get that designer to explain it.”","“Miss Xia, she actually dares to plagiarize on a TV show. I don’t know how many people’s works she has plagiarized in private. Such a person isn’t worthy to be a designer at all!”","Hearing the judge’s words, everyone looked at the masked designer with disdain. The young lady was very young and had a good figure. Although her face was covered, it was obvious that she was a beauty. Why did she have to do such a thing?","The host received instructions from his earpiece. The filming was suspended, and the judges went on stage to observe the two sets of dresses closely. “That’s right, they’re the same. Miss Xia, did your design get stolen before the competition?”","Xia Tong said thoughtfully, “I don’t know either. I’ve already submitted my design to the production team.”","In order to prove her innocence, Xia Tong printed a copy of the design as soon as she received it and handed it to the production team. With the production team as witnesses, it was meaningless no matter how that small-time designer tried to explain herself.","The judges all berated, “In this day and age, there are all kinds of people. In the past, in order to arouse inspiration, designers could go for days without sleeping or eating. Now, these young designers are only thinking of taking shortcuts.”","“She’s really embarrassing the honor of designers!”","When Xia Tong saw that everyone was speaking up for her, the corners of her mouth curled up proudly as she revealed a provocative smile at Qiao Xi."]},{"number":965,"title":"Chapter 965 - The Eyes Of The Public Are Sharp","paragraphs":["“Since our works are the same, why is everyone unanimously sure that I copied Miss Xia’s work and not the other way around?” At this moment, Qiao Xi suddenly spoke, her cold voice interrupting everyone’s discussion.","When the famous critic in the fashion industry saw Qiao Xi interrupt him, he was even angrier. “What nonsense are you talking about? How could Miss Xia have plagiarized your work?”","Qiao Xi looked at everyone indifferently, and the corners of her mouth curled up slightly. “Why not? Is her design ability very strong?”","Xia Tong said angrily, “Miss Qiao, the filming has already been suspended, and the production team won’t spread the news of what happened today. Why are you questioning me? I don’t know where you got my design plan from and how you boldly made the same work as me, but I believe the eyes of the public are sharp. It’s obvious who was the one who plagiarized. Moreover, my inspiration came from roses and butterflies. Can you tell me what your inspiration is?”","Qiao Xi glanced coldly at her. As expected of an actress. She was quite good at pretending.","Below the stage, Yu Qinghe’s face was gloomy, and Shen Xiu’s gaze was cold. The two of them immediately stood up, wanting to argue with the producer. As soon as they walked out of the audience seats, they bumped into someone.","At this moment, everyone was watching the commotion. Only Gu Zheng was standing in the corner of the corridor. When he saw Shen Xiu and Qiao Xi, Gu Zheng nodded slightly at them. “Mr. Shen, Madam Shen.”","“President Gu, Xi Xi...”","“It’s okay. She can handle it herself. We don’t have to interfere. It won’t be too late for us to attack when she can’t.” Gu Zheng smiled. “But I believe that the trash from the Xia family is not her match at all.”","Shen Xiu could not help but nod. They had watched Xi Xi grow up, so of course, they believed in her ability.","At this moment, Xia Tong was still arguing on stage. “I know you’re a designer and I’m not a professional, but you can’t say that I plagiarized you just because of this! Although I’ve never systematically learned it, I’m talented. Design can’t be obtained through hard work. You have to be talented!”","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart. This woman was really confident. No part of the work she produced came from her own ability and idea, yet she still had the cheek to say that she was talented?","“Miss Qiao, Shen Yu has already voted for me just now. He has already acknowledged my work. Who will support you?” Xia Tong’s tone was mocking.","Everyone stared at Qiao Xi, but before she could speak, Shen Yu suddenly stood up and strode over with a serious expression. “Miss Xia.”","Xia Tong looked up and trembled when she met his cold eyes. The next second, he said distantly, “Who said I approve of your work?”","The atmosphere instantly became awkward. Xia Tong’s face alternated between red and white as she bit her lip tightly. Faced with Shen Yu’s powerful aura, she could not be arrogant.","“I did vote just now, but I just like this piece. I didn’t acknowledge you or express my support for you. How would I know if you designed this piece?” Shen Yu’s eyes were filled with disdain.","Xia Tong clenched her fists tightly, and her voice trembled slightly. “Shen Yu, why are you always suspecting me? What did I do wrong? This is clearly my design!”","Her voice was choked, but her eyes were filled with anger. Shen Yu had been going against her since the beginning. What right did he have to do this? He was just an abandoned child of the Shen family!","As Shen Yu had been working hard outside all these years and had not returned home to inherit the family business, there were rumors that Shen Yu did not have a good relationship with his family. Shen Yu had been in the entertainment industry for so many years, but the Shen family had not given him any help. Moreover, there were rumors that he had already cut ties with the Shen family. Xia Tong thought that since she had the Xia family as her backer, Shen Yu had no reason not to help her.","Shen Yu was the most famous celebrity present. As long as he voiced out his support, her fans would definitely support him too. Hence, Xia Tong wanted to try her best to rope Shen Yu in. She looked at Shen Yu sincerely and blinked innocently. “Shen Yu, believe me, okay?”","Xia Tong walked closer with tears in her eyes. She had used this expression to seduce her sugar daddy back then. She believed that no man could refuse such a pitiful woman.","She heard that Shen Yu had always had a good temper. How could he embarrass a female celebrity in public? This was not what a gentleman should do!"]},{"number":966,"title":"Chapter 966 - I’m Her Brother","paragraphs":["“No! I don’t believe you.”","Shen Yu’s voice echoed in the huge recording venue. Everyone was dumbfounded. They really did not expect the usually gentle Shen Yu to embarrass Xia Tong in public.","Xia Tong’s face instantly turned red as she frowned tightly. She forcefully suppressed her anger and said in a cold voice, “Since everyone has their own opinions, for the sake of fairness, let the production team investigate the truth. I want to prove to everyone who the real plagiarist is!”","The producer hurriedly went forward to persuade her. “Why don’t we settle it in private?”","“I can’t suffer this grievance for nothing. Since it has already happened, I have to investigate it clearly,” Xia Tong said righteously. “I didn’t plagiarize. I really don’t understand why Shen Yu is protecting this small-time designer. Could it be that there’s a special relationship between the two of you?”","Everyone’s gazes shifted between Shen Yu and Qiao Xi. Ever since he debuted, he had always been clean and had no scandals. Now that he actually had an ambiguous relationship with this designer, the fans present were instantly unhappy.","“Impossible! How could Brother Yu be related to this designer? That woman is obviously a vixen who likes to seduce men. He must have been bewitched by her!”","“Xia Tong is so confident. That designer must have copied Xia Tong’s design!”","Hearing the excited voices of the fans, Xia Tong smiled proudly. “Shen Yu, you’re a Best Actor and a popular male celebrity in the industry. Why ruin your reputation as a plagiarist? Moreover, I think she approached you just to ride on your coattails.”","Shen Yu raised an eyebrow. “She’s trying to ride on my coattails?”","A trace of mockery flashed past Xia Tong’s eyes. “Miss Qiao is indeed very beautiful. It’s understandable that you like her, but if you malign me like this for the sake of the woman you like, it’ll ruin your reputation as a Best Actor! Although I respect you very much, I can’t stop investigating the truth just because of you!”","The entire venue was in an uproar.","Shen Yu’s manager’s eyes turned cold. What was Xia Tong talking about? She was clearly saying that the two of them had an unspeakable relationship, which was why Shen Yu was speaking up for Qiao Xi! She was slandering Shen Yu!","The fans below the stage instantly exploded, shouting to express their dissatisfaction.","Xia Tong’s tone softened a little. “Shen Yu, please forgive my rashness. I shouldn’t have said that to you just now, but you know very well that I’m from the Xia family of Luo City. Although I’m not as famous as you in the entertainment industry, I still occupy a high position. Why would I plagiarize the work of a small-time designer? Wouldn’t that ruin my reputation?","“I really don’t understand. What’s your relationship with her? Why are you protecting her?!”","“I’m her brother,” Shen Yu said casually. His voice was indifferent with a trace of disdain. “Tell me, should I protect her?”","The recording venue instantly fell silent. Everyone widened their eyes in disbelief.","What? Shen Yu was the brother of a masked designer?","Xia Tong was stunned. Her expression froze, and the corners of her mouth twitched slightly. “She...”","Shen Yu’s expression was indifferent. “Miss Xia, you’re so young. Why are your thoughts so strange? Why do you think that our relationship is impure the moment you see me protecting a girl? Is malicious speculation a trait of the Xia family?”","The fans also stood up for Shen Yu. Xia Tong’s words just now were to deliberately slander Shen Yu. She meant that Shen Yu was having an affair with the masked designer, which was why he was standing up for her.","Xia Tong’s face was ashen as she said with difficulty, “I... I misunderstood. I’m sorry, Mr. Shen.”","Shen Yu raised an eyebrow. “That’s it?”","Qiao Xi: “...”","‘Brother, there are so many people here. You’re the gentle Best Actor! You have to maintain your image! You can’t ruin all your years of hard work on an impulse!’","Xia Tong panted heavily. She had already apologized, so what else did she want? And this designer was actually Shen Yu’s younger sister? Then why was she still participating in a show like this?","The fans below the stage knew that Shen Yu and the masked designer were siblings. They instantly beamed and praised, “So the masked designer is Shen Yu’s younger sister! Although she hasn’t taken off her mask, one can tell that she’s a beauty just by looking at her figure!”","“She’s the younger sister of the Best Actor. Does she need to plagiarize? This is just a small TV show. So what if she loses? At most, she’ll just go home and inherit the family business!”"]},{"number":967,"title":"Chapter 967 - It’s Good To Know One’s Mistake","paragraphs":["The judge who spoke up earlier was also stunned. He originally thought that this designer was just a small figure who could be manipulated by others. Unexpectedly, she was actually Shen Yu’s younger sister! However, he remembered that this designer’s surname was Qiao. She was probably a distant relative of the Shen family!","Xia Tong, on the other hand, had a calm expression as if she did not care about the other party’s identity. “Shen Yu, it’s naturally right for you to protect your sister, but you can’t insist that I plagiarized her just because she’s your sister!”","As soon as she finished speaking, Xia Tong looked at the producer at the side. The two of them looked at each other.","The producer understood what Xia Tong meant. All the evidence pointed to Qiao Xi. Even if Shen Yu was dissatisfied, he could not cause trouble for the production team. After all, he still had to maintain his image.","Moreover, this show was filmed for Xia Tong. Her sugar daddy had invested 50 million just to make her famous. Since their production team had accepted the money, they naturally had to work for others.","At the thought of this, the producer hurriedly went forward and said, “Before the show started, everyone had to submit their designs on time. Logically speaking, Miss Xia Tong and the masked designer have submitted their designs. Since neither of them are admitting that they plagiarized, why don’t they show their designs? It’ll be obvious then.”","At this moment, the director was in the middle and did not dare to offend anyone. He could only send someone to get the design. In order to ensure fairness, the director even sent a videographer to accompany them. Everyone at the recording venue would observe the scene in real time through the big screen. Everyone could clearly see the staff member quickly getting a folder with the design. Under the gazes of so many people, he did not have time to change it at all.","After the designs were brought over, Xia Tong even tried to persuade her. “Miss Qiao, you came from a good family and are young and beautiful. Why ruin your future on impulse? I’ll give you a chance. As long as you apologize now, I won’t pursue this matter anymore. I won’t let anyone at the scene spread the news either.”","“It’s good to know one’s mistake. You’re still young, so you can’t keep thinking about plagiarism. You’re wilful now, but you’ll definitely regret what you did today in the future.”","Qiao Xi did not want to pay attention to her at all. She turned to the staff member and said, “Open it!”","Seeing that Qiao Xi was so arrogant, Xia Tong was angered to the point of having a ferocious expression. If she was arrogant now, what would she say when the design was exposed?!","The folder was opened. There were a total of six people participating in the competition, but there were only five designs inside. The others had all taken their own designs, so there was only one left. Xia Tong and Qiao Xi were not in a rush to take it.","“Why is there only one design left?”","“One of them must not have handed in the design! Let’s see whose design it is!”","The director got the staff member to open the design. Xia Tong smiled proudly. Her name was definitely on it.","Qiao Xi chuckled. The Xia family’s IQ was not too high. They thought that they were invincible just because they were a little smart, but they forgot that if they did too many bad things, they would expose themselves sooner or later.","At this moment, the staff member opened the design and announced loudly, “The name signed off is Miss Xia Tong!”","With that, he showed the design to the camera to ensure that everyone could see it clearly.","Xia Tong was overjoyed, but she did not show it. Instead, she sighed helplessly. “Miss Qiao, I already said that I could forgive you, but you still wanted to make things worse. Do you think you can do whatever you want just because you’re Shen Yu’s younger sister?","“The facts have proven that I’m the owner of this work. Now, you have to apologize to everyone present. It was your willfulness that caused the show to be suspended and everyone’s precious time to be wasted. You have to be responsible for this!”","Qiao Xi slowly raised her eyes, and the corners of her mouth carried a trace of an imperceptible smile. “Miss Xia, you and I know very well who stole whose design. I’ll also give you a chance. I hope you can take the initiative to admit your mistake.”","Xia Tong’s expression turned cold as she retorted in exasperation, “What nonsense are you talking about?! You were the one who copied my work and stole my design, yet you’re still biting back. Since you’re so stubborn, I’ll see you in court!”","Xia Tong looked aggrieved and sounded like she was about to cry. “The work I painstakingly designed was plagiarized, and I’m being wronged. The truth is right in front of us, but you’re still unwilling to admit your mistake. Don’t you think you’ve gone too far?”","Qiao Xi’s eyelashes trembled slightly, and a trace of coldness flashed past her eyes. “It is quite excessive.”"]},{"number":968,"title":"Chapter 968 - She’s Also A Plagiarist","paragraphs":["Everyone thought that Qiao Xi had admitted it, and Xia Tong’s face was filled with pride. “I don’t want to waste everyone’s time either. As long as you apologize to me and draw a new design, I’ll forgive you! We’ll pretend that this didn’t happen and re-record it.”","Xia Tong immediately swallowed the words in her mouth. Just as she was about to retort, an angry voice came from backstage. “I don’t agree!”","Everyone looked in the direction of the voice and saw a man in a silver-gray suit walking out of the darkness. The critic who had been bribed by Xia Tong was about to berate him, but he was stunned when he saw the man’s face. “Mister... Mr. Lu?”","The man’s icy-cold gaze swept past everyone before finally looking at Qiao Xi, and then there was a trace of gentleness in his eyes.","Everyone present was familiar with this face. It often appeared on the covers of major fashion magazines. He could be said to be the prince of the fashion world—Lu Zhi, the president of Liuli Corporation.","“It’s Lu Zhi! He’s even more handsome in real life than on the cover of a magazine!”","“Lu Zhi was once a designer too. He should hate plagiarism! Moreover, Miss Xia only asked that designer to apologize. She didn’t ask for anything else. Why wouldn’t he agree?”","The judge did not dare to offend Lu Zhi and smiled obsequiously. “Mr. Lu, you probably don’t know yet that this designer plagiarized Miss Xia’s work. Now, Miss Xia is just asking the designer to apologize. You’re here today...”","“Why should she apologize?” Lu Zhi interrupted the other party mercilessly. He did not take the judge in front of him seriously at all and looked at Xia Tong coldly.","“You said that you designed this gown?” Lu Zhi questioned.","Seeing Lu Zhi’s deep eyes staring at her, Xia Tong instantly blushed shyly. “Yes... I did.”","She thought that Lu Zhi would praise her, but the next second, Lu Zhi suddenly sneered. “How did the design of Liuli’s chief designer, Gu Shan, from half a year ago become Miss Xia’s work? Miss Xia, why don’t you think about it carefully? Is your identity worthy of this design?”","Qiao Xi lazily crossed her arms and slowly curled the corners of her lips. She did not have any evidence to prove her innocence, but so what? As long as Lu Zhi appeared, who would doubt his words?","Xia Tong’s expression froze. The shyness and joy in her heart instantly vanished. She felt as if she had been struck by lightning. What did Lu Zhi mean? What did this have to do with Gu Shan?","When her manager, Chen Li, heard the name Gu Shan, her entire body could not help but tremble. She looked at Qiao Xi in disbelief and wished for nothing more than to bore a hole through her.","The audience also reacted and exclaimed, “So this design is Gu Shan’s work! In other words, Xia Tong first copied Gu Shan’s work, then Designer Qiao copied Xia Tong’s work?”","“Xia Tong is also a plagiarist! What right does she have to criticize others?”","Xia Tong gulped in horror and said in a dry voice, “Mr. Lu, this must be a misunderstanding. I didn’t...”","Lu Zhi did not want to talk nonsense with her. He instructed the staff member to play a video. In the video, a slim woman was sitting in front of Lu Zhi with her back facing the surveillance cameras.","“I’m finally done, but I still feel that something is wrong.”","Lu Zhi took the design and looked at it carefully. He smiled and said, “It’s already very good! Aren’t you asking too much of yourself?”","“Then I’ll keep it for now. Maybe I can use it one day.”","The video showed the design. It was exactly the same as Xia Tong’s. Instantly, the entire venue was silent.","“Let me explain to everyone. The woman in the video is Gu Shan and also my good friend. Miss Xia copied Gu Shan’s work.” Lu Zhi’s lips curled into a mocking smile.","The audience stood up one after another. The judges also looked at Xia Tong in disbelief. Even if she wanted to plagiarize, she could not plagiarize Gu Shan’s work! Was she courting death?","After a moment of silence, a fan roared crazily, “Xia Tong! Didn’t you say that you designed it yourself? How could you lie to us?”","“You actually dare to steal Gu Shan’s design? Do you think what you stole is yours? Do you think you’re better than Gu Shan? You really overestimate yourself!”","“No!” Xia Tong shouted in a panic. The blood in her body seemed to have frozen. She looked at the people around her. Everyone’s eyes were filled with disdain and disgust. She had never been so embarrassed."]},{"number":969,"title":"Chapter 969 - Confession And Apology","paragraphs":["Xia Tong lowered her head in embarrassment. She would not allow her reputation to be ruined just like that. The person who plagiarized Gu Shan was that small-time designer, not her. Why should she get scolded?","“Mr. Lu, I admit that I didn’t design this!”","Her lips were pale and trembling slightly. At this moment, she could only admit her mistake because she could not withstand the anger of Gu Shan’s fans. She gritted her teeth and said word by word, “This design originally belonged to Miss Qiao. She copied Gu Shan’s work!”","Now that her reputation was ruined, she would not let that b*tch be alone. She had only plagiarized an unknown designer, while that b*tch plagiarized Gu Shan!","As soon as she finished speaking, everyone was dumbfounded. The image of Xia Tong berating Designer Qiao appeared in front of their eyes, but in reality, it was Xia Tong who stole the design.","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. She was finally telling the truth? Unfortunately, it was too late!","Lu Zhi met Qiao Xi’s eyes and understood in his heart. He said with disdain, “Miss Xia, you really know how to slander others. Your name is clearly written on this design.”","At this moment, Xia Tong was extremely regretful. She originally wanted to use the design to prove her innocence, but now, she wished she had not taken that design. Unexpectedly, she shot herself in the foot.","She stood rooted to the ground, her forehead covered in sweat. At this point, she could only find someone to take the blame. She gritted her teeth. “It... It was my manager, Chen Li, who gave me the design.”","Chen Li’s expression was extremely ugly, but she was not in a rush to retort. She knew that Xia Tong had pushed her to take the blame, but she could not refuse because she knew that if Xia Tong was ruined, all her years of hard work would be in vain.","She lowered her head, tacitly agreeing to all of their crimes. However, how could Lu Zhi let them off so easily?","“Miss Xia, you mean that this design originally belonged to Miss Qiao? Your manager and the production team colluded and stole Miss Qiao’s design. They pretended that it was your work. Is that correct?” Lu Zhi asked.","That was indeed the truth, but when it was said so bluntly, Xia Tong wished she could find a hole to hide in.","Xia Tong forced herself to calm down. Fortunately, the recording was suspended now. After the matter was over, she would get the producer to tell the entire production team not to spread the news. As for the fans, she would give them more benefits. As long as she apologized sincerely now, this matter would be forgotten by everyone soon.","“Yes! It’s my fault! I was just muddle-headed, so I used someone else’s design. I’ve let everyone down.”","Xia Tong apologized with tears in her eyes, but there was no regret in her eyes. She had already apologized, but what about Designer Qiao? She needed to apologize even more. The crime of plagiarizing Gu Shan was very serious.","When she thought about this, Xia Tong suddenly looked at Qiao Xi with a face full of regret. “I’m sorry, Miss Qiao. I shouldn’t have used your design, but you should apologize to Gu Shan!”","Qiao Xi was angered to the point of laughing. This woman was really stubborn!","When Chen Li heard this, she said agitatedly, “Yes! Our Xia Tong was just rash, but Miss Qiao deliberately plagiarized Gu Shan’s work. You’ve offended Gu Shan. You should apologize to everyone!”","At this moment, Xia Tong was also staring fiercely at Qiao Xi. Her expression gradually turned ferocious, and her vicious gaze seemed to want to kill. If her reputation was ruined, she had to drag this b*tch down with her!","Just as the two sides were in a deadlock, Lu Zhi said calmly, “Xi Xi, take off your mask.”","Everyone was stunned. From what Lu Zhi said, he seemed to be very familiar with this designer.","Qiao Xi nodded, and her lips curled into a stunning smile. She used her fair and slender fingers to take off her mask, then a beautiful face appeared in front of everyone.","Today, Qiao Xi had changed her usual pure style and specially put on makeup with a strong aura. Her fiery red lips matched the tight dress she was wearing, making her look exceptionally enchanting like a blooming rose. She looked both pure and beautiful. She made others unable to stop themselves from admiring her.","However, even though she was very beautiful, it could not offset the fact that she had plagiarized. Why did Lu Zhi want her to take off her mask?","Just as everyone was making wild guesses, the female judge who had been standing beside Shen Yu suddenly said, “Wait! I think I’ve seen her before!”","Xia Tong had a look of disdain. What was there to be surprised about? They were all from the fashion industry, so it was not surprising that she had seen Qiao Xi before."]},{"number":970,"title":"Chapter 970 - Matters That Can Be Solved With","paragraphs":["“It’s you! I didn’t expect you to come too!” The female judge’s tone gradually became respectful. She was so excited that her voice was trembling. She hurriedly walked forward, but she was afraid of offending the other party and kept a certain distance from Qiao Xi. She asked tentatively, “May I know if you’re Gu Shan?”","Gu Shan?","With that said, the entire venue fell silent. Time seemed to have stopped at this moment.","Xia Tong’s pupils suddenly constricted, and her eyes which were filled with resentment were gradually enveloped by shock. The expression on her face gradually stiffened as she subconsciously looked at Qiao Xi.","At this moment, Qiao Xi’s eyes were bright like stars, and her entire body emitted a shocking charm. She looked at the female judge and said with a gentle tone, “Yes, I’m Gu Shan. Hello, Senior.”","The female judge was extremely excited. Although she was old enough to be Gu Shan’s mother, she was still a crazy fan of Gu Shan.","“Miss Gu Shan, I really like your work too much. I’ve collected all the designs you drew previously. I didn’t expect to see you in person here!”","Lu Zhi slowly walked to her side and said casually, “Gu Shan, you can’t keep a low profile anymore.”","Hearing Lu Zhi’s words, everyone was convinced that this 20-year-old girl in front of them was the famous Gu Shan. These words were like a heavy blow to Xia Tong’s heart. She almost stopped breathing. Her vision darkened, and she almost fainted.","Impossible! How could she be Gu Shan?!","Chen Li was silent for a moment before she reacted. She shouted, “You must be mistaken. It’s impossible for Gu Shan to be participating in the show!”","Lu Zhi turned around and said in a mocking tone, “Mistaken? Everyone should know that Gu Shan is Liuli’s chief designer. We’ve worked together for so many years. How could I be wrong? Moreover, who said that Gu Shan can’t participate in this show? She was invited to be a guest. Can’t she join?","“Gu Shan has both fame and fortune now. She’s also Shen Yu’s younger sister. She can’t be bothered to snatch anything from Miss Xia. She just wants to play. What can you do about it?”","Lu Zhi’s tone was light, but it was as if he had slapped Xia Tong hard. Cold sweat broke out on her forehead. She was in a sorry state.","At this moment, Shen Yu slowly said, “Director Feng, my sister’s design was stolen and she was wrongly accused of plagiarism. If Mr. Lu hadn’t happened to come and proved my sister’s innocence, what would have happened?”","The director and producer could only smile helplessly. “Mr. Shen, Mr. Lu, and Miss Gu Shan, I’m really sorry. It was our production team’s mistake. I’ll handle it according to the rules and compensate Miss Gu Shan for her psychological damage.”","Money was just a number to Qiao Xi. She did not lack money, and to Xia Tong, anything that could be solved with money was not a problem.","Qiao Xi slowly walked in front of Xia Tong and raised her eyebrows. “Miss Xia, shouldn’t you apologize to me?”","Xia Tong’s face darkened. She gritted her teeth and said with difficulty, “I’m... I’m sorry.”","“There’s no need for compensation. I just hope that Miss Xia and the production team will publicly apologize to me online. You won’t refuse, right?”","Public apology?","The director looked troubled. “Miss Gu Shan, this show is still being recorded. If we publicly apologize now, it’ll affect the show’s viewership ratings. This...”","Before Qiao Xi could speak, Lu Zhi snorted. “You’re unwilling? You made the chief designer of Liuli suffer. Shouldn’t you publicly apologize?”","The director lowered his head and remained silent like a primary school student who was being reprimanded in front of Lu Zhi.","“Moreover, Gu Shan is Mr. Shen’s younger sister! Mr. Shen’s parents dote on their daughter very much. If you offend her, do you think this show will still have a chance to air?” Lu Zhi said casually.","As soon as he finished speaking, Shen Xiu and Yu Qinghe walked over. Shen Xiu had always been expressionless, but Yu Qinghe was the daughter of a rich family. She had been doted on by her family since she was young. After she married Shen Xiu, she was also pampered. No one dared to offend her. Now that she saw her beloved daughter being bullied, her expression was terrifyingly gloomy.","The moment Shen Xiu and Yu Qinghe appeared, the director trembled in fear. He could not afford to offend Lu Zhi and the Shen family, so he could only let Xia Tong suffer. After all, Xia Tong was only from the Xia branch family. The Xia family would not go against the Shen family for her.","After thinking for a few seconds, the director smiled obsequiously. “Mr. Lu, don’t worry. We definitely won’t let Miss Gu Shan suffer in vain. The production team and Miss Xia will definitely apologize publicly online!"]},{"number":971,"title":"Chapter 971 - Asking For Too Much","paragraphs":["Lu Zhi smiled slightly. The director heaved a sigh of relief. “Xia Tong, just apologize! Miss Qiao doesn’t need you to compensate her for the psychological damage. It’s just a simple request. As long as you agree, this matter will be over.”","Xia Tong bit her lip tightly and looked at Qiao Xi with resentment. A public apology was equivalent to admitting that she stole someone else’s design. In that case, she would not be able to participate in the show anymore.","This little b*tch was quite capable. She actually used the Shen family and Lu Zhi’s power to suppress her. Did she really think that she was a pushover?","Xia Tong abruptly looked up and gritted her teeth. “Director, don’t forget who invested in this show. If I publicly apologize, it’ll be equivalent to me quitting the show. How will this show continue filming?”","The director looked embarrassed. 50 million was indeed not a small sum, but he could not offend the Shen family for this sum of money! After thinking for a moment, the director’s tone was a little stiff. “Xia Tong, you can’t say that. This is your fault, so you should apologize. Even if someone is protecting you, you can’t—”","“Miss Qiao, can we talk?” Xia Tong interrupted the director and looked at Qiao Xi with a gloomy expression.","Qiao Xi glanced at her coldly, and Xia Tong only felt extremely embarrassed. When had she ever been so embarrassed? She forcefully suppressed her anger. “I’ll get straight to the point. How much is your design? I’ll buy it. We can then forget about the public apology.”","Everyone was stunned. Xia Tong wanted to buy Gu Shan’s design and participate in the competition with it?","The venue was silent for a moment. Seeing this, Shen Yu’s fans cursed, “Is this person crazy?! She stole someone else’s design but refuses to apologize. She even wants to spend money to buy it?”","“Gu Shan is the chief designer of Liuli and Shen Yu’s younger sister. Would she lack money? She just wants an explanation!”","Xia Tong heard the mocking voices around her and sneered in her heart. This small-time designer’s surname was Qiao, and she was not Shen Yu’s biological sister. The Shen family indeed did not lack money, but it did not mean that this young lady did not lack money. Xia Tong naively thought that as long as the money she offered was enough, Qiao Xi would not pursue the matter.","“Miss Qiao, how much do you want? Just tell me.”","Lu Zhi’s eyes turned cold. She wanted to send Qiao Xi away with just money? Was she joking? Gu Shan’s work was unique and could not be bought by money. He was just about to go forward and berate her when Qiao Xi suddenly raised her eyes and said with a smile, “Sure.”","Everyone was stunned, and Lu Zhi swallowed the words in his mouth. Xia Tong did not expect it to be resolved so easily. A trace of disdain flashed past her eyes.","She knew that with Gu Shan’s current status and strength, her designs might cost hundreds of thousands or even a million yuan, but this was not a problem. Her sugar daddy had already invested 50 million yuan, so she did not lack that sum of money.","“50 million!”","Qiao Xi spoke indifferently, but it was suffused with a trace of irrefutable dignity.","Lu Zhi, who was in a fit of anger: “...”","Everyone was dumbfounded. Only Shen Yu smiled as if he had expected this.","The words ’50 million’ echoed in Xia Tong’s mind. She almost vomited blood. Her face alternated between green and white as she gritted her teeth. “Miss Qiao, stop joking.”","Qiao Xi lazily crossed her arms. “Do I look like I’m joking? Could it be that my design isn’t worth 50 million?”","The design was hers, so she had the right to set the price. If Xia Tong thought it was too expensive, she could choose not to buy it. She just had to publicly apologize online.","Xia Tong shouted in exasperation, “No matter how good your design is, it’s just a piece of paper. How can it be worth 50 million? Even if you want money, you can’t casually state a price! If you continue to fool around, our deal will be canceled!”","“The deal is canceled?” Qiao Xi laughed out loud and raised her eyebrows. “Miss Xia, looks like you still don’t understand. You stole the design. You refused to apologize and insisted on buying my design. I agreed to your request, but you’re canceling it now. If you’re not sincere about buying it, then forget it.”","Xia Tong was furious, and her voice became sharp. “You’re asking for 50 million because you know that someone invested 50 million in the production team for me. You’re clearly teasing me!”","Even though she was Gu Shan, a top fashion designer, she was actually asking for 50 million for a piece of design. This was clearly an exorbitant price. Xia Tong gritted her teeth and said, “I can only give you two million!”","Shen Yu frowned. Did she think she was giving the money to a beggar?"]},{"number":972,"title":"Chapter 972 - The 50 Million Investment Is Gone","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi did not even bother to look at her and said casually, “Miss Xia, you should know that I’m the chief designer of Liuli. The work I design can bring Liuli a lot of money. Although I’m not too satisfied with this gown, it can still bring Liuli at least 50 million yuan. If you want to buy this design, you have to compensate us for our losses. Otherwise, why should I sell it to you?”","Everyone nodded in unison and instantly felt that Qiao Xi’s asking price was not high anymore.","Lu Zhi stood up. “That’s right. Any one of Gu Shan’s designs can bring huge benefits to Liuli, and 50 million is nothing. Miss Xia, if you want to buy it, take out the money. If you refuse to, apologize publicly. It’s your choice.”","Xia Tong was so angry that her face turned red. 50 million for a piece of paper? She was not stupid! She did not expect this designer to be so greedy. She asked for 50 million without any room for discussion.","“Miss Xia, since you’re neither willing to apologize nor pay, then don’t blame me for being nasty,” Shen Yu said coldly, a trace of ruthlessness flashing past his eyes.","Xia Tong’s face was pale, and the director lowered his head with an embarrassed expression. He was already cursing Xia Tong and Qiao Xi in his heart. Neither of these two women was willing to give in, so this show could not continue. On one hand, it was the Shen family and Lu Zhi. On the other hand, it was the investor. He did not dare to offend either of them and could only be stuck in the middle.","Xia Tong was so afraid that her entire body was trembling. However, on second thought, this designer was not the biological daughter of the Shen family, and she was from the Xia family. Why would the Shen family offend the Xia family for an unrelated person? Shen Yu was probably just saying it casually. Would he really attack her?","Her expression softened, and her tone was exceptionally arrogant. “It’s not that I’m unwilling to accept it, but Miss Qiao, you’re insincere. You’re asking for 50 million right away, so forget it. I’ll quit the show.”","With that, Xia Tong and Chen Li turned to leave.","“Miss Xia, in that case, let’s see who between the Xia and Shen families is stronger!” Shen Yu said casually, but his body was filled with strong killing intent.","No! No way! Shen Yu would not attack her for an unrelated person. Moreover, if he wanted to sue her for plagiarism, he would have to go through legal procedures. Why would Shen Yu waste his precious time for a designer?","Xia Tong’s breathing became irregular as cold sweat broke out on her back. She gritted her teeth and left as if she was escaping.","The recording studio was silent for a moment. The director’s phone suddenly rang. It was a message from the investor. He clearly said that if Xia Tong withdrew, he would withdraw his investment.","The director’s expression was ugly as he looked at Shen Yu helplessly. “Mr. Shen, this...”","If the 50 million yuan investment was gone, shouldn’t the Shen family take responsibility? After all, this series of events happened because of Qiao Xi!","Shen Yu glanced at him coldly and said slowly, “Director Feng, don’t forget your promise. I hope to see you publicly apologize online today.”","With that, Shen Yu and the others left, leaving the production team looking at each other.","...","At this moment, in the president’s office, Xiang Rong was reporting to Gu Zheng while trembling. “President Gu, I promise you that I’ll investigate this matter thoroughly and strictly deal with people who have been bribed!”","Xiang Rong never expected that the young lady who saved his daughter was actually Gu Zheng’s wife! Hence, Gu Zheng directly looked for him today. When he saw Gu Zheng, Xiang Rong was so nervous that his forehead was covered in sweat. He was afraid that this man would get angry and tear down the entire television station.","After hearing about what had happened at the scene, Xiang Rong did not hesitate to cancel the 50 million investment. It did not matter if Xia Tong did not participate. He would never allow anyone to secretly manipulate the results of the competition. Those who helped Xia Tong cheat would also be punished. He only hoped that Gu Zheng would not blame them.","Gu Zheng leaned lazily against the sofa, his long fingers tapping lightly on the table. “Who invested 50 million?”","“Uhh... It’s the young master of ‘Xingxin Foods’ in Luo City.”","Gu Zheng stopped what he was doing. His voice was cold, but it made one shudder. “Those people stole my wife’s design, and the producer also helped Xia Tong hide the truth. This must be all his doing!”","Xiang Rong nodded. “Actually, the development of Xingxin Foods has been getting worse over the years, but their young master still splurges all day long. For Xia Tong, he spent 50 million yuan. He doesn’t even consider the overall situation. He’s just a good-for-nothing.”"]},{"number":973,"title":"Chapter 973 - Young Madam Is A Femme Fatale","paragraphs":["Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent as he said casually, “Song Shijing, how long do you think Xingxin can last if it’s handed to this good-for-nothing?”","Song Shijing replied seriously, “According to my investigation, the young master of Xingxin Foods is Xia Tong’s fan. Because he embezzled a sum of money from the company, it’s difficult for the company to operate. If he really inherits the company, the company probably won’t last a month.”","Gu Zheng nodded thoughtfully. “Since Xingxin Foods is going to go bankrupt sooner or later, why don’t I acquire the company so that it won’t be ruined in his hands?”","His casual words had decided the fate of the company, making Xiang Rong tremble in fear. It was said that Gu Zheng was swift and decisive. His tone was clearly so calm, but he spoke in an imposing manner.","Suddenly, Gu Zheng’s gaze landed on Xiang Rong. He broke out in a cold sweat and said, “President Gu, I didn’t manage this matter well. I...”","“I heard that you and Xi Xi are old acquaintances. I’ll invest in this show!”","The station head was stunned.","Gu Zheng said casually, “Record the show again. Choose ordinary people to participate in the competition.”","Xiang Rong gasped. Not only did Gu Zheng not pursue his mistake, but he was also willing to invest. It seemed that everything Gu Zheng did was to make Mrs. Gu happy!","With Gu Zheng’s investment, the show continued filming, but all of Xia Tong’s scenes were cut.","Song Shiyu was confused. “Can this show be popular? What’s the president thinking? He’ll only lose money after investing so much!”","Song Shijing glanced at him and said meaningfully, “The president has so much money, so it doesn’t matter if he loses some. Moreover, he’s not investing in this show to earn money. It’s just that Young Madam is participating in the recording. He doesn’t want her to work for nothing.”","Song Shiyu nodded, then said something shocking, “I know. Young Madam made the usually calm president spend so much money to support her. She’s really a femme fatale!”","Song Shijing frowned. Forget it. His brother’s IQ was hopeless.","After the recording, Qiao Xi removed her makeup in the most luxurious dressing room. Shen Yu walked in and gestured for the makeup artist to leave. At this moment, there were only the two of them in the empty dressing room.","Shen Yu leaned against the chair beside her and handed her a photo. There was a name written on the back. “He’s the one investigating your identity.”","That person was called Meng Fan. Qiao Xi had never heard of this name, and she had no recollection of this surname. If he was the one who spread the news that the blood of the divine physician’s descendant could cure all poisons, it would mean that he was going against Shen Yu. Why would he do this?","In the photo was a handsome man with red hair. His eyes were filled with sinisterness, and he exuded a cold aura. He was like a venomous snake that flicked out its tongue, making one shudder.","Shen Yu’s expression was serious. Before he came to look for Qiao Xi, he had already gone to see Gu Zheng. These few days, the two of them had been secretly investigating and found this man called Meng Fan almost at the same time. Gu Zheng did not know this person either.","Shen Yu had also asked a few juniors, but they said they did not know him. How did this person know this secret?","“Little Six, do you still remember the Situ family?”","Qiao Xi nodded. Old Master Situ was very kind and even gave her a hollowed-out porcelain vase. He did not have the airs of an elder at all.","“Maybe this matter has something to do with Situ...” Shen Yu shook his head. “No, no! That can’t be!”","“By the way, I heard that Gu Zheng’s younger brother also came to T City to look for you.” Shen Yu quickly changed the topic.","Qiao Xi was slightly surprised, then took a deep breath and said, “Meng Fan deliberately spread the news, but he didn’t say that I’m the descendant of the divine physician. I guess he must know my identity, but we don’t know him. This means that his name is fake, and his identity can’t be exposed.”","Shen Yu was instantly enlightened. If Meng Fan could not expose his identity, it meant that his identity was very special.","Qiao Xi stood up and left. As soon as she left, she saw Gu Yao standing around the corner with a cute young lady. The other fans had all left following the celebrities they liked. Only this young lady saw Gu Yao at a glance and took the initiative to talk to him. “Hello, are you a friend of Designer Qiao?”","Gu Yao was wearing a long khaki windbreaker. His soft hair was hanging low, and his eyes were clear and deep. His skin was smooth and fair, like a cute little puppy. To be honest, he and that young lady were quite compatible."]},{"number":974,"title":"Chapter 974 - My Teammates Say I’m Like A Primary School Student","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi stood at the door and observed Gu Yao. She should have known that Gu Yao could not be Huang Lilan’s biological son. With Huang Lilan’s looks and vicious thoughts, how could she have given birth to such a handsome and kind Gu Yao? Huang Lilan’s son should be a scheming man like Lu Yan.","Gu Yao’s eyes had always been clear. The smile on his face was like a spring breeze. He was a bright young man who exuded a gentle aura. One look from him could capture the heart of a young woman, but he knew nothing about his charm.","Hearing the lady’s voice, Gu Yao slowly looked up at her and replied softly, “Yes.”","His voice matched his appearance very well. The young man’s handsome voice was very gentle. The lady’s cheeks gradually turned red as she fell in love with him.","The two of them chatted, and Gu Yao asked about what had happened before. The lady answered truthfully. The corners of his mouth curled into a smile, but it did not reach his eyes.","He was tall and had his head lowered. The lady raised her head when talking to him. The way the two of them talked made them look like a beautiful oil painting. The lady could not extricate herself at this moment. She was deeply immersed in his smile, and her eyes were filled with love.","However, the next second—","Gu Yao said, “Damn! Are you kidding me?! She wanted to buy Qiao Xi’s design? So what if she’s rich?! No matter how rich she is, can she be richer than Qiao Xi? If she’s so awesome, why doesn’t she buy Gu Corporation?!”","The lady’s expression suddenly stiffened, and the love in her eyes was gradually covered by shock.","Qiao Xi: “...” Why did such a handsome little puppy have a mouth?","However, Gu Yao did not feel that something was wrong at all and continued talking, “She actually dares to say that Qiao Xi plagiarized? Even if Qiao Xi were to draw something with her feet, it’ll still be better than the work of that little b*tch, Xia Tong! Doesn’t she know that she’ll be struck by lightning if she pretends to be cool? Who does she think she is?!”","The young lady stood where she was, the corners of her mouth twitching slightly. She looked heartbroken. This man was so gentle and loving when he did not speak. His casual actions were so seductive, but when he did speak...","Gu Yao did not care about the lady’s expression at all and shouted indignantly, “That bullsh*t director also helped Xia Tong hide the truth and even dared to delete the surveillance footage! Are these people tired of living? I’m going to settle the score with them and let them know the consequences of offending Qiao Xi.”","He was about to leave when he suddenly realized that a young lady was still beside him. The originally gentle young lady looked at him with disdain and shook her head helplessly. “Sir, please shut up, okay?”","With that, the lady left as if she was escaping. Perhaps this was what it meant when one’s heart was dead!","Gu Yao frowned. It seemed that what unfolded was more infuriating than he had imagined. Xia Tong’s skin was thicker than the city walls. He had to avenge Qiao Xi!","At this moment, Qiao Xi slowly walked forward and looked at him with a strange expression. She sighed helplessly. “Gu Yao, do you know why you can’t find a girlfriend?”","Gu Yao frowned unhappily. “Qiao Xi!”","After being dissatisfied, Gu Yao started to be curious again. He leaned over and asked, “Li Xing’er asked me the same question. I’m not too sure either. Tell me!”","Qiao Xi looked at him with sympathy. “It’s fine. It’s good this way.”","Originally, Qiao Xi planned to return to Li City after filming the show, but now that Gu Yao had rushed over, Qiao Xi decided to stay in T City for a few days. Coincidentally, Gu Zheng had also bought a villa in T City. Although no one had lived in it for a long time, someone would tidy it up regularly.","When the few of them returned to the villa, it was already evening. On the way back, Gu Yao heard Qiao Xi’s story and found out that Xia Tong was from Luo City’s Xia family.","“The Xia family has been so annoying since long ago!” Gu Yao glanced at Qiao Xi and said gently, “Ignore them. They’re just a group of small fries. They’re not worth your anger. Forget about today’s matter. Let’s play games!”","Qiao Xi’s eyes instantly lit up when she heard that they were playing games. She had just taken out her phone when she heard Gu Yao say with a grin, “Let me tell you, I’m really awesome now. My teammates even praise me when I’m playing games.”","“What do they praise you for?” Qiao Xi had seen Gu Yao’s gaming skills before. They were really tragic. It was a pity that he looked like an esports big shot.","Gu Yao raised his head and smiled proudly. “My teammates all say that I’m like a primary school student. Aren’t they just praising me for being young?”","Qiao Xi: “...” ‘Gu Yao, are you sure they’re praising you? The hidden meaning of saying that you’re like a primary school student is that you’re as lousy at playing games!’"]},{"number":975,"title":"Chapter 975 - 5: Justice","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi sized up Gu Yao with a serious expression. She really suspected that there was something wrong with Gu Yao’s IQ. If she had time, she would bring him for a check-up. If they could find out the problem earlier, she could treat him earlier.","The two of them played a few rounds of games before leaning against the sofa and scrolling through their phones in boredom. Gu Yao suddenly sat up and hesitated. In the end, he picked up his phone and handed it to Qiao Xi. “Take a look.”","Qiao Xi took the phone and glanced at it, instantly speechless.","[Xia Tong: Due to personal reasons, I’ve decided to quit the show ‘The Birth Of A Designer.’ I won’t participate in this program anymore. If the competition loses its fairness, it’ll be meaningless. If the program team insists on protecting a certain someone, then there’s no need for me to join it.]","As soon as this statement was posted, it instantly attracted many netizens to watch. Although Xia Tong was not an A-list celebrity, she had good resources and had been popular for a period of time. She was the most famous among the participants. Why would she suddenly announce her withdrawal?","Fans left comments: [Our Tongtong has been wronged. What exactly is going on? Does anyone know?]","[This show is a fashion design competition. Could it be that someone is secretly manipulating the show? I remember Chen Li saying that although Tong Tong has never systematically learned design, she’s very talented. The production team must be biased toward a certain contestant, so Tong Tong decided to withdraw.]","[Tong Tong has always had a good temper. They must have crossed the line to make her so angry! @TheBirthOfADesigner]","The fans were indignant and scolded the production team. The director’s and producers’ accounts were filled with criticisms.","Qiao Xi kept having the feeling that this matter was a little strange. Xia Tong plagiarized the design and only announced her withdrawal from the competition after the matter blew up. Previously, the production team was biased toward Xia Tong because of the 50 million investment. Now that the investment was gone, the production team would naturally not tolerate Xia Tong or take the blame for her.","Xia Tong should know this very well. At this moment, she should hide and try her best to reduce her presence. She should be afraid of being exposed. There were so many people present who could testify. Her lie would soon be exposed. She was undoubtedly courting death by doing this.","Why did she send this message? Did someone order her to send it?","Even Gu Yao looked shocked. “Is Xia Tong crazy? She’s maligning the production team like this. Once the director posts the surveillance footage online, not only will Xia Tong’s reputation be ruined, but she might even receive a lawyer’s letter from the production team suing her for slander! Is she crazy?”","That was right. Normal people would not do such a thing. Why was she doing this?","Despite the crazy number of comments from the fans, Xia Tong did not step forward to clarify anything. The production team did not want to blow up the matter and have it affect the viewership ratings of the show, but since Xia Tong wanted to ruin the production team’s reputation, they could not swallow their anger.","Xia Tong was willing to risk being sued to do this. Was there a more tempting condition for her to do this?","Qiao Xi looked at the comments and suddenly saw a familiar username. It was Xia Mengyan!","Xia Mengyan: [Justice is in the heart. You’re all my family. Why can’t you go home and talk? Why do you have to create a scene online? Moreover, this is clearly your fault. You should apologize to her and delete the message immediately.]","Xia Mengyan was a famous perfumer, but she had just returned to the country, so she naturally did not have as many fans as Xia Tong. Soon, Xia Tong’s fans found this comment. Xia Mengyan and Xia Tong both had the surname Xia. It seemed that they were relatives, but why was Xia Mengyan speaking up for another person?","Xia Tong’s fans were instantly angry. They immediately ran to Xia Mengyan’s account and questioned why she did not help her sister. Tong Tong was bullied by the production team, but her family did not help her. As Tong Tong’s family member, she scolded her instead. It was really too much.","Everyone rushed to Xia Tong’s account, and the comments section instantly exploded. Xia Mengyan’s fans were all stunned. Before they could retort, Xia Mengyan closed the comments section.","Gu Yao was burning with anger. “Xia Mengyan is too scheming. She pretended to speak up for you and was even scolded by Xia Tong’s fans. With her words, those fans will soon know that you’re the one who’s in conflict with Xia Tong!”","Qiao Xi reacted. She knew why Xia Tong had sent this message. She was instructed by Xia Mengyan. She smiled, then picked up her phone.","“What are you doing?” Gu Yao asked.","“I’m going to call Xia Tong.” Qiao Xi’s words made Gu Yao look puzzled."]},{"number":976,"title":"Chapter 976 - Testing Xia Tong","paragraphs":["The call was connected, but the other party did not pick up for a long time. Qiao Xi nodded. “As expected. She has the guts to spout nonsense online, but she doesn’t dare to answer my call.”","After hanging up, Qiao Xi stood up and put on her jacket. Gu Yao hurriedly asked, “Where are you going?”","A trace of danger flashed past Qiao Xi’s eyes. “She’s not answering my calls, so I can only look for her myself. I want to see if she dares to spout nonsense in front of me.”","Gu Yao: “...” It was too scary! Qiao Xi looked like a tigress when she was angry!","Qiao Xi drove straight to Xia Tong’s studio. She guessed that the entire studio was thinking of ways to protect her reputation. Moreover, everyone unanimously agreed to Xia Tong’s message, but it was useless no matter what they did.","After getting out of the car, Qiao Xi knocked on the door forcefully. The door was closed as if no one was inside, but she knew that those people were hiding inside. She unhurriedly took out a thin metal wire from her bag and casually fiddled with the door lock a few times before it opened with a click.","Gu Yao looked at her in shock. He did not expect his sister-in-law to have such skills. What did she not know?","At this moment, everyone in the room was looking at them with terrified expressions. Qiao Xi crossed her arms and greeted everyone with a smile. “Everyone’s here! Then why didn’t you open the door?”","Gu Yao: “...” He really admired Qiao Xi’s calm temperament. She had clearly broken the lock and was discovered, yet she was still so calm.","Chen Li was discussing countermeasures with Xia Tong when she looked up and saw Qiao Xi and Gu Yao. She instantly roared, “Who let you in?”","Qiao Xi chuckled. “I forced my way in with my own ability!”","The studio was silent. Chen Li almost spat out a mouthful of blood. She was furious. “You’re not welcome here. Please leave!”","Qiao Xi paid no attention to her at all. Her icy-cold gaze landed on Xia Tong, but her tone was very gentle. “Miss Xia, don’t you know why you withdrew from the competition? Won’t your face turn red when you casually post false news online?”","Xia Tong took a few steps back guiltily. “I can post whatever I want. I didn’t name anyone. What does it have to do with you?!”","“But I know that the person you’re talking about is me! I find that statement of yours an eyesore! Moreover, you’re the one who did something wrong. What right do you have to criticize me? I’m very curious. You clearly know that I have evidence, yet you still dare to provoke me. Why is that?”","Xia Tong’s and Chen Li’s expressions were ugly. Xia Tong bit her lip and did not say a word, but Qiao Xi did not intend to let her off. She continued to ask, “You know that doing this will anger the production team and ruin your reputation, but you still took the risk. Did someone order you to do this?”","As soon as these words were spoken, Xia Tong’s expression clearly changed. Qiao Xi smiled lightly and stared fixedly at her, not missing the slightest change in expression.","“It’s Xia Mengyan?”","Chen Li’s and Xia Tong’s bodies stiffened. Xia Tong pretended to be calm, but the emotions in her eyes betrayed her.","“She gave you money? What did she promise you that you didn’t hesitate to ruin yourself to work for her? Or did the Xia family pressure you so much that you had no choice but to agree?”","Xia Tong lowered her head and bit her lip. Qiao Xi said indifferently, “I have to say that Xia Mengyan’s plan this time isn’t bad. She asked you to post the news online first, then she stood up to protect me and was scolded by many fans. When the truth is revealed, your reputation will be ruined, but Xia Mengyan will be praised by everyone. I have to thank her. At that time, she’ll appear and say that we’re cousins with a good relationship. I’ll inexplicably become Xia Mengyan’s stepping stone.”","Under Qiao Xi’s questioning, Chen Li’s and Xia Tong’s breathing almost stopped, and their faces were ashen. Qiao Xi understood in her heart that all her guesses were correct.","“Thank you for the clues. I’ll take my leave.”","Chen Li and Xia Tong looked at Qiao Xi’s back view and gnashed their teeth in hatred. They clearly did not say a word. Qiao Xi had guessed everything herself.","Qiao Xi and Gu Yao left. Gu Yao sighed. “I suddenly pity them.”","“Why should you pity them? I didn’t force them. I guessed everything myself from the beginning. I can only say that I’m too smart, while they’re not good at hiding themselves.”","As soon as she finished speaking, Qiao Xi turned around and closed the door. The door was locked, and it was no different from when she first arrived. She sighed. “Look at how kind I am!”"]},{"number":977,"title":"Chapter 977 - The Internet Has No Memory","paragraphs":["The two of them returned to Longwan Residential. Gu Yao was still puzzled. “Is it fun for Xia Mengyan to pretend? This clearly has nothing to do with her, but she insisted on interfering.”","At this moment, the netizens were still discussing fervently. The production team finally came forward to clarify the matter. First, they criticized Xia Tong for distorting the truth. She was clearly the one who used her connections to enter the production team and secretly manipulated things, but she was the one who slandered the production team. It was good that they were no longer working with her. They did not want to work with Xia Tong either and even decided to sue her for slander.","Immediately after, the production team sent another message to apologize to the chief designer of Liuli, whose real name was Qiao Xi. According to Gu Zheng’s request, they explained the situation clearly and deeply reflected on their mistakes. They also expressed their sincere apology to Miss Gu Shan.","The two pieces of news from the production team explained the matter very clearly. Everyone also reacted.","[Ah! My worldview has collapsed, so the person who plagiarized is Xia Tong! She stole Gu Shan’s design and even accused Gu Shan of plagiarism! Is she crazy?]","[The production team is in the wrong too! They helped Xia Tong hide the truth for the sake of investing. If the designer wasn’t Gu Shan, that person would definitely have been misunderstood. Fortunately, Lu Zhi was able to stand up for her and prove her innocence.]","[The production team has apologized, which means that they’ve already repented. However, not only did Xia Tong not apologize, but she even continued to distort the truth. Why is she so shameless?!]","[I admit that I spoke a little too loudly earlier. I’m sorry, Gu Shan. We were wrong.]","The internet instantly exploded as netizens berated Xia Tong. Soon, someone reacted. [Right, it seems that someone tried to persuade Xia Tong in the comments section earlier!]","[I remember too. That person is Xia Tong and Gu Shan’s family member. I think her name is Xia Mengyan. She said that it was Xia Tong’s fault and even asked Xia Tong to apologize to Gu Shan. At that time, she was even scolded badly by Xia Tong’s fans. My heart aches for her!]","[Looks like Xia Mengyan and Gu Shan have a good relationship! When she heard that her cousin was wronged, she immediately stood up for her. Even though she was insulted by everyone, she didn’t delete the comment. I want to have such a cousin too.]","Just as everyone was praising her, someone said in confusion: [That’s not right! I remember that Xia Mengyan framed Qiao Xi before and caused an uproar on the internet. Indeed, the internet doesn’t have memories.]","[That’s all in the past. It must be a misunderstanding! If Xia Mengyan could stand up for her, why would she frame her?]","Qiao Xi looked at the comments online, and the corners of her mouth curled up slightly. A single comment was enough to clear Xia Mengyan’s name, offsetting the scandal of her trying to be a mistress and snatching someone else’s fiance.","Since Xia Mengyan liked acting so much, Qiao Xi would continue acting with her!","Qiao Xi raised her eyes and looked at Gu Zheng. She knew that it was Gu Zheng’s doing that the production team apologizes so readily. Actually, she did not care if the production team apologized or not. She was very curious about what benefits Xia Mengyan had given Xia Tong to make her agree to such an unreasonable request.","Gu Zheng raised his cup and took a sip of coffee. His fingers tapped lightly on the table as he asked with a smile, “Do you want to know what benefits Xia Mengyan gave her?”","“Actually, it’s very easy to guess. The fact that Xia Tong plagiarized can’t be hidden. Instead of struggling at death’s door in the entertainment industry, she could take this opportunity to leave. At this moment, Xia Tong seems to be despised by everyone and has no choice but to leave the industry. In reality, she’s willing to withdraw from the industry. The Xia family gave her a guarantee that she could still have money to spend even after she leaves the industry. She naturally agreed.”","To put it simply, Xia Tong entered the entertainment industry to earn money. Even if she had to leave the entertainment industry now, she would be earning more than before. Moreover, she did not have to be insulted. What reason did she have to refuse?","“Shares?” Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows and realized that Xia Mengyan must have given Xia Tong shares. Although Xia Tong was not a popular celebrity, her salary was not low either. Since Xia Mengyan could make her give up her reputation and future, she must have promised Xia Tong a lot of shares.","However, why did Xia Mengyan have to pay such a huge price just for a good reputation?","While Qiao Xi was still puzzled, Xia Mengyan suddenly started a live broadcast. Back then, when Xia Mengyan was in the midst of a scandal where she was said to have snatched someone else’s marriage contract, a group of brainless fans still believed that their idol would not do such a thing. Coupled with the Xia family spending a lot of money on public relations, they quickly suppressed public opinion. Now that everyone was talking about this new incident, the netizens were not as angry as before.","Moreover, Xia Mengyan had stood up for Qiao Xi this time. Not only had she cleared her name, but she had also attracted a large number of fans."]},{"number":978,"title":"Chapter 978 - Sudden Family Banquet","paragraphs":["For the sake of her reputation, Xia Mengyan would do anything. However, was this really useful?","Qiao Xi entered the live-stream. Xia Mengyan was wearing a very simple white dress, and her makeup was very pure. She smiled gently. She did not go straight to the point but played a piano piece for everyone. She sat on the chair, and her hair fell slightly as she played, giving others a feeling of peace.","Xia Mengyan was the daughter of the Xia family. She had a noble identity and was a famous perfumer. Even if she was not a celebrity, she had many fans.","After she finished playing a song, she established a perfect image in everyone’s hearts. Then, she got to the main topic and slowly said, “Regarding what has happened online recently, I’ll seriously explain it to everyone. Xia Tong and Gu Shan are indeed my cousins, but Xia Tong is a cousin from the Xia branch family while Gu Shan is my biological aunt’s daughter.”","After a pause, Xia Mengyan said helplessly, “Xi Xi doesn’t often return to the Xia family, and Xia Tong doesn’t keep in contact with us, so the two of them don’t know each other. I didn’t expect Xia Tong to use the Xia family’s power to suppress Xi Xi.","“After I found out about this, I immediately went to Xia Tong’s comment section to persuade her. At that time, I just wanted to protect Xi Xi. I was very angry that Xia Tong had wronged Xi Xi. I didn’t think too much about it and directly commented. I was also insulted by some fans, but even so, I didn’t regret it. Fortunately, the person those fans were scolding was me. If they knew that the person Xia Tong was talking about was Xi Xi, they would definitely have run to Xi Xi’s account and insulted her.","“The misunderstanding between me and Xi Xi has been resolved. We have a good relationship!”","Qiao Xi smiled. If she were a netizen, she would definitely be deceived by Xia Mengyan’s appearance.","At this moment, the netizens in the live-stream felt even sorrier for Xia Mengyan. The netizens’ impression of her increased. She would rather suffer insults to protect her younger cousin. Why would someone who doted on her younger cousin snatch her younger cousin’s fiance? What had happened before must have been a misunderstanding.","Xia Tong’s outcome was very tragic. She quickly announced her withdrawal from the entertainment industry and issued an apology.","Xia Mengyan reposted the apology statement and added: [Tong Tong, I’m very happy that you realized your mistake. Don’t blame me for exposing you previously. I’m doing this for your own good. No matter which one of you made a mistake, I’ll point it out. Only then will you improve.]","After that, Xia Tong publicly apologized to Qiao Xi. This way, Xia Mengyan would become a hero again. As for why Xia Tong apologized, it did not matter if it was because of the production team’s reprimand or the pressure from the Shen family and Gu Zheng.","At this moment, everyone agreed that Xia Tong did not want to apologize at first. It was only when Xia Mengyan came forward to persuade her that she realized her mistake and chose to apologize.","When the live broadcast was about to end, Xia Mengyan said with a smile, “Everyone, I still have something to do, so I’ll go offline first. Tomorrow is the family banquet. Everyone in the Xia family has to gather at the old residence, so I have to go back and help Grandpa and Grandma prepare.”","When they heard this, the fans asked curiously: [If everyone from the Xia family goes back, will Qiao Xi go too?]","Xia Mengyan nodded and said, “Of course. If there’s nothing important going on, everyone in the Xia family will go back.”","[Speaking of which, it’s all thanks to Mengyan that Xia Tong was able to apologize. Qiao Xi will probably thank Mengyan in person when she goes back tomorrow!]","After the live broadcast ended, Qiao Xi threw her phone on the sofa and sneered. It turned out that Xia Mengyan wanted to use public opinion to make her return to the Xia family!","The news that the Xia family was holding a family banquet spread throughout high society. Everyone was very curious about whether Qiao Xi would return. After all, the grudge between the Yin and Xia families back then was no secret.","Many curious people sent Qiao Xi WeChat messages. [Have you seen Xia Mengyan’s live broadcast? Will you go to the Xia family’s house?]","Gu Zheng said casually, “We can go, but not this time.”","As soon as he finished speaking, a trace of coldness flashed past his eyes. He suddenly tightened his grip on the cup, and his fingers turned slightly white. His voice was extremely cold. “The Xia family must have spent so much effort to lure you there to obtain greater benefits from you.”","“Could it be my blood?” Qiao Xi was slightly surprised. Previously, her eldest brother had reminded her that Meng Fan had spread the news that her blood could cure all poisons. The Xia family had also been looking for the descendant of the divine physician. It was very likely that the Xia family had set up a trap to lure her to the Xia family for her blood."]},{"number":979,"title":"Chapter 979 - Mrs. Gu Has Gained Weight","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi had taken the opportunity to check Xia Mengyan’s body but found nothing. However, she had an inexplicable feeling that there seemed to be a type of poison lingering in Xia Mengyan’s body.","Her intuition had always been very accurate. As a doctor, this was a special ability. She was able to confirm that the Xia family had been poisoned. However, this poison was very mild and would not affect their lives for the time being. However, it was hard to say what would happen to them in the future. Hence, after the Xia family found out that the blood of the divine physician’s successor could detoxify poisons, they started looking everywhere for that person.","Gu Zheng shook his head and said firmly, “The Xia family probably doesn’t know that you’re that person yet. The person who spread the news is indeed up to no good, but...”","He paused for a moment and continued, “But once that person reveals that you’re the descendant of the divine physician, you’ll be equivalent to a blood bank. Many people will target you.”","Qiao Xi had long realized this. Her blood could detoxify poisons. This was a skill and also a calamity. However, her blood could only detoxify one person. She had already helped Gu Zheng detoxify the poison and the two of them were already connected by blood. Her blood was useless to others.","“Everyone hopes to get your blood. If the Xia family or others target you at this time, can that person still be indifferent? If the Xia family attacks first, they’ll undoubtedly be courting death. Before they can succeed, they’ll already be devoured by other forces.","“I’m guessing that everyone is just watching now. No one dares to make the first move as they’re afraid that they’ll become the target of others. This way, you’ll be safer. There’ll be another group of people protecting you.”","Qiao Xi was dumbstruck. Everyone wanted her blood, but only one person could obtain it in the end. If the Xia family really made a move, the others would first eliminate the Xia family. The Xia family probably understood this logic, so they would not rashly make a move.","It was because of human greed that she became the target of protection. However, no one knew that she had already detoxified Gu Zheng’s poison.","Qiao Xi did not notice a trace of abnormality flash past Gu Zheng’s eyes. He cleared his throat and said, “The current situation isn’t very serious yet. They don’t know your identity yet, and the Xia family is only suspicious, so they want to keep you by their side.”","“That makes sense. They want to seize the initiative and keep me by their side. Once they confirm it, they can attack me. At that time, it’ll be too late for others to attack.” Qiao Xi nodded.","Suddenly, Gu Zheng’s gaze turned cold. He stretched out his strong arms and pulled Qiao Xi into his embrace, pressing her onto the sofa. His hot breath sprayed on her neck, making her feel ticklish and slightly nervous.","“You... What are you doing?” Qiao Xi stammered.","Gu Zheng stood up slightly and stared at her with his deep eyes. His tone was gentle, but there was no response. “You can only stay by my side. No one can snatch you from me.”","Qiao Xi’s body trembled uncontrollably. Gu Zheng laughed, and his voice suddenly became gentle. “Mrs. Gu, no matter what happens, you’re not allowed to leave me.”","She looked up and met his gentle eyes. His light brown eyes were filled with love and affection. At that moment, her heart seemed to be surrounded by a warm current as she nodded shyly.","“Okay.” No matter what happened, she would not leave Gu Zheng.","Under the man’s scorching breath, Qiao Xi’s body gradually softened. Her clear eyes were glazed over. She curled up in his embrace like a kitten and said in a soft voice, “Ah Zheng, I’m tired. Can you carry me upstairs?”","The atmosphere was especially ambiguous at this moment. The two of them should return to their room to do something meaningful. Qiao Xi looked at Gu Zheng with a shy expression. Unexpectedly, Gu Zheng slowly stood up and teased, “Mrs. Gu, you’ve gained weight recently. I can’t carry you.”","Qiao Xi: “...” Damn! This bastard actually dared to mock her?","The living room was silent for a long time. Qiao Xi slowly said, “Gu Zheng...”","Gu Zheng looked at her with a smile and waited for her to continue.","Qiao Xi said, “You... Are you looking for a beating?”","Gu Zheng looked indifferent. Mrs. Gu could not beat him anyway.","...","The next morning at six.","Ring, ring, ring...","Gu Zheng woke up on time, and Qiao Xi opened her sleepy eyes. The sky was slightly dark when she suddenly reacted and roared. “Gu Zheng!”","He turned on the lights in the bedroom and turned around slowly. “Yes?”","Qiao Xi shouted in exasperation, “Why did you set the alarm so early? Don’t you know that I want to sleep?”"]},{"number":980,"title":"Chapter 980 - He Just Wanted To Be By Her Side","paragraphs":["At this moment, she wished she could kick Gu Zheng out and throw that damned alarm clock out as well. If he were not her husband, she would definitely make him die an ugly death.","“Mrs. Gu, your body is too weak, so I’ve decided to have you run with me in the morning to develop healthy habits. Otherwise, how can you defeat me?”","Qiao Xi took a deep breath. She could not hit her husband, so she could only endure it. She shouted anxiously, “I’m not weak!”","She covered herself with the blanket and ignored Gu Zheng. She was very angry when she woke up, so even if God were here today, He could not disturb her sleep.","Gu Zheng leaned over to the bed, lifted the blanket, and smiled. “Mrs. Gu, if you’re cursing me, it’s best to let it out. It’ll be very uncomfortable to keep these things bottled up!”","Qiao Xi’s eyelids twitched. Gu Zheng was a smart person, right? She could not hide anything from him.","“I guessed correctly. You’re indeed scolding me in your heart.” Gu Zheng’s tone was teasing. He did not continue to force her to go for a morning run. Instead, he leaned behind her and hugged her tightly. He whispered in her ear, “Xi Xi, what are you scolding me for?”","His voice was very gentle, but it scared Qiao Xi so much that her entire body trembled. Gu Yao’s words suddenly echoed in her mind. ‘My brother is a very strange person. The calmer and gentler he is, the more terrifying he actually is. A second ago, he was still talking to me gently. I was still lamenting in my heart about having a brother with a very good temper. The next second, I was beaten up. Qiao Xi, you must be careful. If you encounter such a situation, you must immediately admit your mistake and not resist. Otherwise, you’ll suffer harsher revenge.’","Later on, Gu Yao reminded her again, ‘Gu Zheng likes you so much. He definitely won’t hit you, but a two-faced man like him will definitely think of ways to punish you.’","When she thought about this, Qiao Xi’s entire body could not help but tremble. However, her mouth seemed to not listen to her anymore as she blurted out the thoughts in her heart, “You bastard! You two-faced man! If you disturb my sleep again, I’ll kick you out!”","As soon as she finished speaking, the corners of Gu Zheng’s mouth curled up slightly to reveal a charming smile. Without giving Qiao Xi a chance to react, a scorching kiss landed on her lips. It was surging and fierce as if it wanted to devour her.","After a long time, Qiao Xi felt her breathing quicken, her lips go numb, and her mind go blank. The man’s gentle voice sounded. “Are you still cursing me?”","At this moment, Qiao Xi finally confirmed Gu Yao’s words. Gu Zheng was really too evil. She knew very well that if she did not get up now, she might be suffocated by Gu Zheng’s kiss.","20 minutes later.","Qiao Xi followed behind Gu Zheng with a face full of resentment. He was not training her body at all but torturing her!","Gu Zheng turned around and glanced at her. “Are you unhappy?”","Qiao Xi rolled her eyes at him and did not say anything.","“Alright, don’t be angry anymore.” Gu Zheng coaxed her gently. His low voice was filled with affection without the slightest impatience.","After their morning run, Gu Zheng went upstairs to take a shower while Qiao Xi collapsed on the sofa, not wanting to move at all. Not far away, she heard Song Shijing and the butler talking. “The president wakes up every morning to run. He’s been like this for so many years, but Young Madam has never gotten up early. Why did he call her over today? I think Young Madam doesn’t seem too happy.”","The butler looked at Qiao Xi, who was slumped on the sofa, and explained, “All these years, he has always been alone. Now that he has someone he likes, he wants the person he loves to participate in everything he does. He’s not forcing Young Madam to run in the morning. He just wants her to accompany him.”","Song Shijing sighed. “The Gu and Lu families don’t treat the president well. He has never felt love since he was young and doesn’t have many friends. It wasn’t easy for him to have Young Madam, but she doesn’t understand him.”","Qiao Xi’s heart instantly softened. It turned out that Gu Zheng only felt lonely, so he wanted to pull her along for a morning run. He only hoped that there would be someone by his side to talk to and not always be alone.","At the thought of this, Qiao Xi abruptly stood up. Seeing Qiao Xi leave, the butler said softly, “Shijing, Young Madam heard our conversation. She won’t be angry with the president, right?”","Song Shijing nodded and said, “I don’t think so, but we have to control Song Shiyu. As long as he doesn’t spout nonsense, we won’t be exposed.”","After breakfast, the conversation between Song Shijing and the butler appeared in Qiao Xi’s mind. Her tone was a little gentler. “Do you wake up so early every day to run?”"]},{"number":981,"title":"Chapter 981 - Gu Zheng Is Exposed","paragraphs":["Every day when Qiao Xi woke up, Gu Zheng was already dressed and waiting in the dining room. He would accompany her to eat breakfast before going to work. She had indeed never thought about what Gu Zheng had done during this period of time and whether he would be lonely. After thinking about it, the anger in Qiao Xi’s heart instantly dissipated.","“Ah Zheng, you work until late at night every night and wake up at six in the morning. It’s not good for your body if you don’t sleep enough. You have to take care of your body no matter how busy you are!” Qiao Xi looked at him with a worried expression.","Gu Zheng nodded in agreement.","Qiao Xi recalled Song Shijing’s conversation with the butler and felt very guilty. She quickly said, “It’s okay. I won’t let you be alone in the future. I’ll wake up early and run with you.”","Gu Zheng slowly looked up, his deep eyes shining. He smiled. “Alright.”","Seeing that he seemed to be slightly sad, Qiao Xi felt even guiltier. “I’ll definitely wake up early. No matter what, I’ll accompany you.”","Gu Zheng looked at her gently, his eyes filled with love.","Qiao Xi said confidently, “Not to mention six, even four o’clock is fine. Gu Zheng, you’re usually so busy. All I can do is be by your side. I won’t let you be alone.”","“Four o’clock?” Song Shiyu happened to walk over and said in surprise, “President, why would you wake up at four? Don’t you usually wake up at seven?”","Qiao Xi was puzzled. Didn’t Gu Zheng wake up at six? Sometimes, he would wake up even earlier, so why did Song Shiyu say that he only woke up at seven?","Song Shiyu said, “What’s there to be lonely about? The president wakes up in the morning and gets ready, then has breakfast with you before going to work. There are hundreds of people in the company surrounding him. How could he be lonely? Thank God he’s not annoyed!”","Qiao Xi came to a sudden understanding. So Gu Zheng did not wake up early every day and only occasionally trained his body. He was not as lonely and pitiful as she imagined?","Gu Zheng put down his chopsticks, and his expression darkened.","Song Shiyu did not realize that danger was coming. He smiled arrogantly. “The president only woke up so early today because he wanted to wake Young Madam up! He was afraid that Young Madam would be angry, so he deliberately said that he was lonely to pretend to be pitiful!”","Gu Zheng looked up slowly and said indifferently, “Song Shiyu.”","At this moment, his eyes were calm, but the more gentle he was, the more terrifying he was. His thin lips parted slightly. “Are you very free?”","Song Shiyu shook his head. “No, I have to go to a meeting with you later!”","“Song Shijing can accompany me to the meeting. You have a more important task. Leave for the mountains immediately! Be back in a week.”","Song Shiyu wanted to cry but had no tears. Why did he send him to the mountains for no reason? Moreover, there was a lot of work there. How could he come back in a week? The president was asking him to work without sleep. Was he not just telling the truth? Did the president have to be so petty?","...","At ten o’clock, Qiao Xi reported to Li City University on time. After work, she was about to leave when she bumped into a familiar figure. Qiao Xi originally did not want to pay attention to him and walked past him. Unexpectedly, the person directly rushed over. “Qiao Xi, you’re still so rude. You didn’t even say anything when you saw me.”","At this moment, Xia Yunlou’s face was filled with resentment. “I went to Longwan Residential to look for you this morning. Those people refused to let me in, so I came here to look for you!”","Qiao Xi had an indifferent expression. Xia Yunlou had gone to Longwan Residential, but the butler did not tell her. He probably knew that she hated Xia Yunlou, so he did not want to disturb her because of an unrelated person. Unexpectedly, Xia Yunlou actually found her here.","“Have you seen Mengyan’s live broadcast? Did you even listen to what she said?!”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows and sneered. “She said so much, so how would I know what she meant?”","Xia Yunlou’s face was livid. She suppressed her anger and said, “Our family is holding a family banquet, so we’re letting you come home! No matter what, I’m your mother. It’s only right for you to return to the Xia family to attend the banquet. No one will gossip. Hurry up and go back with me!”","“Oh!” Qiao Xi had an indifferent expression, but her next words almost made Xia Yunlou vomit blood. She looked at Xia Yunlou with an innocent expression. “But I don’t want to go to the family banquet! I’m afraid that if I eat at the same table as you, I won’t be able to help but vomit.”","Xia Yunlou was dumbstruck, and her mouth opened wide in shock. She did not expect that Qiao Xi would actually say such things. It just so happened that Qiao Xi even looked arrogant. The flames of rage in Xia Yunlou’s heart instantly burned fiercely.","“What did you say?! You bastard!” Xia Yunlou screamed."]},{"number":982,"title":"Chapter 982 - Don’t Project One’s Shortcomings On Others","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi dug her ears and repeated loudly, “I said that your Xia family is disgusting. I’m afraid I’ll vomit if I eat with you!”","The Xia family was disgusting?","Xia Yunlou was angered to the point her face flushed red. She was unable to suppress the anger in her heart and shouted at the top of her voice, “Qiao Xi! Have you gone mad?!”","“What? Have you become crazy after hearing that I’m not attending the family banquet? Where did your Xia family get the confidence that I’ll definitely attend as long as you invite me?” Qiao Xi retorted.","Xia Yunlou was so angry that her entire body was trembling. She gritted her teeth and said, “I’ll ask you again. Are you coming back with me or not? You’re a descendant of the Xia family. Do you want me to beg you to go back and attend the family banquet?”","Qiao Xi’s eyes were icy-cold as she smiled lightly. “Madam Xia, I’m very curious. In the past, the Xia family didn’t acknowledge me as their granddaughter at all and wished for nothing more than for me to scram far away. To you guys, it was best if I didn’t embarrass the Xia family. Why are you trying your best to invite me to the family banquet this time? What’s your motive?”","Xia Yunlou avoided his gaze. The anger in her eyes instantly dissipated as she lowered her head guiltily.","“Oh! You really have ill intentions! The Xia family is spending so much effort holding a family banquet just to lure me over. What do you want from me?”","Qiao Xi’s words caused Xia Yunlou to fly into a rage out of humiliation. “What nonsense are you talking about?! Of course, the elders invited you home for a meal. Don’t project one’s shortcomings on others!”","“What are you talking about? Your Xia family is only focused on benefits. Would you do anything that’s not worth your effort? Xia Mengyan spent a lot of money to clear her name and make it seem like we have a good relationship, right? How many shares did she give Xia Tong?”","Qiao Xi smiled and said, “If I’m not wrong, what you want is even more precious than shares. Moreover, only I can give it to you, so you’re trying your best to get me to return to the Xia family.”","Xia Yunlou’s expression changed. “I don’t understand what you’re saying.”","“Madam Xia, I’ve already guessed it. Why are you pretending?” Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully. Xia Yunlou had lived for so long, but she was not as good at hiding her emotions as Xia Tong.","Qiao Xi continued, “What you want should be related to my mother, right?”","“I’m your biological mother!” Xia Yunlou shouted in exasperation.","Qiao Xi was even more sure of what she was thinking in her heart, and she sneered. “After Mom passed away, everything she had was left to me. If the Xia family wants to obtain what she left behind, they have to look for me. That’s why all of you spent so much effort to make everyone think that I’m from the Xia family. If I don’t admit to this matter, I’ll be despised by everyone.”","Xia Yunlou was angered to the point of being unable to speak. She could only glare fiercely at Qiao Xi.","“Madam Xia, are you guilty? Are you speechless? The angrier you are, the more sure I am of my guesses. Thank you for providing me with the clues.”","As soon as she finished speaking, Qiao Xi suddenly thought of something and stared at Xia Yunlou with burning eyes as she sized her up. She remembered that her grandmother and uncle had said that Xia Yunlou was very obedient and sensible when she was young. She was bright and cute. Everyone liked her very much, but everything changed after Xia Yunlou was taken away by Xia Cheng.","Xia Yunlou had already agreed to go home with her siblings, but she suddenly changed her mind. Moreover, the gentle and cute young lady suddenly became vicious.","At first, they thought that Xia Yunlou was threatened. Later on, they slowly realized that she had really changed. However, even if a person could change, they could not completely become another person overnight. Other than her appearance being exactly the same, her character was not similar to before at all.","Not only did Xia Yunlou not acknowledge her siblings and mother, but she also hated them. Hence, the Yin family had always suspected that the person in front of them was not the real Xia Yunlou. They had also secretly investigated for a long time, but they still could not find any useful clues.","After she became an adult, Xia Yunlou even stole her sister’s fiance. Her hatred for her sister increased day by day. Actually, Qiao Xi knew clearly in her heart that the reason Xia Yunlou hated her, her biological daughter, was because she was raised by Xia Yunqiu.","Qiao Xi was silent for a moment. Perhaps she could help the Yin family solve this mystery. Her hypnosis technique could get some clues from the deepest part of Xia Yunlou’s mind.","“Xia Yunlou.”","Qiao Xi called out lightly with a bewitching voice, “Look into my eyes.”","Xia Yunlou’s entire body instantly stiffened, and her eyes gradually became empty before turning blood-red. She looked at Qiao Xi in a daze like a puppet."]},{"number":983,"title":"Chapter 983 - Dangerous Family Banquet","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi was full of smiles as she asked in a gentle voice, “Are you the real Xia Yunlou?”","The surroundings suddenly fell silent. Xia Yunlou slowly looked up, and her empty eyes seemed to have a crack. She replied indifferently, “I am.”","Qiao Xi was stunned. Her grandmother and uncle both suspected that she was not the real Xia Yunlou, but even under hypnosis, Xia Yunlou was still able to confirm her identity.","Hypnosis could control someone like Gu Zheng, who had extremely strong self-control. Of course, she could also control Xia Yunlou. Moreover, she was clearly hypnotized now. Under such circumstances, she would not lie.","Could it be that she was really Xia Yunlou?","Ring, ring, ring...","Suddenly, Xia Yunlou’s phone rang. Her empty eyes gradually recovered their clarity and were shrouded by anger and viciousness. She did not remember what had just happened at all and warned fiercely, “You have to come to this family banquet, or you’ll bear the consequences!”","Qiao Xi was silent for a moment before she smiled lightly. “Alright, when does it start?”","Xia Yunlou probably did not expect Qiao Xi to agree so readily. She was stunned for a few seconds before replying, “Seven in the evening.”","“Alright.” Qiao Xi nodded.","Xia Yunlou smiled proudly. Qiao Xi was stubborn, but in the end, she was afraid of the Xia family’s power and did not want to offend them, so she still had to obediently attend the family banquet.","She would slowly deal with her when she arrived at the Xia family!","Qiao Xi watched Xia Yunlou’s departing figure. She had indeed agreed to attend the family banquet, but she would not attend on time. She had to make the entire Xia family anxious. It would be best if they sent someone to personally invite her.","...","Longwan Residential.","Qiao Xi went straight to the bedroom as soon as she entered. She found her grandfather’s notebook and found it. It recorded that if the other party was hypnotized, what they said would definitely be the truth. Hence, Xia Yunlou was not lying. There were only two possibilities, then. This person was the real Xia Yunlou, but for some reason, her character had suddenly changed. She hated her siblings and mother very much.","The other possibility was that she was not the real Xia Yunlou, but she thought that she was. Perhaps she had lost her memory, or perhaps there was another reason. In short, she subconsciously thought that she was the real Xia Yunlou.","Uncle and Grandma had always thought that the real Xia Yunlou was still wandering outside. That was a thorn in their hearts and also a strand of hope. However, if this person was the real Xia Yunlou, then all their previous efforts and persistence would be in vain.","Qiao Xi was unable to imagine how sad and helpless they would be when they found out about this.","She closed her grandfather’s notes. Actually, when she thought about it carefully, Xia Yunlou was only five or six years old back then. How could she have pretended? At that time, she really liked her brother, sister, and mother. If she was pretending, how could Grandma not tell?","Just as she was deep in thought, Gu Zheng pushed the door open and walked in. “I heard you’re going to the Xia family’s banquet?”","Qiao Xi nodded.","Gu Zheng took off his jacket and sat beside her. He hugged her from behind and muttered in a low voice, “Mrs. Gu, you know that they have ill intentions, yet you still want to attend?”","“I’m not stupid, so I’ll be careful. Moreover, what can those idiots do to me?” Qiao Xi grunted coldly with disdain, but Gu Zheng’s face remained cold. “Mrs. Gu, you have to remember that safety comes first. I don’t want you to take the risk.”","“Yes.” Qiao Xi nodded obediently, then said softly, “I don’t think the Xia family knows that I’m the descendant of the divine physician. They probably invited me back for my mother’s inheritance. I tested Xia Yunlou today, and she was indeed very nervous. Since Xia Cheng wants to obtain those things, he needs my signature. He won’t hurt me for the time being, but they might want to have me under their control first. For example...”","“By poisoning you?” Gu Zheng’s expression darkened, then he chuckled and said, “Unfortunately, you’re immune to poison! Looks like you’ve already planned it out. Even if you go, they won’t really hurt you, but are you so sure that there’s no danger at all?”","Looking at Gu Zheng’s deep eyes, Qiao Xi could not help but feel slightly guilty. Of course, it was impossible for her to not be in danger at all, but she was very confident that the trash from the Xia family could not hurt her. Since she had decided to attend the family banquet, she would not let the Xia family have an easy time.","Gu Zheng looked at her seriously. “Mrs. Gu, I hope you can protect yourself. Otherwise, you’ll regret it.”","Hearing the man’s low and hoarse voice, Qiao Xi’s entire body could not help but tremble as she gulped."]},{"number":984,"title":"Chapter 984 - I Learned To Lie From You","paragraphs":["At around six in the evening, Qiao Xi was still lazily leaning against the sofa and playing games. The family banquet officially began at seven. At this moment, people had started to arrive and would take their seats. It would only officially start when everyone was present.","Qiao Xi played the game unhurriedly without the slightest intention of leaving. The next second, Xia Yunlou called.","Xia Yunlou was very impatient, and her tone was filled with anger. “Do you know what time it is? Where are you?”","Qiao Xi’s fingers moved nimbly on the screen as she casually said, “Oh, I suddenly don’t want to go anymore.”","These words almost caused Xia Yunlou to vomit blood from anger. She gritted her teeth and shouted, “Qiao Xi! You’re fooling around! So many elders are waiting for you. What right do you have to not come?”","At this moment in the Xia family’s villa, everyone heard Xia Yunlou’s roar and looked over. Old Madam Xia asked with a gloomy expression, “Yunlou, Qiao Xi said she’s not coming? This girl really doesn’t know etiquette!”","“Aunt, didn’t she already agree? Why isn’t she coming?” Xia Mengyan asked.","Qiao Xi heard their voices and chuckled. “I just don’t want to go. I suddenly recall Madam Xia saying in public that Xu Anran is your daughter and I have nothing to do with you. Then why should I attend the Xia family’s banquet? Moreover, you don’t welcome me very much.","“I’m very close to the Yin family, so I have to keep a distance from the Xia family. If I attend the family banquet, it’ll cause Grandma and Uncle to misunderstand, so I won’t be going. I hope you have fun!”","At this moment, Xia Yunlou’s entire body was stiff, and her face was ferocious. She roared like a wild beast, “Qiao Xi!”","Seeing the gazes of the guests, Xia Yunlou immediately restrained her anger and lowered her voice. “Don’t forget that Mengyan is your good cousin. She has endured so many criticisms for you. Now that Mengyan has invited you to the family banquet, you’re unwilling? Even if you don’t care about me, you have to come for Mengyan’s sake!”","Qiao Xi nodded thoughtfully. “That makes sense.”","However, the next second, her tone was filled with innocence and difficulty. “But I can’t do anything about it! Today is also the day of the Yin family’s banquet. As the precious daughter of the Yin family, of course, I have to go back and see my grandmother! My grandmother dotes on me so much. If I don’t go back and see her, I’ll be unfilial. I believe everyone will understand.”","Xia Yunlou berated, “What nonsense are you talking about? The Yin family isn’t holding a family banquet at all!”","“You can say that Xia Mengyan is taking the blame for me, so why can’t I say that the Yin family is holding a family banquet? I learned how to lie from you!”","Xia Yunlou instantly choked. Qiao Xi already knew that all of this was a setup by the Xia family to use the power of public opinion to force her to return to the Xia family. She knew it clearly in her heart, but others did not.","Now, for the sake of not attending the family banquet, Qiao Xi fabricated the lie that the Yin family was holding a family banquet. At that time, as long as Yin Lianxin appeared to confirm her words, everyone would naturally not suspect anything.","The two of them were lying, but neither could refute the other.","“Madam Xia, don’t think that I can’t expose your lies. I have the Yin family behind me. What can you do to me?","“Madam Xia, don’t you know about the grudge between the Yin and Xia families? The two families haven’t been in contact for decades. If Grandma invites me home but I go to the Xia family’s residence, that’ll be truly unfilial! Any normal person would choose their grandmother over attending a banquet held by a mistress.”","Xia Yunlou’s face alternated between green and white. She gritted her teeth and said, “Qiao Xi, don’t go too far!”","“How am I going too far? I just don’t want to attend your family banquet. If there’s nothing else, I’ll hang up.” As soon as Qiao Xi finished speaking, the person on the other end of the phone panicked.","“Wait!”","A few seconds later, an old and kind voice sounded on the other end of the phone. “Xi Xi! I’m your grandfather.”","Qiao Xi leaned against the sofa and turned off the game interface. She turned on the loudspeaker and threw her phone on the coffee table. Her tone was indifferent and distant. “If you have something to say, quickly say it. I’m still very busy.”","Xia Cheng was indeed stunned for a moment. He was suppressing his anger. When he spoke again, his tone was still very gentle. “Xi Xi, I know that you don’t have any feelings for the Xia family, but you’re very close to Yunqiu. After all, she’s your adoptive mother. We still have some of her designs and photos in the family. Don’t you want to take them back?”"]},{"number":985,"title":"Chapter 985 - Going To The Banquet Alone","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi had long known that the Xia family still had her mother’s belongings, but she did not know what they were. She did not expect that there would actually be some designs.","Qiao Corporation relied on fashion design to make a fortune, but she had never heard that her mother knew how to design as well. Moreover, her mother stopped interacting with the Xia family when she was young. Why would the Xia family have her old designs?","“Old Master Xia, you’re indeed very smart. You’re using my mother’s belongings to force me to go back.” Qiao Xi’s eyes narrowed slightly, and her voice gradually turned cold.","Xia Cheng smiled proudly. “How can I force you? You’re a child of the Xia family. Of course, we all hope that you can come back. Come quickly. Everyone is waiting for you!”","“Alright.” Qiao Xi’s eyes were filled with coldness as she hung up.","On the other hand, the smile on Xia Cheng’s face suddenly vanished, and his gaze gradually became vicious. “Bastard! When she arrives at the Xia family, I’ll see how arrogant she can be.”","Xia Mengyan pretended to be worried. “Grandpa, are we really going to let Xi Xi drink that? But—”","“Mengyan!” Xia Yunlou immediately tried to persuade her. “You’re just too kind. Since Qiao Xi can’t be used by us, then let her be poisoned like us. At that time, for the sake of protecting her life, she’ll definitely look for the antidote. That way, we’ll be able to detoxify the poison in our bodies as well.","“You’re the future heir of the Xia family. You have to be ruthless when you have to be. She’s just an outsider. Can she compare to the lives of our entire Xia family?”","Xia Mengyan nodded, a sinister look in her eyes.","At this moment, Xia Ji’s wife subconsciously looked up at Xia Yunlou. Didn’t they say that Qiao Xi was Xia Yunlou’s biological daughter? Why was she so vicious as to harm her own daughter?","Seeing Madam Xia staring at her, Xia Yunlou glared and asked coldly, “Why are you looking at me?”","Seeing this, Xia Ji did not protect his wife but reprimanded her. “If it weren’t for the fact that you’re Mengyan’s mother, do you think you would have the right to attend the family banquet? Since I asked you to come, you’d better be obedient and not say anything you shouldn’t. Otherwise, you’ll suffer! Hurry up and apologize to Yunlou!”","Madam Xia lowered her head and bit her lip without saying anything.","Xia Yunlou’s face was filled with disdain. “Forget it, I don’t want to bicker with her either. Look at her useless appearance. I feel annoyed just looking at her. If she hadn’t given birth to Mengyan, she would have been chased out long ago.”","Madam Xia’s expression turned even uglier. She crossed her fingers and looked uneasy.","Xia Mengyan, who was at the side, saw her mother being berated but did not say anything. There was not a trace of heartache in her eyes as if she was just a stranger.","At this moment, Qiao Xi had already left Longwan Residential and was driving to the Xia family’s villa.","Song Shiyu shouted anxiously, “President! Did you hear that? Those bastards from the Xia family are threatening Young Madam. Are you sure you want Young Madam to deal with those people alone? They must be up to no good! Hurry up and protect Young Madam! If you don’t want to go, let me go. With me around, they definitely won’t dare to bully Young Madam!”","Gu Zheng and Song Shijing looked up at the same time and glanced at him meaningfully. It seemed that only a fool like Song Shiyu did not understand that no one could threaten Qiao Xi. She was going because she wanted to. Moreover, it was only because Xia Cheng had agreed to return Xia Yunqiu’s belongings that she was willing to go. Since she knew that the Xia family had ill intentions, it meant that she had already come up with a countermeasure to ensure her safe return.","Song Shijing’s first impression of Qiao Xi was that she was a weak woman. Later on, he realized that Young Madam’s methods were on par with the president’s. She would never be afraid of the Xia family! Moreover, she was not a weakling who needed protection. Song Shiyu would only cause trouble if he went.","After a moment of silence, Gu Zheng smiled. “How can I feel at ease letting my cute and kind Mrs. Gu go alone? I’ll go myself.”","Song Shiyu and Song Shijing looked at each other in disdain. Ever since the appearance of Young Madam, the president had changed. He was showing off his love all the time.","...","At eight in the evening.","Qiao Xi had just arrived at the Xia family’s residence. The banquet was supposed to start at seven, and everyone had already been sitting in their seats for an hour. At this moment, all of their expressions were gloomy. Xia Yunlou was even more furious, and the cup in her hand was almost crushed.","Qiao Xi walked in and waved at everyone with a smile. “Everyone’s here! Why aren’t you eating yet?”"]},{"number":986,"title":"Chapter 986 - Keep The Goodies Within The Family","paragraphs":["When Xia Yunlou heard this, she could not help but roar, “You still have the cheek to say that?! It’s all because of you! What did I tell you during the day? The banquet starts at seven, but you only rushed over at eight. Aren’t you embarrassed to have so many elders wait for you on an empty stomach?”","Qiao Xi glanced at her and said casually, “I’m not the one who wants to come. Aren’t you the one who invited me? If you’re unwilling to wait for an hour, then it just shows that you’re not sincere!”","Xia Yunlou was angered to the point her face flushed red. She could lose ten years of her life by talking to Qiao Xi.","At this moment, Song Shiyu, who was hiding outside the door, heard this and could not help but sigh in his heart. Young Madam was still so calm when facing this group of covetous people from the Xia family. There seemed to be no need for them to protect her anymore.","Gu Zheng was smiling meaningfully at the side. When Qiao Xi entered, they had already arrived at the entrance of the Xia family’s villa, but they were not in a rush to enter. Instead, they stood at the door and listened to the sounds coming from the corner of the wall.","Qiao Xi’s appearance caused everyone present to be dissatisfied. Xia Mengyan immediately stood up and patiently reminded her, “Xi Xi, you’re a junior. Why aren’t you greeting the elders when you see them?”","Xia Yunlou roared, “Rude wild girl! How embarrassing!”","“Since you think I’m embarrassing, I’d better go! In any case, I didn’t want to come in the first place. My husband is going to bring me out for a feast when I get home!” As she spoke, Qiao Xi walked out the door.","Xia Cheng was instantly anxious. He glared at Xia Yunlou and hurriedly said kindly, “Xi Xi! Don’t be angry! Your mother is a little impatient, but she’s doing this for your own good. Don’t bicker with her and quickly take a seat!”","“Since Old Master Xia said so, then I’ll reluctantly stay,” Qiao Xi said with a smile as she walked straight to the empty seat and sat down.","At this moment, everyone’s gazes were on her like a pack of hungry wolves. Xia Yunlou calmed down and said in a gentler tone, “Xi Xi, didn’t President Gu come with you?”","Qiao Xi replied without the slightest hesitation, “This is the Xia family’s banquet. Why would he come here? Moreover, he’s very busy and doesn’t have time to attend such a boring banquet.”","Xia Yunlou instantly choked. Every word Qiao Xi said could anger her to the point her blood pressure rose. However, since Gu Zheng was not here, they could rest assured and deal with Qiao Xi.","“Xi Xi, during the matter of the marriage contract previously, why didn’t you speak up for Mengyan? She was scolded by netizens for so many days and felt terrible. Can you bear to see your cousin suffer?” Xia Yunlou criticized.","At this moment, a servant went forward and poured a cup of tea for Qiao Xi. Qiao Xi was caught off guard and picked up the teacup to finish it in one gulp. Everyone revealed sinister smiles when they saw her drink the tea.","Old Madam Xia also reprimanded, “Yes! Mengyan is your sister, but you watched her suffer. You’re too heartless!”","Qiao Xi was angered to the point of laughing. It seemed that the Xia family had spent a lot of money to settle this matter, so they wanted her to pay for it.","“Oh!” Qiao Xi replied indifferently.","Seeing that Qiao Xi was so arrogant, Old Madam Xia felt as though her attacks were ineffective. She could not take it anymore and continued, “It’s just a small misunderstanding between you cousins. Why did you have to make things worse? President Gu is young and promising. It’s understandable that Mengyan likes him. It’s normal for an outstanding man like President Gu to have a few women by his side. He can’t possibly spend the rest of his life with you alone. Since there’ll be women fighting for your favor sooner or later, why don’t you give this opportunity to Mengyan? Good things shouldn’t be left to outsiders!”","Qiao Xi replied without raising her head, “Tsk tsk, Old Madam Xia, you’re surely worthy of being a mistress. You make ruining someone else’s marriage sound so refreshing and refined. Your Xia family’s education philosophy is really destructive!”","Being a mistress was a stain on Old Madam Xia’s life. These words were like a slap to her face in public, making her unable to raise her head.","“Although Gu Zheng and I didn’t hold a wedding, we got our marriage certificate a long time ago. We’re legally married. Xia Mengyan fell for a married man and even faked the marriage contract in a vain attempt to use me to climb up the social ladder. As the first wife, do I have to cooperate with all of you? Do you still have any shame?”","As soon as these words were spoken, the huge villa fell silent. Everyone’s faces were ashen, and they only felt their cheeks burn with pain. They all berated angrily, “Qiao Xi!”","Xia Cheng was still relatively calm, but he was unable to conceal the flames of rage in his eyes. He glared fiercely at Qiao Xi. “Shut up!”"]},{"number":987,"title":"Chapter 987 - Something Must Be Wrong","paragraphs":["At this moment, the Xia family had already blocked the signal, and Qiao Xi was unable to contact the outside world. Under the siege of everyone, it was impossible for her to escape. Yet she still dared to be so arrogant?","Xia Cheng no longer pretended, and his face was filled with viciousness. “Qiao Xi, immediately post a statement online and say that it’s just a misunderstanding. Say that someone was deliberately slandering Mengyan. Mengyan has always been very good to you, so she definitely wouldn’t ruin your marriage!”","Qiao Xi said casually, “It’s easy to be struck by lightning if I lie too much. I won’t do such a thankless task.”","Everyone’s gazes immediately became fierce. However, Xia Mengyan still pretended to be a good cousin and patiently advised, “Xi Xi, do you know that this matter has already affected the company’s reputation? You’re also a member of the Xia family. Can you bear to see Grandpa worry about the company at his age?”","Then, she looked at Xia Cheng and comforted him softly. “Grandpa, don’t be angry. Xi Xi won’t be so heartless. She’ll definitely help us.”","Qiao Xi lazily leaned against the chair and slowly closed her eyes. After all, out of sight, out of mind. It seemed that one of the reasons Xia Cheng forced her to attend the family banquet was to help Xia Mengyan clear her name.","Although Xia Mengyan had already recovered her image by criticizing Xia Tong, there were still some people who thought that she had offended Gu Zheng and was unwilling to collaborate with the Xia family. Hence, they needed someone to clarify this matter.","If she really clarified things for Xia Mengyan according to the Xia family’s instructions, the Xia family would soon hire a group of fake commenters to spread rumors online. They would say that she deliberately led Xia Mengyan around and made Xia Mengyan think that she was engaged to Gu Zheng, causing her reputation to be ruined. That way, Xia Mengyan would be the one who was wronged from beginning to end.","Qiao Xi had long seen through these people’s thoughts. Her icy-cold gaze swept past everyone. All of them had ulterior motives, but there was one person who was different—Xia Ji’s wife.","Madam Xia was completely different from the rest of the Xia family. She always lowered her head like a frightened bird, and it was as if no one took her seriously. What made Qiao Xi even more puzzled was why Xia Mengyan was so distant from her biological mother and was very close to Xia Yunlou instead.","There must be something wrong. She really should investigate Madam Xia’s background.","Xia Cheng’s eyes were filled with anger. When he saw that Qiao Xi did not agree, his gaze became fierce. Since she was not cooperating, then she could not blame him for being heartless. When she was poisoned, she would obediently listen and look for the medicine until she found the right antidote. It could be considered as benefiting the entire Xia family while fulfilling her value.","When he thought about this, Xia Cheng turned around and gestured for Xia Yunlou to pour the wine. Then, he looked at Qiao Xi with a gloomy gaze. “Xi Xi, since you’re unwilling, I don’t want to force you. Let’s have a toast, then. Let’s let bygones be bygones. We’ll get along well in the future. After all, we’re family. Why go against each other?”","Qiao Xi lowered her eyes to look at the glass of wine. The wine was clear and suffused with a strong fragrance. She could not see anything wrong with it, but she was aware that there was poison in the wine. She raised her eyes and swept her gaze across the Xia family. Everyone’s eyes carried resentment and anticipation. They hoped that she would immediately drink this glass of wine and be obedient after being poisoned.","Qiao Xi’s gaze suddenly landed on Madam Xia, who was not far away. She saw Madam Xia staring at the wine glass with a burning gaze, then she looked at Qiao Xi. Her eyes were filled with anxiety and a trace of horror. She was afraid that someone would notice that she was reminding Qiao Xi.","Xia Ji followed Qiao Xi’s gaze and turned around to glare fiercely at Madam Xia. She immediately lowered her head and was terrified to the point her entire body trembled. She did not dare remind Qiao Xi anymore.","Qiao Xi was slightly surprised. Madam Xia was completely different from the rest of the Xia family. She actually tried to signal her not to drink.","She picked up the wine glass, and the hearts of everyone in the Xia family rose as they stared at her hand with burning gazes. They urgently hoped that Qiao Xi could drink that glass of wine.","At this moment, Song Shiyu, who was hiding in the dark, looked serious and clenched his fists. As long as Gu Zheng gave the order, he would break in to protect Young Madam.","Everyone could tell that there was something wrong with this glass of wine. If Young Madam really drank it, she would definitely be hurt. However, if Young Madam did not drink it, how could those hungry wolves let her off?","Qiao Xi raised the wine glass to her lips, but she suddenly stopped in the next second. She held the wine glass a little farther away and said casually, “Old Master Xia, I agreed to come to the Xia family to retrieve my mother’s belongings. Shouldn’t you give them to me first?”"]},{"number":988,"title":"Chapter 988 - Xia Cheng Broke His Promise","paragraphs":["Seeing that Qiao Xi did not drink the glass of wine, Xia Cheng frowned. Xia Ji had already lost his patience and rushed over to pick up the glass, wanting to forcefully pour it into Qiao Xi’s mouth. However, in the next second, his wrist was firmly grabbed by Qiao Xi.","Xia Ji looked at Qiao Xi with a shocked expression. She was only a 20-year-old girl, yet she was actually so strong. She could grab his wrist with one hand, and it seemed to be effortless.","There was not the slightest fear in Qiao Xi’s eyes. Instead, she smiled indifferently. She grabbed Xia Ji’s wrist and slowly exerted force. “Old Master Xia, are you going back on your word?”","Xia Cheng’s expression was gloomy. Before he could speak, Old Madam Xia shouted anxiously, “Qiao Xi! What are you doing? Let go of my son! This is the Xia family’s territory. You can’t fool around here! Otherwise, don’t blame us for being nasty!”","“Old Madam, if I remember correctly, your son is the one who attacked me first, right? I’m just defending myself. I didn’t say that I wouldn’t drink this glass of wine. I just want to get my mother’s belongings first, but Mr. Xia is in a rush to force me to drink. Could this wine... be poisonous?”","The entire hall instantly fell into a deathly silence. Everyone had different expressions, but they all carried a trace of guilt. The corners of Xia Cheng’s mouth twitched slightly as he glanced at Qiao Xi with a slight uneasiness. Qiao Xi meant that she could drink, but she had to get her hands on the belongings before she drank the wine.","Xia Cheng hesitated for a moment, then instructed, “Mengyan, go get your Aunt Yunqiu’s belongings.”","Those things were meaningless to them, but if Qiao Xi could be used by them, then it would be a great thing for the Xia family. Once she was poisoned, so Gu Zheng would probably not sit idly by. With Gu Zheng’s current power and status, it should be very easy for him to find the descendant of the divine physician.","Xia Cheng’s tone became gentle. “Xi Xi, don’t misunderstand. Your uncle thinks that you don’t want to reconcile with us, so he became a little anxious. Let go of him.”","Qiao Xi let go, but Xia Ji looked at her with disdain without a trace of anger. In his eyes, Qiao Xi was already a fish on the chopping board that could be slaughtered at will. It wouldn’t be long before she knelt on the floor and begged them to let her off.","After a while, Xia Mengyan walked down empty-handed. Qiao Xi smiled and asked, “Where are the things?”","Xia Mengyan looked troubled. “Grandpa, I’ve searched the warehouse. Aunt Yunqiu’s belongings are nowhere to be found.”","At this moment, Old Madam Xia revealed a vicious expression. Qiao Xi wanted Xia Yunqiu’s belongings? Dream on! Since she wanted them so badly, she should go to hell to get them from Xia Yunqiu!","Xia Cheng glanced at Old Madam Xia and knew that she had secretly destroyed the belongings. He did not flare up but raised his glass and said to Qiao Xi, “Then I might have remembered wrongly. They were probably just worthless things that aren’t worth your attention! Let me give you a toast!”","Qiao Xi glanced at the wine glass on the table and completely ignored Xia Cheng. She directly stood up, and her voice was filled with dignity. “Old Master Xia, since you’re unwilling to give me the belongings, I’ll go look for them myself!”","Seeing that she was so arrogant, Old Madam Xia shouted in exasperation, “Qiao Xi! Do you think this is your house? Your grandfather took the initiative to give you a toast, but you actually pretended not to see it?”","Qiao Xi snorted. “Decades ago, my grandmother divorced Old Master Xia and announced that the two families would no longer have any contact. My mother, Madam Xia Yunqiu, had always lived with my grandmother. What right do you, Old Madam Xia, and the entire Xia family have to keep my mother’s belongings? Old Madam Xia, not only do you like to be a mistress, but you also like to snatch other people’s belongings. You have such special hobbies!’","Old Madam Xia was so angry that her breathing quickened and she almost fainted. She shouted without caring about her image, “Someone! Capture this little b*tch! Ah! I’m so angry!”","At this moment, she could no longer care about letting Qiao Xi drink. All she could think about was making Qiao Xi pay the price.","The bodyguards rushed over with the intention of subduing Qiao Xi, but before they could approach, Qiao Xi took two steps back and kicked the other party’s knee. That person’s legs went weak as he knelt in front of Qiao Xi.","“Old Master Xia, you promised to return my mother’s belongings to me, but you went back on your word. In that case, I don’t have to drink this glass of wine anymore.” Qiao Xi remained calm and composed.","“Go! Catch her!” Old Madam Xia roared.","Qiao Xi stood on the spot and said casually, “Right, I forgot to tell everyone that Ah Zheng is already waiting for me outside the door. If I can’t walk out of the Xia family’s door in an hour, he’ll personally come to look for me."]},{"number":989,"title":"Chapter 989 - Who Destroyed The Belongings?","paragraphs":["Xia Cheng’s expression changed, and he hurriedly waved his hand to signal the bodyguards to leave. Then, he whispered something to Xia Ji, who was beside him. After about half a minute, he said kindly, “Xi Xi, what are you talking about?! Would we harm you? It’s all a joke.","“Didn’t you say that President Gu wasn’t coming? It’s good if he comes. Let him come in and have a meal with his family to liven things up. Everyone wants to see your husband too!”","Qiao Xi smiled coldly. As expected, Xia Cheng was still afraid of Gu Zheng. Actually, she was not sure if Gu Zheng was here at all, but with his character, he would at least send Song Shiyu or Song Shijing to protect her.","“I only want my mother’s belongings. Give them to me immediately!” Qiao Xi’s tone suddenly became fierce.","Xia Cheng frowned. If Gu Zheng really came, they could not continue to force Qiao Xi to drink. Otherwise, she would definitely notice that the wine was poisoned. At that time, it would be troublesome if Gu Zheng barged in.","He could only suppress his anger for the time being. “Butler, bring Yunqiu’s belongings over.”","A few minutes later, the butler walked over with a tattered box. “Master, I found it.”","Qiao Xi opened the box. The things inside were very messy. There was a photo album and a sketchbook. They were probably the designs Xia Cheng had mentioned. She flipped open the photo album, and her expression instantly changed.","Her mother’s photo had been scratched by someone with a knife. Every cut was very forceful. The person even wrote the words ‘b*tch’ and ‘damn you’ on her mother’s face with a red pen. It was obvious that the person hated her mother.","Qiao Xi’s pupils suddenly constricted as she raised her eyes to look at Old Madam Xia. Her indifferent eyes were filled with ruthlessness, and her entire body emitted dense killing intent. Old Madam Xia looked at her gaze and was terrified to the point her entire body trembled. She took a few steps back in horror and said while trembling, “Why are you glaring at me? I didn’t do it.”","Qiao Xi stood up and slowly walked toward her, her icy-cold eyes staring fixedly at her.","Song Shiyu, who was outside the door, could not help but gulp. He had to admit that Young Madam was really scary when she was angry! No wonder even the president did not dare to provoke her.","Gu Zheng’s expression was similarly gloomy. He rarely saw Qiao Xi so angry. Since the Xia family had the guts to anger her, they had to bear the consequences.","At this moment, Old Madam Xia took a few steps back and bumped into the chair behind her. She could not retreat anymore and shouted in horror, “Qiao Xi! Go away! I already said that it has nothing to do with me!”","“I didn’t say a word just now, yet you’re busy explaining yourself. Is it because you’re guilty?” Qiao Xi spoke coldly like a messenger from hell, making one tremble with fear.","Old Madam Xia could not retort. She stood there trembling and looked at the others for help.","“Xi Xi, stop fooling around.” Xia Mengyan hurriedly went forward to stop her and advised softly, “Actually, when we got these designs and photo albums, they were already destroyed. We were afraid that you would be sad, so we didn’t tell you. I was also very sad, but I couldn’t salvage the things. I could only keep them and give them to you. How could you misunderstand us?”","Qiao Xi paid no attention to Xia Mengyan at all. Her eyes were still staring at Old Madam Xia as if she would tear her into pieces in the next second.","Old Madam Xia was so scared that she broke out in a cold sweat. She stammered as she retorted, “That’s right! What right do you have to malign me? These things were already destroyed when they were sent here. Xia Yunqiu must have done something wrong outside and offended someone. That’s why this happened after she died. She can only blame herself for this!","“Ah!” As soon as Old Madam Xia finished speaking, she suddenly screamed. Qiao Xi forcefully broke her wrist, and a cracking sound was heard. An intense bout of pain swept through her entire body.","Qiao Xi’s gaze was gloomy and cold. “I’ll ask again. Did you destroy my mother’s belongings?”","Xia Mengyan was also frightened by the angry Qiao Xi and hurriedly tried to persuade her. “Xi Xi, let go! This wasn’t Grandma’s doing at all. Even if you have doubts, you should wait until the matter is investigated clearly. How can you hurt your elders without distinguishing right from wrong?”","Qiao Xi could not be bothered with Xia Mengyan and looked at Old Madam Xia with a sharp gaze. Her entire body emitted strong killing intent. “I’ll give you another chance. Answer me!”","At this moment, Old Madam Xia had already forgotten the pain in her wrist. She looked into Qiao Xi’s eyes as intense fear spread from the bottom of her heart. From Qiao Xi’s red eyes, she seemed to have seen a fiery hell. She could even hear miserable cries."]},{"number":990,"title":"Chapter 990 - The Furious Qiao Xi","paragraphs":["The pain in her wrist made Old Madam Xia almost faint. Her throat was dry, and she could not say anything. However, her strong desire to live made her roar with all her might, “It wasn’t me!”","“Then tell me who it is. Perhaps I can let you off.” Qiao Xi smiled sinisterly as her gaze swept past everyone. Under Qiao Xi’s deterrence, everyone lowered their heads. No one stood out to admit all of this.","Old Madam Xia trembled uncontrollably. She could sense that Qiao Xi really wanted to kill her. “Qiao Xi! It really wasn’t me. How could a junior like you—”","Before she could finish, her throat was suddenly tightened. Qiao Xi suddenly grabbed her neck. “Who destroyed my mother’s belongings? Are you going to tell me?”","Old Madam Xia found it difficult to breathe and could not say a word. It was not until her face was ashen that Qiao Xi slowly let go. At this moment, tears surged out of her eyes as she clutched her neck in horror and said while trembling, “It... It was done by Butler Liu!”","Butler Liu hurriedly stood in front of Old Madam Xia and explained, “Miss Xi Xi, I didn’t do it on purpose. Moreover, when Miss Yunqiu was still alive, I was very attentive to her. She was always kind and respectful. She treated me as an elder. If she knew that I destroyed these things, she definitely wouldn’t have the heart to blame me.”","Qiao Xi was angered to the point of laughing. He was just a dog by Xia Cheng’s side. Was he worthy of her mother’s respect? As a butler, he destroyed the belongings of his master. He did not admit his mistake and even tried to explain himself? The Xia family was the same from head to toe. They were all the same!","She could believe it if it was not intentional, but were the words ‘b*tch’ and ‘damn’ not intentional?","Qiao Xi picked up a photo and placed it in front of Butler Liu. She said slowly, “I know you took care of my mother for a period of time, so I can give you a chance. Tell me who destroyed her belongings!”","Butler Liu had indeed taken care of Xia Yunqiu, but that was a long time ago. He thought that the child Xia Yunqiu raised would definitely be as gentle as her, so he did not take Qiao Xi’s warning to heart. He said without hesitation, “I did it, Miss Xi Xi. Today is a family banquet. The elders here have been waiting for you for more than an hour. It’s fine if you don’t know how to be grateful, but you’re fooling around over the belongings of a dead person. If news of this gets out, everyone will say that you’re unfilial!","“You’re all descendants of the Xia family. Look at Miss Mengyan. She has always been steady and respectful to her elders. If you were half as sensible as Miss Mengyan, you wouldn’t be so incompatible with the Xia family!”","Qiao Xi slowly took a few steps closer as the corners of her mouth curled into a cold smile. She abruptly raised her eyes, which were filled with dense killing intent.","“You... What are you doing?” Butler Liu was frightened by her terrifying gaze, and his voice trembled.","At the end of the day, he was innocent! He was just a butler and had no grudge against Miss Yunqiu. Why would he destroy her belongings? However, since the old madam had already said so, how could he dare to retort? At this point, he could only brace himself and admit it.","“I... I know my mistake. I really didn’t do it on purpose! Please let me go! My old bones really can’t take it.” He begged for mercy while trembling.","“Xi Xi! Butler Liu didn’t do it on purpose. He has already admitted his mistake. What else do you want? No matter what, Butler Liu has served the Xia family for his entire life. How can you—”","Bang!","Suddenly, a loud bang interrupted Xia Mengyan’s words. Qiao Xi kicked Butler Liu a few meters away. He hugged his legs and wailed. Before he could get up, Qiao Xi walked over and stepped on his hand.","“Help!” A scream resounded throughout the entire Xia family’s villa. Everyone’s expressions changed.","Qiao Xi fiercely stepped on his finger, and the corners of her mouth carried a ghastly smile. “Did you use this hand to destroy my mother’s belongings?”","Butler Liu lay on the floor and looked at Old Madam Xia pleadingly. He was indeed suffering from some physical pain now, but if he exposed Old Madam Xia and Miss Yunlou, his outcome would definitely be even worse. Hence, he could only grit his teeth. “I know my mistake now! Old Madam Xia, Old Master! Save me!”","“Qiao Xi! Stop!” Xia Cheng berated.","Old Madam Xia, who was at the side, had a ferocious expression, but she hid behind Xia Cheng in horror and did not dare to say anything."]},{"number":991,"title":"Chapter 991 - Chasing Butler Liu Away","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi ignored Xia Cheng and lowered her head to look at the disheveled Butler Liu. She chuckled and said, “Butler Liu, who gave you the illusion that I’m easy to bully?”","Butler Liu was in so much pain that he could not say anything. He could only whimper and glare at her fiercely. This was the Xia family’s residence. How could she dare to attack him? Moreover, she would go to jail if she deliberately hurt someone. She would not want to get into a lawsuit, right?!","Crack!","“Ah!”","A miserable scream sounded along with the sound of bones breaking. Qiao Xi withdrew her foot as if she had stepped on disgusting trash.","She lowered her eyes to look at Butler Liu, who had collapsed on the floor. She slowly bent down and whispered in his ear, “Don’t think that just because you’re taking the blame for Old Madam Xia and Xia Yunlou that this matter is over. I’ll deal with you first. Then, I’ll slowly deal with the two of them!","“Even if I hurt you, no one in the Xia family will stand up to help you! You destroyed my mother’s belongings. As her daughter, I’m disheartened over it. It’s not a big deal if I accidentally step on you, right? Moreover, I can tell that your injuries are very light. You don’t have to trouble the police with such a small matter, right?”","“You...” Butler Liu gritted his teeth, his gaze gradually filling with fear.","Qiao Xi smiled coldly. “You can indeed get a sum of compensation from me after calling the police, but as the butler, you destroyed Eldest Miss’ belongings. Who will dare to hire you in the future? You can only rely on the compensation you received and retire.”","Butler Liu’s entire body trembled violently. At this moment, he realized that Qiao Xi was the one who was the most difficult to deal with.","Qiao Xi stood up and looked at the things in the box. Those things had all been destroyed by others and could no longer be repaired.","Xia Cheng’s expression was gloomy. Now that the inheritance had been handed to Qiao Xi and she had beaten up the butler, it was time for her to drink that glass of wine. Hence, he advised gently, “Xi Xi, Butler Liu was the one who destroyed Yunqiu’s inheritance. I’ll chase him out of the Xia family. I absolutely won’t allow such a person to continue staying in the Xia family.”","Originally, Qiao Xi thought that no matter what, her mother was Xia Cheng’s daughter. He would not just watch as her belongings were destroyed. After hearing Xia Cheng’s words, she was sure that Xia Cheng must have known about this long ago.","Qiao Xi did not say anything and directly raised the wine glass to her lips. She drank it in one gulp in front of everyone. Everyone was instantly excited. Qiao Xi had been poisoned, so how could they be afraid that she would not obediently listen to them?","Xia Cheng gestured for the servants to send Butler Liu to the hospital, then looked at Qiao Xi affectionately. “Xi Xi, I owe you and your mother. Actually, I missed you very much. Your mother has passed away, so you have to be filial in her place. You should stay in the Xia family’s residence to accompany me for a few more days.”","Qiao Xi put down the empty wine glass and was slightly troubled. “But I promised Ah Zheng that I would go home. He’s still waiting for me outside!”","Xia Cheng’s expression changed as he continued gently, “It’s still early. After eating with us, go upstairs and rest, okay?”","Everyone knew that this poison would make Qiao Xi faint. If she was still safe and sound after half an hour, it meant that she was not poisoned. However, how was this possible? They had seen Qiao Xi drink that glass of wine with their own eyes.","As for Gu Zheng, Xia Cheng had other ways to deal with him.","Qiao Xi looked at Xia Cheng’s scheming gaze and smiled lightly. “Alright! I’ll go upstairs now.”","Xia Cheng did not expect that Qiao Xi, who was still furious just now, would be so obedient at this moment. Things were going even smoother than he had expected. After that, everyone sat down to eat. Everyone at the dining table had ulterior motives. Xia Cheng could not help but size up Qiao Xi. She was still in a very normal state.","“Mengyan, I think Xi Xi is tired. Bring her upstairs to rest.”","Everyone from the Xia family raised their eyes to look at Qiao Xi. Their proud gazes were no longer concealed. At this moment, she was already a lamb waiting to be slaughtered.","Qiao Xi nodded, stood up, and followed Xia Mengyan upstairs. Xia Mengyan brought her to the guest room. Qiao Xi entered and smiled. “Miss Xia, why are you guys in such a rush to keep me in the Xia family?”","Xia Mengyan’s expression changed as she hurriedly explained, “Xi Xi, you’re thinking too much. Grandpa thinks that you’re too tired, so he asked you to go upstairs and rest for a while. Don’t misunderstand us.”","“I know that the Xia family has already blocked the signal. I can’t contact anyone, but don’t forget that if I can’t walk out of the Xia family safe and sound in half an hour, Gu Zheng will rush in with his men.”"]},{"number":992,"title":"Chapter 992 - The Antidote She Developed","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi sat lazily on the sofa and looked at Xia Mengyan with a sharp gaze. “How are you going to explain this to Gu Zheng when the time comes? Are you going to be holding his wife here while disregarding him?”","Xia Mengyan instantly choked. She could not help but be nervous. Could it be that Qiao Xi had discovered their plan?","“Xi Xi, rest well. President Gu will come to pick you up in a while. Even if he doesn’t come, Grandpa will send you home. You must be too tired. Don’t let your thoughts run wild.”","As soon as she finished speaking, Xia Mengyan stared fixedly into Qiao Xi’s eyes. The poison was about to take effect, and Qiao Xi would not be able to hold on for long. Sure enough, Qiao Xi’s body started swaying.","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart. From the moment she drank that glass of wine, she knew what the poison was. It was the same poison as the one in Gu Zheng’s body. This poison would cause a person to fall into a deep sleep as soon as it entered their body. The Xia family was taking this opportunity to test the poison on her. Unfortunately, what the Xia family did not know was that she was immune to poison and was very familiar with this poison.","Qiao Xi calculated the time it would take for the poison to flare up and pretended to be weak all over as she collapsed on the sofa. Then, she closed her eyes.","Xia Mengyan stood on the spot and sized her up. After confirming that the poison had acted up and Qiao Xi no longer had the ability to resist, she heaved a sigh of relief. She turned around and walked out of the guest room, locking the door behind her.","Not long after, the other members of the Xia family walked in. Xia Cheng took out a pill and stuffed it into Qiao Xi’s mouth.","Old Madam Xia said unhappily, “Xia Cheng, this medicine is rare. We don’t have many of them. It’ll be a waste to give a pill to Qiao Xi!”","Xia Cheng smiled and explained, “What do you know?! The person who gave me the medicine said that if the person who’s poisoned takes this antidote and it works, the blood in her body will have the effect of detoxifying the poison. We can then drink her blood to detoxify the poison. Isn’t this more effective than a hundred antidotes?”","When Old Madam Xia heard this, she was extremely excited. “Does that mean our entire family can be saved?”","It turned out that this was the Xia family’s plan all along. Although this was a little different from the news that Meng Fan had spread, in the end, it was just to get her to be the antidote. Who exactly sent this news to the Xia family? Was it someone from the Medical Association, or was it someone from the Medical Association pretending to be a doctor?","Qiao Xi curled up on the sofa and quietly listened to the Xia family’s conversation. She carefully tasted the pill in her mouth. Wasn’t this pill developed by her?","Back then, she developed this medicine to help Gu Zheng detoxify the poison, but it was useless. Who stole her medicine?","“But President Gu is still outside...” Xia Ji was a little uneasy. They all knew Gu Zheng’s methods, so they naturally did not dare to provoke him.","“When he comes, find an excuse to delay him. Also, don’t tell Mengyan about this,” Xia Cheng instructed. “This matter is very dangerous, after all. We can’t implicate Mengyan no matter what. Once the matter is exposed, we have to insist that it has nothing to do with Mengyan.”","Although Xia Cheng said that, he was actually very sure that no one would discover their plan. If Gu Zheng really barged in to ask for her, they would just say that Qiao Xi had already left. What could Gu Zheng do to them?","At this moment, Song Shiyu was hiding outside the window. He gritted his teeth in hatred. “President, when are we going in? I can’t take it anymore. I want to go in and beat all these people up!”","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent, and his smile was sinister. “We can’t enter through the window. We have to walk in through the door and get my Mrs. Gu back!”","In the guest room.","After everyone left, Qiao Xi opened her eyes. She hurriedly stood up and easily opened the door. At this moment, everyone from the Xia family was conspiring in the living room. There was no one upstairs. Qiao Xi was prepared to quietly sneak into Xia Cheng’s study to look for clues. Before she could leave, an extremely gentle set of footsteps suddenly came from the door.","That person was extremely careful and afraid of being discovered. He gently pushed the door open. Seeing this, Qiao Xi hurriedly lay back on the sofa, then she saw a figure carefully walk in.","“Miss Qiao! Wake up!” Madam Xia’s voice was gentle as she shook Qiao Xi’s arm.","Qiao Xi closed her eyes tightly and pretended to be asleep.","Madam Xia was so anxious that she sighed. Her voice trembled. “Miss Qiao, they want to harm you. While President Gu is still waiting outside, quickly go downstairs and leave with him!”","Qiao Xi pondered in her mind. Madam Xia seemed to be different from the others. From the moment she entered, Madam Xia had vaguely reminded her that the Xia family had ill intentions. Now, she was taking the risk to tell her to leave quickly."]},{"number":993,"title":"Chapter 993 - An Inexplicable Sense Of Trust","paragraphs":["With Qiao Xi’s usual character, even if Madam Xia was expressing her goodwill, she would still be vigilant. Perhaps this was all the Xia family’s plan to test if she was really unconscious. However, when she heard Madam Xia’s anxious voice, Qiao Xi’s heart surged with an inexplicable sense of trust.","Seeing Madam Xia’s anxious appearance, Qiao Xi did not continue pretending. She opened her clear eyes.","Madam Xia was surprised and delighted to see her awake. “That’s great! Miss Qiao, you’re finally awake!”","Qiao Xi sized up the woman in front of her. She could not see a trace of sinisterness in her eyes, only worry and happiness. However, Qiao Xi really did not understand. She had never seen Madam Xia before, so why was Madam Xia so concerned about her?","Madam Xia was Xia Mengyan’s mother. She did not care about her daughter but about another unrelated person. Why was that?","“I’m fine.” Qiao Xi slowly stood up.","Madam Xia held her hand, feeling anxious and afraid. “Hurry up and leave! If you continue to stay in the Xia family, you’ll be killed by them! I’ll bring you out. After we get out, go look for President Gu for help immediately. Don’t hesitate!”","At this moment, footsteps suddenly came from outside. Madam Xia’s body froze, and her forehead was covered in sweat. It was obvious that she was very afraid.","Qiao Xi frowned. Madam Xia was Xia Ji’s wife and Xia Mengyan’s mother, so why was she like a frightened bird in front of the rest of the Xia family? She did not have the demeanor of the Xia family’s mistress at all.","Xia Ji’s voice came from the door. “Dad, it’s almost time. If we don’t think of a way, I’m afraid President Gu will barge in.”","Old Madam Xia hurriedly said, “That’s easy! We’ll just say that Qiao Xi wants to stay in the Xia family for a few more days. Even though she has married Gu Zheng, it won’t do our Xia family any good. Now, we just have to send Mengyan to Gu Zheng’s side and let him make his own choice. Our Mengyan is so beautiful and obedient. No man will refuse her. She’ll definitely be able to sit firmly in the position of Mrs. Gu. At that time, our entire family will be able to enjoy life with Mengyan.”","In the guest room, Madam Xia frowned. Her eyes were filled with sorrow and pain. She was sad that her daughter had to be given away as an item. She was sad that her daughter was willing to join forces with the rest of the Xia family.","Actually, Qiao Xi had always suspected that Madam Xia was just a woman casually found by the Xia family to make up the numbers. Their goal was to announce to the public that Xia Ji and Madam Xia were very close and had an affectionate image. Actually, the real Madam Xia had long disappeared.","In the Xia family, no one took Madam Xia seriously. Her husband and daughter treated her as air, and the servants did not seem to take her seriously either. However, Madam Xia’s feelings for Xia Mengyan were real. Her heart really ached for her daughter. This kind of expression could not be faked.","Could it be that Madam Xia was really Xia Mengyan’s biological mother? How could such a weak but kind-hearted woman give birth to such a scheming daughter like Xia Mengyan?","At this moment, Old Madam Xia’s voice sounded from outside the door again. “Once he has Mengyan’s company, Gu Zheng won’t look for Qiao Xi anymore. If he insists on looking for Qiao Xi, we’ll say that Qiao Xi has already fallen asleep. When she wakes up, we’ll arrange for a driver to send her back. As for what will happen on the way, we can’t guarantee it.”","Everyone understood what Old Madam Xia meant and turned to leave.","After the door fell silent, Madam Xia said while trembling, “Let’s go! I’ll bring you out!”","“It’ll be easier for me to be discovered if you bring me out. Moreover, they’ll absolutely not let you off. I don’t want to implicate others,” Qiao Xi said indifferently.","Madam Xia had a difficult expression as she held Qiao Xi’s hand and said anxiously, “Miss Qiao, it’ll be too late if you don’t leave now! They won’t let you leave because they...”","Looking at Madam Xia who wanted to say something but hesitated, Qiao Xi smiled. Of course, she knew what Xia Cheng wanted to do. He wanted to use her to test the medicine and cure everyone in the Xia family. Not to mention leaving, it would be very difficult for her to even survive.","A trace of disdain flashed past her eyes. She really did not take the Xia family seriously. She smiled at Madam Xia. “Thank you, but I can’t leave yet. You can leave first.”","“I know you’re staying here for Miss Yunqiu’s belongings. I know where they are. They’re all in Xia Yunlou’s room. There are also some precious jewelry and clothes!” Madam Xia said anxiously."]},{"number":994,"title":"Chapter 994 - You Must Be Very Happy To Be","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi could not help but raise her eyebrows. Madam Xia actually called her mother ‘Miss Yunqiu’? Her tone was also a little gentler. “You’re already struggling in the Xia family. If they find out that you let me go, will they let you off? I’ll be fine. Since I dared to come to the Xia family, I have a way to escape unscathed, but I can’t leave now.”","If she really left, Xia Cheng would definitely know that Madam Xia was the one who let her go. What kind of punishment would Madam Xia, who was not liked by the entire family, receive? Would everyone in the Xia family vent their anger on her? Would she be tortured to death?","Qiao Xi did not want to implicate the others. Seeing Madam Xia’s worried expression, she said softly, “Don’t worry, Gu Zheng will save me.”","Madam Xia was slightly stunned, then she smiled with envy. “I heard that President Gu dotes on you very much. You must be very happy to be married to such a man!”","...","In the Xia family’s villa.","At this moment, two luxury cars were parked at the entrance. Xia Cheng was already nervous even before he saw Gu Zheng. The two cars seemed to be reminding Xia Cheng that Qiao Xi’s husband was already here. If they wanted to hurt Qiao Xi, they had to think about what price they should pay.","Xia Cheng’s forehead was covered in a cold sweat, but he had lived for decades, after all. He would not be frightened so easily. He quickly composed himself and led everyone to welcome them. However, before he could reach the car, Song Shijing stopped him.","“Mr. Xia, please stop.”","Song Shijing’s cold and distant voice entered Xia Cheng’s ears. He was instantly infuriated and felt that he had lost his dignity. Qiao Xi was his granddaughter, and as Qiao Xi’s husband, Gu Zheng should respectfully call him ‘Grandpa’. However, Gu Zheng was clearly here, but he did not show his face. Instead, he sent an assistant to stop him. The assistant even spoke so rudely. He did not take him seriously at all.","Gu Zheng was sitting in the car and leaning lazily against the back of the chair. He did not care about the people outside at all. Song Shijing was enough to deal with them. In his eyes, Xia Cheng was just an ant. He came to the Xia family’s villa just to pick up Mrs. Gu. Otherwise, he would not have stepped into the Xia family’s territory. He did not even want to waste time talking to Xia Cheng.","Seeing that Gu Zheng was so rude, Xia Cheng was so angry that his face turned livid and his chest felt heavy. After a while, he forced a smile and said obsequiously, “Mr. Song, please tell President Gu that Xi Xi is a little tired and wants to rest in the guest room for a while. We’ll send her back when she wakes up.”","Gu Zheng, who was in the car, suddenly opened his eyes. His gaze was sharp and cold. Even though he did not get out of the car, it made the surrounding people feel a strong chill.","Song Shijing asked, “Young Madam promised the president that she would come out on time. If she wanted to rest in the Xia family’s residence, she would have called to tell the president. Why didn’t she call?”","Xia Cheng smiled obsequiously and explained, “We were paying our respects to Yunqiu just now. Xi Xi saw Yunqiu’s belongings just now and was too sad. She cried for a long time and got too tired, so she fell asleep. She didn’t have time to call President Gu, so I came out to tell him so that he wouldn’t worry.”","Gu Zheng snorted from the car. Song Shijing said seriously, “So, the family banquet today was to pay respects to Young Madam’s mother. As Madam Xia’s son-in-law, our president naturally has to go in and pay his respects. He can bring Young Madam back with him afterward. Old Master Xia, you won’t refuse, right?”","“Uhh... The worship ceremony has already been completed. We can’t disturb Yunqiu anymore.” Xia Cheng’s expression was extremely ugly. He was nervous for a moment.","Song Shijing nodded. “Alright then. Our president won’t be entering, but it’ll definitely be midnight when Young Madam wakes up. Old Master Xia, please send Young Madam back to Longwan Residential.”","Xia Cheng widened his eyes in disbelief. He did not expect Gu Zheng to be fooled so easily. Perhaps he had other matters to attend to and was in a rush to leave.","In a few hours when it was dark, they would let Mengyan wear Qiao Xi’s clothes back. Their figures were similar anyway, so Song Shijing probably wouldn’t be able to tell. Once Mengyan arrived at Longwan Residential, everything would depend on Mengyan’s methods.","Xia Cheng smiled and nodded. “Don’t worry, Mr. Song. We’ll definitely send Xi Xi back. There are still some trivial matters at home, so I’ll go back first.”","Song Shijing watched Xia Cheng leave and smiled coldly. After the Xia family entered the house, Song Shijing opened the car door and said respectfully, “President, it seems that Xia Cheng is indeed ready to take action.”"]},{"number":995,"title":"Chapter 995 - he Xia Family’s Secret","paragraphs":["Gu Zheng’s eyes were sharp and filled with strong killing intent. His voice was low and hoarse. “She doesn’t want to be exposed yet. I can cooperate with her, but...”","He was unable to tolerate Qiao Xi being in danger alone, and he was unable to imagine what was happening in the Xia family’s villa at this moment. The feeling of not being able to contact her was truly too torturous.","Xia Cheng returned to the villa and heaved a sigh of relief when he saw Gu Zheng’s car leave through the surveillance cameras. However, he did not know that the car stopped after leaving the surveillance area and Gu Zheng got out of the car.","On the other hand, Madam Xia was afraid of being discovered, so she could only leave the guest room. Perhaps Xia Cheng thought that even if the antidote was effective, it would be impossible for Qiao Xi to wake up so soon, so he did not send anyone to guard Qiao Xi at all.","Qiao Xi quickly unlocked the door and walked toward Xia Yunlou’s room. Madam Xia said that her mother’s belongings were all in Xia Yunlou’s room. If there was enough time, she would go to Xia Cheng’s study to search the place as well. Perhaps there would be pleasant surprises there.","Qiao Xi’s footsteps were very light, and her figure was agile. She avoided a few servants and quickly found Xia Yunlou’s room. Coincidentally, the door was not locked, and the room was very luxurious. It could be seen that the Xia family really doted on their daughter.","After entering, Qiao Xi went straight to the dressing table. There were a few jewelry boxes on it, and the word ‘Qiu’ was engraved on them. These were indeed her mother’s belongings. Did Xia Yunlou not feel ashamed of keeping these expensive belongings?","Qiao Xi found a large leather bag in the room and packed all the jewelry. Suddenly...","Her body suddenly froze. She clearly felt that there was someone behind her, and this person’s aura was very light. It seemed that he was an expert. Her eyes suddenly turned cold as she slowly bent down and took out a dagger from her boot.","Just as she was about to turn around and counterattack, the person grabbed her wrist and the dagger fell to the carpet. She fell into a warm embrace. The familiar smell of sandalwood made her realize something.","The man had been looking at her for a long time. At this moment, his eyes were filled with smiles as he teased, “Mrs. Gu, am I not able to support you? Why are you here to steal from the Xia family?”","Qiao Xi’s face was filled with surprise. This was Xia Yunlou’s room. How did Gu Zheng get in?","Gu Zheng gently pinched her soft cheek and looked at her dotingly. He seemed to like her surprised expression. She looked like a little hamster.","“Mrs. Gu.”","A murmur that carried a trace of huskiness and charm sounded. Qiao Xi abruptly raised her eyes. The man’s slightly cold lips gently kissed her forehead, then he pressed his lips against her ear and chuckled. “Mrs. Gu, you took such a long time to find your way here. And you haven’t entered Xia Cheng’s study yet? Are you sure you don’t need my help?”","Qiao Xi widened her eyes, then frowned. Gu Zheng specially climbed in through the window to look for her just to mock her?","She originally wanted to seek help, but Xia Cheng, that old fox, had blocked all the signals. She could not contact Gu Zheng, so she could only complete the mission alone. If she admitted that she needed Gu Zheng now, wouldn’t it be very embarrassing?","Qiao Xi thought for a moment and said with a firm expression, “There’s no need. You’re so busy! There’s no need for you to attend to such a small matter!”","Seeing that she was unconvinced, the corners of Gu Zheng’s mouth curled up slightly. He asked softly, “You really don’t need my help?”","His voice carried a trace of ridicule. In Qiao Xi’s opinion, this was blatant mockery! She absolutely could not let Gu Zheng have his way, so she abruptly nodded. “Yes! It’s unnecessary!”","Gu Zheng’s long fingers touched his chin, and his voice was filled with joy. “It’s fine if you don’t need me, Mrs. Gu. But I originally wanted to accompany you to find the Xia family’s secret.”","The Xia family’s secret?","Qiao Xi’s eyes immediately widened. Gu Zheng must have some clues since he said that. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have climbed in through the window. It seemed that this was no small matter.","“Mrs. Gu, you must be very interested in this secret because it concerns Madam Xia.”","Qiao Xi was instantly interested. She wanted to investigate Madam Xia not because Madam Xia had saved her, but because she could not find any useful information about Madam Xia with Black Tide’s account. All she could find was that Madam Xia was the daughter of an ordinary family. After she married into the Xia family, everyone in her family passed away. She could not find any clues.","Her identity was very likely faked. All her relatives had died, so no one could investigate her further. Their goal was to hide Madam Xia’s true identity."]},{"number":996,"title":"Chapter 996 - One’s Appearance Reflects One’","paragraphs":["Xia Ji clearly did not like his wife, but he had never cheated on her. He had been with Madam Xia for so many years. Although everyone in the Xia family hated her, no one had thought of chasing her away. Why was that?","Qiao Xi was really curious, so she asked Qin An to investigate Madam Xia’s identity. However, she only obtained a little information. Now that Gu Zheng mentioned the Xia family’s secret, she was instantly interested.","However, she had already rejected Gu Zheng. At this moment, she wished she could take back what she had just said. She slowly looked up. Indeed, Gu Zheng’s eyes were filled with ridicule. She could only brace herself and say sweetly, “Senior! I was just joking just now! Of course, I’m very happy that you’re willing to help me!”","Gu Zheng had already expected her to go back on her word, but the next second, he chuckled. “Forget it. I believe you can handle such a small matter yourself.”","Qiao Xi hurriedly pulled him back, and she was angered to the point of stammering. “I-I can’t do it myself. Can you help me?”","She shook his arm and looked at him with anticipation, but Gu Zheng looked down at her with a trace of ridicule in his eyes. He said casually, “I’m usually so busy. Why would I need to attend to such a small matter?”","Qiao Xi: “...” ‘Damn it! Bastard, believe it or not, I’ll slap you!’","The corners of her mouth twitched slightly, and her tongue did not work anymore. She could only suppress her anger and say aggrievedly, “Ah Zheng, you’re my husband! Of course, you’ll help me if I’m in trouble. You can’t just watch me fall into a predicament and not save me, right?”","Gu Zheng looked at Qiao Xi’s anxious gaze that was like a crafty kitten. He smiled lightly and raised his eyebrows. “Tell me again who I am to you.”","Qiao Xi’s face was filled with shyness as she pounced into his embrace and thumped his chest shyly. “Idiot! I’ve already said it!”","Gu Zheng coughed. ‘I’m afraid not many people can take Mrs. Gu’s punches! Surely she’s not venting her anger on me, right?’","Qiao Xi hid in his embrace and smiled slyly.","That was right! She did it on purpose! She wanted Gu Zheng to be punished!","Gu Zheng smiled helplessly, then said, “Actually, Madam Xia and your mother were friends—lifelong friends.”","The smile on Qiao Xi’s face instantly vanished as she abruptly raised her eyes.","“Madam Xia is easily bullied. Xia Ji married her to control your mother. When Madam Xia fell into the hands of the Xia family, your mother could only be at the mercy of the Xia family.”","Qiao Xi’s eyes suddenly turned cold. The Xia family was really unscrupulous when it came to using Madam Xia to control her mother. The jewelry in Xia Yunlou’s room was all obtained through threatening her mother. No wonder there were so many of her mother’s belongings in the Xia family’s villa.","The two of them no longer hesitated and went straight to Xia Cheng’s study. Gu Zheng had already investigated. There was a secret room in this study. He knew the entrance and switch of the secret room like the back of his hand. The two of them successfully entered the secret room. It was very spacious here. After looking around, there were no useful clues. There was only a dusty photo album in the corner of a bookshelf.","Qiao Xi flipped open the photo album. It was a photo of the Xia family. On it were Xia Cheng, Old Madam Xia, Xia Ji, and Xia Yunlou. The photo was slightly yellow and looked to be from more than 20 years ago. Xia Ji and Xia Yunlou were both very young.","Qiao Xi narrowed her eyes as she looked at Xia Yunlou’s face. She picked up the photo and asked, “Ah Zheng, look at this photo. I keep having the feeling that the current Xia Yunlou is very different from the past.”","Gu Zheng nodded. He had realized it too.","Qiao Xi tried her best to describe it. “It’s not that they look different, but their auras are completely different.”","The elderly said that appearances would reflect one’s heart. In the photo, Xia Yunlou was full of smiles. She looked very innocent and kind. Her eyes were also very warm, making people subconsciously want to get close to her. However, the current Xia Yunlou was full of viciousness. Her eyes were filled with schemes and sinisterness. She was completely different from the Xia Yunlou from 20 years ago.","Qiao Xi looked at Xia Yunlou in the photo and felt inexplicably awkward. It was as if this person’s soul and body had split into two.","Gu Zheng said softly, “If the Xia Yunlou in front of us is fake, then it must have been done on purpose by the Xia family. Moreover, her every word and action imitates the real Xia Yunlou. She lives according to the other party’s preferences and character. The photo from 20 years ago was also deliberately imitated by her.","“However, one day, Xia Yunlou suddenly disappeared. Xia Yunlou escaped her restraints and released her suppressed nature. Unknowingly, she became herself again."]},{"number":997,"title":"Chapter 997 - Treating Her Like A Little Lab Rat","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi was dumbstruck. If Xia Yunlou’s actions were indeed an imitation, then after the target disappeared, she could finally reveal her true nature. She became as shrewish and vicious as she was now.","At this moment, Qiao Xi’s mind was slightly chaotic. She really wanted to know where the real Xia Yunlou had gone. Was she already dead, or had she escaped?","Gu Zheng stroked her hair gently and changed the topic. “Actually, Old Madam Xia was a little similar to Old Madam Yin when she was young.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes and took a glance. She casually flipped through a few photos of Xia Cheng and Old Madam Xia. They indeed looked very similar to her grandmother. She sneered. “How laughable. The first wife gave birth to his children and helped him manage the company, but he fell in love with a woman who looks similar to the first wife.”","Xia Cheng found a good reason for his affair. He fell in love with Old Madam Xia because she looked like Yin Lianxin, so he was not a scumbag. It was just that he had been too lonely all these years.","Qiao Xi thought for a moment. If she were her grandmother, she would definitely hate Xia Cheng even more. Xia Cheng had probably explained this to her grandmother back then, so her grandmother divorced him without the slightest hesitation and completely cut off all ties with the Xia family.","The two of them did not find any useful clues and returned to the guest room. Qiao Xi leaned into Gu Zheng’s embrace and asked softly, “Ah Zheng, do you know why the Xia family is forcing me to stay here?”","“I don’t know,” Gu Zheng replied indifferently.","“They poisoned me.”","Actually, Gu Zheng had long known about the Xia family’s plan when he was hiding outside the door, but when Qiao Xi asked him that, he was unable to suppress the killing intent in his heart.","“Not only did they poison me, but they also fed me an antidote. They’re not sure if the antidote will work, so they’re testing it on me. They treat me like a lab rat.”","After that, Qiao Xi smiled. “Unfortunately, this poison is useless against me, and I’m unable to help them test the medicine. Since they’ve done this to me, I can’t easily let them off.”","“Mrs. Gu, how do you want to deal with them?” Gu Zheng hugged her soft waist and asked softly.","Qiao Xi smiled sinisterly. “I want them to know that not only is there no benefit in inviting me over, but I’ll also pose a big problem to them! I’m already very satisfied that I was able to find that photo album and my mother’s belongings on this trip today. You can leave first.”","As soon as she finished speaking, Qiao Xi lay on the sofa and pretended to be unconscious again. She was very curious about how the Xia family and Gu Zheng were poisoned together. What was the relationship between the Xia and Lu families?","Gu Zheng stood up, and the smile on the corners of his mouth suddenly stiffened. The scene before his eyes suddenly became blurry. He rubbed his eyes. Fortunately, Qiao Xi did not see his abnormality.","Qiao Xi thought that she had already detoxified the poison in his body and the two of them were already connected by blood, so he would never be blind again. But in reality...","Gu Zheng’s eyes were gradually losing light. He could only rely on the light coming from the window to determine the direction. He adjusted his breathing and said softly, “Mrs. Gu, be careful. I’ll wait for your good news.”","Without waiting for Qiao Xi’s response, Gu Zheng opened the window and nimbly climbed out. Qiao Xi was slightly surprised. Why did the man who was still worried just now suddenly leave?","At this moment, the Xia family was probably already surrounded by Gu Zheng’s people. Their plan was within Gu Zheng’s expectations, so he was at ease leaving her alone here and letting her deal with the Xia family.","Just as her thoughts were running wild, footsteps came from outside the door. Xia Ji asked softly, “Dad, is the antidote really effective?”","Xia Cheng smiled proudly. “That’s a medicine developed by the Medical Association. Even if this medicine is useless, we can continue to use Qiao Xi to try other antidotes. One of them will definitely be effective.”","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart. They really treated her as a lab rat. No matter what, she was still human. They actually didn’t care about her at all. Perhaps they had done many such vicious things behind her back. This group of people was really the scum of society!","Old Madam Xia’s voice suddenly sounded as she laughed so hard that it made one nauseous. “Get Mengyan to prepare to go to Longwan Residential later. President Gu will definitely like her. With Mengyan by his side, he won’t be in the mood to care about Qiao Xi’s life!”","Xia Cheng’s voice was serious. “Don’t be anxious. We’ll talk about it when Qiao Xi wakes up. If that medicine works, we have to keep her as the antidote! But we can’t detain her here for no reason. We have to have a good reason, or else...”"]},{"number":998,"title":"Chapter 998 - She’s A Successful Substitute","paragraphs":["Xia Cheng knew clearly in his heart that even if Gu Zheng liked Mengyan and was not in the mood to care about Qiao Xi, there was still the Yin family. Yin Lianxin would definitely come looking for Qiao Xi.","At this moment, his expression was gloomy. He recalled the years when he was with Yin Lianxin. When he married into the Yin family, he had to listen to the Yin family’s arrangements for everything. Although the Xia family was prosperous, he did not feel grateful to the Yin family. He only felt resentment. Due to the Yin family’s power, he would not go against them if they came to ask for Qiao Xi. He had to find an excuse to deal with them.","Old Madam Xia’s eyes were filled with resentment as she said, “There are many reasons. Why don’t we say that Qiao Xi is already dead? Let’s set a fire and say that Qiao Xi was burned to death. That way, we can use the excuse that she was already burned to ashes. We’ll just give some ashes to them.”","Xia Cheng nodded. “This idea is feasible, but we can’t act rashly now. We have to wait until President Gu really falls for Mengyan and completely forgets about Qiao Xi. Only then will President Gu not blame us.”","Old Madam Xia was very confident in her granddaughter. Mengyan had been educated since she was young and learned the four arts. She had a gentle and generous character. Many rich young masters came to ask for her hand in marriage, but they were all refused. She believed that it would not be long before Mengyan could firmly grasp Gu Zheng’s heart.","If Gu Zheng liked Qiao Xi’s character, they would get Mengyan to imitate Qiao Xi’s every move, just like how she imitated Yin Lianxin back then. Even if she was a substitute, she would still be a successful one. After all, she had already become the old madam of the Xia family.","Qiao Xi slowly stood up and leisurely leaned against the door to listen to their conversation.","Old Madam Xia said proudly, “Mengyan will marry Gu Zheng sooner or later. At that time, when we spread the news that Qiao Xi was burned to death and she completely falls into our hands, she’ll still be at our mercy!”","Xia Cheng’s expression changed. Actually, he married Yin Lianxin not only for the sake of the Yin family’s power but because he really liked Yin Lianxin. However, marrying into the Yin family was a humiliation to him, so he chose a woman who looked very similar to Yin Lianxin. However, he felt that the woman in front of him was a little unfamiliar now.","At this moment, Old Madam Xia did not notice Xia Cheng’s displeasure and continued to say arrogantly, “Yin Lianxin has always suppressed me. Now that her granddaughter has fallen into my hands, I must vent all my resentment from all these years on her!”","As soon as she finished speaking, the door of the guest room was suddenly pushed open from the inside. Everyone was shocked and hurriedly took a few steps back.","“What do you want to do to me, Old Madam Xia? Tell me in detail.” A cold female voice came from inside the house, scaring Old Madam Xia so much that her body suddenly froze. Her already ferocious face became even more terrifying, like an old witch in a movie.","Qiao Xi crossed her arms and appeared in front of everyone. She raised her eyebrows and asked, “You said you want to vent all your resentment on me? Tsk tsk, you’re too heartless!”","Old Madam Xia did not expect that Qiao Xi had already woken up, nor did she expect that she would actually hear their conversation. As she looked at Qiao Xi’s arrogant expression, she thought of Yin Lianxin. As long as Yin Lianxin appeared, she would be the third party who would be despised by everyone. She would never be able to raise her head in front of Yin Lianxin, and the resentment in her heart surged like a tide.","“Yes! I want you to suffer! I want to torture you! So what? Do you think you can still escape from the Xia family?” Old Madam Xia looked at her with resentment.","“Oh.” Qiao Xi had an indifferent expression as she turned around and returned to the guest room. She leisurely leaned against the sofa with her legs crossed and looked at Xia Cheng indifferently.","Xia Cheng recovered from his shock, and his eyes were filled with a look of pleasant surprise. Not only was Qiao Xi awake, but the lights in the room were not switched on. She actually did not lose her eyesight. This meant that the medicine had taken effect. In other words, Qiao Xi’s blood had become their antidote.","Xia Ji immediately reacted and hurriedly ran downstairs. He instructed everyone to guard the Xia family’s villa and not let anyone enter. They had to watch Qiao Xi closely.","At this moment, Qiao Xi’s eyes were still indifferent without the slightest fear. Since the Xia family dared to set up a trap to harm her, she would absolutely make the Xia family pay the price.","Now, Xia Cheng should be sure that his entire family could be saved. How disappointed would he be to realize that all of this was just his imagination?","Old Madam Xia could not take it anymore and shouted with a ferocious expression, “Tie this little b*tch up! Don’t let her escape!”","Xia Cheng was still relatively calm. He instructed, “Yunlou, tell Mengyan to get ready. Drive Mengyan to Longwan Residential later.”"]},{"number":999,"title":"Chapter 999 - Taking Revenge For Xi Xi","paragraphs":["Xia Cheng walked into the house, turned on the lights, and advised softly, “Xi Xi, actually, I can’t bear for you to suffer either. It’s just that for the sake of the Xia family, I can only do this. I promise you that as long as you obediently stay in the Xia family, I’ll try my best to satisfy you in the future.”","Qiao Xi grunted coldly. “You want to imprison me? Then which room in the villa do you plan on putting me in?”","Before Xia Cheng could answer, Old Madam Xia cursed, “Little b*tch! You still want to stay in the villa? Are you worthy? Ah Cheng, there’s an old house in the suburbs. Let her stay there and get a few people to watch her. It’s best if you lock her with chains to prevent her from escaping.”","Xia Cheng frowned. He, too, felt that letting Qiao Xi stay in the villa would be a disaster. It was better to send her to the suburbs, so he nodded and said, “Xi Xi, the air in the suburbs is good. Go there and recuperate. I’ll send servants to take care of you.”","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart. She really hated Xia Cheng’s hypocritical appearance. He clearly wanted to treat her as a lab rat to test the medicine, yet he was still pretending in front of her.","At this moment, Xia Ji had already rushed back with a length of hemp rope in his hand. He entered without saying anything and wanted to tie Qiao Xi up. The next second...","Bang!","With a loud bang, Xia Ji felt a sharp pain in his abdomen. His body flew up and he crashed into the wall outside the door.","The scene in front of him stunned everyone in the Xia family. Xia Ji could no longer care about the pain in his body. He looked up anxiously, wanting to see who had kicked him. When he saw the man in front of him, his body suddenly stiffened.","“Didn’t Old Master Xia promise me that he would send Mrs. Gu home? Where are you sending her now?” A low and cold voice sounded with strong killing intent. The smiles on the faces of the Xia family members froze, and the blood in their bodies seemed to have frozen.","His voice was so calm, but it made them break out in a cold sweat and tremble uncontrollably.","Song Shijing retracted his foot coldly and retreated behind Gu Zheng while glancing at the Xia family coldly.","Gu Zheng? Hadn’t he left?","Xia Cheng and Old Madam Xia were terrified and could not help but take a few steps back. They had seen Gu Zheng’s car leave with their own eyes. Why did he suddenly appear in the guest room?","Gu Zheng stood in front of Qiao Xi, his deep eyes filled with killing intent. The corners of his mouth curled into a cold smile. “I remember Old Master Xia saying that he was paying respects to my mother-in-law today. Xi Xi was tired from crying, so she decided to rest in the Xia family for a moment. Is this what you mean by paying respects?”","Xia Cheng’s expression froze. When he met Gu Zheng’s cold eyes, he was so scared that his entire body trembled. The muscles on his face trembled as he stammered, “President... President Gu, you... You’ve misunderstood. We were just joking with Xi Xi. How could...”","“The environment in the suburbs is good. Yunqiu has also stayed there before. There are many of her belongings there, so I... want Xi Xi to stay in the suburbs for a period of time. It’s good for her health.”","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow with a faint smile. “Is that so?”","“Yes! Yes!” Xia Cheng nodded crazily as cold sweat trickled down his forehead.","Qiao Xi pounced into Gu Zheng’s arms. The man hugged the little woman in his arms a little tighter. He asked in a mocking tone, “Then please explain why Mr. Xia wanted to tie Xi Xi up with a rope.”","Xia Ji sat against the wall, not expecting Gu Zheng to mention him. He was so scared that his legs were trembling. Xia Cheng explained while trembling, “Uhh... Xia Ji just wanted to...”","“Everyone knows that I dote on Mrs. Gu and can’t bear to see her being bullied. Old Master Xia, if you don’t give me a reasonable explanation today, then I can only take revenge for Xi Xi.”","Xia Cheng’s expression instantly changed. They had all heard of Gu Zheng’s methods. He would definitely not let Xia Ji off easily. Most importantly, they had detoxified Qiao Xi’s poison, but they had yet to obtain Qiao Xi’s blood. She was everyone’s antidote, so they could not just watch her leave.","Xia Cheng thought for a long time. His eyes shifted as he gritted his teeth and said, “President Gu, listen to me. Sumei wanted to send Xi Xi to the suburbs. Xia Ji only did it according to his mom’s wishes. He wasn’t willing to do it at all.”","Old Madam Xia’s name was Ai Sumei.","Qiao Xi smiled. Xia Cheng was still so selfish. He could push everyone else under the bus for his own sake. Between Ai Sumei and Xia Ji, he chose Xia Ji without hesitation.","Old Madam Xia was stunned as she looked at Xia Cheng in disbelief."]},{"number":1000,"title":"Chapter 1000 - Dare To Do But Don’t Dare To Accept","paragraphs":["“Old Master Xia, I don’t object to you letting Xi Xi stay in the Xia family for a period of time, but Old Madam Xia wants to chase Xi Xi to the suburbs. How can I be at ease with her staying out there? I’d better bring Xi Xi home. Someone might plot against her if she stays in the Xia family,” Gu Zheng said indifferently.","Qiao Xi grabbed Gu Zheng’s sleeve and said with a face full of fear, “Ah Zheng, quickly bring me away. I’m afraid every time I see Old Madam Xia. She even said that she wants to torture me and vent all her resentment on me. It’s too scary!”","Xia Cheng turned around with an angry expression and glared fiercely at Old Madam Xia. If it were not for this idiot spouting nonsense, Qiao Xi would not be so resistant to staying in the Xia family.","Old Madam Xia lowered her head and did not dare to retort. After Xia Cheng turned around, a smile immediately appeared on his face. He said gently, “Sumei is indeed too muddle-headed. She always thinks that Xi Xi is here to look for trouble with her on behalf of Lianxin, so she said those words. Those were all out of anger. She doesn’t mean it at all. She’s in the wrong for this. I’ll ask her to apologize to Xi Xi.”","“So what if Xi Xi is here to look for trouble? Does Old Madam Xia have the right to be angry?” Gu Zheng said casually, “Since she became a mistress and ruined someone else’s marriage, she has to be prepared to be cursed at. Why doesn’t she dare to admit her mistake?”","Xia Cheng’s face was livid, and Old Madam Xia was so angry that her breathing became irregular. No matter how powerful Gu Zheng was, he was just a junior. What right did he have to say this in public?!","“I remember that the Xia family invited Xi Xi to today’s family banquet. She didn’t take the initiative to come, nor did she come to look for trouble with Old Madam Xia. Xi Xi is so busy, so how could she have time to look for unrelated people? Old Madam Xia, you’re overestimating your position in Xi Xi’s heart.”","Gu Zheng’s tone was indifferent, and he did not curse at all. However, he just meant to say that Ai Sumei was an ant in their eyes. No one wanted to look for trouble with her at all because she was not worthy. Qiao Xi did not take her seriously at all.","Xia Cheng’s face turned red. If they looked down on Su Mei, then what was he?","Just as Xia Cheng was immersed in his anger, Gu Zheng said slowly, “Old Master Xia, my wife’s body is weak to begin with. Now that she was threatened by Old Madam Xia, do you think she can make up for her crimes with just an apology?”","If an apology could not make up for it, what did he want?","Xia Cheng was so angry that his entire body was trembling. Stars were starting to appear in front of his eyes. He suppressed his anger and said while trembling, “President Gu, why don’t we ask Xi Xi how to deal with this?”","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes and asked softly, “Xi Xi, what do you think we should do?”","Qiao Xi fell weakly into Gu Zheng’s arms and lowered her head weakly. She said sweetly, “Ah Zheng, everyone knows that I’m kind-hearted. Grandpa asked me that because he thinks that I’m soft-hearted and won’t deal with Old Madam Xia.","“But I feel so wronged! They invited me to the family banquet, but they later said they were going to tie me up and throw me to the suburbs. There aren’t many people, so even if something bad happens to me, no one will know about it. Boo-hoo... I’m so pitiful! I didn’t do anything, yet Old Madam Xia wants to torture me. Maybe it’s because when she sees me, she’s reminded of her past when she was despised. It’s not my fault that she’s a mistress. Why is she venting her anger on me?! If I had known earlier, I wouldn’t have come to the Xia family!","“Ah Zheng, don’t blame Grandpa. It has nothing to do with him. It’s all my fault. If I hadn’t come, Old Madam Xia wouldn’t have done such an impulsive thing. Boo-hoo...”","Song Shiyu: “...” Young Madam was acting weaker and weaker. If he did not know her well, he would have believed her.","Xia Cheng was already suppressing his anger, and the flames of rage in his eyes almost sprayed out when he heard Qiao Xi’s words.","Gu Zheng nodded with heartache. “Since the family doesn’t welcome Mrs. Gu, let’s leave. We won’t visit again in the future to avoid being annoyed. As for those who threaten you, Mrs. Gu, they’ll have to be careful.”","Sumei’s mind buzzed. Of course, she could hear the threat in Gu Zheng’s words. She glared fiercely at Qiao Xi. This little b*tch actually exaggerated things in front of Gu Zheng as if she had done something vicious. She clearly had not attacked yet!","She looked at Gu Zheng’s gloomy eyes and was instantly terrified to the point her entire body trembled. She pointed at Qiao Xi and roared furiously. “Qiao Xi! Shut up! I’ve never threatened you. Why are you pretending?!”","When Qiao Xi heard her angry roar, she choked and abruptly burrowed into Gu Zheng’s embrace while trembling in fear."]}]);
